window.AKK_THE_VILLAINS_LITTLE_SISTER_IS_SPOILED_BY_THE_MALE_LEAD_CHAPTERS=(window.AKK_THE_VILLAINS_LITTLE_SISTER_IS_SPOILED_BY_THE_MALE_LEAD_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":101,"title":"Chapter 101: Banras 02","paragraphs":["Song Luokui secretly poked her head out of the room. By this time, Chi Yu had already changed his clothes - he was wearing a white T-shirt and a pair of shorts, with a pair of flip-flops.","He heard the noise and looked up, seeing Song Luokui in her sneaky pose. \"What's wrong?\"","Song Luokui smiled sheepishly, \"Nothing.\" She opened the door and pretended to walk out casually, putting on her sunglasses, \"Shall we go?\"","In fact, she was dressed quite well - she was wearing a black one-piece swimsuit underneath, and had put on a white T-shirt over it, which reached down to her thighs, so she wouldn't be too exposed when they went to the beach.","It's just that when Chi Yu looked at her long, pale legs, he swallowed hard and could only keep his gaze on her face.","Chi Yu put on his camera, took her hand, \"Then let's go.\"","\"Mm.\"","The two went downstairs and walked towards the beach. Song Luokui had thought they would just play around on the beach, but instead Chi Yu took her to a small port, where there was a yacht. Chi Yu went on board first, then helped Song Luokui up.","Song Luokui was quite surprised and delighted, \"We're going out to sea?\"","Chi Yu: \"Yeah, do you like it?\"","\"I love it!\" Song Luokui was very satisfied with the arrangement.","It was just the two of them on the yacht. Song Luokui saw that Chi Yu was very familiar with operating it - he untied the mooring lines, weighed anchor, and started the yacht, and soon they were heading out to sea.","Song Luokui sat in the cabin, which was nicely decorated with sofas, a refrigerator stocked with red wine, drinks, and fruits, and even a TV and karaoke setup. She sat on the sofa, the window open, feeling the sea breeze blowing, her legs crossed, completely at ease.","Chi Yu quickly moored the yacht in the middle of the sea. He took Song Luokui to the deck, where they enjoyed the beautiful sea view. Chi Yu picked up the camera and started taking photos of Song Luokui.","Song Luokui was already quite skilled at posing, and she was very happy today.","After a while, Chi Yu also brought out some fishing gear. \"We can do some deep-sea fishing.\"","Song Luokui immediately went over, \"I want to try.\"","The two of them sat on the deck and started fishing, occasionally clinking their drink glasses.","\"Actually, I don't quite understand why you like me,\" Song Luokui asked the question that had been on her mind.","It wasn't that she lacked confidence, but she felt the development of their relationship was a bit unexpected. She had originally thought that she and Chi Yu should be more like enemies.","Even if they weren't in a life-or-death relationship, they should have been the kind of acquaintances who weren't very close.","As for why it had developed into this, was it all because she had saved him once in Y Country?","Chi Yu looked at her, her hair disheveled by the sea breeze. He reached out and tucked her hair behind her ear. Song Luokui also turned to look at him, but with her sunglasses on, Chi Yu couldn't see her eyes.","Chi Yu spoke, \"From kindergarten, your grades have always been the best in your class, all the way through high school and even university. Your college entrance exam score was the second highest in the capital, you have a piano grade 10 certificate, you can dance, and you speak three foreign languages.\"","\"You are well-mannered, have many friends, and always win awards whenever you participate in school activities, even though you don't seem to like participating in activities much, and you also don't like to participate in social circle activities. In my competition with your brother, every time you were involved, I lost.\"","Song Luokui listened as Chi Yu listed her strengths. How did he know so much about her?","\"Wait a minute, the last one, your competition with my brother, I was involved and you lost every time? I didn't know about that.\"","Chi Yu: \"At the middle school sports meet, you suggested that your brother perform a 'kill the Japanese' act, and he won first place. Later, at the ice rink, we got into a fight and you tore my pants, so I lost. Last time, you submitted an article to Song Hua, and because of the single-hand photo, Song Hua's monthly sales exceeded Shan Yu.\"","Chi Yu grasped her hand, \"When things happen, you are brave and calm. In Y Country, when you saved me, you just glanced and roughly understood what happened, then calmly bandaged me, changed location, and even remembered to bring me food the next morning.\"","Chi Yu grabbed her hand and kissed it, \"And there are so many other things. I'm just one of the many who likes you. Your brilliance has just been well-hidden, so only a few people know, but I know that there have been so many who have liked you from a young age.\"","Song Luokui listened to him, \"So I'm that outstanding, huh. But... what about the reason for your affection? There are so many outstanding people in your circle.\"","Chi Yu leaned in, took off her sunglasses, \"The reason? It should be that day in the courtyard when you looked at me, wanting to get rid of me. That gaze.\" He looked into her eyes, seeing his own reflection in them, which made him feel delighted. \"At that time, I thought, those eyes are so beautiful.\"","He suddenly leaned in and kissed her on the eye.","Song Luokui's ears instantly turned red, and a light blush rose on her face. She placed her hand on his chest, and Chi Yu cupped her face, preparing to kiss her...","\"No!\" Song Luokui covered his mouth, \"When did you start liking me? Was it a long time ago?\"","Chi Yu blinked, \"I don't know when, but it was indeed a long time ago.\" He just gradually felt that this person should be his, and no one else could covet her, and he also felt very happy being with her.","Song Luokui stood up, \"Wait a moment, I'm a bit shy.\" She then ran back into the yacht's cabin.","Chi Yu: ...","He waited for a while, thinking she should be shy enough now, and was about to get up to find her, when suddenly the fishing rod moved. Chi Yu immediately grabbed the rod and started pulling it up...","On the other side, Song Luokui was holding an iced drink against her flushed face, when she suddenly turned and saw Chi Yu pulling in the fishing line outside. She hurried out, \"Has a fish taken the bait?\"","Chi Yu \"Mm\"ed and focused on reeling in the catch... After a while, a beautiful fish jumped up from the sea surface... It was actually a yellow-banded grouper! Chi Yu placed the catch in a small bucket next to him.","Song Luokui was extremely excited, \"Amazing!\"","Chi Yu, seeing her smiling face, also felt very happy. But suddenly, Song Luokui grabbed him, stood on her tiptoes, and kissed the corner of his lips, \"It's really amazing!\"","Chi Yu held her waist with one hand, smiling even more joyfully.","While Song Luokui was excitedly talking about how they should cook the fish, Chi Yu suddenly looked towards the distance, \"There's another yacht over there.\"","Song Luokui stood up, \"Where?\"","Chi Yu pointed in a direction, and Song Luokui looked through the binoculars she had fetched from the cabin. The other yacht was a bit larger than theirs, and she could see some people on the deck. Hmm? They looked a bit familiar?","Suddenly, one person turned around!","Song Luokui: \"Oh no! Let's go back quickly.\"","Chi Yu: \"What's wrong?\"","Song Luokui: \"My girlfriends are on that yacht.\" She didn't know they were also in Banras! Ah, if they were discovered, it would be disastrous.","\"Let's go, let's go, let's go!\" She thought she might have just seen Zhang Xiyue holding a pair of binoculars and looking in their direction as well. Hopefully, she didn't see them.","On the other yacht, Zhang Xiyue hadn't spotted them, but she noticed their yacht and pointed it out to Weng Jiao.","\"Shall we go take a look? Maybe there are some handsome guys?\""]},{"number":102,"title":"Chapter 102: Banras III","paragraphs":["\"Go ahead, call the captain to sail over and take a look,\" Weng Jiao and the others had no objections.","However, as their yacht went a short distance, they saw the other boat leaving rapidly.","\"Hey? Why are they leaving?\" Zhang Xiyue was still looking through the binoculars, \"I think I saw a guy, don't know if he's a handsome one, only saw the back of his head.\"","Lou Sasa: \"Were there any other people?\"","\"No more.\"","\"Alright then, they clearly don't want to be disturbed, let the captain stop here, we can just play around. I was planning to go scuba diving later anyway.\"","\"Okay.\"","On the other side, when Song Luokui initially saw that boat coming towards them, she panicked, constantly urging, \"Go, go, go, let's get out of here quickly.\"","Chi Yu swiftly started the yacht, \"whoosh\" leaving that area of the sea, until they could no longer see that boat. Song Luokui then sat up from her prone position, as she was previously lying down, afraid of being seen by anyone who came close.","But now the problem was, her sisters were also in Banras, what if she went out and got discovered?","Back on land, Song Luokui was a bit worried about this issue.","Chi Yu: \"I'll take you to a place, we won't run into anyone there.\"","Song Luokui: ?","Returning to the hotel, the two packed their things and left the five-star hotel, then Chi Yu took her to a private villa, with a private beach in front of the villa.","Chi Yu: \"Originally I was afraid to bring you here because I thought you might not like it, since there's no one around. I thought you'd prefer somewhere livelier.\" He was worried she'd think he had ulterior motives bringing her here.","Song Luokui: \"No, no, no, I love it, I prefer quiet places.\" There were actually staff at the villa to serve them, they just wouldn't appear unless instructed.","Their luggage was directly taken and unpacked by the staff, and Song Luokui changed into different clothes before running out again, with Chi Yu following behind her.","Song Luokui ran happily along the beach, Chi Yu chasing after her, occasionally the two would stop to look at some small animals on the sand, like sideways-crawling crabs, and even little sea turtles.","She also collected some seashells, planning to make a shell necklace, while Chi Yu found a conch shell, which Song Luokui held up to her ear and truly heard sounds from.","In the evening, they steamed and ate a starry puffer fish, and after eating, Song Luokui toured the villa before going to bed.","The next day, Chi Yu took her scuba diving, and seeing the beautiful starfish, seagrass and more under the sea made Song Luokui very happy. She even wanted to catch fish, but they quickly slipped out of her hands.","After the dive, the two returned to the boat, then back to the villa, where there was a swimming pool. When Song Luokui came out in her swimsuit, she saw Chi Yu swimming in the pool, wearing only swim trunks. Hearing her approach, he immediately surfaced from the pool and swam over to her.","Chi Yu pushed his wet hair back with one hand, then with a forceful push lifted himself to sit beside Song Luokui, grabbing a towel nearby to wipe himself before extending a hand to her, \"Want to swim together?\"","Song Luokui looked at his six-pack abs physique and swallowed, her face slightly flushed, shaking her head, \"No, no.\"","Swimming together would be too intimate, what if something happened?","Seeing she didn't want to swim, Chi Yu didn't mind, \"Then you can watch me?\"","\"Okay.\"","With that, Chi Yu jumped back in, shooting forward like a merman, swimming to the other end and back.","When Chi Yu got tired from swimming, he sat beside Song Luokui, \"Where do you want to go tomorrow?\"","Song Luokui: \"Do you have any plans?\"","Chi Yu pointed to the forest next to the villa: \"We can take a walk in that forest, have a picnic barbecue, or we can go shopping?\"","Worried about running into her sisters while shopping, Song Luokui immediately said: \"Let's go to the forest for a walk tomorrow, and have a barbecue picnic.\"","\"Okay.\"","That evening was another seafood feast, and the next day Chi Yu got a bicycle from somewhere and rode with her towards the forest.","Song Luokui wore a sundress, a straw hat, carrying a flower basket and sitting on the backseat, one arm around Chi Yu's waist, the two happily setting off.","The bicycle was parked at the edge of the forest as the path ahead was too rough for cycling, so they walked slowly instead.","What they didn't know was, at that time, a murderer had snuck into the forest and was hiding in the shadows.","This forest was actually part of Chi Yu's private property along with the villa, belonging to the same owner, and the murderer had sneaked in illegally.","Song Luokui and Chi Yu were oblivious to this, slowly walking while chatting, when suddenly Song Luokui felt like someone was watching her. She turned to look but saw nothing.","Chi Yu also immediately sensed something was off, pulling Song Luokui's waist close to him, leaning down to whisper in her ear, appearing to others like he was kissing her: \"Let's go back.\"","Song Luokui's heart raced, though scared she remained calm and nodded, the two acting as if they didn't notice anything as they slowly headed out.","But as they walked, a gust of wind blew, and a person lunged at them. Chi Yu was already on high alert, pulling Song Luokui into his arms as he spun, dodging the attack, before placing her behind a tree. He immediately attacked the assailant.","The person had a dagger, managing to cut Chi Yu's hand, but he acted as if it was nothing, feinting before sweeping the person's legs out from under them, making them fall.","Chi Yu then kicked the hand holding the dagger, making it fly out, and Song Luokui quickly went to grab it. Next, Chi Yu started viciously beating the murderer!","This was her first time seeing him so ferocious, his forearms bulging with muscle, eyes intense, punching the person's face which instantly swelled and bled.","When the person tried to fight back, Chi Yu kicked them in the stomach, then punched their chest, Song Luokui swearing she heard the sound of breaking ribs. Immediately after, Chi Yu grabbed the person's hand and twisted it, a sickening crack as they screamed.","Song Luokui watched from behind the tree, never imagining Chi Yu could fight so well.","Soon, staff from the villa arrived, armed, having received news that a murderer might have snuck onto the property and fearing for Chi Yu and Song Luokui's safety. But when they arrived, the murderer had already been subdued by the master of the house.","The murderer was taken away, but Song Luokui worriedly looked at Chi Yu's injury, \"Let's go back quickly, I'll disinfect and bandage your wound.\"","While bandaging Chi Yu, Song Luokui asked and learned that like her brother, Chi Yu had been trained in martial arts from a young age, just not sent to the military by his father, instead having private instructors at home.","The day's activity ended there, with Song Luokui insisting Chi Yu rest at the villa, while local Banras news reported the murderer being caught and subdued by a couple from Hua Country.","Though a minor injury, Chi Yu still felt apologetic, hugging Song Luokui, \"Sorry, today's arrangements had some errors.\"","Song Luokui: \"These kinds of uncontrollable things happen, you don't need to apologize, and you protected me, making me feel you're even more reliable.\" She caressed his face.","Chi Yu buried his head in the crook of her neck, holding her, \"Mmm.\"","The barbecue picnic was moved to the next afternoon, on the beach, with villa staff joining them. When Song Luokui came out, she had forgotten to apply sunscreen, so she sat on a beach chair applying some.","When Chi Yu walked over, she squeezed a handful of sunscreen and rubbed it directly onto his bare abs, \"Let me put some sunscreen on you.\"","Chi Yu suddenly stiffened a little, almost groaning.","Chi Yu grabbed her hand, took a deep breath, \"Don't move, I... ahem.\"","Song Luokui let out an \"ah\" sound, her face instantly turning red, then her gaze went down... damn!"]},{"number":103,"title":"Chapter 103: Sing and Drink","paragraphs":["Song Luokui's face flushed red as she turned around, absentmindedly squeezing out sunscreen and rubbing it on her legs.","Chi Yu sat behind her, one arm wrapped around her, his head resting on her shoulder.","\"You've already covered this part, how about a different area?\" Chi Yu suddenly spoke, noticing that she had been rubbing the same spot over and over again for four or five times.","Song Luokui paused, then immediately switched to the other leg, her gaze wandering, speaking softly, \"Are you... done yet?\" Although the servants around them couldn't understand Chinese, Song Luokui still kept her voice down when talking to Chi Yu.","Chi Yu had his arm around her waist and shook his head, \"Just a little while longer.\"","...Why is it taking so long? Song Luokui grumbled in her mind, continuing to rub her legs.","Chi Yu suddenly said, \"Do you want me to help you with your back?\"","Song Luokui stiffened, \"No... that's not necessary.\"","Chi Yu lifted his head and placed his hand on the back of her neck, \"How about this area?\"","Song Luokui: \"Okay.\"","Chi Yu: \"Then let me help you.\" He took the sunscreen, squeezed some onto his hand, and then directly applied it to the back of her neck, also spreading it down to the nape of her neck.","Song Luokui had her hair tied up today, exposing her slender, fair neck. A few strands of hair had fallen down and were gently draped over it, and just by looking at her, Chi Yu couldn't help but swallow hard.","If he wasn't afraid of being seen as a scoundrel, he would have wanted to just lean in and kiss her right then. Chi Yu closed his eyes and took a deep breath - the person in front of him was even more alluring than he had imagined.","\"All done.\" Chi Yu's voice was slightly hoarse.","Song Luokui turned around, took the sunscreen, glanced down at it briefly, \"Are you done?\"","Chi Yu: \"Yes.\" He pulled her up, \"Shall we go have some barbecue?\"","\"Mm.\"","Over there, the servants had already roasted some food, so the two of them could just take and eat.","Chi Yu somehow produced a bottle of red wine, pouring it into a transparent wine glass, and asked Song Luokui, \"Would you like a sip?\"","Song Luokui hesitated for a moment, \"Then... just a small one? The alcohol content shouldn't be too high, right?\"","Chi Yu: \"It's not high, but...\"","Song Luokui knew what he meant. Even low-alcohol sweet wines could make her tipsy. But she seemed to have drunk a whole bottle last time, \"Just a small one, I should be fine.\"","Chi Yu: \"Mm, just a small one.\" He poured her just a tiny bit, truly just a small sip.","Song Luokui swirled the wine glass, sniffed it, the sweet wine aroma wafting out. She first licked the wine, finding it quite good, and then drank the small amount.","\"Ah. Delicious.\" Song Luokui's eyes were bright and shining.","Chi Yu also took a sip, his gaze fixed on her the whole time, \"How is it?\"","Song Luokui nodded, \"It's fine, I don't feel dizzy.\" She then ate several more skewers of the barbecue.","As they ate and chatted, looking at the distant sea view, Song Luokui picked up the binoculars and spotted dolphins in the distance.","\"Dolphins!\" Song Luokui was a little excited. She handed the binoculars to Chi Yu, then picked up a camera, zooming in to start filming.","\"Click, click, click.\"","After a while, the dolphins swam away and disappeared from view, but Song Luokui was quite satisfied looking at the photos. She then ate several more skewers of barbecue.","She looked at Chi Yu pouring more red wine into his own glass, and she handed her glass to him, \"Give me another small sip, just a little bit is fine.\"","Chi Yu: \"You'll get drunk. Be good, no more drinking.\"","But Song Luokui looked at him, \"I want to drink. Otherwise... you have to drink it for me?\" She leaned in and directly took a sip from his glass.","\"Delicious!\" Song Luokui blinked, unaware that her face was already starting to flush red.","Chi Yu reached out and gently stroked her cheek, \"It's red.\"","Song Luokui: \"Hm?\"","Chi Yu turned to the side and said to one of the servants, \"Could someone please go back and make me a hangover soup? Thank you.\"","One of them, who was the chef, immediately stood up, \"Of course, sir, I'll go right away.\"","Song Luokui: \"I'm not even drunk?\"","Chi Yu: \"Just in case.\" He handed her a drink, \"No more drinking from now on.\" He had originally suggested just a sip to let her try the taste, but when her face turned red after the second sip, he felt she would get drunk if she had a third.","Song Luokui took the drink, \"Okay.\"","Among the servants, one suddenly took out a guitar and started strumming and singing, and the rest of them cheered. Chi Yu and Song Luokui also turned to look.","A romantic foreign song rang out by the seaside, and everyone started clapping along and listening intently.","Although Song Luokui didn't understand the lyrics, the melody was very pleasant. She poked Chi Yu, \"Do you know how to play the guitar?\"","Chi Yu grasped her hand, \"I do.\"","When the song finished, he kissed her hand and stood up, \"Let me sing one for you.\"","Song Luokui was delighted, \"Okay!\"","Chi Yu went over and said to the man with the guitar, \"May I borrow the guitar to play a song for my girlfriend?\"","The servant: \"Of course, sir.\" He handed the guitar to Chi Yu and went to sit down, and everyone cheered and clapped as Song Luokui enthusiastically joined in.","Chi Yu gestured for everyone to be quiet, and as soon as they fell silent, the opening chords rang out, and soon Chi Yu started softly singing, \"My dream, the boundless sea can gently hear, in the romantic sunlight, the girl is dancing, the one I love most is her smile... I like you, my sun...\"","This was a love song, and although the others couldn't understand the lyrics, they felt it was very beautiful. Song Luokui, however, understood it, and her already flushed face became even redder, but she kept smiling and gazing at Chi Yu.","As the song ended, everyone cheered, and Chi Yu returned the guitar, walking back to Song Luokui and gently kissing her forehead, \"I like you.\"","Song Luokui closed her eyes and then opened them, snuggling against his arm as he sat down, \"Mm, thank you, I really like it.\"","They sat in the back as the others performed more acts, Chi Yu and Song Luokui continuing to eat and watch, the atmosphere very joyful.","Song Luokui looked at Chi Yu taking another sip of red wine, and she started feeling a bit restless again. Somehow, she was a little excited today, so her courage was also a bit bolder.","\"I want to drink more.\" She stared at the red wine in his hand.","Chi Yu raised an eyebrow, \"Really? Not afraid of getting drunk?\"","Song Luokui: \"If I get drunk, you can just carry me back and let me rest.\"","Chi Yu studied her steadily, \"Are you sure you won't regret it?\"","Song Luokui: \"I won't regret it. I want to drink.\"","Chi Yu looked at her flushed lips, \"Okay.\"","The next moment, Chi Yu took a sip of the red wine, then used his hand to grip her chin, directly stealing a kiss from her lips.","Song Luokui's pupils dilated, and her hand immediately clutched the front of Chi Yu's shirt.","\"Mmm...\"","The wine flowed down her throat, and Song Luokui blinked her eyes, then closed them."]},{"number":104,"title":"Chapter 104: Drink the Hangover Soup","paragraphs":["Chi Yu gently wiped the wine from the corner of Song Luokui's mouth, his voice low, \"Would you like another drink?\"","Song Luokui was panting, her eyes slightly red and moist, her whole face flushed like a red apple, not sure if it was from the alcohol or from shyness.","Suddenly, there was another burst of cheers from behind them. Song Luokui then realized they were still there, though not many people, and she felt quite embarrassed. She immediately snuggled into Chi Yu's embrace, \"No, I don't want to drink anymore.\"","Chi Yu directly pulled her onto his lap, \"They didn't see.\"","Song Luokui let out a soft whine, lightly hitting his chest with her small hand, but still kept her head buried in his embrace.","After a while, it seemed like the alcohol was starting to affect her. She lifted her flushed face and tugged at Chi Yu's sleeve, \"I feel a bit... dizzy.\"","Chi Yu looked at her glistening eyes, seeing that she was speaking in broken sentences, realizing she was a bit drunk.","He lifted her up in his arms and headed towards the villa.","Along the way, he passed through the kitchen and told the chef, \"Please send the hangover soup to my room.\"","\"Yes, sir.\"","Chi Yu carried Song Luokui to the room, placing her on the bed. The hangover soup soon arrived, and Chi Yu brought it back to the bedside.","Song Luokui was still wide awake, but her senses seemed a bit dulled.","Chi Yu held the hangover soup to her lips, \"Good girl, have a little. Your head won't hurt tomorrow.\"","Song Luokui blinked her eyes at the liquid in the cup, then looked down and took a sip, scrunching her face and turning away, \"It's... hard... I don't want to drink it.\"","Chi Yu coaxed her, \"Have just one more small sip, and I'll give you some candy later.\"","But Song Luokui turned to look at him, staring at him for a while, then raised her finger and swayed it back and forth, \"No, you're not my brother. I only have one brother.\" She remembered her brother's name was Song Luosheng.","Chi Yu was both amused and a little annoyed. Even when drunk, she still remembered this. He was even a bit jealous of Song Luosheng. \"Then who am I?\"","Song Luokui: \"You... you are Chi Yu.\"","Chi Yu: \"Besides that, what am I to you? What should you call me?\"","Song Luokui pondered, \"What are you to me? What should I call you?\"","Suddenly, as if remembering something, she clapped her hands, \"You are my... man!\" But her brain seemed to freeze, and she felt like she shouldn't have said that.","Chi Yu blinked, \"Your what?\"","Song Luokui: \"My man! You are my man!\"","Chi Yu chuckled and leaned in closer, his voice coaxing, \"Mm, I'm your man, so what should you call me?\"","Song Luokui looked at his face, then suddenly reached out and touched it, \"Should I... call you... husband?\"","She tilted her head, her gaze innocent.","Chi Yu's breath caught in his throat. He hadn't expected her to suddenly say those two words. He tightly embraced her waist with one hand, put down the hangover soup with the other, and pulled out his phone to start recording, speaking softly, \"Say it again?\"","Song Luokui furrowed her brow, not understanding why he kept making her repeat it. But she still pouted and said it again, \"Husband, mmm...\"","Chi Yu felt an immense happiness and fulfillment that was different from the satisfaction he got from his work. He deeply kissed the person in his arms, and if not for his remaining rationality, he almost would have taken her right then.","Song Luokui was kissed to the point of almost not being able to breathe, pushing at him with one hand, but her hand was caught and held to the side, her chin lifted up to prevent her from turning away.","After a long while, Chi Yu finally released her and picked up the hangover soup. \"Darling, let's drink the hangover soup together so it won't be bitter.\"","Song Luokui: ?","Then, Chi Yu took a sip of the hangover soup and directly fed it to her mouth-to-mouth...","\"Darling, let's have another sip...\"","The hangover soup was gone, and there were drips of it all over Song Luokui's clothes, having dripped down from her chin.","When Chi Yu tried to come in for another kiss, Song Luokui covered her mouth, \"No more drinking.\"","Chi Yu chuckled, \"Mm, no more drinking.\" There wasn't any left anyway.","Song Luokui then yawned, collapsing back onto the bed, \"No more drinking, my mouth hurts.\"","Chi Yu pulled the blanket over her, \"Mm, no more drinking.\"","Song Luokui's eyes were drooping, \"Sleeping now.\" As soon as she said that, she fell asleep.","Chi Yu lay down beside her, stroking her hair and gazing at her lips, now reddened and swollen from the sucking. His eyes narrowed, and eventually he couldn't resist leaning down to give her a light kiss.","...","The next morning, Song Luokui was awakened by the sound of the heavy rain. She sat up with her eyes closed, checking the time on her phone - it was just past 3 a.m. in Banras.","Suddenly, a bolt of lightning flashed, illuminating the sky and the entire room. Song Luokui shuddered in fear.","She quickly turned on the room light and looked outside. She could faintly see the tumultuous sea in the distance, the rain pounding relentlessly against the windows. Another lightning bolt streaked across the sky, and she saw the trees on the nearby mountain swaying violently.","Song Luokui felt quite frightened. She hurriedly closed all the curtains, then ran back to the bed, burrowing under the covers with just her eyes peeking out.","She couldn't help but feel like the howling wind and waves sounded even louder. Suddenly, another bolt of lightning struck, and the overhead lights flickered before going dark completely - she didn't know if it was a power outage or an electrical issue.","Song Luokui fearfully hid completely under the covers.","But it still felt so terrifying. She even started to worry that the seawater might flood in and submerge the villa.","As her fear grew, Song Luokui grabbed her phone, turned on the flashlight, and quickly ran out of the room.","\"Knock, knock, knock!\" The knocking sounded especially loud in the night.","Chi Yu immediately opened his eyes and got up. As soon as he opened the door, a soft body hurried into his embrace. Chi Yu quickly held her, seeing the raging storm outside and understanding what was going on.","\"Don't be afraid.\" Chi Yu carried her to the bed and tucked the blanket around her. He had just turned on the lights, but they weren't working.","Song Luokui's muffled voice came from under the covers, \"Seems like the power is out.\"","Chi Yu: \"It might be the electrical box. Let me make a call.\" He picked up his phone and called the villa's caretaker, who quickly sent someone to check on it.","After hanging up, Chi Yu lay down next to Song Luokui, embracing her gently. \"Don't be afraid. Even if the power is out, the villa has a backup generator. The electricity will be back soon.\"","Song Luokui turned to hug his waist, \"When I woke up, it was just raging wind and rain outside, with thunderstorms. I was afraid the seawater would flood in.\"","Chi Yu stroked her hair, \"That won't happen. When the villa was built, they considered that risk. This area hasn't had any seawater intrusion issues in over 200 years, which is why the villa was built here. The weather in Banras can be like this sometimes, but it should be back to normal in about a day.\"","Sensing Chi Yu's familiar scent, Song Luokui's fear lessened significantly. \"Why?\""]},{"number":105,"title":"Chapter 105: The Night","paragraphs":["Chi Yu: \"This is possibly related to the geographical location of Banras, or perhaps factors of magnetic fields. For now, scientists are still investigating the specific reasons. Some people might want to come here during a certain season on purpose to experience this extreme weather.\"","Song Luokui: \"Does that mean we can't go out and play tomorrow?\"","Chi Yu: \"Yeah, let's stay in the villa tomorrow. I'll take you out to play the day after.\"","Song Luokui: \"But... it seems like my sisters are still around here.\"","Chi Yu: \"They've already left Banras, last night in fact.\"","Song Luokui tilted her head, her lips brushing Chi Yu's chin in the darkness. She paused for a moment, \"Ahem, you... how did you know?\"","Chi Yu: \"Why don't you check their social media updates? Although I should clarify that I don't have access to their social media, but I can find out through other channels.\" When he learned that Zhang Xiyue and the others were also here, Chi Yu had someone keep an eye on their whereabouts.","Song Luokui took out her phone and opened it, \"...I didn't ask you that.\" She opened her social media and indeed saw the posts about Zhang Xiyue and the others leaving Banras. Their next stop seemed to be Baro.","Chi Yu chuckled lightly, \"Well, I just didn't want you to misunderstand.\"","Recalling the previous misunderstanding, Song Luokui's face showed an embarrassed expression, but luckily it was too dark for him to notice.","Chi Yu gently patted her back, \"Are you sleepy? Want to go to bed?\"","Song Luokui felt it would be awkward to sleep together with him, but she was also a bit afraid to go back to her own room alone.","Chi Yu: \"If you don't want to sleep, shall we reminisce about what happened last night?\"","Song Luokui: \"Hm? What happened last night?\" She started recalling, remembering Chi Yu feeding her alcohol. Suddenly her whole body felt flushed, and the hand resting on Chi Yu's waist gripped his clothes as she squirmed.","Chi Yu seemed to sense her embarrassment. \"Done reminiscing? Or shall I help you reminisce?\"","Song Luokui: \"No... no need, I drank last night and got drunk. I was wrong, I shouldn't have overestimated myself.\"","Chi Yu placed his hand on her face, gently caressing it. \"It's not that. Think again?\"","Song Luokui: \"...It's not? But after I got drunk, I just went back to my room to sleep, right?\"","Chi Yu: \"What about before you went to sleep?\"","Song Luokui: \"Before I went to sleep...\" Recalling the hangover soup Chi Yu had the chef make, \"I drank the hangover soup?\"","Chi Yu: \"Yeah, and what did you say while drinking it?\"","Song Luokui tried hard to remember but couldn't recall. \"Said... something? I didn't badmouth you, did I?\"","Chi Yu laughed out loud, \"No.\"","Song Luokui felt relieved, \"I didn't throw a tantrum either, right? I don't think I usually do that when drunk.\"","Chi Yu: \"No, you didn't. I just asked you what you should call me.\"","Song Luokui: \"Oh, so I just called you by your name?\" She figured she would have just called him by his name like usual.","Chi Yu: \"No, that's not it.\"","Song Luokui: \"Then I don't remember.\"","At that moment, Chi Yu played the audio recording from last night. Her voice in the recording sounded muddled yet soft, \"Husband?\"","Then came Chi Yu's slightly husky voice, calling her a good girl, and asking her to repeat it. So she called out \"husband\" again, followed by sounds too embarrassing to describe.","Ahhhh!","Song Luokui was utterly mortified!","She grabbed the blanket and covered herself completely, curling up in sheer awkwardness as if trying to dig herself a fortress by gripping the bedsheet with her toes.","Song Luokui turned to move away from Chi Yu. She was truly too embarrassed. The raging storm and lightning outside seemed trivial now. Chi Yu immediately pulled her into his embrace, his mouth near her ear, \"Good girl, say it again for me?\"","Song Luokui covered her ears: \"Don't call me a good girl, it's too embarrassing.\"","Chi Yu chuckled softly, the vibrations from his chest transmitting to Song Luokui. He grabbed her hands and pulled them away, holding them tightly. \"Then what should I call you?\"","Song Luokui: \"Just call me Kuikui like everyone else does.\" Wah~ Still so embarrassing!","Chi Yu: \"But I don't want to call you the same as everyone else.\" He wanted to call her by a name only he used.","Song Luokui: \"Then... then you come up with something else.\"","Chi Yu: His sensual voice whispered in Song Luokui's ear, \"How about... old wife?\" That one phrase \"old wife\" made her curl up like a little piglet.","\"You... you... come up with something else.\" Song Luokui was pinned down, unable to escape, her face burning hot.","Chi Yu's hand reached for her lips in the darkness. \"Bribe me, and I'll change it.\"","Song Luokui opened her mouth and bit down on his thumb. Chi Yu leaned closer. \"Old wife?\"","Song Luokui screamed internally again. She raised her hand to cover Chi Yu's mouth. \"Don't call me that.\"","Chi Yu's eyes curved with a smile as he planted a kiss on her palm. Song Luokui immediately retracted her hand, but the next second her chin was tilted up. \"Since the good girl won't bribe me, I'll just take my bribe myself.\"","Song Luokui only felt her mouth being nibbled on before she opened it, allowing his plundering kiss...","The next second, a bright light flashed. It was either the power coming back on or the electricians had fixed it. Song Luokui felt her eyes being covered, then Chi Yu pressed a button on the bedside table to switch to a dimmer light before removing his hand.","Chi Yu finally released the person in his embrace. The little one's eyes were slightly reddened, not to mention her swollen lips. Song Luokui looked up into Chi Yu's smiling eyes, covering her face with both hands. Then she got up, \"I... I'll go over there first.\"","Before her feet could touch the ground, she was scooped up and placed back on the bed, wrapped tightly in the blanket. \"Time to sleep, I won't tease you anymore.\"","Song Luokui: \"But...\"","Chi Yu glanced outside. \"Not scared anymore?\"","Song Luokui also looked out. It was still terrifying out there. If she went back to her own room alone, she would definitely be scared. She snuck another look at Chi Yu.","Chi Yu patted her shoulder gently. \"Go to sleep, I won't touch you.\"","Song Luokui: \"What about you?\"","Chi Yu grabbed another blanket so they wouldn't have to share. \"I'll be right here, don't be afraid.\"","Song Luokui took a deep breath and closed her eyes contentedly. She didn't feel sleepy just moments ago after all that excitement, but now a sudden wave of drowsiness hit her.","Soon, Song Luokui fell asleep. Chi Yu watched her the whole time, and once her breathing became steady, he turned off the lights. Wrapped in the blanket, he held her close as he too drifted off to sleep.","When Song Luokui woke up the next day, Chi Yu was no longer by her side. It was still raining outside, but not as terribly as the night before.","Song Luokui walked barefoot to the window, peering out. Some trees seemed to have fallen in the villa grounds, and the butler was organizing people to clear them away. In the distance, the sea was raging, and vaguely she could see people picking things up.","Song Luokui turned and left the room, finding Chi Yu working on his laptop in the living room. He had earphones on and upon seeing Song Luokui, immediately told the person on the other end: \"One moment please.\""]},{"number":106,"title":"Chapter 106: Villa Daily","paragraphs":["Song Luokui got up and went directly to Chi Yu's side, immediately giving him a princess-carry and lifting her up. \"Why aren't you wearing shoes?\" Although the floor was carpeted, he was worried her feet would get cold.","Song Luokui looked down at her feet, \"I forgot.\"","Chi Yu carried her to the sofa and sat down, fetching a pair of slippers from the room for her to wear. \"If you're hungry, go downstairs to eat or have someone bring food up. I have some things to take care of right now, but I'll join you in a bit, okay?\"","Song Luokui waved her hand dismissively, \"You're busy.\"","She first returned to her room to take a shower, then went downstairs to eat. After finishing her meal, she brought another portion upstairs to Chi Yu's room and sat beside him.","She didn't say anything, just listening as Chi Yu arranged some company matters.","In the middle, Chi Yu paused and looked over at her. Song Luokui pointed to the plate of delicious food, using a fork to spear a piece and holding it to Chi Yu's mouth.","Chi Yu opened his mouth to eat it, then continued looking at the PowerPoint presentation on his computer.","After Chi Yu finished eating, Song Luokui fed him another bite, intermittently feeding him until the entire plate was empty.","Song Luokui sat beside him, replying to some company matters on her phone. When she finished replying, Chi Yu's meeting was also about to end.","She heard Chi Yu say \"Meeting adjourned\" before leaning over to him, \"Work's over?\"","On Chi Yu's end, his headset was still on, so the people on the other side heard a girl's voice and immediately perked up their gossip-hungry ears.","It was morning on the boss's side, yet there was a girl's voice. Just who was this celestial being beside the boss so early? Did something happen last night...? And wasn't the boss on vacation abroad? Everyone wanted to listen further and see if they could make out anything, but the boss had already turned off his headset.","Over there, Chi Yu quickly turned off his headset. \"Yeah, it's over.\" He closed his laptop, got up, and left the room with Song Luokui.","On the other side of the meeting room, everyone saw the boss had exited the meeting, so they also exited, though still curious to gossip.","Only Chen Nan looked completely unfazed - that voice was clearly the Song family's younger sister. The big boss is impressive!","Since it was raining and not good to go out, there were plenty of things to do in the villa - an indoor swimming pool, KTV room, movie theater, mahjong room, video game room, even a gym and dance studio!","In the movie theater, Song Luokui browsed the recently released films to see if there were any interesting ones. Most were foreign, with only a few domestic options.","Song Luokui selected what looked like a rather funny movie and started playing it.","Beside her, Chi Yu handed her a tub of popcorn made by the chef. Song Luokui took it, eating while asking Chi Yu, \"Have you seen this one before? Is it good?\"","Chi Yu: \"No.\"","Song Luokui: \"Then we can watch it together.\"","\"Okay.\"","The movie soon started playing. It was indeed quite funny, and Song Luokui leaned against Chi Yu's embrace, laughing. But then it suddenly became emotional, with the male and female leads kissing. Song Luokui felt a bit awkward and looked up at Chi Yu, who happened to be looking at her.","Song Luokui jolted and immediately covered his eyes. \"Don't look!\" Heavens know that when she entered the bathroom today, she saw her lips were swollen, and not only that - there was even a hickey on her collarbone.","She had previously believed in his character, but now... this was a slap in the face.","Chi Yu allowed her to cover his eyes, but he could still hear the audio. After a while, he said, \"That scene is over, can I look now?\"","Song Luokui turned to see the movie had returned to being funny, so she released her hands from covering his eyes.","\"Ahem, you can look.\"","Chi Yu took her hand. \"Alright. Cover my eyes again if another scene like that comes up.\"","Song Luokui: ...","It was past 4 PM when the rain stopped and the sun actually came out.","Chi Yu pulled Song Luokui out onto the balcony. \"Shall we go out to watch the sunset later?\"","Song Luokui breathed in the fresh, post-rain air and saw the distant sea surface sparkling under the sun's rays. She nodded, \"Let's go now! Doesn't the beach have lots of things after the rain?\"","Chi Yu: \"Probably.\"","Song Luokui changed her clothes, grabbed a small bucket, and quickly ran out to the beach with Chi Yu.","There really were many things here. During lunch, she had heard the maid say they could catch large seafood on the beach in the morning.","Lobsters, sea urchins, jellyfish, crabs, overturned baby turtles, seashells - you name it, it was all there.","In no time, the small bucket was filled with various sea creatures.","In the distance, the sun was slowly setting towards the sea. Chi Yu set up his camera, quickly running over to put his arm around Song Luokui's shoulders. Song Luokui raised her hand in a scissors gesture. \"Click!\"","Chi Yu returned to the camera, adjusting the settings again. They took several photos like this.","They continued until the sun slowly sank below the horizon, sitting side-by-side on the beach to watch this beautiful scene.","Even after the sun had set and the evening grew a bit chilly, Chi Yu didn't bring Song Luokui back to the villa until later.","For dinner, they ate the seafood they had caught in the bucket earlier. Of course, the chef also prepared other dishes, even bringing up a bottle of red wine from the cellar. However, Song Luokui dared not drink anymore, lest Chi Yu take advantage of her without her knowing.","The next day, the weather was fantastic. Chi Yu took a convertible sports car from the underground garage. Song Luokui, wearing a beautiful dress, got in the car and waved her hand. \"Let's go!\"","The car sped along the coastal road. Song Luokui turned to admire the seaside scenery, feeling this place was truly beautiful.","They passed through a forest and into the city, arriving at a famous large mall nearby. The mall was quite crowded today.","Holding hands, the two browsed around. Song Luokui wanted to buy gifts for her family, so she went into one store and bought a bunch of things, having them directly shipped back home.","Chi Yu simply followed beside her, not complaining about being tired. When it came time to pay, he handed over his card directly.","After buying gifts for everyone, she looked over Chi Yu beside her and entered a men's clothing store. She picked out a tie for him to try on, then selected two outfits. \"Even though you seem to always wear custom-made clothes, I want to buy these for you today. Do me this favor and wear them at least once.\"","Chi Yu: \"I'll wear them often.\"","Song Luokui: \"No need for that, I know what you wear to work.\"","Chi Yu: \"Then I'll wear them on dates.\"","Song Luokui looked at him. \"You're quite the charmer.\" Then she handed the items to a staff member. \"Please wrap these up for me.\"","Chi Yu tried to hand over his card again, but Song Luokui refused. \"It's a gift from me, I'll pay for it myself.\"","Chi Yu put his card away, clearly delighted. \"Okay~\"","Afterwards, she went to other stores, buying shoes, cufflinks, watches, and more for Chi Yu. She returned with a day's worth of shopping.","The next day, Chi Yu had her accompany him to a private gala event hosted by a famous jewelry brand. In the morning, she began preparations - a spa massage, various skincare treatments, hair styling, putting on a custom gown, accessorizing with the brand's jewelry pieces, and finally, slipping into crystal high heels. She looped her arm through Chi Yu's as they headed out."]},{"number":107,"title":"Chapter 107: Evening Banquet","paragraphs":["The driver transported the two of them to a castle, where the brand's director, Luo Wei, welcomed the guests at the entrance. Upon seeing Chi Yu's car, Luo Wei promptly ran over and opened the door for him, \"Welcome, Mr. Chi Yu. Your presence truly honors us.\"","Chi Yu shook his hand and nodded, \"Hello, apologies for one moment.\" He walked over and opened the door for Song Luokui, placing his hand on the roof to prevent her from bumping her head and using his other hand to help her out.","Luo Wei's eyes lit up when he saw Song Luokui, and he approached them, \"And who might this be?\"","Chi Yu: \"This is my girlfriend.\"","Luo Wei exclaimed in awe, \"Oh, you two are truly a match made in heaven. It is our utmost honor to have you and your girlfriend here today.\"","Song Luokui extended her hand to shake his, \"Hello, I'm Song Luokui. You can just call me Song.\"","\"Hello, hello, I'm Luo Wei. Please, follow me this way.\"","The two followed Luo Wei into the castle, where seating had already been arranged, with other celebrities present.","Some people were surprised to see Chi Yu enter and immediately approached him, \"Mr. Chi, I didn't expect to see you here. Do you remember me?\"","Chi Yu conversed with them effortlessly and introduced Song Luokui, \"This is my girlfriend, Song.\"","Song Luokui sensibly stood beside him as a beautiful ornament, maintaining the same smile unless someone came to provoke her.","\"Chi, is this the one you said you like? Besides her good looks, I really can't see what other virtues she possesses,\" a girl said in F language as she walked over, clinging to a man's arm while scrutinizing Song Luokui.","The man beside her immediately scolded her upon hearing this, \"Lili, don't be so rude.\" He also spoke in F language, then turned to Chi Yu and extended his hand, \"Apologies, my sister is quite immature.\"","Chi Yu ignored him and declined to shake his hand. Song Luokui beside him blinked and responded to Chi Yu in F language, \"Do they think I don't understand F? To openly insult me like that?\" She then scrutinized the girl, \"Frankly, at least I have the virtue of good looks, but I don't see you possessing even that, let alone any other virtues.\"","Her words instantly turned the two people green with embarrassment. They truly believed Song Luokui didn't understand F language, assuming most people from China only spoke Y language.","The man smiled awkwardly, \"Excuse us.\" And they left.","Chi Yu led Song Luokui to their seats, \"Don't mind them, just some minor nouveau riche.\"","Song Luokui looked at him, \"Your admirer?\"","Chi Yu shook his head, \"No, someone who knew me likely expressed interest before, but I directly rejected them. I told them I had a girlfriend and that I really liked my girlfriend.\" Chi Yu held Song Luokui's hand, \"Even though you weren't my girlfriend at the time.\"","The dinner was about to begin, and Song Luokui playfully scratched his palm, \"I'll interrogate you about it later.\"","Chi Yu felt delighted, implying Song Luokui cared about him, \"Sure, you can ask me anything.\"","Song Luokui raised an eyebrow, about to say something but feeling the setting was inappropriate, so she swallowed her words, deciding to ask later.","At that moment, the brand's director Luo Wei took the stage, \"I'm delighted to have you all at our Dignifi dinner tonight. On behalf of Dignifi, I'd like to raise a toast to you all for an enjoyable evening.\"","He raised a glass of champagne, and Chi Yu and Song Luokui also raised their glasses, though Chi Yu replaced hers with soda when she drank.","After everyone took a sip, Luo Wei set his glass down and continued, \"First, I'd like to extend a special welcome to a few individuals. The first is Mr. Chi Yu and his girlfriend. As Dignifi's largest raw material supplier, I hope we can maintain a close partnership. I truly didn't expect you to attend today, and I'm deeply honored.\"","Luo Wei raised his champagne glass to Chi Yu, who reciprocated out of courtesy.","\"Next, I'd like to welcome our dear friends, the Najil couple...\"","\"Lastly, I'd like to thank our brand's global ambassador, Miss Su Xihua...\"","Su Xihua, also from China, was a very beautiful woman wearing Dignifi's latest jeweled necklace.","Chi Yu noticed Song Luokui admiring the necklace, \"Do you like it?\"","Song Luokui: \"What?\"","Chi Yu had already summoned someone, \"Please have that entire set packaged for my girlfriend.\"","Song Luokui: ?? Like packaging leftovers?","Song Luokui tugged his sleeve, \"I was just looking, doesn't mean I want to buy it.\"","Chi Yu: \"It's alright, I want to buy it for you.\"","Although reluctant to admit it, Song Luokui felt she was being defeated by Chi Yu's gift-giving. She beckoned him closer with her hand, \"Lean your head down?\"","Chi Yu lowered his head, thinking she wanted to say something, but to his surprise, Song Luokui kissed his cheek. Chi Yu was instantly delighted and nuzzled his cheek against hers.","Nearby, Lili, who had previously mocked Song Luokui, secretly took a photo and sent it to her faux friend Siliya, \"Dear, Chi Yu really does have a girlfriend, and they seem very affectionate.\"","After sending it, Lili smiled, pleased to imagine the hideous expression on Siliya's face. Siliya always boasted about being the top socialite, claiming no man was beyond her reach.","On the other side, Siliya indeed looked hideous upon seeing the photo. She thought Chi Yu had deceived her, never expecting it to be true. She didn't recognize the Chinese girl in the photo, assuming she must be from some nouveau riche family, just a pretty face trying to snag a wealthy man. Siliya believed Chi Yu was simply toying with the girl.","Unaware of Siliya's assumptions, on the stage, a one-of-a-kind princess crown was displayed. Chi Yu immediately raised his paddle, determined to obtain it.","Luo Wei's mouth remained agape, grinning. This princess crown was worth 2.1 billion, and he didn't expect to sell it that night, let alone to Chi Yu.","When Chi Yu raised his paddle, Song Luokui was still eating cake, unaware until Luo Wei expressed gratitude, and she realized Chi Yu had spent a fortune just to buy her a crown.","Song Luokui: \"...Why did you buy it again?\"","Chi Yu: \"I wanted to buy it for you, as a birthday present for your coming of age. Consider it a gift I never gave you, for my Princess Kuikui.\"","Song Luokui: \"That money would be enough for my birthday gifts for the next twenty years. And don't call me Princess Kuikui.\"","Chi Yu: \"It's not enough.\" His treasure deserved everything good."]},{"number":108,"title":"Chapter 108: Interrogation","paragraphs":["When the evening banquet ended, Luo Wei still wanted to invite Chi Yu and Song Luokui to take a photo together, but Chi Yu declined, \"Sorry, I can't show my face during this trip.\"","Luo Wei was very understanding, \"Oh, no problem. Would it be possible for me to take a personal photo with you two using my phone? I absolutely won't share it with the media.\"","Chi Yu looked towards Song Luokui, and Song Luokui had no objection, \"Sure.\"","Luo Wei: \"Thank you very much.\" He then took out his phone and took a picture with the two of them. \"Thank you both for coming tonight. Thanks, and I hope we can meet again the next time I visit Hua Country.\"","Chi Yu: \"Of course.\"","After returning to the villa with the jewelry she bought, Song Luokui was a bit tired. After washing up, she sat on the bed. Shortly after, Chi Yu came over wearing his pajamas, holding the gems they had purchased that day.","He opened one of them, \"Would you like to try wearing them tonight?\"","Song Luokui looked at the necklace, earrings, bracelet, and other pieces, \"Why don't... we try the crown? We can wear the other pieces another time.\"","Chi Yu picked up the crown, \"Okay.\"","He carefully placed the crown on Song Luokui's head and handed her a mirror. His eyes were full of affection, \"Beautiful.\"","Song Luokui looked at herself in the mirror, and she did look beautiful. When she turned her head, she saw Chi Yu sitting there, staring at her. She smiled at him, \"What are you looking at?\"","Chi Yu brushed the strands of hair that fell over her forehead, \"Looking at how beautiful you are.\"","Song Luokui felt proud, \"Of course.\" No one had ever told her that she wasn't beautiful since she was a child.","After admiring herself for a while, she took off the crown. Chi Yu took it from her, put it away, and sat down next to her.","Song Luokui remembered the matter she wanted to question him about, \"I have some questions I want to ask you, and I hope you'll answer honestly.\"","Chi Yu sat upright in front of her, \"Ask, and I'll answer anything that doesn't involve national or company secrets.\"","Song Luokui laughed, \"I have to commend you for your sense of duty to keep national secrets confidential no matter what. Don't worry, I won't ask about national secrets, and of course, I won't ask about your company's secrets either.\"","Song Luokui picked up her phone and opened an app that said she needed to ask her boyfriend a few questions, along with some other questions she wanted to know tonight.","\"First, earlier tonight, you said I wasn't your girlfriend, so why did you tell others that you have a girlfriend?\"","Chi Yu: \"Because in my heart, I'll only have one girlfriend, and that's you, and it can only be you.\"","Song Luokui lowered her eyes, \"What if I don't agree to be with you?\"","Chi Yu: \"I'll keep waiting for you to agree.\"","Song Luokui looked up at him again, \"And... what if I don't agree and choose someone else?\"","Chi Yu's gaze sharpened: \"Kill him!\"","Song Luokui: ??","\"...Darling, we must abide by the law.\"","Chi Yu grabbed her hand and laughed, \"Yes, I'll abide by the law. What I meant was, I'll defeat him and take you back!\" He placed her hand on his face, \"I'll make you realize that only I deserve you. By the way, I like when you call me darling.\"","Song Luokui breathed a sigh of relief and stroked his face, \"You scared me, I thought you were going to resort to force and coercion.\"","Chi Yu: \"What if I did try to take you by force? What would you do?\"","He had actually thought about it - if she resisted his advances, one day he might not be able to restrain himself and resort to force and coercion.","Song Luokui: \"What could I do? I'd have to lie down and accept it. When I don't have enough strength, I'll lie down. When I have the ability, I'll strike back, if I don't like you.\"","Chi Yu pulled her into an embrace, \"I love it when you talk about wanting to get rid of me.\" She's especially dazzling.","Song Luokui: ...Why does she feel like he has issues?","Oh well, she chose him, issues and all.","Song Luokui pushed him away, \"We haven't finished asking questions.\"","Chi Yu sat up properly, \"You continue.\"","Song Luokui: \"How many people have confessed their feelings to you? I want to know how many rivals I have.\"","Chi Yu: \"...\"","Song Luokui frowned at him, \"Why aren't you answering? Is it too many?\"","Chi Yu pinched the bridge of his nose, \"No... do love letters count?\"","Song Luokui: \"Of course.\"","Chi Yu: \"...Ahem, has anyone written a love letter or confessed to your brother?\"","Song Luokui stroked her chin, \"As far as I know, quite a lot. I've even seen a whole backpack full of love letters for him...\" Suddenly, she looked at Chi Yu, \"Don't tell me you were one of them?\" Thinking about it, it made sense. \"Okay, I understand now. You don't need to answer this question. It's probably about the same as my brother's case.\"","Chi Yu suddenly asked, \"Can I ask you a question?\"","Song Luokui: \"Sure, we can ask each other. If I can answer, I definitely will.\"","Chi Yu: \"Did you also receive love letters?\"","Song Luokui smiled awkwardly, \"Haha, well, let's skip that question.\" Although she didn't receive as many as her brother, she did receive quite a few, and her brother had dealt with some of them.","Song Luokui: \"Next question, next question.\"","\"Did you like someone before me? Am I your first love?\"","Chi Yu nodded with certainty, \"Yes, you're my first love.\"","Song Luokui smiled, her eyes crinkling, \"You're my first love too.\" Her first love in both lifetimes.","Chi Yu smiled back at her, \"That's great~\"","Song Luokui continued, \"Is there anything you're hiding from me? Not including national or company secrets.\"","Chi Yu thought for a moment, \"There shouldn't be anything.\"","Song Luokui nodded, \"Then I believe you. If there is...\"","Chi Yu: \"If there is, you can have someone beat me up.\"","Song Luokui: \"Next... no, you can ask me a question now.\" Song Luokui sat obediently and batted her eyes at him.","Chi Yu: \"If... if your brother finds out about our relationship and doesn't approve, what would you do?\"","Song Luokui paused, \"That's a good question. It's like asking who I would save if you and my brother fell into the water.\"","Chi Yu: \"So who would you save?\"","Song Luokui: \"Neither, you both know how to swim. If my brother finds out about our relationship and doesn't approve, I'll try to convince him to agree. If I can't convince him, then I'm afraid you'll have to remain my secret lover.\" Song Luokui patted his face, \"Although my brother's opinion is important, your behavior is also very important. If you behave well, he'll agree.\"","\"Of course, my parents' opinion is even more important.\" If her parents opposed it, she might have to seriously reconsider this relationship. But with her brother, it's quite obvious that they don't get along, so he's unlikely to approve.","Chi Yu breathed a sigh of relief, \"As long as we don't break up, it's fine.\" As for her parents, he was confident he could win them over.","Song Luokui asked some typical questions about favorite colors and hobbies. She continued until it was getting late and she grew tired, then stopped. Time would prove everything.","After Song Luokui fell asleep, Chi Yu left her room.","The two stayed in Banras for another two days before preparing to return to their country. Song Luokui was very satisfied with this trip and with Chi Yu. He was emotionally stable, able to properly handle and arrange various events. In short, he was very reliable.","On the first day back in the capital, Song Luokui wanted to surprise her brother Song Luosheng by going to his company to find him. However, as soon as she entered, she saw a beautiful woman trying to seduce her brother?"]},{"number":109,"title":"Chapter 109: Woman","paragraphs":["A beautiful woman wearing a low-cut dress and a form-fitting skirt, her long hair cascading down her back, leaned against the front of the desk, her head tilted down close to Song Luosheng, the two of them murmuring to each other.","As Song Luokui entered, she saw this scene and blurted out, \"Er... sorry to interrupt.\" She immediately retreated.","Questions swirled in her mind. Who was this woman? Could she be the one her brother was interested in? Come to think of it, she had never seen him close with any girl before.","She remembered that as soon as she got home, Aunt Gui had mentioned their grandparents introducing a girl to her brother. Could this be that girl?","Song Luokui was about to leave, puzzled, when the door suddenly opened from the inside and the woman stepped out. She flicked her hair elegantly, giving Song Luokui a slight smile before departing.","Er...","At that moment, Song Luosheng came out, ruffling Song Luokui's head. \"You're back. Why didn't you tell me? I would have gone to pick you up.\"","Song Luokui pointed at the woman who had just left. \"Brother, was that... your girlfriend?\"","Song Luosheng's expression turned disgusted instantly. \"No! That woman has nothing to do with me.\"","\"But just now...\" Song Luokui saw they seemed rather intimate.","Song Luosheng pulled her into the office. \"Don't mind her.\"","\"Oh... I thought she was the girl Grandpa and Grandma introduced to you,\" Song Luokui said. \"Speaking of which, you could get a girlfriend now, Brother.\"","\"Is Luokui thinking of getting a boyfriend?\" Song Luosheng asked casually, then called his secretary to bring in some fruit, snacks, and milk.","However, his question made Song Luokui uneasy. \"Haha, if I had a boyfriend, you wouldn't object, would you, Brother?\"","\"Of course not, as long as he's good to you. But... at least let me check him out first and investigate him. As a man, I understand men the best. Some men are great at deceiving women, saying they can't live without you and love you the most, but then they cheat when the chance comes. They just stop loving you, just like that.\"","\"Watch out for those men who suddenly appear, some of them are just looking for a rich girl to change their fate. You know those kinds of men are unreliable, right?\"","\"What if it's not someone who just appeared, but someone we've known since childhood?\"","Song Luosheng looked straight at Song Luokui. \"Luokui, do you like someone from our circle?\"","Song Luokui shook her head frantically. \"No, no, I was just asking. Since you said those who just appear are no good, I wondered what if it's someone from our circle we've known?\"","At that moment, the secretary brought in the snacks and milk.","Song Luosheng handed Song Luokui the milk. \"Some people from our circle are relatively more reliable, but others only rely on their family's influence. Some families are quite messy, and I hope you don't get involved with those kinds of people.\"","\"If you really like someone, let me know, and I'll investigate everything for you. Don't let love blind you!\" Song Luosheng flicked her forehead.","Song Luokui covered her head. \"Brother, do I look like a girl blinded by love?\"","\"Who knows? Love is the most irrational thing, after all.\"","\"Oh, I almost forgot. I actually wanted to surprise you.\" Song Luokui took out a gift from her bag. \"Ta-da, this is a gift I bought for you abroad.\"","Song Luosheng took it and opened it - it was a fountain pen. Song Luokui handed him another gift. \"And here's another one.\"","Song Luosheng received a pure gold lucky charm figurine. \"Brother, put this in front of your desk, so your company will have a constant stream of wealth!\" Song Luokui placed it beside his desk.","Song Luosheng's desk was quite large, with various small figurines, some of which Song Luokui had given him. There were also two photo frames, one with a family portrait including their grandparents, and another of just him and Song Luokui.","\"Oh, I also bought you some clothes, but they're at home.\"","Song Luosheng felt warmth in his heart. \"Okay, I'll try them on when I get home tonight.\"","\"Mmhmm.\" As she spoke, Song Luokui grew drowsy, having just returned from her flight without much rest.","\"Get some rest if you're tired,\" said Song Luosheng.","Song Luokui yawned. \"Alright, I'll go home then.\"","\"I'll go down with you.\"","\"Okay~\"","...","That evening, Song Luokui happily took out the gifts she had bought for her parents, as well as for Aunt Gui, Uncle Kang, and Uncle An.","Everyone was delighted to receive their gifts.","\"Thank you, Miss.\"","\"You're welcome.\"","\"How was the activity this time? Nothing happened, I hope?\" Song Luosheng asked.","Without missing a beat, Song Luokui made up a story. \"No accidents, we also did some environmental protection work.\"","Song Moqian and Sheng Rong nodded approvingly. \"That's good.\"","In her heart, Song Luokui clasped her hands, apologizing silently. She would definitely donate more to environmental causes. True to her word, that very night she donated 100,000 yuan to an ocean conservation foundation.","Meanwhile, Qi Yu hadn't fared so well. He returned home without even resting, diving straight into work. As soon as he reached the office, he gathered everyone for a meeting. Everyone knew the boss was back.","However...","The boss who had returned seemed to have changed a bit, appearing less intimidating than before. Word had it that the boss had fallen in love... so men in love seemed to have a soft glow around them.","After resting for a day, Song Luokui went to the company.","\"Boss, you're here.\"","\"Hello, Boss.\"","\"Hello, Boss.\"","\"Hello, everyone,\" Song Luokui responded to their greetings.","Entering her office, she saw a pile of documents on her desk awaiting her signature.","Song Luokui took her seat and started working, with Li Bei by her side, briefing her on the company's recent affairs and occasionally answering questions about the documents.","\"By the way, the houses at ChunWang Manor have been renovated. You can go take a look when you have time, Boss.\"","Song Luokui looked up. \"Really? Can we move in?\"","Li Bei said, \"Yes, we've also invited professional air quality testing agencies to inspect, and everything is fine. But I suggest waiting a little longer before moving in.\"","\"Okay, no rush. I'll go take a look when I have time. Thank you for your hard work.\"","\"Not at all.\"","\"Oh, I brought you a gift too. Wait a moment.\" Song Luokui took a small box out of her bag. \"This is for you.\"","Li Bei accepted it. \"Thank you, Boss!\"","\"I also brought a gift for Yu Manager, but she's not here today. Could you pass it to her for me later?\"","\"Yes.\"","At five o'clock, Song Luokui wanted to leave, though it wasn't quite quitting time yet. Li Bei was about to follow her, but Song Luokui stopped her. \"Li Bei, you can clock out now, no need to follow me all the time.\"","\"But your brother, Boss...\"","\"Li Bei, your boss now is me. Don't mention it to my brother if he doesn't know. That's how it is, okay? I'm leaving now. Bye bye.\"","Song Luokui hurried downstairs. Qi Yu was already waiting for her in the underground parking lot of her company building - she had a date with him tonight. What would happen if Li Bei found out?"]},{"number":110,"title":"Chapter 110: Blind Date","paragraphs":["At the parking lot, Song Luokui quickly found Chi Yu's car, \"Let's go, go, go.\" She was afraid of running into employees, as it happened that Chi Yu came to look for her on the night he returned... her employees probably didn't get a clear look at him back then, did they?","Chi Yu drove out of the parking lot, \"Let's go to Jinwei Hall for dinner first, then see an opera?\"","Song Luokui: \"Okay.\"","As the car drove down the street, it happened to be rush hour, so there was some traffic. Song Luokui looked outside and suddenly spotted a familiar figure.","\"Wait, wait, Chi Yu, pull over for a bit.\" Song Luokui was staring into a window, wasn't that her brother Song Luosheng?","And sitting across from him was a girl...","Chi Yu quickly pulled over to the side, leaned over to look, \"What's up?\"","Song Luokui pointed at the window, \"That's my brother, the girl sitting across from him... I don't know her.\"","Chi Yu: \"Is it a blind date?\"","Song Luokui was suddenly shocked, \"A blind date??? He didn't tell me. Oh right, Aunt Gui did mention that grandpa and grandma introduced a girl to my brother.\" That day she thought it was that girl, so is it this girl today?","Song Luokui looked at the girl sitting across from her brother, she seemed gentle and reserved, with a striking appearance. But she didn't know what her personality was like.","After a while, as if sensing something, Song Luosheng pulled the curtains closed, blocking the view from outside.","Song Luokui: \"Can't see anymore.\"","Chi Yu: \"Want to go take a closer look?\"","Song Luokui shook her head, \"It's fine, let's go. My brother has his own life and privacy.\" Just like how she was secretly going out with Chi Yu on a date, her brother didn't know about that either.","On the other side, Song Luosheng asked, \"Miss Su, how did you get to know my grandparents?\"","Although Su Congrong had a striking appearance, her personality was a bit shy and socially awkward. She spoke in a gentle manner, \"I... my grandparents seem to know your grandparents.\"","She felt it was quite sudden too. She had just returned from abroad when her grandparents said they wanted to introduce her to a young man. She originally wanted to refuse, but due to her personality issues, she couldn't bring herself to decline. She didn't expect the man she met to be so... so graceful, seeming like an outstanding young man. Recalling what her grandparents said about his family background, it seemed they were quite influential as well.","Su Congrong suddenly felt a bit insecure, as a man like this probably wasn't lacking in admirers.","At this moment, Song Luosheng had an expressionless look, \"Is that so?\"","\"Yes... yes.\"","Song Luosheng: \"Is Miss Su studying art?\"","Su Congrong: \"Yes. I studied art at the Royal College in Y Country.\"","Song Luosheng: \"My sister originally wanted to go to the Royal College in Y Country too, but she felt it was too dangerous abroad, so she didn't end up going.\"","Su Congrong suddenly sensed the young man's gaze softening, \"Does Mr. Song... have a sister?\"","Song Luosheng: \"Mm-hmm.\"","Su Congrong: \"I don't know what Mr. Song's sister's name is, but I used to attend some social gatherings and ladies' events in the country, so I may have seen your sister before.\"","Song Luosheng: \"My sister doesn't like attending those kinds of events, you probably haven't seen her.\"","\"I see...\" Su Congrong clutched her dress, suddenly unsure of what to say.","Song Luosheng glanced at his watch, \"Let's end our meeting here today, I'll have someone arrange for Miss Su to be sent home.\"","Su Congrong: \"Does Mr. Song have some urgent matter to attend to?\"","Song Luosheng: \"No, it's just that my sister should be off work, I'll go pick her up.\"","Su Congrong also stood up, \"Miss Song is already working? I thought she was still in school.\"","Song Luosheng: \"She's still in school, but she started her own company and is working during summer break.\" He sounded quite proud.","Su Congrong: \"Miss Song must be very capable.\"","Song Luosheng didn't show modesty either: \"Yes, my sister is great.\"","Su Congrong: ...She suddenly wanted to meet Mr. Song's sister, it would surely be great to become friends with such an outstanding person.","Su Congrong was escorted to leave, while Song Luosheng called Li Bei, \"Has my sister gotten off work? She should be at the company, right?\"","Li Bei: \"Boss, the Director left at 5 o'clock.\"","Song Luosheng: \"Aren't you with her?\"","Li Bei: \"The Director doesn't want me following her.\"","Song Luosheng: \"Alright.\" He hung up and called home, \"Aunt Gui, has Luokui come home yet?\"","Aunt Gui: \"No, the young lady said she's not coming home for dinner tonight.\"","Song Luosheng frowned, \"She went out with friends again? But aren't Zhang Xiyue and the others abroad?\"","Song Luosheng then called Uncle An, \"Is the young lady in the car?\"","Uncle An: \"The young lady said she's going out with friends and didn't need me to drive her.\"","Song Luosheng's frown deepened, what other friends does his Luokui have?","Song Luosheng directly called Song Luokui, \"Where are you? Aunt Gui said you're not coming home for dinner tonight?\"","On the other side, Song Luokui had just arrived at Jinwei Hall with Chi Yu. Seeing the call, she immediately gestured for Chi Yu to be quiet, \"Hello? What's up, brother?\"","Then Song Luosheng asked that question.","Song Luokui blinked and lied: \"I'm having dinner with friends tonight, I brought them gifts.\"","Song Luosheng: \"What friends? Aren't Zhang Xiyue and the others still abroad?\"","Song Luokui rolled her eyes and said, \"Classmates, the ones who usually take care of me in class.\"","Chi Yu pulled out a bill and handed it to a nearby waitress, typing on his phone: \"Pretend to be her classmate and say something.\"","The waitress was very considerate, taking the money and walking over to Song Luokui with a smile, her voice loud enough for Song Luosheng to hear on the other end of the phone: \"Dear, what's wrong? Hurry up.\"","Song Luokui reacted quickly, \"Coming, coming. Brother, I'll go home after I finish eating.\"","Song Luosheng: \"When you're done, I'll have Uncle An come pick you up. Next time, let Uncle An take you, in case anything happens.\"","Song Luokui: \"Okay... okay.\" She had no choice but to have dinner with Chi Yu.","Sitting in the private room, Song Luokui felt a sense of guilt, \"Sigh, sneaking out with a guy to have dinner, hiding it from my brother, I suddenly feel like I'm being so disobedient? Is this my rebellious phase coming?\"","Chi Yu: \"A guy?\"","Song Luokui looked at him, \"Well, you're my boyfriend.\"","Chi Yu was satisfied.","Song Luokui: \"But I have to go home after we eat. Oh right, is your house at ChunWang Manor renovated yet?\"","Chi Yu: \"Yes.\"","Song Luokui: \"Mine is done too. Should I move there?\"","Chi Yu: \"After a while, maybe when school starts again.\"","Song Luokui: \"Mm-hmm?\"","Chi Yu: \"I'll move there too.\"","Song Luokui's eyes widened, \"You're moving there too?\"","Chi Yu took her hand, \"Then we won't have to sneak around to date anymore.\"","At the mention of sneaking around, Song Luokui felt guilty towards Chi Yu again.","Oh, she was such a terrible person, deceiving her brother on one hand, making Chi Yu be her secret lover on the other! What a bittersweet life."]},{"number":111,"title":"Chapter 111: Exploration","paragraphs":["After finishing dinner, Uncle An had already set out to come pick her up, Song Luokui originally thought of letting Chi Yu leave first to avoid running into him, but Chi Yu pulled her into his embrace, \"We still have time. You didn't accompany me to watch the opera today, so you owe me a compensation.\"","Song Luokui: \"......\" No problem.","She cupped Chi Yu's face with both hands, \"Promise, once the compensation is over, you leave first.\"","\"Okay.\" Chi Yu's eyes were fixated on her lips, not letting go. Today's dishes were a bit spicy, making Song Luokui's lips even more alluringly red.","Song Luokui tilted her head and leaned in. Although she was still a bit shy, after experiencing the storms of life, she could now lean in without hesitation.","As for Chi Yu gripping her waist with increasing force, it was as if he wanted to embed her into his own body.","She could even feel the heat radiating from Chi Yu's body. It was already very hot that day, even though the air conditioning in the private room was set to 22 degrees Celsius, but after just a short while, Song Luokui felt like she was going to break out in sweat.","She pushed Chi Yu away, her voice coming out making her blush, \"Okay... I can't breathe anymore.\"","Chi Yu wiped the corner of her mouth with his thumb, kissed her again, then held her in his embrace for a long while before finally letting her go.","\"I'll go back to the car first, and watch you leave before I leave.\" The prestigious heir of the Chi family, all his frustrations were unleashed on this adorable person, but he embraced it willingly.","\"Okay.\"","When she returned home, Song Luokui saw that Song Luosheng was waiting for her. Before he could say anything, she preemptively explained, \"Brother, I saw you on a blind date today?\"","The words Song Luosheng was about to say were swallowed back down. \"If you saw me, why didn't you come over?\"","Song Luokui rolled her eyes, \"Brother, you were on a blind date, why would I come over? I thought that girl looked quite pretty. What did you think of her, Brother?\"","Song Luosheng took a sip of water, \"Just like that, it wasn't a blind date, just a casual meeting out of courtesy since Grandpa and Grandma introduced her.\"","Song Luokui: \"I see, making a new friend isn't bad either. Speaking of which, Brother, you're also at that age. It's time for you to find a relationship. You've always been competing with Chi Yu for first place, so why don't you compete in finding a girlfriend, getting married, and having kids?\"","There was a momentary silence from Song Luosheng. That was a good question.","\"But neither of us has a girlfriend, so there's no rush,\" Song Luosheng said after thinking it over. \"Besides, having a girlfriend would affect my ability to make money. Always caught up in lovey-dovey stuff, when would I have time to manage the company? Just wait, whoever gets into a relationship first will definitely be hindered in making money.\"","Song Luokui: ....... Sorry, she already hindered Chi Yu from making money.","It seemed like her family had benefited, she got a boyfriend, and Chi Yu took time away from making money to go on dates with her, while her brother had no love life, only caring about making money.","So Song Luokui tested the waters: \"If that's the case, then what if I seduce Chi Yu and make him call you Uncle, that way he'll be hindered from making money, and he'll have to respectfully address you as Uncle, how's that?\"","Song Luosheng rejected the idea immediately without a second thought, \"No way! If you seduce him, that's just giving him a freebie. Absolutely not, Luokui you can't do that.\"","Song Luokui: \"...... Okay okay.\" She already had.","Song Luosheng: \"Even joking about it is not allowed, but you've given me an idea, I'll find someone else to seduce him instead.\"","Song Luokui blurted out, \"No!\" Chi Yu was hers, her brother finding someone to seduce her boyfriend, what kind of thing was that?","Song Luosheng looked at her, \"Why not? Luokui, although that Chi Yu did save you, we've repaid all debts owed. We need to be clear about boundaries, understand?\"","Song Luokui: \"...... Um, but he also saved my life, if you find someone to seduce him it would be like harming him, wouldn't that be repaying kindness with enmity? Father would beat you if he found out.\"","Song Luosheng: \"Father won't find out, but you make a fair point. Alright then, I'll use proper means to defeat him.\"","\"Okay okay, I'll cheer you on, Brother. Brother, I'm going to rest now, I'm tired.\"","\"Go ahead.\"","......","Half a month later, Zhang Xiyue and the others finally returned from their vacation. Of course, they brought gifts for Song Luokui, \"I heard you attended some summer camp activity and also went to Banras? Why didn't you find us?\"","Song Luokui: \"It wouldn't be good for me to disrupt your own plans by joining you all.\"","Zhang Xiyue accepted this reason, \"Alright, Sa Sa and the others asked me to bring you gifts too.\"","Song Luokui: \"Thank you all, I'll treat you all to a meal when I have time.\"","\"Sure. Going on a trip was tiring but also very fun. I'm going to rest for a few days first.\"","\"Okay.\"","A few days later, Zhang Xiyue came over in a panic, \"Luokui, Luokui! Something bad happened.\"","It was the weekend today, and Song Luokui was resting at home for a rare day off since she didn't go to the company, while Chi Yu went on a business trip to another city.","\"What's wrong? What happened again?\"","Zhang Xiyue showed Song Luokui a photo on her phone, \"Isn't your brother dating a girlfriend now?\"","Song Luokui looked, and it was that girl her brother met before, Su Congrong, who was apparently also a wealthy heiress from Jing City who had just returned from studying abroad not long ago.","\"I know about this, it was my grandparents who introduced her. It shouldn't be a girlfriend, just making a new friend.\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"But it looks like you're going to have a sister-in-law soon?\"","Recalling what Song Luosheng said before, \"It probably won't happen, it seems like my brother didn't have much interest.\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"But that means they've met again after the initial meeting, so there's progress, right?\" The photo showed them riding horses side-by-side at a stable, chatting.","Song Luokui: \"I'm not sure about this either. My brother didn't mention it.\"","Zhang Xiyue just wanted to gossip, \"Speaking of which, Brother hasn't had a single romantic rumor all these years, this is the first time.\"","Song Luokui: \"It just shows my brother has been upright and proper.\"","Zhang Xiyue waved her hand, \"I think Brother has just been totally focused on his career. Oh, if your brother does get a girlfriend, he might not dote on you as much anymore, what will you do?\"","Song Luokui: \"My brother isn't that kind of person. Besides, I can get a boyfriend for him to dote on me. If my brother gets a girlfriend, it's normal for him to dote on her.\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"That's true, Brother is that type, even if he gets married he'll probably still dote on you, even if you take advantage of him for life he'll probably be fine with it. But if you get a boyfriend, who knows how Brother will react.\"","Song Luokui: \"What about you? You were more interested in romance than friendship during the trip, how did that go?\" Although she knew her sister had already handled the little boyfriend situation, she still wanted to hear it from her own mouth.","But Zhang Xiyue was evasive, \"Haha, nothing, nothing happened.\" She couldn't admit that she had only recently found out her little boyfriend was related to that Chi fellow who called himself Brother, that would make her a traitor, wouldn't it? If everyone knew, they'd call her a traitor. Better to just play along for now and not say anything.","Song Luokui blinked: \"Alright.\""]},{"number":112,"title":"Chapter 112: Warm House Moving","paragraphs":["Zhang Xiyue was afraid of giving herself away, and she mainly wanted to hear gossip. Since there was no gossip, she didn't stay long before leaving.","She had just walked out the door when she turned back, \"Oh right, let's all go out for a meal tomorrow.\"","Song Luokui: \"No problem.\"","However, the next day when Song Luokui was having a meal with Zhang Xiyue and others at the restaurant, Lou Sasa's eyes were sharp. She tilted her chin and pointed to a corner, \"Luokui, your brother, and a woman.\"","Song Luokui turned to look, and there was a woman sitting in front of her brother. It wasn't Su Congrong, but the woman she had seen when she went to surprise him last time.","Zhang Xiyue: \"It's not the one from the Su family, Luokui. Did your family introduce someone else? I don't recognize that woman, and her gaze... seems unsavory.\"","Lou Sasa: \"She has a seductive, promiscuous aura.\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"Yes, yes, that's the feeling.\"","Song Luokui: \"I don't know her, but I've seen that woman before... My brother doesn't seem to have a good impression of her.\" She just didn't know why the two were having a meal together, and she didn't know what her brother was up to.","\"Oh shit, she's making a move.\"","Song Luokui saw the woman reach out to caress Song Luosheng's face, but he immediately slapped her hand away. Then Song Luosheng wiped his hand with a napkin as if he had touched something dirty, said something, and the woman across from him looked unpleasant.","Song Luosheng stood up and quickly left.","Weng Jiao: \"It's not some company's honeytrap scheme, is it?\"","Zhou Yue: \"It's possible. My brother seems to be really busy lately, I don't know what he's up to.\"","Lou Sasa: \"Didn't your brother say anything?\"","Zhou Yue looked at Song Luokui, \"My brother wouldn't tell you about Brother Song's business, Luokui. Didn't Brother Song tell you anything?\"","Song Luokui shook her head: \"No. Nevermind, I trust my brother can handle it. From the looks of it, my brother doesn't seem to like that woman.\"","No one said anything else and quickly ate their meal, talking about some travel anecdotes instead.","In fact, everyone's guesses were not wrong - it was indeed a honeytrap, but Song Luosheng didn't fall for it. He did have a small collaboration with Wei Qing, but he didn't expect that Wei Qing would later send such a woman to interact with them, and even try to make physical advances on him. It was truly disgusting.","Song Luosheng was furious and called Lin Xingyan, \"From now on, you deal with her. After this is over, we won't be working with them again.\" If it weren't for the significant benefits, he really wouldn't want to collaborate with Wei Qing's side.","Song Luosheng sighed, and just as that ended, Su Congrong called him again, \"Hello? Mr. Song, are you free? I'd like to invite you to an art exhibition if possible?\"","Song Luosheng: \"I'm sorry, Miss Su, I'm not too free. Miss Su, let's not meet again. It was just an introduction by our elders, and I think you understand.\"","\"Oh... I'm sorry. Then I won't disturb you, Mr. Song.\" Su Congrong hung up dejectedly, and her friend Lv Shu kept asking, \"How was it? How was it?\"","Su Congrong covered her face, \"He said we shouldn't meet again, so... he probably doesn't like me.\"","Lv Shu: \"How can that be? Oh, didn't you say he has a younger sister? Why don't you try approaching his sister? Congrong, a woman pursuing a man is like chasing through a veil - don't be afraid. Song Luosheng is a big shot in high society, other than the one from the Chi Family. If you could become his girlfriend, many would envy you.\"","Su Congrong: \"But...\"","Lv Shu: \"Congrong, you don't want to end up being arranged into a political marriage, do you?\"","Su Congrong: \"Then... I'll give it a try.\"","\"Yes, try. Oh, let me help find out about his sister's situation.\"","\"Thank you, Shu.\"","\"We're best friends. Just don't forget me when you become rich and noble in the future.\"","\"Of course.\"","...","Chi Yu returned from a business trip, and Song Luokui secretly went to meet him again, \"I encountered a woman at my brother's company before... Do you think it could have been a honeytrap scheme?\"","As soon as Chi Yu heard it, he said: \"Yes.\"","\"Ah?\" Song Luokui was stunned.","Chi Yu took out an earring and put it on her, \"It's a honeytrap, but your brother shouldn't be that stupid. He probably wouldn't fall for it.\"","Song Luokui touched her earlobe, \"Why did you buy me another gift?\"","Chi Yu: \"I saw it and thought of you, so I bought it.\" After putting it on her, he admired it, \"Beautiful.\"","Song Luokui: \"Thank you.\"","Song Luokui: \"My brother...\"","Before she could finish, Chi Yu kissed her. Song Luokui froze, and Chi Yu said, \"I don't want to hear you talk about your brother all the time. We finally get to meet.\"","As he spoke, he kissed her again. Song Luokui was helpless - this man was becoming more and more domineering. He looked celibate, but when kissing, it was as if he wanted to devour her.","He was increasingly unsatisfied with just meeting secretly. He wanted to be able to see her anytime, anywhere.","After kissing, Chi Yu leaned his forehead against hers, \"When, when can I appear openly?\"","Song Luokui: \"...Why don't I ask my parents first.\" If her parents agreed, then her brother shouldn't have an issue either, right? Or if he did have an issue, he couldn't force her to break up, could he?","But she also felt bad towards her brother who had grown up together with her, since her brother had been so good to her.","Song Luokui's conflicted expression was reflected in Chi Yu's eyes, \"Even if your brother beats me up if he finds out, I don't care.\"","Chi Yu suddenly lowered his gaze, looking dejected.","Song Luokui's heart immediately softened, and she hugged him, \"No, I'll stand by your side.\"","Chi Yu hugged her back, concealing his smile. Occasionally showing vulnerability was effective too.","A few days before the new semester, Song Luokui packed up some of her belongings to move to the house at ChunWang Manor. If she hadn't packed, she wouldn't have realized that the gifts Chi Yu had given her already filled two large boxes, and she planned to move them all there.","Chi Yu really wanted to help her move, but was rejected. Not only that, he couldn't even go over that evening when she had a housewarming dinner at the new place.","Song Luokui invited her brother, Zhou Yue, Lin Xingyan, and others. Of course, she invited her sisters too.","\"Luokui, you're finally moving out to live on your own.\"","Song Luokui: \"Just occasionally, if it gets too late after work, I'll stay here.\"","\"That's almost the same. I thought you'd live in the main residence until you got married.\"","\"Haha.\"","They ate until after 10 PM, and everyone gradually left. Song Luosheng was worried she'd be scared living alone, \"Do you want me to stay here tonight to keep you company?\"","Song Luokui: \"No need, I want to live alone. You can go back, Brother.\"","\"Alright, call me if you need anything. Don't open the door if someone knocks.\"","\"I know, I know.\"","Just as her brother went downstairs, someone came out from the opposite side, which Song Luokui didn't expect. She was about to wash up when Chi Yu called her, \"I'm outside your new home.\"","Song Luokui: ???","Song Luosheng, who had just gone down to the parking lot, suddenly realized he had forgotten his phone and turned back..."]},{"number":113,"title":"Chapter 113: Stimulation","paragraphs":["When Song Luokui opened the door to her room, she saw Chi Yu standing at the entrance. She immediately pulled him into the room, \"What are you doing here? No one saw you, did they?\"","Chi Yu: \"No, I've been across the way.\" Chi Yu followed her to the couch, glancing around at the decor as he went, and embraced Song Luokui when she sat down.","Song Luokui: \"Across the way?\" She suddenly remembered that Chi Yu had bought the place across from her. \"So you're living across from me now?\"","Song Luokui leaned on his shoulder.","Chi Yu: \"Yeah.\"","\"When did you move across the way?\"","Chi Yu: \"A few days ago. You said you were moving over here soon, so I moved here too. I didn't get to come over for your housewarming meal.\" Chi Yu sounded a little hurt.","Song Luokui felt a bit sorry for him. \"Sorry about that.\" She kissed him to comfort him, but Chi Yu took the opportunity to pull her into a passionate kiss.","\"Knock knock knock\" At that moment, there was a knock at the door. \"Luokui, your brother forgot his phone.\"","The kissing couple froze. Song Luokui gave a start and pushed Chi Yu away. \"Oh no, no, no, my brother's here! You hide! Quick, quick!\" Song Luokui wiped her mouth and stood up, then pulled Chi Yu into her bedroom. \"Don't you dare come out, okay?\"","\"Luokui? Are you in the shower?\" Outside, Song Luosheng didn't hear anyone come to the door, so he knocked again.","After saying that, she quickly closed the door, took a deep breath, thought about the kiss just now, and immediately looked at her mouth in the mirror. It was a little swollen. Song Luokui grabbed a bag of spicy snacks and stuffed a strip of it into her mouth, then went to open the door. \"Brother, why are you back again?\" Her face was still flushed, and her hair was tousled.","Song Luosheng was just about to knock again when the door finally opened.","\"Why did it take you so long to open the door?\" Song Luosheng walked in and started looking for his phone. \"Have you seen my phone?\"","Song Luokui: \"I didn't hear you knocking from inside the room. Your phone? I don't think I've seen it. Do you remember where you put it?\"","Song Luosheng: \"I forgot. Let me look around.\" He had just finished eating. \"Why are you eating spicy snacks again? Cut down on the junk food.\"","Song Luokui felt a little guilty. \"Okay, okay, I was just tasting them.\"","Song Luosheng was still looking for his phone. \"Where could it be? Let me check the bathroom.\" He looked around the bathroom but didn't find it either.","\"That's odd? I'm sure I had it here with you. Luokui, give me a call.\"","\"Okay.\" Song Luokui took out her phone and called Song Luosheng. Soon, the ring tone sounded from Song Luokui's bedroom.","Song Luokui's face turned pale, but Song Luosheng had already grabbed the door handle and was about to go in. \"Wait!\"","Song Luokui shouted loudly and rushed over, but with a click, Song Luosheng had already opened the door. \"What's wrong? I heard the sound coming from here.\" Song Luosheng walked in.","Song Luokui rushed over and hugged Song Luosheng from behind. \"Brother, wait a minute.\"","Song Luosheng stopped in his tracks when she hugged him. \"Luokui, I can see my phone.\"","Song Luokui peered over Song Luosheng's shoulder but didn't see Chi Yu. However, she did see Song Luosheng's phone on the dressing table, probably left there accidentally during the earlier tour.","She let go of Song Luosheng, ran over to grab the phone, and walked back to the door. \"Here's your phone, brother.\"","Song Luosheng took the phone and looked at her closely. \"Why did you tell me to wait just now?\"","Song Luokui took a bite of the spicy snack. \"Oh, it's just my room. I didn't want anyone going in.\"","Song Luosheng ruffled her hair, unsatisfied. \"I'm your brother, no need to be so distant.\"","Song Luokui: \"I've grown up now.\"","Song Luosheng: \"Alright, alright, our Luokui has grown up. From now on, I'll get your permission before going into your room. I'll leave now. Don't eat too many snacks this late at night. Get some rest.\"","\"Got it, got it. Bye brother.\"","Song Luosheng suddenly turned around. \"Hold on.\"","Song Luokui tensed up. \"What...what is it?\"","Song Luosheng smoothed her hair and touched her face. \"Your face looks a little flushed. Let me see if you have a fever.\"","Song Luokui: \"I'm fine, just...hot from...eating the spicy snacks.\"","Song Luosheng: \"Don't eat so many spicy snacks, your mouth is swollen. Rest well and lock the doors and windows.\"","After closing the door, Song Luokui's legs felt weak. After calming down for a while, she immediately locked the door and ran to her bedroom. \"Chi Yu? Darling?\"","\"Click\" Chi Yu came out of the bathroom.","Song Luokui sighed in relief, went over to hold his hand. \"Thank goodness you were clever. You gave me such a fright. If my brother had seen you in my room...\" Song Luokui mimed slitting her throat. \"We'd be dead for sure.\"","When Chi Yu entered the room earlier, he had seen the phone, so when he heard Song Luosheng mention it, he immediately hid in the bathroom.","He listened to their conversation from the bathroom, feeling like he was someone having an affair with the female lead.","But wasn't it an affair? Aside from his brothers, hardly anyone knew that Song Luokui belonged to him.","Chi Yu noticed the spicy snack in Song Luokui's hand that wasn't there before. \"Why are you suddenly eating spicy snacks?\"","Song Luokui glared at him. \"Because my mouth was swollen, so I was afraid my brother would notice. I used the spicy snacks to cover it up.\"","Chi Yu finally understood what happened and comforted her. \"Sorry, it was my fault. Next time I'll kiss you more gently.\"","Song Luokui blushed and playfully punched his chest.","\"Let me show you my place. Have you eaten? If not, I'll make you some noodles, so you can have my housewarming meal too.\"","\"Okay~\"","\"Let's go to the kitchen.\"","Although he said he would cook noodles, Chi Yu washed the vegetables, cut the tomatoes, and Song Luokui only boiled everything together. In the end, afraid she might get burned, Chi Yu scooped out the noodles himself.","Chi Yu ate the noodles while Song Luokui nibbled on the spicy snacks, since she had already opened the bag and thought she might as well finish it.","\"Want to come over to my place later and take a look?\" Chi Yu suggested.","Song Luokui checked the time. \"It's too late. How about tomorrow? Do you want to have the housewarming meal at your place?\"","Chi Yu: \"Sure, just the two of us?\"","Song Luokui: \"Ah? What about your brothers like Senior Ji Xiao and the others from last time?\"","Hearing Song Luokui say this, Chi Yu suddenly smiled at her. Song Luokui was puzzled. \"What's wrong? Are they not available?\"","Chi Yu suddenly grabbed her hand. \"No, I'm just happy. I'm happy that you're actively entering my circle.\"","Song Luokui felt a little embarrassed and guilty. \"No...no, I'm not. When should we have it?\"","Chi Yu: \"Let's do it tomorrow then. I'll ask them.\"","\"Sure! If they're not available, we can postpone it.\"","\"Okay.\"","When Ji Xiao and the others heard about it, they all said they were definitely available tomorrow evening.","Song Luokui: \"Then I'll have to go buy a gift tomorrow.\"","Chi Yu: \"Do you want me to accompany you?\"","Song Luokui: \"No need, I want to surprise you, it won't be a surprise if you go with me.\"","\"Okay.\"","Chi Yu finished the noodles, then cleaned the kitchen, and kissed her several times before finally leaving, but a few minutes later he knocked on the door again, handing Song Luokui a box, \"This is a gift. A housewarming gift.\"","Song Luokui took it happily, \"Thank you.\"","\"I'll be going then.\"","\"Mm, good night.\"","\"Good night.\""]},{"number":114,"title":"Chapter 114: Greenhouse Meals on the Pond Islands","paragraphs":["The next afternoon, Song Luokui set off to the mall to buy a gift for Chi Yu. Chi Yu had to work today, but he got off work around four in the afternoon.","\"There's nothing urgent today, so I'll leave first. If there's an emergency, find Chen Manager,\" Chi Yu instructed his secretary before leaving.","The secretary was quite shocked. The boss leaving work on time was already surprising enough, but now he was even leaving early?","The charm of love was quite powerful indeed. Yes, they all knew the boss was in a relationship, but they didn't know who the future Madam Boss would be. Come to think of it, he seemed to know that a lady had visited a few times before, but the boss kept her very close, and no one knew what she looked like.","The front desk girl had probably seen her, but it wasn't appropriate for her to reveal it, so everyone was in the dark. Chen Manager likely knew too, but he definitely wouldn't disclose it.","When Chi Yu returned to Chunwang Gongguan, he first sent Song Luokui a message asking if she was home. Song Luokui said she was out, \"I'll probably be back around five, around five thirty.\"","Chi Yu: \"Okay, then do you want to come over here directly?\"","Song Luokui: \"Mmm.\"","Chi Yu went over to the kitchen area and took a look. The chefs were already busy in the kitchen. A servant saw him coming and greeted him with a \"Sir.\"","Chi Yu: \"Mmm. Do we have cherries and strawberries?\"","Servant: \"No strawberries, only cherries, and grapes, oranges, and others.\"","Chi Yu: \"Please have someone go buy some strawberries. Oh, and have the chef make a strawberry cake, and brew some flower tea for the lady to drink.\"","Servant: \"Yes, I'll take care of it right away.\"","When Song Luokui arrived, the strawberries had already been bought. Song Luokui handed the gift box to Chi Yu, then began looking around at the decor on his side.","\"Your place seems to have a similar layout to mine.\"","Chi Yu: \"Mmm, if in the future... we can connect them directly.\" Chi Yu handed her a strawberry, and there was also a plate of washed cherries beside them.","Song Luokui ate the strawberry, \"If? If what?\"","Chi Yu: \"If we get married.\"","Song Luokui: \"Cough cough cough...\"","Chi Yu gently patted her back, holding her hand tightly with his other hand, \"We will get married, right...\"","Song Luokui looked up at him, realizing he was indeed asking this question with complete seriousness. Song Luokui opened her mouth but didn't know how to answer him. If she said yes, she wasn't sure herself. If she said no, it would hurt his feelings.","Song Luokui pondered how she should respond, when the servant happened to bring over the strawberry cake. \"Sir, the strawberry cake is ready.\"","Seeing that Song Luokui didn't answer, Chi Yu released her hand, took the cake and placed it in front of her. \"If you're hungry, have some cake first to line your stomach.\"","Song Luokui saw that he didn't ask again, so she didn't reply either. \"Okay.\"","At that moment, the doorbell rang. The servant went to open the door, and it was Ji Xiao and the others.","\"Bro, we're here,\" one said, holding a bottle of wine, while the other had someone carrying things behind him.","\"Bro, gifts.\"","Chi Yu stood up and walked over, \"Thanks.\" Then he looked at the things the person was carrying behind Li Yanbei. \"What's that?\"","Li Yanbei: \"We brought you a huge framed photo. You can put it in your room or living room.\" The photo was still covered with a cloth, so Song Luokui didn't know what it was either.","Chi Yu was also a bit puzzled. \"What photo? Let me see.\"","Song Luokui walked over too, thinking it might be a landscape photo or a solo photo of Chi Yu.","However, when they unveiled it...","\"Cough cough cough...\" Song Luokui was immediately choked by her own saliva. Chi Yu hurriedly went to pat her back, while Li Yanbei quickly poured her a glass of water. \"Sister-in-law is quite excited, haha.\"","Song Luokui: \"...\"","Indeed, she was quite excited. The huge photo showed her and Chi Yu, a photo from the ceremony where Chi Yu had confessed his love to her. She was holding a bouquet of flowers, and Chi Yu stood in front of her, holding her hand, the two of them gazing at each other and smiling...","For some reason, Song Luokui remembered that some people would put up a large wedding photo in their room after getting married...","But this was just Chi Yu's house...","Chi Yu examined it and seemed very satisfied. \"Hang it in my room.\"","Li Yanbei: \"Sure, bro, should we have them nail it up now?\"","Chi Yu pulled Song Luokui over. \"Let's see where would be a good spot to put it.\"","The group then entered Chi Yu's room. His room was very large, but the bed area was separated by a wall. There was also an office area, a living room area, a dressing room, and more.","The overall color scheme leaned towards black and gray. On one desk, there were some photo frames displayed. Song Luokui noticed that one of the photos was Chi Yu's graduation photo from college, the one they had taken together in the student council office.","Song Luokui suddenly wondered if he had already had feelings for her back then.","Chi Yu pointed to an empty spot on the wall. \"How about putting it there?\"","Song Luokui looked in the direction he was pointing. It was right beside the bed... You would see it directly when waking up or going to sleep...","\"Um... It's your room, you can decide.\" To be honest, the huge photo made her feel a bit embarrassed.","At this point, Li Yanbei chimed in, \"Sister-in-law, your opinion is still very important, since you'll be sleeping here in the future too, right?\"","Ji Xiao elbowed him, signaling him not to speak nonsense, even though what he said was accurate.","Upon hearing that, Song Luokui's face turned even redder as she glanced towards the bed on that side...","Seeing her blush from her neck all the way up to her face, Chi Yu didn't want to put her on the spot any further. In fact, if the two of them got married, they probably wouldn't live here. This was just a temporary residence.","\"Let's hang it there then.\"","\"Got it, masters, please be careful.\"","...","After it was hung up, Li Yanbei saw the workers out. The chef had also finished cooking the dishes, and the wine Ji Xiao brought was also opened.","\"Cheers!\"","Song Luokui didn't drink alcohol this time. She really did have a soft drink, which Chi Yu carefully checked.","As they ate, they chatted.","Li Yanbei: \"When I first came in, I felt this place was quite nice. Maybe I should buy a unit too, just for investment and appreciation. Although a two-unit building seems a bit small.\"","It wasn't that small though, each unit was over 200 square meters.","Jiang Xubai: \"You wouldn't buy this place if it wasn't a two-unit building, right? You're here for Sister-in-law. I heard Sister-in-law lives next door.\"","Li Yanbei: \"You're right.\"","After finishing the meal, everyone took a tour of the rooms. They had seen the living room when they first came in, and also saw the master bedroom. Then they went to check out the other rooms. The design of every space was very tasteful.","Li Yanbei: \"Who was the designer? I like it.\"","Song Luokui: \"Next time if you're wondering, ask Chen Nan.\" The designer is always found through Chen Nan.","\"Got it.\"","Zhou Wenqin looked at him suddenly and said, \"Brother, aren't you missing something here?\"","Chi Yu: \"What?\"","\"A lady's dressing room and makeup room.\"","Li Yanbei: \"You're being silly, this is Brother's house. Sister-in-law lives next door.\"","Zhou Wenqin: \"Oh, I just felt like I was attending the housewarming of a newlywed couple...\"","Song Luokui's face turned even redder from the side..."]},{"number":115,"title":"Chapter 115: Back-to-School Speech","paragraphs":["Until 10 o'clock that night, Li Yanbei and the others had left, and the cleaning ladies had also gone. Now in the room were only Song Luokui and Chi Yu.","Song Luokui and Chi Yu looked at each other. She blinked her eyes, \"I should go too.\"","Chi Yu held her hand, \"Wait a moment. I thought about what Wen Qin said, and I wonder where you think the dressing room and vanity would be better placed?\"","Song Luokui: \"...Never mind. Didn't you say...we could connect them?\"","Chi Yu smiled when he heard that, \"You're right.\" After getting married, they could connect them.","Song Luokui: \"It's late, I should go back.\"","Chi Yu: \"Yeah, I'll walk you.\"","Song Luokui: \"...\" It was just across the way, there was no need to walk her.","Chi Yu walked Song Luokui to the door. She opened it and turned to say goodnight to him. Then she looked at his hand still holding hers and gestured for him to let go.","But Chi Yu didn't release her hand. Instead, he pulled her into an embrace and sighed, \"I don't want to let go.\"","Song Luokui: \"Okay...if I have time tomorrow, I'll come over again? Or you can come here.\"","Chi Yu kissed her forehead, \"Okay, good night.\"","\"Good night.\"","Since school was starting again, Song Luokui went to the company early the next day. \"I have to go to school the day after tomorrow, so I may not be at the company as much. If there's anything, just have Li Bei tell me. If there are any urgent documents, she can bring them directly to me.\"","\"Understood.\"","The company was slowly getting on track and starting to make good money. With more business, several of their short films received positive reviews.","According to the plan, they were preparing to start producing a TV series, of course starting with a low-budget web series. The company had been buying rights recently, and the more they earned, the more they spent. Song Luokui didn't hesitate to sign the reimbursement forms.","After school started, Song Luokui became a senior in her third year. The college leadership came to find her, \"Student Song, we'd like to invite you as the representative of the College of Liberal Arts to give an opening speech.\"","The leader was very kind, \"Student Song, you've declined many of our previous activity invitations. I hope you can agree this time. Wouldn't it be great to leave a nice memory from your university life?\"","Song Luokui hesitated for a moment but still agreed, \"Okay.\"","The leaders and counselors were delighted. \"Then you can go prepare properly.\"","\"Thank you, leaders and counselors.\"","That night, Song Luokui returned to the family courtyard home. She was writing her speech draft at the desk in her room when Song Luosheng knocked on the door. Song Luokui didn't look up, \"Come in.\"","Song Luosheng brought in some fruit, \"What are you doing? Aunt Gui said you went straight to your room after dinner. Working on homework?\"","Song Luokui: \"No, a speech draft.\"","Song Luosheng was surprised, \"Are you going to participate in a speech contest? I'll go cheer you on, sis.\"","Song Luokui: \"No, it's for the College of Liberal Arts opening ceremony.\"","Song Luosheng: \"Then I'll go watch.\"","Song Luokui: \"How will you watch? Are you going to repeat your freshman year? And aren't you a second-year graduate student? Don't you have an opening ceremony?\"","Song Luosheng: \"Yes, but it won't stop me from watching you.\"","Song Luokui shrugged, \"Fine, but don't make a scene saying you know me when you're there.\"","When Song Luokui told Chi Yu that she would be giving an opening speech at the College of Liberal Arts ceremony, Chi Yu also said, \"Then I'll go watch you.\"","Song Luokui: \"...Maybe not, my brother said he'd go watch me too.\"","Chi Yu: \"It's okay, he won't know I'm there to watch you.\"","The College of Liberal Arts opening ceremony was soon ready to begin. In the university auditorium, all the new students from the College of Liberal Arts were already seated. The leadership of the College of Liberal Arts was seated on the stage.","\"Today, we have also invited two senior students to attend our opening ceremony. Please welcome Mr. Chi Yu, Chairman of the Shan Yu Group, who is also a second-year graduate student at our university.\" The host pointed to the well-dressed man in the front row, and the large screen also broadcasted the people in the front row so everyone could see.","\"Clap clap clap clap!\" Many people in the audience applauded.","Song Luosheng: !! F***!","\"We also welcome Mr. Song Luosheng, Chairman of Songhua Technology, who is also a second-year graduate student at our university - our senior student Song.\" There were a few empty seats between Song Luosheng and Chi Yu. Song Luosheng immediately made eye contact with Chi Yu.","Chi Yu, however, didn't show any reaction. He took the microphone handed to him and said, \"Today, I'm honored to be invited to attend...\" At this moment, Chi Yu's speech was clearly shown on the large screen, and everyone downstairs went \"Wow\" in a loud voice. Some people couldn't help but secretly take photos with their phones.","After Chi Yu finished speaking, it was Song Luosheng's turn: \"I am also very honored today...\"","When the large screen switched to show Song Luosheng's face, the audience let out another loud \"Wow.\"","Sitting in the second row, Song Luokui: ...","She didn't expect it to be like this, and the order too... Her brother must be upset.","However, in such a public setting, Song Luosheng still maintained his composure. After speaking, he sat down obediently and didn't look at Chi Yu again, but he did ponder: Chi Yu came here to watch my sister Luokui, so what is he here for?","After they finished speaking, the applause from below was extremely loud and sustained.","The host smiled and said, \"It seems the two senior students are very popular. Hahaha. Next...\" He then introduced some other invited dignitaries, after which the Dean of the College of Liberal Arts began to speak.","\"Respected teachers and students, good morning everyone! I am... Thank you all for choosing Peking University's College of Liberal Arts... I hope we will study together for the rise of China...\"","\"Now, please welcome our student representative from the College of Liberal Arts, Song Luokui, to deliver a speech.\"","Everyone then saw a young woman stand up from the second row. She was wearing the College of Liberal Arts uniform, with her hair tied in a high ponytail, looking fresh and clean.","As she walked onto the stage, the large screen also clearly showed her face. The audience downstairs let out another \"Wow\" in admiration.","Then a voice was heard: \"Oh my god, what a day. I got to see super handsome guys and a super beautiful lady.\"","\"Respected leaders, teachers, dear students, good morning everyone. I am Song Luokui from the XX class...\"","In the middle of her speech, Song Luokui suddenly made eye contact with Chi Yu downstairs. He was smiling at her. Song Luokui's heart tightened, afraid someone would notice, so she quickly averted her gaze. It then fell on Song Luosheng's face, and he gave her a thumbs up gesture.","The oblivious leader next to him asked, \"Does Mr. Song know the student on stage?\"","Song Luosheng said proudly, \"Ah, that's my sister.\"","The leader was surprised for a moment, seeing the name of the student representative, Song Luokui, on the stage. Oh, it differed from Mr. Song Luosheng by just one character, no wonder.","\"I hope everyone will have a wonderful time at Peking University...\" After finishing her speech, Song Luokui bowed and left the stage.","Next, there were some student singing performances to liven up the atmosphere, as well as speeches by alumni and corporate representatives."]},{"number":116,"title":"Chapter 116: Rumors","paragraphs":["It was not Chi Yu or Song Luosheng who represented the company at the speech, but rather an older senior student from the Faculty of Liberal Arts.","There was also a donation ceremony at the end, where the invited business tycoons donated - one donated 10 million, another donated 20 million.","Chi Yu directly donated an entire building, and not to be outdone, Song Luosheng also donated a building...","Everyone in the audience gasped in shock and burst into thunderous applause, with the institute's leaders grinning from ear to ear.","Finally, the university leaders presented the new students with the institute's badges. After that, everyone sang the Faculty of Liberal Arts' anthem, followed by the national anthem. Each new student was filled with anticipation for the future.","Before the ceremony ended, the leaders took photos with the invited alumni and business leaders.","The leaders also called Song Luokui over, \"Student Song Luokui, come join us, it's okay, come on over.\"","Song Luokui had no choice but to walk over, and Song Luosheng immediately called out, \"Kui Kui, come stand over here.\"","Then Song Luokui ended up standing right next to Song Luosheng, and Chi Yu immediately changed his position to stand beside Song Luokui...","After the opening ceremony of the Faculty of Liberal Arts, everyone was buzzing with discussion.","\"It was so worth it today, we got to see incredibly handsome seniors and an extremely beautiful sister. Oh my god, you know when they appeared? Everyone just went 'Wow!'\"","\"I had already heard some gossip about the two senior brothers in the freshman group, but there was no gossip about the beautiful sister?\"","\"I heard the sister is very low-key. Apparently, she played the piano at a previous gala, performing an epic piece, but after that she rarely appeared in public.\"","\"The school's publicity department tried to get her to film promotional videos many times, but she always refused.\"","\"I don't know what the leaders said to her this time, but she actually agreed to be the student representative and give a speech, wuwuwuwu.\"","\"Aaaahhhh, I was sitting right behind the sister at the time, she really is extremely beautiful! I took photos, but the photos don't capture even a tenth of her beauty when seen in person.\"","\"And the sister is always ranked first in her grade. I heard that her articles have been published in newspapers many times.\"","...","After the speech, Song Luokui sat waiting for Song Luosheng, who had gone to the restroom.","Chi Yu also sat nearby, their eyes not meeting. Occasionally Chi Yu would glance at Song Luokui, then immediately look away. Chi Yu sent her a message: \"Your speech today was great.\"","Song Luokui: \"I was afraid my brother and you would get into a fight.\" Although she knew it wouldn't happen.","Chi Yu: \"I definitely wouldn't fight back.\"","Song Luokui: \"How did you explain coming to see me?\"","Chi Yu: \"I just said I was going to donate an entire building to the Faculty of Liberal Arts.\"","Song Luokui: \"...\" He donated an entire building just to see her speech...","On Song Luosheng's side, as soon as he came out of the restroom, he suddenly bumped into a female student, or rather, a female student bumped into him. However, Song Luosheng still helped her up, \"Are you okay?\"","But that girl immediately hugged him tightly. Song Luosheng's expression changed instantly as he forcefully pushed her away and threw her off.","He was about to question her when she quickly ran away.","Song Luosheng frowned, thinking she was just someone who secretly admired him - not that he was conceited, he just had that kind of status.","Not thinking too much of it, Song Luosheng went out, \"Kui Kui, let's go. I'll take you home.\"","Song Luokui quickly put her phone on silent mode, \"Okay.\" As she turned to leave, she exchanged a brief glance with Chi Yu.","After they left, Chi Yu also got up and left.","The next day, a post quietly appeared online.","#Exposing the Young and Accomplished Chairman of Songhua Technology#","\"Everyone knows that a certain Chairman Song is the head of a major company at a young age, and he's also quite handsome, with many female fans online. But you probably don't know what he's really like in private, do you?\"","\"[Image with face blurred] [Image with face blurred] [Image with face blurred]\"","\"Each image shows a different girl, you know. And you didn't think that was just three girls, did you? It's impossible, these big shots couldn't have been playing with just three women in private. And... you all know, right, as a big shot, some people will directly offer him... ahem, you know what I mean.\"","\"I wonder how those fans who said they would have his children feel, when in private he's probably slept with countless fans already. Let me say something everyone knows - in the rich circles, that's just how it is. Getting a girl pregnant isn't a big deal, they can just pay to take care of it.\"","At first, no one really paid attention to this post. But somehow, the heat quietly started rising.","Of course, Songhua Technology's PR team noticed this post and immediately contacted the poster to warn them and request they take it down. Although it didn't name names, the implication was very clear.","The poster then made another post: \"Scared, scared, the PR team is coming for me so I have to delete it.\"","Shortly after posting that, they deleted the original post. But what's the point of deleting it when netizens had already taken screenshots?","Initially, it was only a small number of people discussing it. But in high-level corporate warfare, they usually wait for the opponent to make a mistake before adding fuel to the fire. So this post was propelled to become a trending topic.","Within just an hour, it had blown up into a major trending topic.","\"They're talking about Songhua Technology, right?\"","\"Although there aren't many pictures of the Songhua Chairman online, I've seen him in person once, and while they say he's handsome, I think his facial features look untrustworthy.\"","\"Some people will try to defend him by saying it's just a moral failing, and since he's not married, it's consensual. But I can only say that for such a dirty man, I feel his company's products are dirty too.\"","\"On the surface it may seem like he's just playing with a lot of women, but doesn't everyone know that in their circles, they can freely play with any kind of woman?\"","\"Let me say this, I think he's very disrespectful towards women, treating them like commodities.\"","\"I heard all his staff are male, maybe he's actually a misogynist? Or maybe he's gay? He plays with women to cover up his orientation? Or to vent his psychological issues? Isn't that how some rich people are?\"","Songhua Technology's PR department immediately activated their emergency response plan, issuing statements and legal letters.","But many people had already seen the posts, so some didn't believe the official response. The hashtag #BoycottSonghuaTechnology# was also gaining heat.","As the person at the center of it all, Song Luosheng was of course aware of the situation. It was clearly just a rumor, but he didn't expect it to blow up so big, with all sorts of vicious speculation emerging.","Song Luosheng said, \"I don't believe there's no one behind this pushing things forward. Zhou Yuan, look into who might be the one pulling the strings from behind the scenes.\"","\"What is the Legal Department doing? They should be working on this.\"","\"Yes.\"","Of course, Song Luosheng was aware of the blurred photo. One showed him chatting with the disgusting woman sent by Wei Qing in a restaurant. Another showed his supposed blind date partner, and the third showed the girl he bumped into yesterday when he went to see Chi Yu's speech.","He thought they were all coincidences, but it turned out someone had deliberately orchestrated them?","\"Find out about the girl I ran into at the Faculty of Liberal Arts last night.\"","\"Yes.\""]},{"number":117,"title":"Chapter 117: Rumor 02","paragraphs":["At this time during class, Song Luokui of course saw the news and kept frowning as she scrolled through numerous online comments insulting her brother.","Some even wanted to dig up Song Luosheng's family history, but they didn't have that kind of extensive resources and hadn't been able to uncover anything yet.","As soon as class ended, Song Luokui left school with her backpack and drove to Songhua Technology. At the entrance of the Songhua Technology building, a crowd of reporters had gathered.","When Song Luokui arrived, the parking lot security guard specifically asked what she was there for, worried that reporters might sneak in.","After stating her identity, Song Luokui easily entered and took a car directly from the parking lot to the floor of the chairman's office. At this time, Song Luosheng was holding a meeting to deal with this crisis.","Song Luokui sat in Song Luosheng's office, waiting and occasionally checking her phone for messages.","The situation was still escalating, and despite the company issuing lawyer letters and clarification announcements, many people still didn't believe it.","At that moment, Song Luokui suddenly received a message: \"Little sister Luokui, are you worried about your brother? Big brother Wei Qing can help. Are you free? Big brother Wei Qing wants to take you out for a meal.\"","Song Luokui: ???Is this person related to this incident? And how did he get her phone number?","Recalling Chi Yu's previous mention of Wei Qing having her photos on his phone, Song Luokui felt a chill.","With a \"click\" sound, Song Luosheng pushed open the door and entered, \"Why did you come here?\"","Song Luokui: \"I came after seeing the rumors in the news.\"","Song Luosheng approached her, \"Don't worry, big brother will handle it. Don't you have class this afternoon? Go back to class later.\"","Song Luokui: \"Are you sure there's no problem? I saw so many reporters outside.\"","Song Luosheng: \"These are all small issues, big brother will resolve them all. Trust me.\"","Song Luokui: \"Okay, let me know if you need any help.\"","Song Luosheng checked the time, \"Did you come here without eating?\"","Song Luokui nodded, \"Yeah.\"","Song Luosheng pulled her up, \"Come, big brother will take you to the cafeteria to eat.\"","On the other side, the public relations manager of Hai Yu Group brought the public opinion report on Songhua Technology to Chi Yu, \"Boss, should we...\"","The PR manager meant to add fuel to the fire, to try and bring down Songhua. Even if Songhua later resolved the issue, at least some people would still believe the rumors.","If it were before, Chi Yu might have considered doing so. But if he really did that and Song Luokui found out...","Chi Yu could even imagine Song Luokui coldly telling him she wanted to break up, and his heart clenched at the thought.","Chi Yu frowned slightly, \"No, don't do anything. If anyone asks about this incident, I hope you can give a positive evaluation of Song Luosheng.\"","The PR manager didn't quite understand, \"This...\" Did the boss have some other way of handling it?","Chi Yu looked directly at him, \"Give me the plan. You can go now.\"","\"Yes!\"","That night, a newly created account suddenly posted a short article: I'm really happy to see that scumbag fall into such a predicament today. When I was 16 years old, I encountered that Songhua scumbag. He directly got me pregnant but didn't take responsibility, and even made me have an abortion...","A long paragraph of text followed, summarizing the author's unfortunate youthful encounter and expressing happiness at the scumbag's current punishment. When someone asked if it was the Songhua Technology chairman who was the hot topic today, the blogger directly replied: Scumbags will get their comeuppance.","Shortly after, the blogger deleted the post, but of course internet users had already taken screenshots and continued discussing it.","\"That must be the Songhua Technology chairman, his surname is Song.\"","\"@Songhua Technology, let that scumbag respond.\"","\"The implication is very clear, right?\"","\"Wait, didn't it say 16 years old? That's underage, isn't that illegal?\"","\"Oh my god, 16 years old, so still in high school?\"","\"So disgusting! Boycott! Boycott!\"","...","Song Luosheng: \"Find the original poster.\"","\"Yes.\"","It was really getting more and more outrageous. When Song Luokui saw it, her brother hadn't even had a first love, and now there was a child involved at age 16? Who was trying to go after her brother? Or rather, go after Songhua?","The situation had escalated dramatically. Some reporters even asked celebrities endorsing Songhua Technology products for their views.","\"Yinger, Yinger, what's your opinion on the Songhua Technology chairman Song's incident? As someone endorsing Songhua Technology products, will you cancel your partnership with the company because of this?\"","Mu Yinger was of course aware of the recent events, but thinking back to her previous encounter with Song Luosheng, she didn't believe the online rumors at all. She had shared drinks with him before, and his gaze towards her was just like any ordinary person's. The only time she saw tenderness in his eyes was when he looked at his sister; otherwise, he always appeared aloof.","\"I absolutely believe in Chairman Song's character. He is definitely not the kind of person described,\" Mu Yinger stated firmly.","\"Are you saying this because you're also one of his mistresses?\"","Upon this comment, all eyes turned towards her as microphones crowded in front of her face. Mu Yinger's expression changed as she coldly looked at the reporter, \"Are you from Fei Yun Entertainment? I'll only say this once - I have never met Chairman Song alone. I do wish I could be one of Chairman Song's mistresses, but alas he doesn't seem interested in me. Not just me, based on the online rumors, Chairman Song probably isn't interested in any of those women either. So I don't believe those rumors.\"","At this moment, her manager rushed out, \"Sorry, sorry, we have another schedule so we're running late. Please make way, make way.\"","\"So Yinger, does this mean you have feelings for Chairman Song?\"","\"Yinger, are you interested in Chairman Song?\"","\"Make way, make way, we need to leave.\" The manager ushered Mu Yinger into the car, \"Quick, let's go.\"","Once the car escaped the crowd, the manager looked disappointedly at Mu Yinger, \"Didn't I tell you to remain silent about this incident?\"","But Mu Yinger's gaze was resolute, \"Sis Lan, let's take a gamble. You can't really believe those rumors about Chairman Song, can you? If I come out to support him now, what about future endorsements...\"","The manager immediately started seriously considering it. \"You make a good point...\" After thinking for a while, she clapped her hands, \"Let's gamble on it! There's no way a man like Chairman Song would do such things, and they're already refuting the rumors anyway.\"","\"Alright, you should immediately release a statement in support of Chairman Song. Let's take this gamble!\"","The agent immediately gave the phone back to Mu Yinger, \"Wait a moment, I'll have someone edit the content and send it to you, then you can copy and paste it before posting.\"","Mu Yinger: \"Okay.\"","Not long after, the process of Mu Yinger's interview was uploaded to the internet, and a portion of people began to attack her.","\"Helping a criminal, what's your mentality?\"","\"She's probably been played out by Director Song, right?\"","\"She wasn't a first-liner before, either, and who knows how she became a spokesperson for Songhua Technology, could it be that she really bribed her way with her body?\"","All kinds of people began to slander Mu Yinger with rumors."]},{"number":118,"title":"Chapter 118: Rumor 03","paragraphs":["Manager: \"For now, stay off the internet and put work on hold until the situation at Songhua Technology is resolved.\"","After Mu Yinger posted in support of Song Luosheng on social media, some other celebrities who also endorsed Songhua Technology's products began posting messages of support for Song Luosheng as well.","\"I believe in Song Director's character.\"","\"No need to say more, it's just rumors! Please don't spread unverified information.\"","...","Slowly, some people started to believe in him.","\"Come to think of it, although Song Director's photos haven't circulated online yet, I did catch a glimpse of his true appearance once. He really was a handsome man. Appearances reflect one's inner self, so I don't think he would be the kind of person described in those rumors.\"","\"Songhua Technology has already issued a clarification, don't you all believe it?\"","\"These days, clarifications don't seem very credible, especially from the entertainment industry where celebrities often release unconvincing clarifications.\"","\"It would be better to report this to the police!\"","\"Even if it's reported, some people still won't believe it. Some only want to believe what fits their expectations and usually won't believe anything contrary.\"","\"With all this discussion, why doesn't Song Director just come out and clarify things himself? He could even do a livestream.\"","\"If you're talking about a livestream, I'm all for it! I solemnly request that Song Director do a livestream!\"","\"+2\"","\"+Phone number!\"","Two days into this escalating situation, Song Luokui had been closely following developments online. That day after class, Chi Yu came to have dinner with her at a restaurant near the school.","\"I wonder who my brother offended.\"","Chi Yu: \"Don't worry, have faith in your brother.\"","Song Luokui: \"I do trust him, but I'm still worried. Could it be someone from the Wei family?\"","Chi Yu: \"Who? Wei Qing? Why would you suddenly think of him?\"","Song Luokui then remembered that message. After reading it, she hadn't paid it much mind. She took out her phone. \"Oh right, I don't know how he got my number either. Take a look.\" Song Luokui handed her phone to Chi Yu.","Chi Yu appeared calm on the surface when he saw it, but the hand holding the phone instantly tightened its grip. \"I'll handle it, don't worry about him.\"","Song Luokui: \"Oh, I haven't told my brother about this yet, mainly because I didn't want to add to his troubles recently.\"","Chi Yu: \"Mmm, I'll take care of it.\"","Song Luokui: \"Okay.\"","After dinner, Chi Yu walked Song Luokui back to her dorm and kissed her forehead. \"Go on in.\"","\"Mmhm, bye bye.\"","Watching Song Luokui enter the dorm, Chi Yu made a call to Li Yanbei. \"Help me find some people...\"","Wei Qing had just left home, heading somewhere, when suddenly his car was surrounded by several other vehicles.","It was a deserted stretch of road, and Wei Qing's car was forced to a stop.","Wei Qing glared. \"Get out and see who it is.\"","\"Yes.\" But before the driver could even finish the question after stepping out, he was knocked unconscious on the side of the road.","Someone knocked on Wei Qing's car window. \"Mr. Wei, our boss requests your presence.\"","Given the circumstances, Wei Qing had no choice but to get out of the car and see who dared to cause him trouble like this.","As the window rolled down, Wei Qing was stunned to see Chi Yu inside, then laughed. \"Chi Yu, if you wanted to see me you could've just called. Was all this really necessary?\"","Chi Yu opened the door and stepped out, walking up to Wei Qing and punching him square in the stomach. Wei Qing doubled over in pain, gasping for air as he prepared to fight back, but was immediately restrained by two men.","Wei Qing had trained before and tried to struggle free, but in the next moment Chi Yu struck his face, then continued raining blows on other parts of his body, punch after punch.","Wei Qing couldn't help but collapse to the ground.","Originally, Chi Yu had planned to have others do this, but then decided it would be better to handle it himself. Chi Yu crouched down and slapped Wei Qing's face. \"Didn't I tell you not to bother her?\"","One of Wei Qing's eyes was swollen and bruised. \"Who?\"","Then, as if realizing, Wei Qing smiled. \"You mean little sister Kuikui?\"","But no sooner had he said \"little sister Kuikui\" than he was punched again. \"You are not entitled to call her that nickname, and she is not close to you.\"","Wei Qing: \"How do you know we're not close? I even have photos of us together.\"","Chi Yu: \"You mean those photos that have already been deleted?\"","Wei Qing looked at him. \"It was you? You deleted my photos?\"","His phone had been lost and recovered once before, and when he got it back, all the photos of Song Luokui were gone, not just the ones on his phone but also those uploaded online.","Chi Yu: \"Don't even think about getting involved with her. You had a hand in that incident in Country X too, didn't you? How dare you show your face in front of her?\"","Wei Qing: \"Do you have any proof?\"","Chi Yu: \"If you harass her again, I won't let you off so easy!\" With that, he stood up, got into the car, and the rest of the men followed, driving away.","Inside the car, Li Yanbei asked, \"Brother, that's all you're giving him, just a small lesson?\"","Chi Yu: \"Isn't that what the Wei family wants, that position? It's better to give them a glimmer of hope before shattering it, isn't it?\"","Li Yanbei: \"As ruthless as ever, Brother.\"","The next day, Friday, Song Luosheng left the company to pick up Song Luokui from school so they could go home together. Their parents would also be home tonight, and they were all going to have dinner out.","Meanwhile, not far away, someone had already secretly started following them by car.","However, those people couldn't get onto the school campus. Song Luosheng picked up Song Luokui directly in front of the girls' dorm building, and as soon as he had her, they left the school. The people outside could only see a woman get into the passenger seat, and immediately started snapping photos.","The two arrived at a restaurant and went inside, leaving those people to wait outside.","In the private room, Song Luokui hugged her parents. \"Mom, Dad, you finally have some free time.\"","Sheng Rong stroked her face. \"Sorry, we always leave our Kuikui home alone.\" She then looked at Song Luosheng. \"Luosheng, come home and keep your sister company whenever you can.\"","Song Luokui waved dismissively. \"No need, I'm all grown up now. Just focus on your work, but take good care of yourselves.\"","Sheng Rong's gaze softened. \"What a good daughter, always concerned for your parents.\"","Song Luosheng: \"...Mom, Dad, I'll come home often to keep Kuikui company.\"","Song Moqian: \"Just don't cause any trouble. I've heard there are going to be a lot of malicious rumors about you on the internet lately.\"","Song Luosheng's expression changed, \"Father, I will resolve it quickly.\"","Song Moqian: \"Hmph! Just don't get your sister involved.\"","Song Luosheng: \"I know.\"","Soon the dishes were served, and the family didn't discuss those unhappy matters. They happily enjoyed the meal together.","After the meal, Song Moqian and Sheng Rong had some matters to attend to, so they quickly left by car. Song Luosheng was also preparing to take Song Luokui back home. Song Luokui clung to his arm as they were about to leave the restaurant. However, just as the two were about to reach the car, a few reporters suddenly swarmed them, \"Song Director, aren't you going to clarify the recent issues?\"","They then looked at the young woman beside him, their eyes lighting up as they immediately started taking photographs!","Song Luokui was completely startled and stood there stunned."]},{"number":119,"title":"Chapter 119: Caught on Camera","paragraphs":["The few reporters suddenly thrust their microphones in front of Song Luokui's face: \"Do you know anything about your relationship with Mr. Song?\"","\"Have you heard that he got a minor pregnant?\"","\"What is your relationship with Mr. Song?\"","Song Luokui stepped back, but those people pursued her closely, and she almost twisted her ankle. Song Luosheng immediately pulled Song Luokui into his embrace, not allowing others to take photos of her, his expression furious. \"Please make way.\"","Those reporters were relentless, \"Who is this lady? Is she your girlfriend? Or your mistress? Or your next target?\"","Song Luosheng: \"Get lost!\" Song Luosheng pushed through those people, quickly walked to the car and put Song Luokui inside, closing the door. He then turned to look at the reporters, eyeing the logos on their microphones. \"Xinghai Entertainment, Baoxiao Entertainment, right? You'll see.\"","\"Mr. Song, are you threatening us?\"","\"Mr. Song, please answer the question? Why are you not answering? Is it because it's all true?\"","\"Mr. Song, that lady seems quite intimate with you, but she looks a bit young. Is she an adult?\"","Song Luosheng said nothing, got into the car and drove away.","Those people actually chased after them in their car. Song Luosheng sped up, merging into the traffic flow and shaking them off, then headed toward the mansion.","He was still furious, calling Zhou Yuan, \"Look into Xinghai Entertainment and Baoxiao Entertainment for me. Report any issues, or just acquire them directly if possible.\"","\"How much evidence have we collected so far? Release it all as soon as possible, file lawsuits where applicable! Get the legal team working on this immediately!\"","After hanging up, Song Luosheng finally looked at Song Luokui sitting in the back: \"Luokui, I'm sorry. Are you alright?\"","Song Luokui was a bit scared at first since it was her first time encountering such a situation, \"No... I'm fine.\"","Seeing Song Luokui like this made Song Luosheng even angrier. \"Brother will make them pay for this.\" And they had originally come to have a meal, so why were there reporters?","At this moment, the earlier scene had already spread on the internet, with netizens seeing the video of Song Luokui being frightened and stepping back before Song Luosheng hugged her protectively into the car.","Although it was only a few seconds, Song Luokui's appearance was still seen by everyone.","\"The phrase 'love at first sight' which I didn't believe before, I now believe it!\"","\"And 'fall in love at first sight!' Oh my god, I declare I'm in love!\"","\"Damn! Who is that girl? I want to know her information in three minutes.\"","\"You reporters have no heart! No heart! That beautiful girl was so scared by you!\"","\"Is it just me who wants to know what her relationship with the Chairman Song is? Could it be boyfriend and girlfriend?\"","\"But don't you think she looks a bit like Chairman Song? I think she's a family member? Or a relative?\"","\"No, have you all forgotten about the scumbag Song's affairs?\"","\"Anyone associated with that scumbag Song can't be a good woman.\"","Within just two hours, this video had been shared over a hundred thousand times, but it was later completely deleted from the internet.","Someone saved the video and re-uploaded it, but found it also got deleted. Some people tried to send it to friends but found they couldn't receive it either.","\"It can't be shared anymore? Everyone should know who I'm talking about, right? It only appeared for two hours before disappearing completely.\"","\"My god, what kind of little princess is she? She made it vanish from the internet in an instant.\"","\"No one could dig out any information on her?\"","A few minutes later, these posts were also deleted.","While the video was spreading on the internet, Song Luokui was resting at home and was fine now.","On the other hand, Chi Yu was still at the company since his girlfriend and family were going out for dinner tonight, so he could only work overtime.","Chen Nan was currently at a club attending a friend's birthday party when a girl next to her whispered to her companion: \"Hey hey, look, look, there's new gossip about Young Master Song.\"","\"Damn! Who is that girl? He's hugging her in his arms.\"","\"Could it be Young Master Song's girlfriend?\"","\"No, don't you recognize her? That's Young Master Song's sister. Can't you see she looks a bit like Young Master Song?\"","As the most devoted little brother of the family head, Chen Nan immediately came over upon hearing about Song's sister. \"What are you talking about? Let me see too.\"","The girl handed over her phone, \"It's gossip about Young Master Song.\" Of course, they didn't believe the recent online rumors about him, only those clueless outsiders would believe such nonsense.","Chen Nan saw it and immediately knew it was trouble, his expression changing as he stood up and went out to make a call.","While Chi Yu was wondering if his girlfriend had finished eating, Chen Nan called him, \"Boss, check online, Sister Song has been exposed on the internet.\"","Chi Yu immediately opened the online posts to check, and upon seeing Song Luokui frightened by the scene, anger rose within him. What was Song Luosheng doing, allowing his sister to be harassed by reporters like that!","Chi Yu: \"Investigate which reporters and companies they're from, acquire them directly!\"","\"Yes.\"","After hanging up, Chi Yu stood up and called Song Luokui, but Song Luokui was with Song Luosheng at the time with her phone on silent mode, so she didn't hear the call.","As the online situation escalated, Song Luosheng of course knew about it too. He let Song Luokui rest well before going to handle this incident.","Song Luokui was still unaware, picking up her phone to find missed calls from Chi Yu, as well as Xi Yue, Weng Jiao and others.","Their group chat also kept mentioning her: \"Luokui, check online, you've been exposed.\"","\"Luokui, what are you doing? Were you scared?\"","Song Luokui immediately opened the screenshots they sent her and searched online, finding that the video of her being questioned by reporters had been posted on the internet.","Song Luokui covered her face, not so much angry but rather embarrassed, mainly because she looked so dazed and stupid at the time.","This time, Chi Yu called again, and Song Luokui immediately returned to her room and closed the door to answer, \"Hello?\"","Chi Yu was currently driving and about to return to the mansion, \"Baby, are you at home in the mansion?\"","Song Luokui: \"Yes. Have you seen the news online? Don't worry, I'm fine, it was just a bit sudden at the time so I got a little scared.\"","Chi Yu: \"Don't mind the news online, I'll handle it properly.\"","Song Luokui: \"My brother has also gone to deal with it.\"","Chi Yu: \"Your brother is doing what he should do, but I want to do something for you.\"","Song Luokui couldn't help but smile, \"Okay, what are you doing now?\"","Chi Yu: \"I'm going back to the mansion. Shall we meet in a bit?\"","Song Luokui: \"The usual place.\"","\"Yeah.\""]},{"number":120,"title":"Chapter 120: Father Hits Brother","paragraphs":["After hanging up the phone, Song Luokui also went to reply to the messages from Zhang Xiyue and others.","\"I'm fine, my brother took care of it. I didn't expect to be photographed while having dinner with family tonight.\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"Has your brother offended someone recently?\"","Song Luokui: \"Maybe, but the issue should be resolved soon. I'm okay.\"","Sure enough, shortly after, all the information about her on the internet was deleted, leaving no trace, except for those saved on people's phones, but they couldn't be shared.","Not far from downstairs, Chi Yu arrived too. Song Luokui sneaked out and ran to the car, and Chi Yu immediately hugged her, \"Were you scared just now?\"","Song Luokui shook her head, \"No, I was just caught off guard for a moment. Luckily my parents had already left, they weren't photographed.\" Otherwise, it would have escalated into another issue.","Chi Yu stroked her head, then caressed her face, and then held her hand, \"My baby did great!\"","Song Luokui blushed a little, \"I'm over twenty years old, not a baby.\"","Chi Yu: \"You'll always be my baby.\"","The two cuddled in the car for another hour. Chi Yu didn't let her go back until it was too late. He kissed her forehead, \"Get a good rest tonight, don't worry about anything. Everything will be resolved tomorrow.\"","\"Okay.\"","Song Luokui sneaked back home and slept well that night. The next day when she arrived at school, some people still glanced at her secretly, mainly surprised that Song Luokui was related to Song, the senior.","However, there weren't many people, and everyone had their own business. Xu Jiarong came over to show concern, \"Nothing happened last night? Those people were really despicable.\"","Someone nearby echoed, \"Yes, yes. Really despicable.\"","Song Luokui smiled at them, \"I'm fine, thank you for your concern.\"","...","At 9 a.m., just when everyone was starting work, Songhua Technology posted several Weibo messages.","The first one was about the \"underage scumbag Song\" incident, claiming that the so-called \"scumbag Song\" was actually someone else, and the \"underage\" person was already twenty-two years old.","Then there were the allegations about those women's photos, which were all fabricated lies. Even the picture of Song Luosheng being knocked down during the opening ceremony speech was used to spread rumors, but a video showed that Song Luosheng was only knocked down, and the girl who hit him was even pre-arranged.","Finally, about last night's incident, \"Mr. Song was merely having a family dinner when he was surrounded and subjected to such disgusting questioning. Who was behind disturbing Mr. Song's family! Ms. Song was frightened last night, and Songhua Technology will sue all those involved!\"","\"Ms. Song? The beautiful lady last night was Ms. Song? Is she the sister or younger sister of the Chairman of Song?\"","\"But a wife can also be called Ms. Song, right?\"","\"...I'm really lucky. They said Mr. Song is currently single and doesn't even have a girlfriend. This is obviously a family member.\"","\"I only want to know who Songhua has offended?\"","\"It must be the Chairman of Song who offended someone?\"","\"Could it be the Shan Yu Group? The two are competitors.\"","\"Why doesn't Songhua make Song's younger sister their spokesperson? If so, I'll definitely buy their products!\"","...","Until the afternoon, a financial news report that didn't attract much attention was about a certain executive of XX Company being investigated, and the company was shut down for rectification due to tax evasion and other illegal activities...","That night, when Song Luokui returned home, she thought there would be no one at home except Aunt Gui. But as she went upstairs, she heard noises.","When she reached the study room, she heard the sound of whipping and rushed in, \"Dad! Don't hit my brother anymore!\"","At that moment, Song Luosheng was kneeling on the ground, his upper body clothed in a shirt with visible streaks, indicating the injuries underneath.","When Song Moqian saw her approach, he immediately stopped the cane in his hand, \"Luokui, your brother made a mistake and needs to be punished.\"","Song Luokui felt very sorry for him, \"What mistake did my brother make?\"","Song Moqian: \"Allowing you to be frightened was his mistake. Luokui, you've grown up too. In our position, one wrong move and everyone will fall into a bad situation. So I always tell you, think thrice before doing anything.\"","\"This is a lesson for your brother. He's still young, and the mistake he made wasn't that big. But what if it happens in the future...\"","Song Luokui pleaded, \"Dad, I was just caught off guard yesterday, I'm fine. Don't punish my brother anymore, he's always been protecting me.\" Song Luokui hugged Song Luosheng tightly.","Song Moqian: \"Since your sister is pleading, we'll stop here today. Remember what I said.\"","Song Luosheng: \"Yes, father.\"","After Song Moqian left, Song Luokui immediately helped Song Luosheng back to his room, took out the medical kit, \"Brother, take off your clothes, let me have a look. If it's too serious, we'll go to the hospital. Dad has been too strict with you.\"","She even wondered if the reason Song Luosheng went down that path in the book was due to family factors. Her father had always been very lenient with her, but he was indeed very strict with Song Luosheng. But she had never imagined that her grown-up brother would still be beaten by her father.","When Song Luosheng took off his clothes, Song Luokui saw several scars on his back. She was grateful that she came home early, otherwise her brother might have been beaten more.","Song Luokui touched it, and Song Luosheng let out a \"hiss\" sound. She immediately retracted her hand, \"Brother, does it hurt a lot?\"","Song Luosheng: \"I'm fine, it doesn't hurt.\"","Song Luokui slapped him directly, \"Slap!\" Song Luosheng howled and almost jumped up. Song Luokui: \"...Still saying it doesn't hurt?\"","Song Luosheng: \"Haha. I'm fine.\"","Song Luokui applied iodine to disinfect the wounds, \"I never thought Dad would hit you. This has nothing to do with your relationship.\"","Song Luosheng: \"It was my fault.\"","Song Luokui: \"What fault? We're the victims, how can the victims be at fault?\"","Song Luosheng: \"Allowing you to be frightened by those people was my fault.\"","Song Luokui: \"...Brother, don't say that. Saying I was frightened makes me feel embarrassed. I'm a boss now, how could I be frightened by a few reporters?\"","Song Luosheng patted her head, \"Luokui just needs to be happy, no matter whether being a boss or doing anything else. Anyone who wants to harm you is unforgivable. Father was right to hit me, and I share the responsibility, whether it was the previous kidnapping incident or this time.\"","Song Luokui: \"Brother, you're only a little older than me. I'm an adult now and free to make my own choices. This is not your fault, but those bad people's fault. I didn't expect Father to hit you. Why didn't Father go and hit the bad guys instead?\"","Song Luosheng: \"How do you know Father didn't hit the bad guys?\" Without his own father's help, he wouldn't have been able to resolve all the issues so quickly.","Song Luokui sighed, \"Okay, I wronged Father. I guess it's because I made you all worry.\" Song Luokui sighed."]},{"number":121,"title":"Chapter 121: Acquisition","paragraphs":["\"Don't bathe tonight, and if you're feeling unwell, remember to go to the hospital,\" Song Luokui said after dressing his wound. \"Oh, and you should avoid spicy foods as well.\"","Song Luosheng put on his clothes. \"Got it, Mother Hen.\"","Song Luokui said, \"I'll call Brother Zhou Yuan to keep an eye on you.\"","\"No need,\" Song Luosheng replied. \"That would make me lose face as the big brother.\"","\"As the older brother, you should set an example.\" Song Luokui sighed and hugged his arm. \"Brother, thank you.\"","Song Luosheng patted her hand. \"Thanks for what? I haven't done anything. In fact, it's because of me that you got hurt.\"","Song Luokui shook her head. \"Thank you for always taking care of me, from childhood till now. Most of the time, it's been you looking after me.\"","Come to think of it, apart from the time when the plot master wanted to get rid of her when she was little, she had never really been harmed. At school, Song Luosheng watched over her, and even when he wasn't around, his underlings would take care of her.","After growing up, he had always supported her, whether it was with company matters or anything else. Their parents were busy with work, and while they loved her dearly, it was Song Luosheng who spent the most time with her.","Whenever she had a slight cold or fever, he was the one who worried the most. \"Brother, you're the best and the most handsome. Even if I do end up getting a boyfriend in the future, you'll still be the most handsome in my heart. Remember what I said.\"","Song Luosheng said, \"Wait a minute... Luokui, you didn't secretly get yourself a boyfriend, did you?\"","Song Luokui blinked. \"...Brother, I was complimenting you.\"","\"Alright then. Luokui is also the most beautiful and obedient child in her brother's heart.\"","Song Luokui immediately took out her phone and called Zhou Yuan. \"Hello? Brother Zhou Yuan.\"","\"Ah, it's little sister Luokui. What's up?\"","Song Luokui said, \"My brother got injured on his back today. Could you please take care of him for the next few days? Don't let him eat spicy foods or drink alcohol, and don't let him overwork himself.\"","\"Ah? What happened to the boss? Was he attacked by some scoundrel for revenge? Wait, let me gather the brothers...\"","Song Luokui shouted, \"...Calm down!\"","Zhou Yuan said, \"...Tell me, Luokui.\"","Song Luokui said, \"My brother's fine, it has nothing to do with outsiders. Just take care of him.\"","\"Alright. Don't worry, little sister Luokui. I'll take good care of the boss.\"","\"Thank you.\"","...","After leaving Song Luosheng's room, Song Luokui returned to her own room and called Chi Yu. \"I never thought my dad would hit my brother. It wasn't even my brother's fault, but I can't say my dad was wrong either...\"","Song Luokui sighed. \"This family can't survive without me.\"","Chi Yu said, \"I can't survive without you either.\"","Song Luokui laughed. \"Don't sweet-talk me again. I know several companies were behind the previous rumors, and there were even people online saying your company was involved, but I believe you.\"","Chi Yu was relieved that she trusted him. \"Yeah, it wasn't my doing.\"","Song Luokui asked, \"What are you up to now?\"","Chi Yu replied, \"I'm at Chunwang Mansion, missing you.\"","\"I'll be back at Chunwang Mansion tomorrow.\"","\"Good. Shall we have dinner together?\"","\"Yeah.\"","...","The next day, Lin Xingyan, who had come to work with Song Luosheng, said, \"Boss, I found that Shanyu Group is also trying to acquire Explosive Entertainment and a few other small studios. And I discovered that they were also involved in reporting these companies.\"","Song Luosheng immediately looked up. \"What's their connection to this? Did they do anything related to the previous rumors? Is this matter related to them?\"","Initially, Song Luosheng had suspected Shanyu Group's involvement, but the investigation revealed nothing.","Lin Xingyan said, \"No, that's not it. Look at this.\" He handed his phone to Song Luosheng to show him a video.","In the video, someone was interviewing a department head from Shanyu Group. \"Songhua has always been a competitor of Shanyu. What's your take on the current online comments about the Songhua CEO?\"","The department head replied, \"Regarding this matter, we don't believe the rumors. And this is Shanyu, please ask questions related to Shanyu. Thank you.\"","Lin Xingyan said, \"They're even defending us.\"","Song Luosheng found it odd as well. \"Why would they defend us?\" He felt it was good enough that they weren't sabotaging them.","\"Never mind, you mentioned they're also acquiring those entertainment media companies?\"","\"Yes.\"","\"Let's see what they're up to.\"","\"Okay.\"","On the other side, Chi Yu also received similar information. \"Boss, Songhua is also trying to acquire those companies.\"","Chi Yu pondered for a moment. \"Then we'll only acquire two of them and let them have the rest.\"","\"Understood.\"","In the afternoon, Chi Yu left work early. Everyone was used to it by now; if the boss left early, they could also leave on time. Not bad.","After school, Song Luokui went straight to Chunwang Mansion. Before she could even knock, the door opened.","Chi Yu took her bag. \"Hungry? Dinner will be ready soon.\"","Song Luokui said, \"Not too hungry. No rush.\"","Song Luokui washed her hands first, then sat on the couch. The table was already set with her favorite fruits, and the TV was playing a drama series.","Soon, a servant came to say that dinner was ready. The two of them walked to the dining table where a sumptuous and exquisite dinner awaited.","Chi Yu said, \"Regarding your brother's incident, our investigation found traces of the Wei Family.\"","Song Luokui frowned. \"Although I know my brother doesn't like Wei Qing, I'm aware they have a business partnership. Why would Wei Qing harm my brother?\"","Chi Yu replied, \"Partnerships and sabotage can happen simultaneously, but this time, it has nothing to do with Wei Qing.\"","Song Luokui said, \"Huh? If not him, then who? My brother only knows him.\" Not to mention that person had also sent her those messages.","Chi Yu said, \"Other members of the Wei Family. I think... it might be related to your father's side.\"","Song Luokui's brow furrowed immediately. If it was related to her father, then it could involve bigger issues.","Chi Yu said, \"We haven't fully investigated it yet. Once we have more detailed information, I'll let you know.\"","Chi Yu smoothed her furrowed brow. \"Don't worry.\"","\"Okay, thank you.\"","After finishing dinner, the chef and servants cleaned up and left. Song Luokui was sitting on the living room carpet, with books on the coffee table in front of her as she was doing her homework.","Chi Yu was sitting beside her, working on his laptop.","When Song Luokui finished her homework and stretched lazily, Chi Yu closed his laptop and pulled her into his embrace. \"Done?\"","\"Mmhm. Done,\" Song Luokui nestled in his arms.","Chi Yu: \"Shall we watch TV?\"","\"Sure.\"","They turned on the TV, randomly playing a popular drama series. Song Luokui was initially watching intently, but soon Chi Yu pulled her into his arms and kissed her, reasoning that it had been a while since they last kissed.","Song Luokui: ......"]},{"number":122,"title":"Chapter 122: Bodyguard, Discovering Crisis","paragraphs":["\"What? They caused such a huge mess and still want to let it slide?\" Song Moqian was very angry. \"I don't care, and don't try to pressure me. They have broken the law and committed crimes.\"","Song Moqian angrily hung up the phone. Sheng Rong came over and caressed his chest to comfort him, \"Don't be angry, it's not worth it.\"","Song Moqian sighed, \"You're right, it's not worth it. No, I'll go keep an eye on them. I'm afraid they might do something.\" Song Moqian picked up his clothes and prepared to leave.","However, just as he was about to leave, Auntie Gui came back with a package, \"Sir, you have a package.\"","Song Moqian found it a bit strange, but he still took the package and opened it. Upon opening it, he saw photos inside of Song Luokui attending classes at school, walking on the road after class, or getting into a car at the school gate.","A thought flashed through Song Moqian's mind: \"This is a warning!\"","When Sheng Rong came over and saw it, she said, \"Why...\" Suddenly realizing something, she looked at Song Moqian with some horror, \"Kuikui...\"","Song Moqian: \"I will assign more people to protect Kuikui. Those people want to threaten me with Kuikui! Dreaming! How dare they do something harmful to the country and still expect me to let them off? If I let them off, I would be disgracing the nation's nurturing!\"","\"You should also be careful when you go out,\" Song Moqian instructed his wife.","Sheng Rong: \"I know, I'll be fine, you don't have to worry about me. It's just Kuikui and Shengsheng... After what happened to Shengsheng last time, I wonder if...\"","Song Moqian's gaze sharpened, \"If it really was their doing, then I don't think I would let them off.\"","Song Moqian had Sheng Rong put the photos away, and then he went out.","That day, when Song Luokui went out, she found that in addition to Uncle An, there were two female bodyguards accompanying her, \"Uncle An, this...\"","Uncle An: \"This is Sir's order.\"","Song Luokui: ???Did something happen recently?","Her parents weren't home, so she couldn't ask them. She could only call her brother Song Luosheng, \"Brother, Dad assigned me two more bodyguards.\"","Song Luosheng: \"That's good.\" To be honest, he wanted to hire ten or eight bodyguards for Kuikui.","Song Luokui: \"...But I find it very inconvenient, and isn't it too ostentatious?\"","Song Luosheng: \"Not ostentatious, Kuikui. You'll know if you watch the news recently. Things are not very peaceful lately. Just obey obediently.\"","Song Luokui: \"Okay.\"","Song Luokui didn't have the habit of watching the news every day. After hearing what Song Luosheng said about the news, she immediately opened the recent major news events and started browsing them.","\"The country's economic layout for the next two years?\" This shouldn't be it.","\"A farmer's family suddenly had a few hundred eggs appear overnight?\" This wasn't it either.","\"Province X's XX Lake was polluted, and large areas of forest parks were deforested. Who was behind it?\" Could it be this one? Was it related to her? Or was it related to her parents?","\"An official in Province F was taken down, a mole was investigated.\" Or was it this one?","Song Luokui couldn't figure it out. She wanted to call Chi Yu, but when she saw the two bodyguards nearby... Never mind.","This time, Uncle An sent her directly to the teaching building, and they waited outside while she was in class. They didn't leave. When she returned to the dorm, Uncle An drove her back to the dorm, and they waited downstairs at the dorm building.","Song Luokui called Chi Yu from her dorm, \"Dad assigned me two bodyguards, and they're following me very closely. Let's not meet for a while.\"","Chi Yu: \"...I need to tell you something. I really didn't hide it from you, I just suddenly remembered.\"","Song Luokui: \"What?\"","Chi Yu: \"I had someone follow you to protect you. But they didn't follow you that closely. They stayed far away.\"","Song Luokui: \"Ah? What if my bodyguards discover them?\"","Chi Yu: \"It depends on whether your bodyguards are skilled or not. If your bodyguards are retired counter-surveillance experts, then they might be discovered.\"","Song Luokui: \"...Then what should we do?\" She still hasn't prepared herself mentally to tell her parents about this yet.","Chi Yu: \"It's okay, I'll take responsibility.\"","Song Luokui: \"No, no, no, forget it. If they really find out, I'll just come clean with my father.\" Song Luokui sighed, \"And I can't keep letting you be my secret lover, can I? If we're discovered, I'll just admit it. I'm old enough, it's just dating, no big deal.\"","Chi Yu: \"Then can I tell my parents?\"If he could tell them, he would be very happy, of course.","Song Luokui: \"...Ah? Right now?\"","Chi Yu: \"When we get a chance.\"","Song Luokui: \"...Well...okay, but let's not make it public for now.\"","Chi Yu: \"Okay~I won't tell anyone else.\" Slowly, one day, everyone would know she belonged to him. Those who wanted to harm her would have to think twice.","\"Okay.\"","Downstairs, one of the female bodyguards had noticed this issue, \"I've noticed someone has been following Miss, but with no malicious intent.\"","Uncle An suddenly became tense, \"Ah? Who is it?\"","The female bodyguard was scanning left and right outside, \"I'm not sure, but is there anyone else assigned to protect Miss?\"","Uncle An: \"I don't think so?\" Besides picking up and dropping off Miss at school, his main job was to protect her. But he didn't need to follow that closely. Usually when Miss was at school, he would return. His main concern was to protect her from any danger on the road.","The female bodyguard suddenly locked onto someone, immediately started her car and gave chase. That person looked flustered and immediately fled. The two started chasing each other around the school campus.","The other female bodyguard didn't give chase, she had to stay here and guard, in case someone was trying to lure them away as a distraction.","On the other side, after a half-hour chase, the female bodyguard grabbed a tree branch and threw it at the person, \"Aiyo!\" The person was hit and slowed down, allowing the female bodyguard to catch up and apprehend them.","The female bodyguard saw that it was someone she knew, \"Zou Su, why is it you?\" The female bodyguard's gaze sharpened, \"Who are you working for doing bad deeds?\"","Zou Su the bodyguard immediately shook his head, \"No, no, I'm not. Elder Sister Wen, I'm also a bodyguard.\"","The female bodyguard: \"Who are you protecting? And why did you run when I chased you?\"","Zou Su: \"...I'm protecting Miss Song.\"","The female bodyguard: \"...I'm also protecting Miss Song.\"","The two looked at each other in silence.","The female bodyguard released her grip, \"Speak up, what's going on? Who is your employer?\" She suddenly thought, \"Could it be the young master?\"","Zou Su: \"No... I can't disclose my employer, but I truly mean no harm. I was also dispatched to protect Miss Song Luokui. I really have no ill intentions.\"","The female bodyguard: \"I will report truthfully.\"","Zou Su: \"I will report back to my employer.\" He worried that he had been discovered and even apprehended, fearing he might lose his job. Who would have thought it was Elder Sister Wen? In the past, Elder Sister Wen was the most formidable in investigations, and he was once her student.","On Song Luokui's side, she was still unaware of this incident, still pondering how to explain it to her parents. As for her brother, well, let's ignore that for now."]},{"number":123,"title":"Chapter 123: Searching for Father Chi in the Pond and Islet","paragraphs":["\"Boss, we were discovered by Miss Song's bodyguards. The person who recognized me was someone I knew before. She asked who was behind me, but I didn't say anything,\" Zou Su reported to Chi Yu.","Chi Yu knew they might be discovered, but he didn't expect it to happen so soon. He fell silent for a moment. Although others praised him for being so capable and excellent, if it was in Uncle Song's eyes, he didn't have much confidence.","Zou Su: \"I'm sorry, Boss. We were careless.\"","Chi Yu: \"Never mind. You can tell her that I asked you to follow her.\"","Zou Su: \"Tell her directly?\"","Chi Yu: \"Yes.\"","\"Got it.\"","Since the boss didn't want to hide it, he naturally told Elder Sister Wen. He found the phone number he had kept for a long time, \"Elder Sister Wen... Our boss said we can tell you, our boss is Chi Yu, the one from the Chi Family.\"","Elder Sister Wen: \"The Chi Family... I see.\"","In the afternoon, when Song Luokui returned home from school, Elder Sister Wen, the bodyguard in the car, seemed to want to say something but held back. It was Song Luokui who noticed and asked, \"Elder Sister Wen, what's wrong?\"","Elder Sister Wen: \"I want to ask you, Little Miss, did you know that someone has been following you to protect you?\"","Song Luokui's heart skipped a beat, \"You mean...\"","Elder Sister Wen: \"Did you know that Young Master Chi Yu sent someone to follow you? What relationship do you have with Young Master Chi Yu? Your father may ask you about this tonight.\"","Song Luokui covered her face with her hands, leaving only her eyes exposed, \"You guys found out? My dad knows too?\"","Elder Sister Wen: \"We just found out as well.\"","Song Luokui: ...At noon, she had just learned from Chi Yu himself that he had sent someone to protect her, and after school, her father already knew? Oh no!","Song Luokui took a deep breath, \"I understand, I will tell my father.\"","Elder Sister Wen didn't ask further, as their task was simply to protect, and they didn't need to know too much about the other details.","After returning home, Song Luokui felt uneasy, and she didn't have much appetite during dinner. Aunt Gui even asked, \"Little Miss, don't you have an appetite today?\"","Song Luokui: \"No, no, I just ate too many snacks at school earlier.\"","After dinner, she went back to her room and called Chi Yu, \"My father knows about it.\"","Chi Yu: \"Yeah. It's my fault.\"","Song Luokui lowered her head and paced around the room, \"It's not your fault, it's my fault for keeping it a secret from everyone. Sigh~\" She sighed. \"It is what it is. It's not a big deal, is it? It's just about having a boyfriend. They should be satisfied with you.\"","Chi Yu: \"Okay, call me if there's anything.\"","\"Mmhmm.\"","After hanging up, Chi Yu drove back to the mansion. As soon as he returned home, he asked, \"Is my father home?\"","The servant: \"The master is in the study.\"","\"Good.\"","Chi Yu went upstairs to the study door and knocked, \"Knock, knock, knock.\"","\"Come in.\" A stern voice came from inside.","Chi Yu opened the door and went in, \"Father.\"","Chi Yong lowered the newspaper he was reading, \"You're back? Have you eaten?\"","Although stern on the outside, Chi Yong was a bit more reserved when facing his only son at home.","Chi Yu clasped his hands in front of his abdomen, \"Not yet, Father. I want to tell you something.\"","Chi Yong looked at Chi Yu's serious expression, \"What is it? Did you cause trouble outside?\" Chi Yong frowned, already thinking about whether he needed to disown his son or not.","Chi Yu: \"No... Well, kind of... I... I have a girlfriend now.\"","Chi Yong was stunned for a moment but seemed pleasantly surprised, \"Girlfriend? That's good news! When will you bring her home to meet us?\"","Chi Yu: \"You should know her.\"","Chi Yong: \"I know her? Is she from the Zhou family, the Chen family, or the Zhan family?\"","Chi Yu: \"None of those. She's from the Song family.\"","Chi Yong pondered for a moment, \"The Song family?\" He took off his glasses and looked at Chi Yu, \"You mean the Song family from the Jian'an Mansion? That pretty and well-behaved young lady from Uncle Song's family?\"","The most beautiful young lady in the mansion was indeed the one from the Song family. He had seen her before. She was a beautiful, well-behaved, and kind-natured girl whose presence made people happy. It was a pity that she was someone else's daughter.","Chi Yu: \"Yes.\"","Chi Yong: \"But... I remember you didn't get along well with their son... Is this you infiltrating the enemy's camp?\"","Chi Yu: \"It's the enemy infiltrating me.\"","Chi Yong studied him for a moment, \"It's her?\"","Chi Yu nodded, \"It's her.\"","Chi Yong: \"Well, okay. Although my relationship with Uncle Song is so-so, I can still talk to him. We should arrange for the two families to meet.\"","Chi Yu: \"...Not that fast. She's still in school.\"","Chi Yong: \"It doesn't matter. You can get engaged first and then get married after she graduates.\"","Chi Yu: \"...It's not time for that yet. We haven't been in this relationship for long, and Uncle Song doesn't know about it either. No one else knows.\"","Chi Yong frowned, \"Are you fooling around? Why didn't you make it official from the beginning?\"","Chi Yu lowered his head, \"It's because your son is incompetent and didn't get official recognition from the start.\"","Chi Yong paused for a moment, \"...So, you haven't actually gotten her family's approval yet? Then why are you telling me this? Shouldn't you be working harder on that?\"","Chi Yu: \"No. Today, Uncle Song probably found out about our relationship, so... I sent people to protect her, but Uncle Song's people discovered them...\" Chi Yu explained the situation.","Chi Yong put down the newspaper in his hand, \"...So what do you want me to do? Go with you to beg for forgiveness?\"","Chi Yu: \"No, I'm just afraid she might get scolded, so I want you to call Uncle Song and check in with him. As for begging for forgiveness, I'll do that later.\"","Chi Yong: \"If you have the chance, remember to bring her home.\"","\"Yes.\"","After Chi Yu left, Chi Yong immediately stood up and rubbed his hands, \"The most beautiful young lady in the mansion is going to be part of our family? Hahaha.\" It was quite amusing to hear such contrasting words from his usually stern face.","Chi Yong walked over to the phone and started making calls.","On the other side, when Song Moqian learned that the bodyguards were actually sent by Chi Yu, he was momentarily stunned. Why would their daughter have Chi Family's young man send people to protect her?","After getting off work, Song Moqian hurried back to Jian'an Mansion. On the way, however, he received a call from Chi Yong.","Song Moqian was quite perplexed by this call. Although both families lived in the mansion and would greet each other when they met, their relationship was neither particularly good nor antagonistic.","\"Hello?\"","\"This is Chi Yong.\"","Song Moqian: \"May I ask what this call is about, Sir?\"","Chi Yong: \"No need for formalities today. I'm older than you, so call me Brother Chi.\"","Song Moqian looked at his own hand, feeling goosebumps rising, imagining Chi Yong's expressionless face saying such words: \"...Please go ahead and speak your mind.\"","Chi Yong: \"I'm calling to apologize on behalf of my unfilial son.\"","Song Moqian immediately understood the situation. \"Well...this is a matter between the younger generations. It doesn't really concern you.\"","Chi Yong: \"How does it not concern me?\""]},{"number":124,"title":"Chapter 124: Father Found Out","paragraphs":["Chi Yong: \"My son got involved with your daughter, which was his fault. He sent bodyguards to protect your daughter out of good intentions and had no malice. Though they kept their relationship a secret from everyone, they're just kids who like the thrill of a clandestine romance...\"","Song Moqian: \"...Wait a minute. You're saying my daughter Luokui is dating your son Chi Yu?\"","Chi Yong: \"Alas! I just found out about this too. Please don't scold the kids. It's my son's fault.\"","Song Moqian: \"I understand. I will get to the bottom of this. For now, I hope you don't spread word about the two children.\"","Chi Yong: \"Of course. Remember, don't scold Luokui. It's all my son's fault.\"","Song Moqian: \"Indeed, it's your son's fault. I'm hanging up now.\"","Chi Yong looked at the hung-up phone, hmmm... everything should be fine now.","Song Luokui was still in her room, looking around and occasionally checking the balcony to see if her parents were back. A car pulled up downstairs - it was her father's car! Song Luokui grew more anxious but took a deep breath and went downstairs to face the situation.","As soon as Song Moqian entered, he saw his younger daughter coming down the stairs. \"Dad, you're back? Where's mom?\" Song Luokui looked behind him but didn't see Sheng Rong, meaning her father was alone.","Song Moqian sat on the couch and gestured for her to come over. \"Luokui, come here.\"","Song Luokui went over and sat beside him, tentatively asking, \"Dad, do you know?\"","Song Moqian patted her head. \"Tell me, when did you two start dating?\"","Song Luokui: \"Last semester, near the end of the term.\"","Song Moqian: \"And before that?\"","Song Luokui lowered her head. \"Before that, we just knew each other and occasionally had meals together. He had helped me before, so...\"","Song Moqian: \"Who else knows about your relationship?\"","Song Luokui shook her head. \"No one else. Just a few of his friends know.\"","Song Moqian was surprised they kept it so secret. \"Whose idea was it to not go public? Yours or his?\"","Song Luokui: \"It was my idea. I didn't want it to be public.\"","Song Moqian: \"Why not?\"","Song Luokui: \"Well... if my brother found out, he definitely wouldn't approve. And if we didn't work out during this period, it'd be easier to break up without anyone knowing.\" Song Luokui fidgeted with her fingers.","Song Moqian raised an eyebrow, not expecting his daughter to be the one who didn't want to go public, and even mentioning... breaking up?","Song Moqian: \"Luokui, before this, we loved you and let you do whatever you wanted. But your mother and I never taught you to treat relationships casually.\"","He initially thought Chi Yu might have pressured his daughter, since she seemed so obedient. He figured it must have been Chi Yu who did something.","Song Luokui wanted to bury her head. \"But... if we don't like each other anymore, don't we have to break up? And I have been serious. I even bought him gifts.\"","Song Moqian: \"How does he treat you?\"","Song Luokui: \"Quite well. He often buys me gifts. He respects me when I don't want to do something. He also tells me about rumors involving my brother and anything in the business world that could harm my brother.\"","Song Moqian: \"...So you became a little spy for your brother's sake?\"","Song Luokui pouted and looked up. \"What little spy? We're just being friendly.\"","Song Moqian: \"...Do you know you did something wrong?\"","Song Luokui: \"I know.\"","Song Moqian: \"Do you know what you did wrong?\"","Song Luokui: \"I shouldn't have dated him without telling you.\"","Song Moqian: \"Anything else?\"","Song Luokui looked puzzled. \"Anything else?\"","Song Moqian sighed. \"I hope you can take relationships seriously.\"","Song Luokui: \"But I have been serious.\"","Song Moqian: ...But to him, she seemed rather casual about it - not going public, breaking up if things didn't work out. Wasn't that casual?","Song Moqian: \"Don't get hurt. And... even though you're an adult now, you must stay safe.\"","Song Luokui: ??? What did he mean by staying safe? Never mind, she'd just agree for now.","Song Luokui: \"I understand, Dad.\"","Song Moqian: \"If you're sure about him in the future, introduce him to your mother and me.\"","Song Luokui: \"What about my brother...\"","Song Moqian scoffed coldly. \"Hmph! He doesn't even know about his sister's relationship. Let him find out himself!\"","Song Luokui breathed a sigh of relief. \"Thank you, Dad.\"","Song Moqian: \"Let me know whenever you go out with him. And no staying over at his place.\"","Song Luokui: \"I understand.\"","Song Moqian: \"I'll tell your mother. Remember to apologize to her, alright?\"","\"I know. I'll talk to Mom.\"","\"Alright. Go rest now.\"","\"Okay~\"","Song Luokui hurried upstairs to her room, closed the door, and clutched her chest, taking deep breaths. Once she calmed down, she called Chi Yu. \"Dad didn't scold me. I'm fine.\"","Chi Yu also breathed a sigh of relief. \"That's good.\"","Song Luokui: \"But I have to let Dad know whenever we go out to play.\"","Chi Yu: \"Okay, no problem.\"","Song Luokui: \"I also need to tell Mom. She hasn't come home yet, and my brother hasn't returned either, so he still doesn't know. Oh, Dad seems a bit upset with my brother for not finding out about our relationship. I still feel a little sorry for my brother.\"","\"I should come clean to my brother when I get the chance.\" Song Luokui sighed.","Chi Yu: \"Sure! I'll follow your lead. By the way, I told my father about our relationship too.\"","Song Luokui: \"Ah?\" Song Luokui buried her face in her pillow. \"What did your father say?\"","Chi Yu: \"Nothing. He was very happy about it and said to bring you home sometime.\"","Song Luokui: \"That's too fast. I'm not ready yet.\"","Chi Yu: \"No problem. We'll go when you're ready.\"","\"Okay~\"","After hanging up, Chi Yu felt relieved, knowing that soon he could announce to everyone that she was his.","Meanwhile, Song Luokui sent a message to Sheng Rong as well.","That evening, when Song Luokui was preparing to rest, someone knocked on her room door. It was Sheng Rong.","\"Mother,\" Song Luokui said, feeling a bit embarrassed.","Sheng Rong stroked her head. \"Luokui, would you like Mom to sleep with you tonight?\"","\"Yes,\" Song Luokui nodded.","The two lay on the bed, with Sheng Rong embracing Song Luokui. \"Tell Mom, how did you and that Chi boy start your relationship?\"","Song Luokui said, \"Well, one day he helped me... after that, I kept owing him favors, so I could only invite him for meals. Things went on like that...\"","Sheng Rong helped tidy her hair. \"Luokui, have you ever thought that he might have done it on purpose?\" Her naive daughter had walked right into his trap."]},{"number":125,"title":"Chapter 125: Find an Opportunity to Introduce","paragraphs":["Song Luokui raised her head, \"But I haven't lost anything, have I? Even if it was intentional, it's not like I'm the only one who did it intentionally.\" Why didn't she refuse? Actually, she had an agenda too, and in fact she was the one who benefited.","Sheng Rong laughed, \"I didn't expect that my Luokui is the one taking the initiative. But I still don't want you to get hurt in the future. That boy from the Chi family is indeed excellent, but I don't know what's going on between you two. Just remember to protect yourself no matter what.\"","\"Mom, I know,\" Song Luokui shyly hugged her mother.","Sheng Rong: \"Okay, go to sleep now. As for your brother... you'll have to coax him later.\"","Song Luokui: \"...Okay~\" She whined, thinking that once her brother found out, something big would happen.","Although they were discovered, Chi Yu didn't withdraw his bodyguards, and those bodyguards were still secretly following Song Luokui as usual.","On Chi Yu's side, both families' parents probably knew about it, so he became more open about it. At least he didn't need to sneak around to see Song Luokui anymore. Instead, he went to pick her up directly when she got out of school.","Song Luokui got into Chi Yu's car, but the bodyguards' cars were following behind them. The two went to a restaurant to have dinner together, while the bodyguards ate in another private room.","Song Luokui: \"I have something to tell you.\"","Chi Yu picked up a piece of fatty beef for her, \"Yeah, go ahead.\"","Song Luokui: \"My parents now know about our relationship, but... my brother still doesn't know, and I feel really guilty towards him. After all, my brother has been so good to me, yet I... you know, right?\"","Chi Yu put down his chopsticks, \"Yeah, I'm prepared.\" Prepared to get beaten up.","Song Luokui: \"Don't be so serious! It's actually good news that my parents don't oppose it now. But my brother... you know he doesn't get along with you, so I'm in a tough spot in the middle. If he really beats you up, you might have to endure it.\"","Chi Yu: \"I'll definitely endure it.\" After all, Song Luosheng would be his future brother-in-law.","Song Luokui stroked his face, \"You have to work hard.\"","Chi Yu grabbed her hand and held it against his face, \"It's not hard work as long as you're with me.\"","Song Luokui took a deep breath, \"Then... I'll bring you to meet my brother. I'll find a time.\"","Chi Yu: \"Okay, I'm ready for anything.\"","Song Luokui: \"I need to plan it out and figure out where to introduce you. We need to choose a good place, a big place, so that if you two end up fighting, people around won't see it and cause trouble.\"","If it's at the mansion, once the two start fighting, everyone in the mansion would know about it within a day. If it's outside, she's afraid someone might take photos and it would become a hot topic again - the Chairman of Shan Group and the Chairman of Song Hua Group fighting would definitely be explosive news.","Chi Yu: \"How about ChunWang Manor?\"","Song Luokui thought about it and found it feasible, \"I think that works.\"","Chi Yu: \"Let's eat first, don't worry.\"","Song Luokui: \"Okay.\"","After they finished eating, of course Chi Yu didn't let the people leave. The two stayed in the private room talking. Chi Yu pulled her into his embrace and kissed her, kissing her until her face was flushed and her head was spinning. Chi Yu rested his head on her neck, \"If your brother tells us to break up, don't listen to him, okay?\"","Song Luokui was in a daze, \"Okay, we won't break up. Of course we won't break up.\"","Chi Yu smiled and rubbed his thumb over her lips before covering them again. Song Luokui could only grab onto his shirt.","\"Knock knock, Miss, the sir says you should go home now,\" came the bodyguard's voice from outside.","Song Luokui was still immersed in Chi Yu's tenderness when the knock came, causing her to immediately sober up. She pushed the man burying his face in her collarbone, \"Time to go home, time to go home.\"","Chi Yu bit her collarbone and took a deep breath, \"Okay.\"","He stood up and helped her tidy her clothes and hair. The two left the private room, and the bodyguards were standing outside.","Chi Yu held Song Luokui's hand and went straight back to his car. He sent her back to the Song family mansion and hugged her before letting her go inside.","Song Luosheng hadn't been home for a few days, busy with something. Song Luokui called him, \"Brother, are you free?\"","Song Luosheng was extremely busy but still said, \"Yeah, what's up? Miss your brother?\"","Song Luokui: \"Well... I have something to tell you.\"","Song Luosheng put down his pen and stopped working, \"Tell me? Is Grandpa asking you to introduce someone to me? Or Grandma? Or Mom and Dad? Luokui, your brother is just focused on making money right now. You don't need to introduce any guys or girls to me.\"","Song Luosheng thought his family was trying to set him up on a blind date again. Seriously, he was so young and good-looking - the best looking in Luokui's eyes. Why were they worried about him?","Song Luokui was speechless hearing him say that, \"Brother, the family isn't introducing anyone to you. You're thinking too much. It's my friend I want to introduce to you.\"","\"What friend needs a special introduction to me? Don't tell me it's your boyfriend, don't scare your brother like that,\" Song Luosheng joked.","Song Luokui paused: \"...Just wait until I tell you, then you'll know.\"","Song Luosheng: \"Okay, okay, when?\"","Song Luokui: \"How about Friday? It'll be the weekend, and I'm mainly worried you've been too busy lately. You haven't been home for a few days. Mom was asking about how you've been doing.\" Today was Wednesday, so Thursday could be used for mental preparation, and Friday would be perfect.","Song Luosheng: \"Sure, where at?\"","Song Luokui: \"ChunWang Manor. Let's have dinner together in the evening.\"","Song Luosheng: \"Okay.\" Luokui was introducing her friend to him, so it must be an important friend. He had to go.","Not only did she have to introduce her friend to her brother, she also had to let her friend know, or else everyone would blame her once they found out later.","So Song Luokui said in the sister group chat: \"Sisters, I have a big announcement to make next week.\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"Why next week, can't you do it today?\"","Song Luokui: \"No, can't.\"","Lou Sasa: \"What's the big announcement? Are you getting married too, Luokui?\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"Who else is getting married?\"","Lou Sasa: \"No, isn't Shanyue always going on blind dates? It seems like she's been preparing for an arranged marriage for ages.\"","Tu Shanyue: \"...I'm just getting to know new friends. Why would Luokui need an arranged marriage?\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"I remember you said one of the guys was decent before, Shanyue. What happened after a few days that he's not good enough now?\"","Tu Shanyue: \"Don't even go there, I can't stand that he's not a virgin.\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"We absolutely can't have a dirty man! But is there even a clean man left in our circle?\""]},{"number":126,"title":"Chapter 126: Found Out, I'm Dead","paragraphs":["\"Kuikui's Older Brother and Yueyue's Older Brother are both like that, aren't they?\" Weng Jiao spoke up.","Lou Sasa: \"Hey, how do you know they are? Have you been hiding under their beds?\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"That's true.\"","Song Luokui: \"My brother probably is.\" Although she hadn't always been by her brother's side, she believed he was like that.","Zhou Yue: \"The leader is definitely my brother, and my brother follows the leader. Plus, my brother comes home every day when he's not working overtime. He's usually super busy.\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"@Tu Shanyue, Xue, why don't you become Zhou Yue's sister-in-law? Or you could be Kuikui's sister-in-law.\"","Tu Shanyue: \"No way, I don't want to. I'd be scared to death to see Kuikui's Older Brother. I don't want to, you go ahead.\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"Hahaha. I don't want to either.\"","Lou Sasa: \"Hahahaha. You don't want to, and I don't want to either. @buying Kuikui flowers to eat Kuikui seeds, Kuikui, how do you feel about your brother being rejected like this?\"","Song Luokui: \"He deserves it.\" Thinking back to when they were kids, Song Luosheng disliked those girls who loudly shouted \"handsome\" at boys outside the sports fields, she felt he deserved it.","Weng Jiao: \"Although we don't want him, Kuikui's Older Brother is quite popular, you know. Kuikui, someone has been asking about you, it seems like they want to pursue your brother but if that fails, they plan to start with his sister.\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"Who is it?\"","Weng Jiao: \"I don't know exactly who it is, it's been passed through several people.\"","Lou Sasa: \"Didn't we see a photo of Kuikui's Older Brother with someone before? Maybe it's that person.\"","Song Luokui: \"My brother can deal with his own matters. It's not good to get involved in romantic issues. Anyway, you all know I have a big announcement to make next week.\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"I'm so curious. I'll be pestering you about it early Sunday morning.\"","Lou Sasa: \"Hahaha, I wonder what's so important that you need to announce it a few days in advance.\"","Weng Jiao: \"I've already got a bucket ready to catch my dropping jaw.\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"Hahaha. So funny.\"","...","However, what Song Luokui had feared ended up happening.","On Friday evening at ChunWang Manor during dinner, Song Luokui told Chi Yu about this matter, and Chi Yu had no issues with it. He had now gained the approval of Song's Father and Song's Mother (in his view, not objecting meant approval), so he was a bit boastful, mainly due to excitement.","It was the previous Thursday afternoon when Song Luokui got out of school, and Chi Yu came to pick her up again. However, the two didn't eat out, but went straight back to the mansion. Chi Yu mainly wanted to see her, and he came with his driver. The two sat in the back of the car talking, with the bodyguard following behind as usual.","When they were about a kilometer away from the mansion, Song Luokui happened to spot a newly opened ice cream shop. \"Oh? There's a new ice cream shop, it looks pretty good.\"","Chi Yu immediately asked the driver to stop the car. \"I'll go get you one.\"","Song Luokui also got out of the car. \"I'll come with you, let me take a look.\"","Holding hands, the two went to buy ice cream. The new store was having a promotion and giving away plush toys.","Song Luokui happily held an ice cream in one hand and a plush toy in the other.","At this time, Song Luosheng was also preparing to go home. He hadn't been home for a few days, and since Kuikui had called him yesterday, he thought it wouldn't be good to stay away any longer. Kuikui must miss him if she called.","He spotted the new ice cream shop and decided to buy one for Kuikui since she likes ice cream. At this time, she should have gotten out of school and returned home, so the ice cream would be perfect for when he got back.","Song Luosheng parked his car and was about to go buy the ice cream. On the side, Chi Yu was helping Song Luokui fix her hair that had fallen across her cheek. Seeing some cream on the corner of her mouth from eating the ice cream, his eyes darkened, and he leaned down to lick it off...","The intimate scene between the two caught the attention of passersby, mainly because they were both quite good-looking.","Song Luosheng glanced over casually, then did a double-take. The two people over there...","\"Damn it! Chi Yu, what are you doing to my sister?!\" Song Luosheng strode over and punched Chi Yu directly in the face. Chi Yu was momentarily stunned, and then another punch came.","Song Luokui was in shock. Seeing Chi Yu being hit again, she quickly threw down her ice cream and hugged Song Luosheng. \"Brother, brother, don't hit him, please don't hit him! I beg you, don't hit him!\"","Song Luosheng felt like his whole body was on fire. \"Kuikui, don't be afraid, Chi Yu deserves to be beaten for bullying you!\"","Someone was already recording a video nearby.","Song Luokui shouted, \"Brother! He's my boyfriend!\"","Song Luosheng's face contorted with rage. \"Kuikui, let me go...\" He was going to beat Chi Yu to death! How dare he bully his sister!","The two spoke at the same time, and as soon as Song Luosheng heard Song Luokui's words, he froze. It took him a long time to find his voice again. \"Kuikui, what did you just say?\"","Song Luokui: \"Brother, he's my boyfriend.\"","Song Luosheng felt like he must have heard wrong. He laughed awkwardly. \"Kuikui, don't lie to me.\"","Song Luokui's eyes turned red. \"Brother, I was actually going to introduce him to you as my friend on Friday. Brother, there are a lot of people here, can we leave first?\"","On the side, the corner of Chi Yu's mouth was bleeding from being punched, but he didn't say anything. He just stood there wiping the blood away. Song Luokui looked at him apologetically, and when Chi Yu saw her red eyes, he immediately felt sorry for her.","\"Song Luosheng, do you want her to be subjected to public scrutiny and gossip?\" Chi Yu spoke up.","There was a circle of people around them, everyone whispering something or other. Mainly, the two handsome guys seemed to be fighting over a beautiful girl, and everyone wanted to see the drama unfold.","Song Luosheng came to his senses and grabbed Song Luokui's hand. \"Kuikui, let's go home.\" He directly pulled Song Luokui to his car.","Chi Yu then told the bodyguard next to him, \"Have them delete the videos.\"","\"Yes, sir.\"","Chi Yu also got into his car, and the two cars headed towards the mansion, one after the other. The crowd quickly dispersed, leaving only the fallen ice cream, which was eventually swept up by a cleaner and thrown into a nearby trash can.","Song Luokui sat next to Song Luosheng, watching him drive with no expression on her face. She was quite conflicted, her hands trembling slightly. \"Brother... I...\"","Song Luosheng: \"Kuikui, don't say anything. Brother originally wanted to buy you ice cream, but I didn't get to buy it. I'm sorry.\"","Song Luokui: \"Brother...\"","Song Luosheng: \"If you're going to talk about him, don't.\"","Song Luokui lowered her head, \"Brother, I'm sorry.\"","She didn't say anything more, and Song Luosheng didn't say anything either. The car went straight to the Song family's building, and then Chi Yu's car also arrived at the Song family's building.","After getting out of the car, Song Luosheng tried to pull Song Luokui back, but Chi Yu quickly came over and blocked them. Chi Yu looked directly at Song Luosheng: \"There is enmity between us, but I hope you don't make her afraid or even upset.\"","Song Luosheng released Song Luokui and grabbed Chi Yu's collar, \"Haven't you been beaten enough? I'm telling you, this is between Kuikui and me, it has nothing to do with you!\"","Chi Yu: \"It has to do with me if you make her sad.\"","Song Luosheng said seriously, \"I won't agree to that.\" He released Chi Yu, and was about to pull Song Luokui back home. After taking two steps, he couldn't help but turn back and punch Chi Yu again.","Chi Yu didn't move, letting him hit him. Song Luokui shouted, \"Brother! If you do this again, I... I will...\""]},{"number":127,"title":"Chapter 127: Argument","paragraphs":["\"I won't talk to you anymore.\" Song Luokui finally said these words, pretending to be a little angry as she ran back home.","Song Luosheng let go of Chi Yu and ran back as well.","However, the scene of Song Luosheng hitting Chi Yu had already been witnessed by someone passing through the courtyard. After one night, everyone in the courtyard knew that the son of the Song family and the son of the Chi family had gotten into a fight again.","Originally, they had fought many times when they were little, so everyone was used to it. But after growing up, there had been no news of the two fighting again, so this fight made everyone quite curious. They were both in their twenties, and adults in the outside world, so how could they still get into a fight?","But let's not talk about the reaction of the people in the courtyard first. After returning home, Song Luokui rushed upstairs into her room and closed the door. She had only pretended to be angry earlier, but now she felt uneasy in her heart. Originally, she was going to tell her brother about it tomorrow night, but now it had been exposed prematurely, and her brother had even seen Chi Yu...","It was truly a case of rain leaking through the roof at the worst possible time. Song Luokui lay on the bed, her head buried in the pillow, wondering what to do, as her parents were not at home.","After a while, there was a knock on the door. Song Luokui's heart skipped a beat as Song Luosheng's voice came from outside, \"Kuikui, open the door!\"","Song Luokui hesitated for a moment but still went to open the door. As soon as she opened it, she saw Song Luosheng looking at her with a troubled expression.","Song Luokui didn't dare to look at him, feeling guilty as well. \"Brother, I'm sorry.\" Song Luokui apologized in a low voice with her head down.","Song Luosheng walked in, closed the door, and didn't say a word. He walked over and sat down on a chair nearby, while Song Luokui didn't dare to sit and just stood by the side.","After an unknown period of time, Song Luosheng finally spoke, \"Tell me, when did you two start?\"","Song Luosheng looked at Song Luokui and pulled the stool directly next to him. \"Come here and tell me.\"","Song Luokui glanced at him and immediately walked over and sat down, but her head was still lowered. \"It was... before he helped me, right? I thought since I owed him a favor, I should treat him to a meal... and then...\"","Song Luosheng interrupted her immediately, \"Wait a minute! What do you mean he helped you? What did he help you with? Didn't I help you pay back the favor already?\"","Song Luokui: \"There were other things...\"","Song Luosheng took a deep breath. \"What other things? Tell me. I can help you pay it back.\"","Song Luokui raised her head. \"Brother, I can pay back the favor I owe. You don't need to help me pay it back. I don't want you to make concessions in the business world either.\"","Song Luosheng suddenly raised his voice, \"I'm willing to! Kuikui! I'm willing to make concessions for him in the business world, rather than you getting involved with him directly! Do you know who he is? He...\" Song Luosheng suddenly choked and didn't continue.","Song Luokui raised her head and realized that her brother's eyes were red. She immediately felt guilty and hugged his arm. \"Brother! I'm sorry! Don't be like this! He... he's been quite good to me. He even told me some internal information before, like I told you about the An Cheng project and other things...\"","Song Luosheng clenched his fists. \"Kuikui, break up with him.\"","Song Luokui's eyes widened, and she immediately turned around and said firmly, \"Brother, I won't! I know what kind of person he is when I'm in a relationship with him, and he hasn't hurt me. Mom and Dad haven't objected either.\"","Song Luosheng's voice was trembling. \"So... Mom and Dad know about it, and I'm the only one being kept in the dark?\"","Song Luokui felt guilty again and turned around to hold his hand. \"Brother, I was going to tell you tomorrow night.\"","Song Luosheng dug his fingernails into his flesh. \"Tell me, when did you two start dating?\"","Song Luokui: \"We officially started dating not long ago.\"","Song Luosheng: \"Specific time!\"","Song Luokui: \"Before the summer vacation.\"","Song Luosheng: \"Good, very good!\" Song Luosheng looked up at her. \"Kuikui, then how long have you two known each other?\"","Song Luokui: \"Didn't we know each other since we were little?\"","Song Luosheng: \"You mean to say that you knew what kind of person he was since you were little? That doesn't count as knowing! I want to know when you two started going out for meals and going out together while hiding it from me.\"","Song Luosheng suddenly remembered something. \"Oh, that incident in Country A, when you were running away, he carried you and ran, didn't he? Was that when you two had already...\"","Song Luokui immediately denied it: \"No! At that time, we...\" She wanted to say that they weren't that familiar at the time, but then she remembered that Chi Yu had taken her out to play, so Song Luokui suddenly looked at Song Luosheng and saw that his expression was now quite unpleasant.","Song Luokui immediately said, \"I can't really remember clearly anymore.\"","Song Luosheng: \"Kuikui, let me tell you, if you really think he's a good person, then he's just pretending to deceive you. Chi Yu is not a good person, otherwise the Shan Yu Group wouldn't have expanded so rapidly in such a short time.\"","\"Have you seen his private side? He's a cold, ruthless, and cruel person. How could the heir of the Chi family be a good person? You've been deceived by him!\"","Song Luokui shook her head. \"No, what about you then? Didn't Songhua Technology also become a big company in such a short time? But in my eyes, you're a very good brother, and he's about the same to me.\"","Song Luosheng looked hurt. \"You're comparing me to him? How could I, your brother, not treat you better than an outsider?\"","Song Luosheng took a deep breath. \"Kuikui, I won't agree to your relationship with him. Even if Mom and Dad agree, I won't agree. Whatever favor you owe him, I'll compensate him directly.\"","Song Luokui: \"Brother, this is my own matter. And if I'm with him, he'll call you Brother-in-law in the future. Didn't you want to defeat him before? If he calls you Brother-in-law, isn't that a kind of defeating him in a way?\"","Song Luosheng's heart skipped a beat: \"... I'd rather be defeated by him than have him call me Brother-in-law, that's too horrible!\"","Song Luokui: \"Can't I be an insider then?\"","Song Luosheng wanted to shake her head to make her sober up. \"Kuikui, how could he let you be an insider? Do you know what happens to insiders in their company in the end?\"","Song Luokui: \"I don't know. I only know that he's been okay to me, and I've grown up, I have to start dating sooner or later. Even if it's not him, it could be someone else. You said before that I deserve the best and most outstanding person, but in this whole circle, who do you think is more outstanding than Chi Yu?\"","\"But what if he doesn't want you later? What if he hurts you?\" Song Luosheng's biggest concern was this.","Song Luokui suddenly smiled, \"Brother, you always think I'm weak, that I should be protected by everyone, that I should just stay cooped up in an ivory tower. But brother... I'm not a weak person, nor am I someone who would live or die for love. Apart from studying, I also have work. Even if Chi Yu and I really do split up in the future, that would just be a growth experience I need to go through myself. Without him, my life wouldn't change much. Perhaps I'd be sad for a while, but just sad for a while.\""]},{"number":128,"title":"Chapter 128: Video of fight uploaded","paragraphs":["\"I'm not obsessed with romance, how do you know that Chi Yu will dump me? Maybe I'm the one who's gotten bored and dumped him? Maybe I was just toying with him? It's not uncommon for girls to play with feelings when they're bored, is it?\" Song Luokui said very calmly.","Song Luosheng suddenly had nothing to say. His sister didn't seem like the soft, obedient, gentle little sister he had in mind.","She actually spoke so lightly of just \"playing\" with feelings.","Song Luokui added, \"Of course, those are just future possibilities. Maybe Chi Yu and I will stay together until we get married. Maybe we'll even have kids, and they'll call you 'Uncle', you know?\"","Hearing her say that gave Song Luosheng a jolt. \"Luokui, stop it, you're breaking your brother's heart.\"","Song Luosheng suddenly stood up. \"I won't agree to it. Luokui, you just rest well.\"","Song Luosheng walked out.","As soon as he opened the door, he saw Aunt Gui peeking around nosily. When she saw him come out, she gave an embarrassed smile. \"Young Master Luosheng, you can have your meal now. Where's the young lady?\"","Song Luosheng: \"Inside.\" He turned his head and said to the room, \"Luokui, time for dinner.\"","Song Luokui also came out, giving Aunt Gui a smile. \"Aunt Gui.\"","The two went downstairs one after the other and sat at the dining table in silence. Aunt Gui served the dishes, but neither of them spoke as they ate in silence.","Aunt Gui, watching them, grew increasingly anxious, not knowing what was wrong between the two siblings who used to be so affectionate, always chatting.","Ah, she didn't know what had happened.","That evening, when Song Moqian and Sheng Rong returned, Aunt Gui told them about the incident.","Song Moqian: \"Don't worry about it, he's been so busy at the company without caring about his sister at all, and now he's finally upset about it.\"","Sheng Rong: \"Luosheng is just a busy child. No matter, I'll go talk to him.\"","Song Moqian: \"What's there to talk about? It's obviously Luosheng's fault.\"","Sheng Rong: \"Oh, you. How could it be Luosheng's fault? It's Luokui keeping secrets that upset him. I'll go check on Luosheng.\"","Sheng Rong went upstairs and knocked on Song Luosheng's door.","Song Luosheng came to open it. \"Mom?\"","Sheng Rong entered. \"Have you been very busy at the company lately? If there's too much work, distribute some to others. There's always too much work to do.\"","Song Luosheng: \"I know.\"","Sheng Rong looked at him. \"Aunt Gui said you and Luokui had a falling out? It wasn't right for Luokui to hide things from you, but she's grown up now and has her own secrets, so we should understand.\"","Song Luosheng: \"Mom, I don't understand! Why him of all people?!\"","Sheng Rong: \"What's wrong with that Chi Yu boy? Isn't he quite a good lad?\"She thought the Chi family boy seemed decent.","Song Luosheng: \"I don't think so.\"","Sheng Rong: \"I know you two don't get along, but putting that aside, that Chi Yu boy is actually quite a good lad and has indeed treated Luokui very well. But of course, it's all hypothetical for now – we'll have to see how it goes in the future.","\"Your sister did say it's just dating for now. Life is long, and maybe they'll break up one day, who knows?\"","Song Luosheng didn't respond, and Sheng Rong continued, \"I know you care deeply for Luokui, and you know how much she values you as her brother – she even acted as an undercover agent for your sake. Don't you think getting angry at her like that hurts her heart?\"","Song Luosheng: \"Mom, I...\"","Sheng Rong patted his shoulder. \"Luosheng, think it over carefully. You're both grown up now. One day, you'll also get married. Luokui will have her own path in life. No matter what you two do, as long as it's not illegal, your father and I will support you. Think it over carefully.\"","With that, Sheng Rong left.","Song Luosheng sat in the chair, deep in thought.","For her part, Song Luokui also felt very regretful. She had wanted to have a nice heart-to-heart chat and act a little spoiled with her brother, but it turned out so differently instead.","At that moment, Chi Yu called her. \"Hello?\" Song Luokui's voice was very low.","Chi Yu's heart skipped a beat. \"Did he scold you? Or hit you?\" The thought of Song Luokui crying over this pained him.","Song Luokui felt much better. \"No, my brother didn't hit me or scold me. We just had an argument.\" Song Luokui sighed. \"My brother said he doesn't approve.\"","Chi Yu: \"And what about you?\"He only cared about her stance.","Song Luokui: \"Of course I refused!\"Her voice brightened.\"Dating is my own business. My brother's disapproval is his own issue. Although it does make me feel a little guilty for keeping it from him, so I guess I'll just have to give him more gifts to make it up later.\"","Song Luokui didn't believe her brother would stay angry at her for long. He was just upset in the heat of the moment.","Chi Yu felt very relieved that she didn't agree to break up.","Song Luokui thought about how her brother had hit Chi Yu, \"How are your injuries? Sorry, my brother was too rash.\"","Chi Yu: \"A bit painful.\"","Song Luokui quickly video-called him. \"Show me right away. Did you put any medicine on it?\"","The video came through quickly, and Song Luokui saw that Chi Yu's lip was swollen and purplish, with bruising on his face too.","Song Luokui: \"Why didn't you dodge? Put some medicine on right away, I'll watch you do it.\"","Chi Yu: \"Okay.\" He immediately went to find the first-aid kit and took out an iodine solution, using a mirror to treat himself while Song Luokui looked on.","Song Luokui: \"Will it look like that tomorrow too? Will it affect you going to the office? Maybe you should take the day off?\"","Chi Yu: \"No problem. We can meet up tomorrow evening then.\"","Song Luokui sighed, \"Let's cancel our plans for tomorrow evening. The goal was achieved anyway, even if the process was a bit... intense.\"","Chi Yu: \"Okay.\"","Song Luokui: \"Also, I probably can't come see you for a few days, or go to ChunWang Manor either. I'm afraid of what my brother might do, so I'll wait until he calms down before seeing you again.\"","Chi Yu: \"Got it. Can we still video chat though?\"","\"Yes, secretly.\" Song Luokui covered her mouth cutely as she whispered.","Chi Yu smiled slightly, but it tugged at his wound, causing a pain. \"Agh!\"","Song Luokui: \"Don't smile! Just rest up properly, okay? Let's end our call here for today.\"","\"Okay, good night.\"","\"Good night.\"","After hanging up, Song Luokui rubbed her face and went to take a shower.","At this point, she had no idea that news of the incident between her brother and Chi Yu had spread throughout the estate. Not only that, but the video of their fight at the ice cream shop had also been uploaded online.","Although the bodyguards made people delete the video at the time, there would always be a few that slipped through the net. And it was two handsome guys fighting over a beautiful woman, after all - people are gossips by nature. So it didn't take long for the video to spread and for people to start commenting on it.","Before long, someone recognized that the two men were the chairmen of Shan Yu Group and Songhua Technology.","\"Even though fighting is wrong, I wish I were that gorgeous woman.\"","\"+1\"","\"+2\"","\"The person above is hilarious, what values? You'd be happy if two men fought over you? I'd say she's probably just a promiscuous woman playing the field.\"","\"The person above is trying to smear her again. I remember the last person who did that had their account suspended after being sued. Wonder how long this one will last.\"","\"I just want to know why the two were fighting? Over a woman? Surely not? Don't they have plenty of women?\"","\"No, don't you guys recognize that woman? It's the one who appeared briefly when the Songhua chairman was being falsely accused last time. She's a total beauty, and I think she's related to the Songhua chairman.\"","\"Was anyone there in person? What actually happened?\""]},{"number":129,"title":"Chapter 129: Everyone Knows","paragraphs":["Song Luokui was still sleeping when her phone was bombarded with calls and messages.","Early in the morning, people were sneaking around the Song Family's neighborhood, wanting to catch a glimpse of the excitement.","\"I heard someone saw the kid from the Song Family fighting with the kid from the Chi Family yesterday. Could it have been over the Song Family's daughter?\"","\"It looks like the Song Family's daughter and the Chi Family's son are together?\"","\"Hey, I think it's great, both are exceptional kids.\"","\"Weren't the Song Family's son and the Chi Family's son at odds since childhood?\"","\"No problem, once they become in-laws, it'll be fine.\"","\"If the Song Family and the Chi Family unite, then in the future... the situation will likely change quickly.\"","\"As if it's for real. Even if it is, can't they just break up? I think my daughter isn't bad either.\"","\"You woman, I'm not belittling you, but do you think the Chi Family's son would look at your daughter?\"","...","Chi Yu and Song Luosheng also quickly discovered the video in the morning and immediately contacted people to remove it.","Although the video was deleted, those who knew about it already knew.","Zhou Yuan called Song Luosheng, \"Big boss, should we rally the brothers? What happened last night?\"","Song Luosheng had tossed and turned all night without sleeping, looking haggard. \"Not yet. It's nothing major. Let's leave it for now.\"","Zhou Yuan: \"Huh?\"","Nearby, Zhou Yue opened her gossiping eyes wide. \"Brother, what did the big boss say? What's up with Luokui and the Chi Family guy?\"","Zhou Yuan: \"Didn't Luokui tell you guys?\"","Zhou Yue: \"I called Luokui, but she didn't answer. She can't still be sleeping at this hour, can she?\"","Zhou Yuan: \"The big boss didn't say anything either.\" If Luokui had anything with the Chi Family guy, he was afraid the big boss would do something drastic.","Meanwhile, the subject of everyone's discussion, Song Luokui, had woken up, but she didn't check her phone. After washing up, she went downstairs for breakfast without seeing her brother, as her parents had already left early.","After eating, she left for school by car.","It was only then that she had time to check her phone and saw all the calls and messages.","There were missed calls and messages from Zhang Xiyue, Lou Sasa, Weng Jiao, and even Chi Yu had called her once.","Song Luokui opened the messages and realized that a video of her brother publicly beating up Chi Yu yesterday had been uploaded, and many people knew about it, but the video had already been deleted.","In the sisters' group chat:","Zhang Xiyue: !! Luokui, is this the big news you wanted to tell us?","Lou Sasa: The comments say you and the man in black, which is the Chi Family guy, went to buy ice cream, and then the man in white beat up the man in black. So Luokui, did you really go buy ice cream with the Chi Family guy?","Weng Jiao: Luokui, if you've really gotten together with Chi Yu, I'll be your disciple!","Zhou Yue: Luokui, it seems my parents know too, not only that, many people in the compound know that your brother and Chi Yu fought at your family's doorstep.","Tu Shanyue: Luokui, your taste is excellent, I support you~","Song Luokui thought for a moment before replying: It's true that Chi Yu and I went to buy ice cream and my brother saw us, so he beat up Chi Yu. I didn't expect it to be filmed and uploaded. Chi Yu and I... have indeed gotten together. I'll tell you more about this later, but for now, my brother is very angry, so I need to appease him first before telling you all.","After sending the message, Song Luokui breathed a sigh of relief. She then replied to others asking about her relationship with Chi Yu.","Until she reached school, Song Luokui thought her classmates wouldn't know, but the class president Xu Jiarong came and sat beside her. \"Luokui? I saw that video this morning. You and Senior Chi... were you scared at the time?\"","Song Luokui sighed and looked around. \"Besides you, who else knows?\"","Xu Jiarong waved her hand. \"No one, just a few people know. I... well, I browse the hot searches every day, so... but the hot search has been removed, and the video is gone too, so don't worry.\"","Song Luokui: \"I know. Chi Yu is my boyfriend. My brother didn't know, so there was a conflict. It's a small matter.\"","Xu Jiarong: \"I'll definitely keep it a secret, definitely keep it a secret.\"","Song Luokui: \"It doesn't matter if it's a secret or not anymore.\" It'll be made public eventually anyway.","Back in the dorm after class, her three roommates were present and immediately looked at her.","Song Luokui sat down tiredly. \"You all know?\"","The three nodded.","Song Luokui: \"Sigh~ I didn't expect it to blow up like this.\"","Wang Sisi: \"Is it because Senior Song doesn't approve?\"","Song Luokui: \"My brother indeed doesn't approve, but it doesn't matter now. I just didn't expect it to blow up this much.\" She was worried about this, as everyone in their circle was discussing it, and even the previous rumors about Chi Yu having a girlfriend had resurfaced.","Wang Sisi: \"It'll be fine, Senior Chi and Senior Song will probably handle it.\"","Song Luokui: \"Since you all know, there's no helping it. I'll treat you all to a meal when I have time.\"","The three were excited: \"Sure, sure, we'll definitely make time.\"","On the other side, Song Luosheng went to the company, and everyone greeted him and observed his expression along the way, as everyone knew about yesterday's incident.","\"The boss has arrived at the company, his expression doesn't look good, everyone needs to tread carefully.\"","As soon as Song Luosheng entered his office, he instructed, \"Bring me the files for these projects and the branch offices.\"","\"Yes.\"","Song Luosheng: \"Schedule a meeting with the chairman of Shan Yu Group for me. I need to meet with him.\"","The secretary was stunned: \"Shan Yu?\"","Song Luosheng: \"Yes.\"","\"Yes, yes, I'll arrange it right away.\"","At Shan Yu Group, they were also baffled when receiving Song Hua's call. \"What?\"","\"This is Li Zhengyang, the secretary of Songhua Technology's chairman. Our boss wants to meet with your boss. Could you please ask if your boss has time and agrees to the meeting? As for the reason, you should know.\"","\"Please hold, I'll go ask.\"","The secretary immediately went to ask Chi Yu, who agreed.","Finally, both parties scheduled the meeting for 5 PM that afternoon at the Shan Yu Group office.","At that moment, the personnel of both sides actually sprang into action immediately. One side prepared to welcome guests, while the other side prepared documents and files. The personnel on both sides were also concerned about one issue - whether their bosses would get into a fight in the office. So they sent people, wondering if they needed individuals with higher combat capabilities.","Zhou Yuan said, \"I'll go with the boss.\"","Lin Xingyan pondered for a moment, \"Although I don't know what we're going to do, it's all for Sister Luokui, right? If they start fighting, immediately call Sister Luokui. I think she should be able to calm both of them down.\"","\"After all, it's not like when we were kids anymore. If they fight, the impact would be significant. It's better to resolve it peacefully if possible.\"","\"Okay.\""]},{"number":130,"title":"Chapter 130: Negotiation","paragraphs":["In the afternoon, after preparing all the materials, Song Luosheng set out for the Shan Yu Group with several people. It took about an hour to travel from Songhua Technology to the Shan Yu Group. At this time, the Shan Yu Group had already prepared to welcome its guests.","At four-fifty, Song Luosheng arrived punctually at the gates of the Shan Yu Group. The driver opened the car door, and Song Luosheng straightened his clothes before stepping out.","Chen Nan greeted him directly at the entrance and shook his hand, \"Mr. Song.\"","Song Luosheng shook his hand, holding it for several seconds before letting go. Chen Nan extended his hand to lead him, \"Mr. Song, this way.\"","Song Luosheng walked ahead, with Chen Nan following behind and moving his hand slightly, \"Dang, I used too much force,\" he thought, his hand was now red. But it didn't matter for today since Kuikui, the younger sister, was the boss's family.","They took the elevator to the chairman's office floor. When Chen Nan led Song Luosheng to the conference room, Chi Yu was already seated inside, his mouth and cheeks still slightly bruised, but he met Song Luosheng's gaze unflinchingly.","A long conference table stretched across the room, with Chi Yu seated in the middle on one side and Song Luosheng seated in the middle on the other side, separated only by the width of the table. Their respective associates surrounded them.","The two men stared at each other for a long while. The employees on both sides didn't dare raise their heads, their eyes darting back and forth nervously. Finally, Song Luosheng spoke up, \"Let them leave. I want to talk to you.\"","Upon hearing this, Chi Yu glanced at the others, and his associates immediately stood up and left. Song Luosheng also told his people, \"You leave too. Give me the documents.\"","After everyone had left, the conference room fell silent again. Song Luosheng directly tossed a stack of project documents across to Chi Yu, \"I'm using these to repay you for the favor you did for Kuikui. From now on, please don't bother her again.\"","Chi Yu glanced at the documents but didn't look through them, \"She doesn't owe me anything. We have mutual feelings for each other. I won't separate from her. And she's a priceless treasure, not something that can be traded.\"","Song Luosheng looked at him expressionlessly, \"I won't agree to it.\" He gave a cold laugh, \"You know she's a priceless treasure, so how dare you steal someone else's priceless treasure?\"","Chi Yu responded, \"She and I love each other. You can't stop our feelings for each other. She's free.\" As for Song Luokui's feelings for him, he wasn't very confident. In this relationship, Song Luokui was the one holding the fishing rod, and he was the fish that had been hooked.","Song Luosheng stood up and reached over, grabbing Chi Yu's tie, \"Love each other my ass. I will never agree to you and Kuikui being together.\"","Chi Yu remained unfazed despite being grabbed by his tie, \"I can assure you that in this world, apart from her family, I will be the one who respects her the most. I believe you should also respect her. And in the Jing City circle, I'm confident that no one is more suitable for her or more worthy of her than me.\"","Song Luosheng gave a cold laugh, \"Since that's the case, what if I let you hand over the entire Shan Yu Group to me in exchange for my approval of your relationship with her?\"","Chi Yu replied, \"I can do that. I'll give the Shan Yu Group to you. I believe I can start another venture and build another Shan Yu Group, not for any other reason, but to provide her with the best life possible!\"","Song Luosheng released him, \"Anyone can talk big.\"","Chi Yu continued, \"If she and I get married, I can give her all my shares in the Shan Yu Group as her dowry. I can work for her.\"","Song Luosheng looked at him deeply, then let go, \"No matter what you say, I still won't agree. You may be cold-blooded and cruel, but she doesn't know that. I do.\"","Chi Yu countered, \"I'm only cold-blooded and cruel towards my enemies, but not towards her. Aren't you the same?\"","The two stared at each other for a long time, as if engaged in a contest of wills.","Finally, Song Luosheng rose to leave. Before opening the door, he turned to Chi Yu and said, \"Anyway, I've already given you something. Kuikui doesn't owe you anything.\"","With that, he left with his people.","Outside, everyone from both sides breathed a sigh of relief, grateful that they hadn't come to blows.","As soon as Song Luokui finished school, she heard about her brother going to the Shan Yu Group to meet with Chi Yu. She immediately called Chi Yu, \"You didn't fight, did you?\"","Chi Yu replied, \"No, we didn't.\" Although Song Luosheng seemed like he wanted to start a fight.","Song Luokui said, \"That's good. So what did my brother say to you?\"","Chi Yu answered, \"He told me not to bother you anymore, but I won't listen to him.\" His voice suddenly became subdued, \"I want to see you.\"","Song Luokui played with the bracelet on her wrist, a gift from Chi Yu, \"Let's wait a few days for my brother to calm down, then I'll go see you, okay?\"","\"Okay.\"","She was talking to Chi Yu on the phone when her brother's car arrived. Song Luokui quickly said, \"I have to go now. My brother's here.\"","Song Luosheng's car stopped next to Song Luokui, \"Get in.\"","Song Luokui obediently got in, and Song Luosheng immediately said, \"From now on, I'll drop you off and pick you up from school.\"","Song Luokui glanced at his expression and saw that he was in a bad mood, so she could only respond with, \"Oh.\"","Song Luosheng didn't say anything else. The car fell silent. In the past, Song Luosheng would have asked her about her recent situation, how her studies were going, how the company was doing, and if she needed any help, but today he remained silent.","After all, it was quite heartbreaking to have the family's 'cabbage' snatched away by a pig.","Although Song Luosheng said he didn't want Chi Yu to see Song Luokui, he also knew it was impossible to prevent it, and his sister Kuikui wouldn't listen to him either. So Song Luosheng was quite troubled.","For several days, the atmosphere at home was not good. Song Luokui didn't meet with Chi Yu either. However, her sisters kept asking her how she and Chi Yu had gotten together.","Thinking that she hadn't been out much lately except for school, Song Luokui decided to go out when her sisters invited her.","But when it was time to leave, Song Luosheng found out and insisted on sending her off, worried that she might be going to meet Chi Yu.","He accompanied her all the way to the private room and only felt at ease after glancing inside and seeing that it was just a group of girls.","Once Song Luokui sat down, Zhang Xiyue immediately grabbed her hand, \"Kuikui, your brother is really keeping a close eye on you.\"","Song Luokui sighed, \"My brother is afraid I'll go find Chi Yu lately.\"","Lou Sasa quickly came over, \"Come on, tell me how you managed to get that prince charming? To be honest, even though your brother and the guy from the Chi family are pretty outstanding, I'm still a bit afraid of them, haha.\"","Weng Jiao: \"Don't mention it, I'm quite afraid too.\"","Song Luokui: \"Back in high school, I originally wanted to study abroad, right? I went for a trial period, and one day I ran into him. At that time...\" Song Luokui recounted the incident where Chi Yu was injured and she had saved him.","\"After that, there was one time when I came out of the club, his car was parked right in front of me. He wanted to give me a ride home. It was getting late, and I felt it wasn't very safe, so I got into the car. After all, I had saved him before, so he wouldn't hurt me, right?\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"Honey, you were really brave. Did you forget about the time you ruined his pants?\"","Song Luokui: \"...\""]},{"number":131,"title":"Chapter 131: Sister Support","paragraphs":["\"Don't interrupt, let Kuikui speak,\" Lou Sasa said, blinking her gossipy big eyes.","Song Luokui: \"The pants incident was from when I was little... There was another time when I went to Country A with my brother. During the banquet, we didn't expect that there would actually be robbers... When we were escaping, he kept running while holding me...\"","As soon as she said that, everyone in the room let out a \"Wow~\" sound.","Weng Jiao: \"He must have had his eye on you back then.\"","Lou Sasa: \"That's right, he must have.\"","Tu Shanyue: \"I think he started being interested in you when you were in Y Country, otherwise why would he have let Kuikui bandage his wound?\"","Everyone unanimously agreed with this statement.","Song Luokui: \"Also, before that, when we were in school, there was a guy who kept pestering me, and he helped me deal with that situation too. When he went abroad, he even bought me gifts.\"","Everyone listening thought it sounded very dreamy - he even bought gifts?","When a guy buys you gifts, it obviously implies intimacy.","Lou Sasa: \"What did he buy you?\"","Song Luokui: \"Things like jewelry and accessories, a lot of them.\"","Weng Jiao: \"Didn't you think anything of it at the time?\"","Song Luokui pondered for a moment, \"Hmm... I did feel it was too intimate at one point and wanted to return the gifts to him, but he gave them back to me. And I was also worried that my brother would find out, so he said I could be his informant. My brother's informant... He would tell me some business information, and I would pass it on to my brother.\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"Wow, he was blatantly making you a double agent!\"","Song Luokui: \"I... I thought it made sense, so that's what I did.\"","Lou Sasa: \"So when did you two officially get together?\" As she asked this, several pairs of eyes fixed on Kuikui.","Song Luokui gulped, \"Around the end of last semester, I suppose. After he came back from abroad, he confessed to me, and he had hinted at it before he went on a business trip...\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"Wow, you kept it from us for so long!\"","Song Luokui smiled awkwardly, \"You know, if I didn't keep it a secret, and my brother found out, then...\"","Lou Sasa: \"But you kept it a secret for quite a while. Just to be clear, before you two got together, we had no idea you had any connection with that guy from the Chi family? It's been two or three years, right? Wow, you kept it a secret for that long?\"","Weng Jiao suddenly remembered something from one day, \"Do you all remember that time we had our Lolita gathering? Kuikui took a call, right? It was a man's voice, and you said it was your brother at the time. Was it really your brother?\"","Saying this made everyone recall that moment. Zhang Xiyue snapped her fingers, \"Was it that guy from the Chi family at the time?\"","Song Luokui nodded.","\"Alright, you can know everything you want to now. My parents actually know about it too. It's just my brother, in his current state, has no reason to object to me dating Chi Yu.\" Song Luokui seemed dejected. In this matter, she did wrong her brother by keeping it a secret from him. But he couldn't stop her from going out and meeting people either.","She truly didn't feel that Chi Yu would hurt her. It was just that her brother thought Chi Yu was dangerous and was afraid she would get hurt.","Zhang Xiyue: \"After all, your brother and that guy from the Chi family don't get along. And for the family's little princess to be with his mortal enemy, anyone would be dumbfounded and opposed to it.\"","Lou Sasa: \"Your brother is just thrown off for now. From an outsider's perspective, Chi Yu is a good match for you. The relationship between him and your brother isn't one of life and death - they just can't stand each other. Your two families don't have any long-standing feuds either. In fact, one could say that your two families joining through marriage could elevate both clans to new heights.\"","Tu Shanyue nodded from the side, \"A marriage alliance with a family like that would certainly benefit the clan. I think your brother and the Chi family guy could totally shake hands and make peace. Their two turfs could merge into one big territory. If not, they could at least avoid crossing paths while occasionally cooperating to take down enemies. That would be great.\"","Weng Jiao: \"I think it's pretty good too - the strong joining the strong is much better than some romance with a poor guy eloping. Your brother can't see it clearly now, but he should come around after some time.\"","Song Luokui: \"I hope so. I'm also worried that my brother's men might object since they don't get along with Chi Yu's people. Yuan Ge, has Yuan Ge said anything recently?\" Song Luokui looked at Zhou Yue.","Zhou Yue shook her head, \"No, he hasn't said much. Just that everyone's on high alert lately, worried that your brother and the Chi family guy might start fighting. If they do fight, they would of course help. But it's better if they don't fight at all.\"","\"Your brother was actually quite shocked too. He even thought about making you a pretty disaster, so that the Chi family guy would have to call your brother 'Big Brother-in-law' or even 'Uncle'. He seemed to find that idea quite satisfying.\"","Song Luokui: \"...\"","Zhou Yue: \"Oh, and my brother also said he doesn't know if Chi Yu would have to kneel and pay respects to the Big Brother-in-law at the wedding. If the Chi family guy has to bow to your brother, wouldn't that mean your brother defeated him?\"","Zhang Xiyue clapped her hands, \"That's right! Kuikui, make Chi Yu call your brother 'Uncle'. See how your brother reacts? For some reason, I can't help but want to laugh at that scene.\" She coughed.","Song Luokui: \"So it seems none of you really object to me and Chi Yu?\"","Everyone shook their heads together.","Zhang Xiyue: \"As your sister, as long as you're happy, that's what matters. After all, that Chi family guy isn't ordinary. From what you've said about your interactions with him, it seems he was the more proactive one pursuing you, right?\"","Song Luokui nodded.","Lou Sasa: \"In any case, you're in the advantageous position for now. Not to mention the future, you've already gained more from this. The Chi family guy isn't bad looking either. Even if it's just a fling, it's not a problem.\"","Weng Jiao tapped Lou Sasa's head, \"Aren't you worried Kuikui might get herself into some trouble? And the Chi family guy isn't someone to be trifled with. But before this, we never heard any rumors about him being involved with women, except for that gossip about a fake girlfriend dragging some girls from our circles into it... Wait, that rumor about a girlfriend back then wasn't actually a rumor, was it? The 'girlfriend' they were referring to was you, right? Everyone in our circle was guessing at the time.\"","Song Luokui nodded, \"It was me they were talking about, but I wasn't his girlfriend at that point yet.\"","Weng Jiao: \"In any case, Kuikui, if you don't see any issues, we'll all support you. From what we can tell now, you two do seem quite well-matched.\"","Tu Shanyue: \"Kuikui doesn't seem like the romantic type. It's just a relationship, I don't think it's a big deal. Besides, Kuikui is already so grown up, what's wrong with having a relationship?\"","Song Luokui felt touched: \"Thank you all.\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"But... you kept it from us for so long, don't you need to treat us to a meal? It would be best if you could bring your boyfriend along.\"","\"Yes, yes, yes.\" The others agreed in unison.","Song Luokui: \"No problem with that, but it's not possible at the moment. My brother won't let me meet Chi Yu, so we'll have to wait until my brother is okay with it.\"","\"No worries, we'll wait.\""]},{"number":132,"title":"Chapter 132: Choosing Men","paragraphs":["The party ended, and Song Luosheng drove Song Luokui home. In the car, Song Luokui hesitated for a moment before speaking: \"Brother.\"","Song Luosheng: \"Hmm?\"","Song Luokui: \"If Chi Yu calls you Uncle...\"","With a screech, the car made an emergency stop, causing Song Luokui to lurch forward. She immediately stopped her sentence, \"Brother, never mind, please focus on driving.\"","Song Luosheng gave her a glance before returning his eyes to the road, his expression grim.","He felt that he needed to take some measures to separate Luokui from Chi Yu.","At ChunWang Manor","The lights in the opposite room remained dim, indicating that Song Luokui hadn't come. Chi Yu hadn't seen her in person for several days, and they could only meet through video calls.","Chi Yu entered the bathroom and took a shower, letting the hot water flow down from his head, over his eyes, nose, and lips...","Suddenly, his phone outside rang. It rang for about ten seconds and then stopped.","Half an hour later, Chi Yu emerged from the bathroom, drying his hair, and noticed Song Luokui's missed call. He immediately called her back, but she didn't answer. He tried a second time, and she finally picked up.","Song Luokui: \"I went out for a gathering with my sisters today. They kept asking about our relationship and said that we should treat them to a meal in the future.\"","Chi Yu: \"Sure, no problem. When?\" The thought of Song Luokui introducing him to her circle made Chi Yu feel happy.","Song Luokui: \"Probably when my brother stops restricting me.\"","Currently, Song Luosheng was indeed the biggest obstacle between them. Chi Yu was already thinking about how he could get Song Luosheng to approve of their relationship. Even if he didn't approve, not allowing them to meet was troublesome.","Chi Yu: \"I'll find a way to make him agree.\"","Song Luokui: \"Don't use too extreme measures, like beating my brother half to death. You mustn't get into any trouble.\" Song Luokui was also afraid that her brother might hurt Chi Yu.","Chi Yu chuckled, \"I won't.\"","Song Luokui: \"I'll talk to my brother again. Let's work on it together.\"","\"Okay.\"","Actually, Song Luokui could meet Chi Yu if she wanted, but that would certainly anger and upset her brother. Now that things were like this, she was afraid that her brother would disown her if she went against him again.","While Song Luokui hadn't figured out a good solution yet, Song Luosheng had already asked someone to gather information on all the young talents in their circle.","He didn't believe that Chi Yu was the only man in the entire circle! Once Luokui met more handsome and capable men, perhaps she wouldn't be deceived by someone like Chi Yu anymore.","In the office, Zhou Yuan and Lin Xingyan placed a stack of files in front of him. \"Boss, what are you going to do with these?\" asked Zhou Yuan.","Lin Xingyan: \"Are you selecting a consort for Sister Luokui? Oh, no, a husband?\"","Song Luosheng: \"Take a look and see which one is most outstanding and worthy of my Luokui.\"","Zhou Yuan picked up a file, \"How about this one? From the An family, he has a master's degree from Princeton University abroad and just returned to the country. Quite accomplished but not very good-looking.\"","Song Luosheng glanced at it and rejected it immediately, \"Not attractive enough.\"","Lin Xingyan: \"What about this one? From the Li family, quite good-looking, currently a senior at Peking University and already a manager at his family's company.\"","Song Luosheng frowned, \"Just a manager? Not capable enough!\" And it was just his family's company.","Zhou Yuan: \"This one? Good family background, capable, but he's had a girlfriend before.\"","Song Luosheng's frown deepened, \"Even worse, a tainted man is not worthy of my Luokui.\"","Zhou Yuan: \"...\"","\"What about the Lou family? Isn't Luokui's best friend from the Lou family?\"","\"No.\"","\"The Zhu family.\"","\"No, their zodiac signs clash with Luokui's.\"","\"The Zhang family.\"","\"No, too old.\" Even though he was only thirty years old.","...","Zhou Yuan was exhausted, \"Why don't I recommend myself then? Boss, what do you think?\" He straightened his clothes.","Next to him, Lin Xingyan: \"Hey? If you're recommending yourself, then I should too. I think I'm qualified.\"","Song Luosheng: \"...Get out of here, both of you.\"","The two were just joking around, as they both saw Luokui as a little sister. Zhou Yuan stroked his chin, \"Boss, why don't we have Luokui attend some upcoming banquets? She'll meet more people at banquets. Let Luokui take a look too since she didn't like attending these events before and ended up being seduced by Chi Yu.\"","Hearing this, Song Luosheng suddenly felt it made sense, \"You're right, Luokui should meet more people. I should have had her participate in more events and meet people from our circle earlier.\"","On the other side, Song Luokui, who was in class, sneezed. With the cold weather lately, was she getting a cold?","A couple of days later, Song Luosheng told her to attend a banquet with him and even hired people to come to their home to do her makeup.","Song Luokui was puzzled, \"What banquet?\" Her brother rarely made her attend these events before since she didn't like them.","Song Luosheng: \"A banquet for our circle, just go have some fun.\"","At seven o'clock in the evening, Song Luokui hooked her arm around Song Luosheng's as they entered a villa. The night had already turned quite chilly, and Song Luokui, wearing a strapless long dress with her hair neatly styled, shivered from the cold before entering the villa.","Once inside, the warmth enveloped them, and Song Luokui felt much better. The reason she disliked attending banquets was because of the many rules and regulations.","Upon entering, quite a few people looked over at her and Song Luosheng, and some even whispered to their companions while glancing their way.","Song Luokui remained composed, simply watching her brother greet others and occasionally introduce her to someone.","Each time, Song Luokui would just smile and shake their hand, acting like a decorative vase. Soon, Zhou Yuan and Lin Xingyan came over as well.","\"Sister Luokui, Boss.\"","Seeing familiar faces made Song Luokui feel much better, \"Brother Zhou, Brother Xingyan.\"","Zhou Yuan: \"Sister Luokui looks beautiful tonight. Have fun this evening.\"","Song Luokui felt like there was a hidden meaning behind his words.","Zhou Yuan: \"By the way, my sister is here too. Luokui, would you like to go and play with her?\" he suggested.","Song Luokui immediately nodded, \"Where's Yueyue?\"","Zhou Yuan then led her to find his sister. Upon seeing Song Luokui, Zhou Yue ran over, \"Luokui.\"","Song Luokui also hugged her, \"Yue Yue.\"","Zhou Yue greeted Song Luosheng and Lin Xingyan, then held Song Luokui's hand, \"Big sister, I'll take Kui Kui to play.\"","Song Luosheng hesitated for a moment and nodded.","Zhou Yue quickly took Song Luokui away, \"I didn't believe it when my brother said the big sister was bringing you here, but I didn't expect you to actually come?\"","Song Luokui: \"What's wrong?\"","Zhou Yue whispered in Song Luokui's ear: \"Although it's a banquet, haven't you noticed that most of them are young people from the circle? The main focus is on making friends, and the real situation is actually a matchmaking event.\"","\"Aren't you already with Chi Yu? So everyone was quite surprised by your arrival, but some people were quite curious about you too. You don't know, your story with Chi Yu has spread throughout the entire circle, and everyone wants to know you.\"","Song Luokui looked around and noticed that not a few people were secretly watching her."]},{"number":133,"title":"Chapter 133: Cry","paragraphs":["\"How come you came too?\" Song Luokui asked.","Zhou Yue said, \"My brother said the eldest brought you here, so he told me to come and hang out too, keeping you company.\"","Song Luokui held her hand, \"Thank you, you're truly my good sister.\"","Zhou Yue leaned in and whispered, \"It seems like your brother wants to introduce you to a man. That's why he brought you here.\"","Song Luokui: ???","\"Huh?\"","Soon after, music started playing on the stage. In a corner, Zhou Yuan told Song Luosheng, \"Eldest, there might be people who want to ask Sister Kuikui to dance later. You must not go up there, okay? We agreed that Kuikui should meet more people.\"","Although Song Luosheng felt uncomfortable, he still nodded, \"Understood.\"","Sure enough, as soon as the music started playing, gentlemen politely invited ladies to dance in the middle of the floor. Someone approached and extended a hand towards Zhou Yuan, who gave Song Luokui a look before ushering her onto the dance floor.","On the other side, Zhou Yuan exclaimed, \"Damn! Who is that guy? How dare he ask my sister to dance?\"","Lin Xingyan said, \"Calm down, your sister might just be meeting more guys.\"","Zhou Yuan: \"...\"","After Zhou Yue went to dance, Song Luokui found a spot to sit down, and no one dared to invite her to dance.","Lin Xingyan said, \"No one dares to ask Kuikui. Should I pretend to go?\"","Song Luosheng also frowned, \"I'll go dance with my sister.\" Zhou Yuan immediately stopped him, \"Eldest, we agreed not to interfere today.\"","At that moment, in another corner, someone had already informed Chi Yu about the situation.","As soon as Chi Yu learned that Song Luokui was attending a so-called matchmaking party, he rushed over. By the time Chi Yu arrived, several dance songs had already been played.","Zhou Yue had danced with three different men three times, but she was tired and stopped, sitting beside Song Luokui.","\"I just went to the restroom and heard people discussing you,\" Zhou Yue told Song Luokui.","Song Luokui asked, \"What did they say about me?\"","Zhou Yue explained, \"One said you look beautiful and would match well with that Chi family member. Another said you don't seem worthy of the Chi family member. The two almost started arguing. Then I went out and told the girl in front that I supported her view. As for the other one, don't think I don't know – she likes that Chi family member but hasn't even met him.\"","\"Oh, I also saw the girl who had a matchmaking date with your brother before. Look over there, that's her, Su Congrong, back from abroad, studied art.\" Zhou Yue tilted her chin towards a girl.","That girl kept glancing at Song Luosheng and occasionally looked towards Song Luokui. When she saw Song Luokui looking her way, Su Congrong smiled at her, hesitated for a moment, then walked over, \"Hello, I'm Su Congrong.\"","Song Luokui was caught off guard that she would approach, \"Hello.\"","Su Congrong said, \"I know your brother and that he has a sister, but I didn't know what you looked like. I never expected to see you in person today. You resemble your brother a bit – you're both very good-looking.\"","Song Luokui smiled, \"Thank you, you're also very beautiful.\"","Su Congrong blushed at her smile, \"Can we exchange contact info?\"","Song Luokui replied, \"Ah, sure.\" She took out her phone.","On the other side, Song Luosheng, who had been keeping an eye on Luokui occasionally, frowned when he saw Su Congrong. At that moment, Chi Yu had just arrived.","Everyone was instantly drawn to the man at the entrance, even those dancing on the floor turned to look. Faint exclamations could be heard: \"It's Chi Yu.\"","\"Wow, how did he end up here? I didn't hear he was coming.\"","\"What's going on?\"","\"It must be for her, right? He's walking over there.\"","As soon as Chi Yu entered, he spotted Song Luokui talking with Su Congrong. Song Luokui looked up at the commotion and locked eyes with Chi Yu, her own eyes widening in surprise.","Su Congrong also noticed and quickly excused herself, \"Well, I'll leave you two alone then.\"","Song Luokui only nodded, watching as Chi Yu kept walking towards her while everyone else stared at them. Even the music seemed to stop.","When Song Luosheng saw Chi Yu, his brows furrowed deeply, \"Who called him over?\"","Zhou Yuan said, \"Maybe someone tipped him off? There are so many people here.\"","As Chi Yu approached Song Luokui and prepared to take her hand, Song Luosheng immediately appeared between them, pulling Luokui behind him. He directly faced Chi Yu, \"Why are you here?\"","Chi Yu didn't look at him, keeping his gaze on Song Luokui behind him. He hadn't seen her in days and only wanted to embrace her.","Song Luosheng pushed Chi Yu, \"Who are you looking at?\"","That's when Chi Yu finally met Song Luosheng's eyes, \"Did you consider her feelings when you brought her to a place like this? She doesn't like these kinds of events to begin with. And did you want to watch her dance with other men? Luckily, everyone here knows about her relationship with me, so they didn't dare!\"","Song Luosheng sneered, \"What relationship with you?\"","Chi Yu grew serious, \"Song Luosheng, I thought you loved her the most, but now I see this isn't love. You're just unwilling to let go, so you're imposing your displeasure onto her, making her live under your control? Is this what you want?\"","Seeing the two at an impasse, Song Luokui immediately stepped forward to push them apart, tears streaming down her face, \"Stop fighting, stop fighting, it's all my fault. I...\" She choked up, crying harder, \"I don't like seeing you two fight.\"","The two men panicked at her tears. Chi Yu was quicker to pull her into an embrace, \"Don't cry. I'm sorry, I shouldn't have argued with you.\"","Song Luosheng glared at him but didn't say more, only comforting her, \"Kuikui, I'm sorry, don't cry. It's all my fault. I shouldn't have brought you here.\"","Luokui's sobs tugged at both men's hearts.","Wiping her tears, her eyes still red, Song Luokui said, \"Can we leave first?\" She suddenly felt embarrassed to still be at the party.","Song Luosheng immediately replied, \"Sure, let's go. I'll take you home.\"","Chi Yu added, \"I'll take you home too.\"","Next, everyone saw Song Luokui holding Song Luosheng's left hand and Chi Yu's right hand, with the three of them walking out of the banquet hall.","Zhou Yue: ...It seemed like she just saw Luokui pinch her thigh.","Zhou Yuan: It scared the hell out of me, I thought they were going to start fighting.","As for the other people's reactions, they were varied.","\"I suddenly want to ask, what does it feel like to have two high-quality men vying for your attention?\"","\"If it were me, I would definitely be very happy.\"","\"The Song family's little sister is so lucky~ I also want two men to vie for my attention.\"","\"Should I find two ugly ones for you to vie for your attention?\"","\"...You get out of here!\""]},{"number":134,"title":"Chapter 134: Outfit","paragraphs":["At this moment in the car, the driver was driving at the front, while in the backseat, Song Luokui was sitting in the middle, with Chi Yu on one side and Song Luosheng on the other.","The driver, sensing the tense atmosphere, wisely raised the partition screen.","As soon as the partition rose, Song Luosheng spoke up, eyeing the intertwined hands of Chi Yu and Song Luokui, \"Let go of my sister. This is my family's car, why did you come in?\"","Chi Yu: \"This is my girlfriend's car.\"","Song Luosheng: \"Psh! This is my family's car.\"","Chi Yu: \"So this isn't Kuikui's car?\"","Song Luosheng turned to Song Luokui: \"Sister, don't listen to him trying to drive a wedge between us.\"","Chi Yu: \"I'm not trying to drive a wedge, I'm your boyfriend, so I can come in, right?\" Chi Yu looked at Song Luokui.","Song Luokui glanced back and forth between them, feeling like crying again. Suddenly she thought of something, \"Wait, is there a mirror? I want to check my face.\"","After crying so hard earlier, she didn't know if her makeup was ruined.","While searching for a mirror, Song Luosheng said, \"Kuikui, you still look beautiful.\"","Chi Yu: \"Your makeup is still intact, don't worry.\" Chi Yu was also looking for a mirror.","Finally, Song Luokui broke free from their grasps and took out a mirror from her makeup bag to look at herself. Her eyes were still a bit red and watery, and although her makeup wasn't completely ruined, it was still a little smudged for her liking.","Song Luokui: \"You two, stop talking for now.\"","Song Luokui started touching up her makeup, brushing her eyelashes and adding some powder to her face. Song Luosheng helped her hold the mirror, \"Sister, let me hold the mirror for you.\"","Not to be outdone, Chi Yu said, \"Tell me which product you need.\"","Song Luosheng: \"Don't listen to him, he doesn't know anything about makeup.\"","Chi Yu: \"I do know.\"","Song Luosheng: \"He must have learned it from other women.\"","Chi Yu: \"No, I learned it myself, because I wanted to have common topics with you. Your brother definitely doesn't know. He doesn't have a girlfriend.\"","Song Luosheng: \"Damn! Kuikui, look at him, he's disrespecting me, your brother. He dares to talk to me like that.\"","Chi Yu: \"I only respect polite people.\"","Song Luosheng: Blah blah blah","Chi Yu: Blah blah blah","The two bickered more and more fiercely, until somehow they both became agitated and moved, bumping into Song Luokui, who was holding an eyebrow pencil to touch up her brows. She thought she could delay things a bit, but the bump caused her hand to jerk, and the eyebrow pencil left a long streak above her brow...","Song Luokui stared at the mirror in shock, taking a deep breath, \"Shut up!\"","In an instant, the two men fell silent, one look at her face told them they were in trouble...","They immediately sat upright and dared not say a word or look at her.","Song Luokui stared at her reflection, wanting to cry but with no tears left. She put the eyebrow pencil away, expressionless, and said nothing more. As for the streaked brow, it was beyond her care at that point!","All the way home, the three remained silent. Song Luosheng and Chi Yu stole glances at Song Luokui's expression, quickly looking away whenever she turned their way.","It's said that a woman with ruined makeup is the most formidable, so neither dared to move. Even the driver wondered why there was no sound from the back.","As soon as they got out of the car, the two men followed Song Luokui into the Song residence.","In the living room, Song Moqian and Sheng Rong had returned early and were chatting when they heard the commotion and looked up to see their younger daughter storming in, followed by their son and the boy from the Chi family.","Seeing that the two must have provoked their younger daughter, Sheng Rong was quite surprised. She knew how good-natured her younger daughter was - what had happened?","Song Moqian spoke first, \"Kuikui, what's wrong?\"","Song Luokui's eyes reddened, \"I don't want to deal with them anymore!\" She ran upstairs.","Song Moqian slammed his palm on the table, \"What did you two do?\"","\"Thump\" - Song Luosheng immediately knelt on the floor, startling Chi Yu, who quickly followed suit.","Sheng Rong hurried to help him up, \"Little Yu, you can't kneel! First tell me, what happened?\"","But Song Luosheng disagreed, \"Mom, why can't he kneel? He's also at fault!\"","Chi Yu: \"Yes, it's my fault. I upset Kuikui.\"","Song Moqian: \"Tell me what happened!\"","Song Luosheng: \"...Nothing much, we just accidentally bumped into her while she was doing her makeup.\"","Sheng Rong: \"No wonder I saw that big eyebrow pencil streak on Kuikui's brow earlier.\"","Song Moqian: \"...And that's it? I don't dare disturb your mother when she's doing her makeup!\" Didn't he know how terrifying a woman with ruined makeup could be?","Sheng Rong glanced over, and Song Moqian sheepishly admitted, \"...Anyway, it's both your faults.\"","Song Luosheng & Chi Yu: \"Yes.\"","Upstairs, Song Luokui hummed a tune as she removed her makeup. It seemed it was her turn to take control.","She lifted her skirt and saw the bruises she had pinched onto herself earlier, which now started to hurt.","After showering and applying ointment, Song Luokui went to bed, leaving everything else for later.","Some time later, Chi Yu left the Song residence, and Song Luosheng went upstairs to knock on her door, \"Kuikui? Kuikui?\"","Song Luokui didn't respond.","Song Luosheng: \"Brother was wrong, I'm sorry.\"","Still no response from Song Luokui.","Outside, Song Luosheng sighed and left.","The next day at breakfast, Song Luosheng passed Song Luokui a steamed bun, but she \"hmph'd\" and pushed it back, finishing her meal before standing up, \"I'm going to school.\"","Song Luosheng immediately said, \"Kuikui, let me drive you to school.\"","Song Luokui: \"I don't want you to, I'll have Uncle An drive me. I have bodyguards too.\"","Soon after, Song Luokui left, and Song Moqian said, \"Serves you right!\"","Sheng Rong pulled at him, \"Kuikui must still be angry, she'll be fine in a couple of days.\"","Chi Yu also sent Song Luokui an apology message, but she didn't reply. She wanted the two men to learn that she could hold a grudge too.","For two days straight, Song Luokui ignored everyone. On this day, as soon as she returned home, she saw Song Luosheng sitting in the living room. When Song Luosheng saw her come back, he immediately said, \"Kuikui, if you want to be with Chi Yu, I won't object as long as you go somewhere with me. If you can endure it, then I won't object to you two being together.\"","Song Luokui looked at him and asked, \"Where?\"","Song Luosheng immediately walked over to her and grabbed her hand. \"Come, I'll take you there.\"","Song Luokui got into Song Luosheng's car, and he drove her around, turning this way and that, until they arrived at a bar.","This place was different from the ones she had been to before. It was filled with a hazy, smoky atmosphere, and the smell of cigarettes and alcohol was overpowering. In one corner, a man was groping a woman under her clothes, while in another, a woman was helping a man...","Her ears were assaulted by the sound of heavy metal and rock music blaring loudly. Down below, men and women were standing and dancing in the pool area, some even stripping..."]},{"number":135,"title":"Chapter 135: Watch","paragraphs":["Suddenly a woman was dragged onto the stage, her clothes torn off, looking as if she was being forced. Song Luokui frowned and took a step forward, but Song Luosheng immediately held her back, \"She's doing it willingly.\"","Song Luokui looked at Song Luosheng, then towards the stage where the woman had a seductive expression on her face. Soon after, another man was also dragged onto the stage...","In a corner, a man was kneeling in front of several other men, licking their shoes as they laughed arrogantly and wantonly!","Elsewhere, a man and woman were directly copulating in public view...","Shortly after, a fight broke out in another area, leaving someone beaten to the point of being unrecognizable, but they were quickly dragged away!","Song Luokui kept frowning as she watched, but she didn't understand, \"Why did you bring me to see this? I would never come to a place like this.\"","Song Luosheng took out a cigarette and lit it up, the smoke obscuring his face and making his hardened features seem indifferent and cold, his gaze on the people below as if they were mere insects.","Song Luokui frowned, this was the first time her brother smoked in front of her. Song Luosheng then spoke, \"Here they come!\"","At the entrance, a group of people suddenly arrived.","Several men in black suits instantly took control of the entire scene, the music stopped, and those who were half-dressed quickly put their clothes back on.","Everyone stepped aside, clearing a path as Chi Yu, flanked by Li Yanbei, walked in. Both were dressed in custom-tailored black suits, their polished shoes making no sound on the carpet.","No one in the room dared to speak. Someone approached to offer Chi Yu a cigarette, but was immediately pushed aside by Li Yanbei, \"My brother doesn't smoke, scram!\"","Li Yanbei's expression was vastly different from the jovial one Song Luokui had seen before.","Chi Yu coolly surveyed the scene, his eyes indifferent and cold, as if those present were mere trash.","\"Where's Yan Ye?\" Chi Yu spoke up.","Someone pointed towards a semi-enclosed booth where a man was kneeling and licking shoes.","Chi Yu headed straight for it. The people there had initially been amused by the sudden silence, but were now too preoccupied by their current amusement to notice the commotion outside.","However, a man suddenly entered, \"Boss Yan, Boss Chi is here.\"","Yan Ye, sitting in the middle while smoking and embracing a woman, scoffed, \"Boss Chi? Who's that?\"","Just then, Chi Yu arrived at the entrance. Upon seeing him, Yan Ye immediately stood up, extinguishing his cigarette. The woman beside him was shoved aside, and the man licking shoes was kicked away. The previously arrogant man now cowered like a turtle, \"Brother, why are you here?\"","Chi Yu surveyed the scene, then strode over, grabbing Yan Ye by the throat and lifting him off the ground.","\"Brother!\" Yan Ye's face turned red as he was choked. \"I'm sorry!\"","Chi Yu then flung him towards a table, smashing him through it, his head bleeding!","The others in the booth made a move, but Li Yanbei's glare stopped them. \"What are you doing?\" Li Yanbei waved his hand, \"Detain them all first and find out who led this debauchery.\"","Bleeding and in pain, Yan Ye rolled over and knelt, \"Brother, I'm sorry, I'm sorry.\" He began slapping his own face.","Chi Yu walked over and kicked him down again. Yan Ye cried and apologized repeatedly.","Chi Yu crouched down, gripping Yan Ye's throat emotionlessly, \"If you want to die, I can grant you a quick end! But if anything happens to the Chi family, I'll make sure you wish you were dead!\"","Had someone not informed him, he wouldn't have known that this usually obedient little cousin was capable of such depravity, acting like an ancient tyrant, even brazenly claiming no one in all of Hua Country dared to challenge him. Who did he think he was?","Chi Yu: \"Since you seem so idle, perhaps a life of leisure is no longer enough for you and you crave excitement. Very well, they need tree planters in the northwest. I'll have someone send you there immediately.\"","Yan Ye cried uncontrollably, \"Brother, I'm truly sorry, waaah.\"","Chi Yu flung him aside, \"There are no more chances.\"","Song Luosheng: \"Do you know who that man is that Chi Yu was choking?\"","Song Luokui: \"Who is he?\"","Song Luosheng: \"His cousin. You see how he treats even his own family.\"","Song Luokui: \"Although I didn't hear the specifics, it's clear the cousin did something wrong.\"","Song Luosheng: \"Even if he was wrong, does that justify sending a family member to plant trees in the northwest?\" At least he heard those words about the northwest and tree planting.","Song Luokui: \"The northwest is fine, it's a contribution to the country. If you were like that, Brother, I'd have Father send you to the northwest to plant trees too.\"","Song Luosheng: \"Ahem! We're talking about Chi Yu. Don't you think he's cold, heartless and cruel? And this is already one of his better sides that I'm showing you.\"","Song Luokui watched Chi Yu below. He did seem different from his usual self, appearing aloof and superior. She saw him seated in the center of a sofa, with a row of people kneeling before him, saying something she couldn't hear. It reminded her of a scene from long ago at Unnamed Mountain Lake.","Later, the club manager was also brought out, and Li Yanbei said something to the supervisor that made him nod fearfully.","Song Luokui watched silently from above, her expression unchanged. She had been well-sheltered, but she wasn't completely ignorant either. She knew Chi Yu's background and that he couldn't possibly maintain his gentlemanly demeanor in private.","But would he ever treat her like that?","Finally, Chi Yu stood to leave. As if sensing something, he glanced up and noticed Song Luokui on the second floor.","Chi Yu was visibly startled.","Everyone saw him suddenly turn and approach Song Luokui and Song Luosheng, frowning at Song Luosheng, \"Why did you bring her here? Don't you know it's not safe?\"","Song Luosheng: \"I brought her to see your true nature.\"","Li Yanbei downstairs looked up and immediately knew why Chi Yu went upstairs, wow ~ the sister-in-law was actually here too, along with the sister-in-law's brother.","Chi Yu looked at Song Luokui: \"I'll take you away from here.\"","Song Luokui glanced at him, then headed straight for the stairs, and everyone saw Chi Yu following behind a girl as the group quickly left.","Even Yan Ye with his swollen face saw it, \"Who's that girl?\"","Li Yanbei: \"That girl? Remember not to talk like that next time, or your brother might send you to Africa to dig mines.\"","Yan Ye shuddered, he certainly believed his brother might actually do that.","Li Yanbei: \"Send these people to the northwest, don't let them come back for nearly a year! Oh, and those others too, let them go and learn a lesson.\"","\"Yes!\"","Yan Ye was about to say something but was immediately muzzled.","Song Luosheng just watched as Song Luokui left with Chi Yu, he didn't follow them. If Luokui still wanted to be with Chi Yu, there was nothing he could do about it."]},{"number":136,"title":"Chapter 136: Agreement","paragraphs":["Song Luokui and Chi Yu walked out of the bar. Outside, several black cars were parked, all belonging to Chi Yu's men. Song Luokui glanced at Chi Yu, and he immediately opened the door of one of the cars.","Song Luokui got in right away, and Chi Yu followed suit. The men behind them also got into their respective cars, and several cars drove off.","In the car, Chi Yu explained to Song Luokui, \"The person you saw earlier was my cousin. He has recently picked up some bad habits from the wrong crowd, so...\"","Song Luokui thought about how that man made someone lick his shoes. This was not just a bad habit, but a cruel act.","Seeing Song Luokui frown, Chi Yu said, \"I've already arranged for him to be sent to plant trees in the northwest. If he doesn't learn his lesson, I won't let him come back.\"","Noticing that Song Luokui hadn't spoken, Chi Yu grabbed her hand. \"Do you think my approach was too cruel?\" After all, he had beaten someone in front of her.","Song Luokui shook her head. \"No, is he really from your family?\" How could Chi Yu, who seemed so upright, have such an ill-mannered cousin?","Song Luokui suddenly realized that she didn't really know much about Chi Yu's family. \"Apart from him, are there any others in your family who are so... ill-bred?\"","For families like theirs, every move they make, if magnified, could cause harm to the entire family. A few days ago, when her brother Song Luosheng and Chi Yu fought—or rather, when Chi Yu was beaten up—the video that was uploaded made her worry about the impact it might have on her parents.","Fortunately, the issue was quickly resolved, and the videos and comments on the internet were removed.","Chi Yu said, \"He's the youngest child of my uncle's family, so he's been spoiled and unrestrained, and he's also made some bad friends.\"","Song Luokui shook her head. \"Friends are secondary; one's own character is most important. If it were my family member, sending him to plant trees in the northwest wouldn't cut it. I think he should go to prison for reform.\"","Chi Yu replied, \"You're right, so I had him sent away. If he doesn't improve, I'll have him go dig mines in Africa.\"","Song Luokui asked, \"Apart from you, who else is in your family? I don't seem to know much about your family situation.\"","Chi Yu explained, \"It's just me in my immediate family, but there are many branches and relatives from my mother's side too. You don't need to worry about the rest of them. You probably know my parents. My grandparents have retired and are currently not in Jing City, but in S City, where my grandmother is from.\"","Song Luokui wondered, \"Then why did you have to deal with your cousin?\"","A flicker of coldness passed through Chi Yu's eyes. \"They couldn't bring themselves to discipline him, but I could.\"","Looking at her calm expression, Chi Yu was afraid she might develop a negative impression of him, so he asked, \"What made you go there today?\"","Song Luokui replied, \"My brother Song Luosheng said I should see your true colors. If I still want to be with you after that, he won't interfere anymore. I don't like that kind of environment.\"","Chi Yu tightened his grip on her hand. \"I won't take you to places like that again. What do you think?\"","Song Luokui shook her head, and Chi Yu's heart tightened with anxiety. His breathing slowed until he heard Song Luokui's words and relaxed.","Song Luokui said, \"It's alright, I suppose. It's about disciplining a child, but... I remembered a long time ago at Unnamed Mountain Lake, I saw you disciplining someone too. That person was also kneeling.\"","Reminded of the incident, Chi Yu quickly explained, \"That person is in prison now. He broke the law, so I had to treat him like that.\"","Song Luokui turned and looked at him intently. \"Would you treat your enemies the same way?\" It was common practice in their circles to eliminate dissenters, even betraying friends and family for the slightest gain.","Chi Yu fell silent for a moment before saying, \"I won't do anything illegal or criminal, I promise.\"","Song Luokui studied him for a while, realizing he was sincere. She reached out to hug him, and Chi Yu, who had been longing to embrace her, pulled her tightly into his arms, his voice tinged with a hint of grievance. \"I was really afraid you wouldn't want me anymore.\"","Song Luokui hugged him back tightly. \"I'm sorry for worrying you. At least my brother Song Luosheng won't stop us now.\"","As Chi Yu breathed in her scent, he felt much calmer. The reason he had been so harsh earlier was mainly because he suddenly realized he hadn't seen his beloved for several days, and he was afraid their relationship was in crisis. Now he had to deal with these messes too, which made him lose his temper.","The car stopped directly in front of the Song family's residence. The two leaned their foreheads together, and Chi Yu gave her a kiss. \"Go on inside. Shall we have dinner together tomorrow?\"","Song Luokui nodded. \"Okay.\"","When Song Luokui returned home, she found that her brother Song Luosheng was already there. \"Brother, how did you get back so quickly?\"","Song Luosheng retorted, \"The cars were parked outside the door for over half an hour. Why do you think I got back so quickly?\"","Song Luokui smiled sheepishly and went to sit beside him, resting her head on his shoulder. \"Brother, thank you. I know you were just worried I'd get hurt.\"","Song Luosheng let out a \"hmph\" without saying anything.","Song Luokui shook his hand playfully. \"No matter what, you'll always be my best brother and the most handsome brother in my eyes.\"","Song Luosheng pouted. \"Before, you said I was the most handsome man in your eyes. Now you've set your sights on a man who isn't as handsome as your brother.\"","Song Luokui burst into laughter. \"No way! You're still the most handsome, really. It's just that in a romantic relationship, you can't only look at appearances.\"","Song Luosheng widened his eyes. \"So you're saying Chi Yu is more outstanding than your brother?\"","Song Luokui reassured him, \"Of course not. It's just that apart from you, Chi Yu is the most outstanding.\"","Song Luosheng seemed satisfied. \"That's more like it.\"","He then continued, \"From now on, you have to be home by 10 pm whenever you go out with him. You're not allowed to stay out overnight. Let me know what you're up to.\"","Song Luokui was delighted. \"Brother, does that mean you approve?\"","Song Luosheng replied, \"No, I just figure you can play around for a year or two at most before kicking him to the curb.\"","Song Luokui thought to herself, well, she would take that as his approval.","\"Alright, I'm going to go rest now.\"","\"Okay, go ahead.\"","After Song Luokui went upstairs, Song Luosheng sat on the sofa for a while before finally punching it in frustration. Damn that Chi Yu!","The next day, since she had promised to have lunch with Chi Yu, Song Luokui went straight to Chi Yu's car after school, and the two headed to the restaurant that Chi Yu had booked.","\"Brother, I'm going out for lunch with Chi Yu today. I'll go back after the meal, so you don't need to wait for me,\" Song Luokui informed Song Luosheng.","Song Luosheng asked through gritted teeth, \"Where are you having lunch?\"","Song Luokui didn't hide it, \"At XXX.\"","Song Luosheng said, \"I see.\"","...","Half an hour later, Song Luokui was at a loss for words when she saw Song Luosheng sitting between her and Chi Yu.","Song Luosheng said, \"What's wrong? Don't you welcome me? Can Song Luokui bear to let this lonely old man eat alone at home?\"","Song Luokui said, \"...Haha. No...\""]},{"number":137,"title":"Chapter 137: Announcement","paragraphs":["Over a meal eaten in a moderate manner, Chi Yu had to endure Song Luosheng's gaze every time he served some food to Song Luokui.","Whenever Chi Yu served some food to Song Luokui, Song Luosheng would also serve her some, and somehow the two men started to compete with each other, until Song Luokui's bowl looked like a small mountain.","At first, Song Luokui still smiled and said, \"Thank you, thank you.\"","Later... Song Luokui's smile gradually disappeared, and she could no longer bear it, putting her chopsticks down on the table with a \"clack\", crossing her arms in front of her and looking at the two men expressionlessly.","Song Luosheng and Chi Yu gave a start and simultaneously took the food from Song Luokui's bowl back and ate it themselves.","Only then did Song Luokui pick up her chopsticks and slowly finish her meal. Finally, with relief, Song Luosheng said directly, \"Sis, let's go. I'll send you back.\"","Song Luokui gave Chi Yu a look before leaving with Song Luosheng, leaving Chi Yu alone in the cold wind, looking a bit pitiful.","Not long after, Chi Yu received a message from Song Luokui: \"Tomorrow, Saturday, I'll come to ChunWang Manor to keep you company all day.\"","Chi Yu smiled upon seeing the message and soon left the restaurant as well.","On the other side, Song Luosheng was driving, glancing at Song Luokui, \"Were you secretly messaging that guy?\"","Song Luokui: \"No, I was talking to my sisters.\" Song Luokui showed him the chat records with her sisters.","\"Alright.\"","The next day, early in the morning, Song Luokui went straight to ChunWang Manor. When Song Luosheng came downstairs, he asked, \"Is Luokui up yet?\"","Aunt Gui: \"The young lady left early this morning!\"","Song Luosheng was surprised, \"That early? Do you know where she went?\"","Aunt Gui: \"The young lady didn't say.\"","Song Luosheng put down the buns in his hand. Could she have gone out with Chi Yu?","Song Luosheng immediately called Song Luokui's bodyguard and learned that his sister had gone to ChunWang Manor.","Oh, to ChunWang Manor, that's fine then.","However, when they arrived at ChunWang Manor, the bodyguard found that their young lady had gone to the house across from them. Song Luokui even told them, \"I ordered food for you, so feel free to hang around here today, and you can go out too. I'll be across the street all day.\"","After the bodyguard saw the person across the street open the door and pull Song Luokui inside, the bodyguard immediately knew what was going on.","The two bodyguards looked at each other: ...","\"Elder Sister Wen, I just told the young master that the young lady came to ChunWang Manor.\"","Elder Sister Wen: \"That's true. This is ChunWang Manor.\" What are they doing here? We can't interfere.","\"Then...\"","\"We don't know anything.\" After all, the head of the household didn't object.","\"Okay.\"","As soon as Chi Yu closed the door, he picked up Song Luokui and sat her down on the cabinet in the foyer. He grabbed her chin and kissed her, \"Mmm...\"","At first, Song Luokui's hands were still supporting herself on the cabinet, but slowly she put her arms around Chi Yu's neck...","After a while, Chi Yu picked her up while kissing her and walked to the living room, sitting on the couch with Song Luokui straddling his lap, their mouths never parting.","It was cold outside in the morning, and Song Luokui was dressed quite warmly, but now her coat was taken off, one shoe was hanging off, and the other had fallen off.","Song Luokui even felt a hand slip under her clothes, caressing her waist and gradually moving upwards...","After a while, the two finally parted, Song Luokui already panting, while Chi Yu held her, ready to go straight to the bedroom.","\"Wait!\" Song Luokui was a bit scared, as Chi Yu seemed too excited today, and she could feel his excitement.","\"I haven't had breakfast yet. I'm hungry.\" At that moment, Song Luokui's stomach growled.","Only then did Chi Yu stop, and Song Luokui fixed her hair a bit, embarrassed, \"I got up early and came straight here, afraid of my brother catching me.\"","Only then did Chi Yu let her sit properly on the couch, helping her take off her shoes and change into slippers, giving her a kiss, \"I'll have someone bring food over.\"","\"Mm-hmm.\"","While Chi Yu was on the phone ordering food, his eyes were still fixed on Song Luokui, and the two were affectionate with each other.","After finishing the call and putting down his phone, he hugged her and started kissing her again.","Song Luokui was kissed breathless, her face flushed and eyes sensual, until the doorbell rang and Chi Yu had to let her go to open the door and get the food.","Song Luokui had been lying on the couch, but as soon as she smelled the food, she immediately rolled over, \"The food's here?\"","\"Yeah.\"","The two sat at the dining table and started eating breakfast, feeding each other bite by bite. After they had eaten their fill, they sat on the couch and watched TV, as they weren't going out that day.","But as they were watching, the two became affectionate again... After some time, Song Luokui felt sleepy and slowly fell asleep.","Chi Yu carried her straight to the bedroom, put her on the bed, and covered her with a blanket. He sat beside her, watching her, and then took out his phone and took a photo of their intertwined hands, uploading it to his social media with just a heart emoji.","Feeling that wasn't enough, he found a normal photo of the two of them from the album, a photo taken during the summer vacation when they were having a meal together in a private room with Ji Xiao, Li Yanbei, and others. It was taken by Ji Xiao.","He absolutely couldn't share any photos from Banras, afraid that if Song Luosheng found out, something might happen again.","In the photo, Song Luokui was holding a large shrimp and smiling at the camera, while Chi Yu was smiling at her from the side.","Chi Yu uploaded the photo, captioning it: My girlfriend [Heart]","He posted two updates on his social media in quick succession, and within ten minutes, dozens of people had liked them.","\"Congratulations, boss!\"","\"Congrats, bro!\"","\"Sister-in-law looks great!\"","\"Bro, when are you going to bring your sister-in-law out for a meal together?\"","\"Congratulations, boss!\"","\"The boss finally found a girlfriend, wah wah wah.\"","\"As expected of the boss, you and your sister-in-law are so well-matched!\"","...","Chi Yu ignored all the comments, tossed his phone aside, and hugged Song Luokui as they slept together.","In just two hours, the photo of the two of them that he had posted had spread throughout their entire circle.","Of course, Zhang Xiyue and the others were at the forefront of gossip, and they had all seen the photo. In their group chat, they were all tagging Song Luokui.","\"Sister, when are you going to treat us to a meal?\"","\"Luokui, did your brother approve?\"","\"That Chi Yu person from the Chi family has gone public, when will you sisters go public?\"","\"Come on, you two are truly a perfect match. The way Chi Yu looks at you is so full of love.\"","\"So full of love, and so incredibly gentle!\"","\"It's hard to imagine that the Chi Yu from the Chi family would actually be like this, even posting a public announcement on social media!\"","Song Luokui was unaware of the discussions happening in the group chat, as she was still asleep.","When she woke up, she was a bit dazed, but the adorable way Chi Yu awoke next to her made her smile. She immediately pulled him into an embrace and showered him with kisses, \"How can you be so adorable?\"","Song Luokui: ???","The two ended up back in bed, almost losing control... Chi Yu was sweating from the strain of restraining himself, and in the end could only bite Song Luokui's cheek before getting out of bed and heading to the bathroom."]},{"number":138,"title":"Chapter 138: Announcement 02","paragraphs":["Song Luokui hid under the covers to put her clothes on. She picked up her phone and immediately saw the photo of her and Chi Yu that Lou Sasa and the others had shared in their group chat.","Song Luokui: \"??? How did you guys get this photo?\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"Whoa~ The person in question has appeared, huh? Tell us, are you two together now?\"","Song Luokui heard the sound of water from the bathroom and her face turned a little red. \"Yes. How did you guys find out?\"","Lou Sasa: \"Sister, check your man's Friends Circle, he posted it, announcing it publicly. You didn't know, but everyone in our circle has been going crazy about it. Although there were rumors before, some people didn't fully believe it because they hadn't seen any evidence.\"","Weng Jiao: \"Now that there's proof, of course everyone's freaking out! And it's clear to see that your man is truly happy about it.\"","Tu Shanyue: \"We were all wondering why you didn't make it public on your own Friends Circle.\"","Song Luokui: \"I was asleep just now.\"","Song Luokui recalled a message.","Zhang Xiyue: \"!! Dear, even though you recalled it, I saw it! You were asleep! Who were you sleeping with?\"","Tu Shanyue: \"The way you said that, of course it's with her man.\"","Weng Jiao: \"Wow~ Was it that kind of sleep?\"","Song Luokui: \"We were just sleeping, nothing else happened.\"","Lou Sasa: \"Nothing else? I don't believe it. Did you kiss? Did you touch each other? Did you take your clothes off? Hehe.\"","Song Luokui covered her face. To be honest, they did do all of those things, but she couldn't let them know.","Song Luokui: \"No, we were just sleeping, we woke up too early this morning.\"","Lou Sasa: \"Is your man not capable?\"","Song Luokui: ...Thinking about his size, he should be very capable. Of course, she hadn't experienced it herself, so she didn't know for sure. But he should be capable, right?","Song Luokui didn't want to talk to them anymore, so she went offline! So they wouldn't keep saying increasingly inappropriate things.","Song Luokui immediately checked her Friends Circle and saw that Chi Yu had posted two posts related to her. The first was a photo of him holding her hand, and the other was a previous photo of the two of them together.","Song Luokui couldn't help but like it. She thought about it and decided to post a photo as well.","Song Luokui kept scrolling through the photos of the two of them on her phone, unable to decide which one to choose.","When Chi Yu came out, she still hadn't chosen one. He walked over and saw her scrolling through their photos. \"What's wrong? Are you going to post a photo? Are you going to announce our relationship to everyone?\"","Chi Yu hugged her, his face beaming with joy.","Song Luokui: \"Yeah, I just don't know which one to choose. Since you made it public already, I can't let you be at a disadvantage, can I?\"","Chi Yu: \"If you don't know which one to choose, why don't we just take a new one right now?\"","Song Luokui thought it was a good idea. But when she opened the front camera, the viewfinder showed their heads pressed together. Chi Yu looked fine, his hair was wet from having just showered. But Song Luokui's face was flushed, and there were marks on her face and neck.","It looked just like after... that.","Song Luokui immediately put her phone down, grimacing a little. \"No, absolutely not. I'll just choose an older photo.\"","Chi Yu: \"What's wrong?\"","Song Luokui looked at him. \"Don't you think it looks like after... you know?\"","Chi Yu understood immediately. If people saw Song Luokui looking like that... he didn't want anyone else to see her like that. \"How about we take one but don't post it anywhere?\"","Song Luokui looked at him curiously. \"You really want to take one? You're not going to post it anywhere, right? You better think carefully. If my brother finds out, he'll come right over and beat you up. He doesn't know I came here today. He thinks I went to ChunWang Manor.\"","Chi Yu: \"I won't post it, I'll keep it for myself.\"","Song Luokui's face turned even redder. She pouted. \"Then... you do it, you take it.\" She grabbed a pillow to hug and pulled the covers up, only exposing her head.","Chi Yu didn't mind. He hugged her and took a photo. Funnily enough, the background was the large photo that Li Yanbei had given them...","Afterwards, the two continued choosing photos. In the end, Song Luokui chose a photo of them together on the street, nothing out of the ordinary. The background was a bustling street, taken after they went to see a movie together.","After choosing the photo, it was time to write the caption. Song Luokui simply copied Chi Yu's: My boyfriend ❤️","Send - Sent.","She didn't need to look, her sisters would definitely tease her in the group chat soon enough. Song Luokui put her phone on silent and didn't check it anymore. She looked at Chi Yu: \"I'm hungry.\"","They hadn't eaten lunch yet, and it was already past noon.","Chi Yu: \"The chef is cooking right now.\" He had called someone to come cook earlier.","\"Okay~\"","On the other side, Song Luosheng didn't see the photo of Chi Yu and Song Luokui together until the afternoon. He definitely didn't see it on Chi Yu's Friends Circle, but rather in some group where someone had shared it. Afterwards, he saw the post that his own sister had made on her Friends Circle...","Damn!","Song Luosheng opened his photo album and immediately chose a photo of him and Song Luokui, with Song Luokui hugging his arm and both of them smiling at the camera. It was taken at home during the New Year.","He suddenly realized that it had been a long time since he had taken a photo with Luokui. No, tonight he would have to take several more.","Song Luokui opened her Friends Circle to upload a photo and wrote the caption: My sister ❤️","Hmph! As if they didn't have any photos together!","That night, someone in their circle photoshopped an image combining the three Friends Circle posts. On the left was Chi Yu's: My girlfriend ❤️, in the middle was Song Luosheng's, and on the right was Song Luokui's.","\"Damn, who photoshopped this image? What a hero.\"","\"Hahaha, I find it pretty funny, to be honest.\"","\"The protective big brother isn't happy, so he's separating the two of them. Hahaha.\"","\"Whoever made this, hurry and delete it. What if the main characters see it? I dare you to leave it up.\"","\"Don't delete it, let me save it first. Hahaha.\"","\"You can clearly guess that Song Luosheng is full of resentment.\"","\"His little sister got hooked by an outsider. If it were me, I'd be full of resentment too. But then I remember it's that guy from the Chi family, and I feel like there's nothing to worry about. Probably only Song Luosheng would react like this.\"","In the end, the photo was still taken down, but many people had already saved it. Song Luokui also saw it, and although she could only remain speechless, she wasn't angry that someone had played a prank.","In the evening, Chi Yu drove her home, openly parking his car right in front of the Song family's building. Song Luosheng had already returned, and from the second-floor balcony, he saw Chi Yu escorting his little sister back and even unbuckling her seatbelt to lean in and kiss her!!!","Damn!","Song Luosheng immediately went downstairs, but Chi Yu had only given her a quick kiss before letting Song Luokui out of the car, after all, they had kissed a lot already that day.","By the time Song Luosheng came out, Song Luokui had already gotten out of the car. Seeing her brother, she suddenly felt a bit self-conscious, but then remembering that her relationship with Chi Yu was now public and had the approval of their parents, as well as her brother's half-approval, she didn't feel self-conscious anymore. \"Brother, why did you come out?\""]},{"number":139,"title":"Chapter 139: Invite Roommates to Dinner","paragraphs":["Song Luosheng and Chi Yu exchanged a glance in the car, \"If you don't get out now, I'm afraid he'll eat you up.\"","Song Luokui: \"...Alright, brother, let's go inside.\"","Song Luosheng pulled Song Luokui into the house quickly, and Chi Yu didn't drive back home until he could no longer see Song Luokui's figure.","When he got back home, Chi Yong was still surprised, \"You seem to be coming back here quite often recently?\"","Chi Yu: \"Yeah. It's convenient.\"","Chi Yong: \"It's convenient for you to play with that doll from the Song family, isn't it? If you're dating, treat her well, or else I'll have to bow my head in front of Song Moqian.\"","Chi Yu: \"I know, I will.\"","Chi Yong: \"So... when will you bring her back for me and your mother to meet? Your mother has been busy recently too, we need to find a good time.\"","Chi Yu: \"We'll see.\" He felt that his treasure wasn't ready to meet the parents so soon, and he hadn't formally met Song's parents either. The last time was when he went in to apologize; there hadn't been a formal meeting yet.","Chi Yong: \"Anyway, you're not a kid anymore, you should know your limits in whatever you do. If there's anything you can't resolve, just ask. Girls are a bit more delicate, you need to coax them.\"","Chi Yu: \"I know.\"","...","Since going public with Chi Yu, everything became much more convenient. Chi Yu would even pick her up from school in the mornings, but sometimes when Song Luosheng saw this, he would intercept and send Song Luokui to school instead, with Chi Yu following behind in his car, which counted as sending her too.","To avoid this, Song Luokui would tell Chi Yu in advance what time she was leaving, specifically to avoid her brother.","\"Actually, you don't have to send me every day. Having the driver send me is enough; you need to go to work too.\"","Chi Yu: \"It's fine, I want to see you more.\" If he went to work, he wouldn't see her all day and would miss her.","Song Luokui suddenly remembered about the dinner invitation, \"So when do you have time to treat my roommates and sisters to a meal?\"","Chi Yu: \"Together or separate?\"","Song Luokui: \"Separate would be better.\"","Chi Yu: \"Okay, let me arrange it and let you know when it's set.\"","\"Okay.\"","...","Back at the company, Chi Yu asked his secretary about his upcoming schedule. He was originally supposed to go on a business trip for half a month soon.","Chi Yu: \"Postpone it by a week and clear out two evenings for me.\"","\"Yes.\"","After clearing out the time, Chi Yu asked Song Luokui for her opinion and if those times worked for her.","Song Luokui: \"Let me check.\"","In the dorm room when everyone was there, Song Luokui said, \"Chi Yu wants to treat you all to a meal. Are you free this week? If not, we can postpone it.\"","\"Who?\" The three of them looked over with shining eyes.","Wang Sisi: \"You mean Senior Chi Yu?\"","Song Luokui felt a bit shy, \"Yeah, just a casual meal.\"","The three immediately nodded, \"We're free, we're free. Any day this week is fine, I don't have evening classes anyway.\"","\"Me neither.\"","\"Me neither.\"","\"Wait, can we bring plus-ones?\" Wang Sisi raised her hand, wanting to bring her boyfriend Lin Cheng along. Her boyfriend would surely be very willing too.","Song Luokui: \"Sure, that's fine.\"","\"Great. Just let us know when and where you decide, and we'll be there.\"","Song Luokui: \"Okay, I'll tell him.\"","Wang Sisi: \"Finally you two went public, you have no idea how long I've been holding back.\"","Zhang Jingfeng: \"What, did you know about them way earlier?\"","Wang Sisi: \"Well, not that early, but I felt Senior Chi Yu wasn't being very normal around Luokui.\"","At this moment, Song Luokui was calling Chi Yu. \"Yeah, you can decide the place. Do they eat spicy food?\" Song Luokui looked at the others.","The three of them nodded immediately.","Song Luokui: \"They all eat it, they're not too picky, as long as it's delicious.\"","Wang Sisi wrote a word in her notebook: Expensive!","It's not that they wanted to take advantage or anything. They knew this was merely a drop in the bucket for Chi Yu. They just wanted to experience the high life.","Although Lin Cheng would take Wang Sisi to some upscale places for meals, they had never been to super high-end places. They wanted to know where the top elite dined.","If Song Luokui knew, she would say that the places they normally dined weren't actually that different from the general public's. Of course, they would also go to some more private, high-end places to eat.","Song Luokui gave an OK sign and told Chi Yu: \"Somewhere with more privacy would be better...\"","In just a moment, Chi Yu had his secretary arrange a spot for the very next day.","As for the gathering with Song Luokui's sisters, that would likely be on the weekend.","When Song Luokui mentioned the potential locations in the sisters' group chat, everyone had different opinions on where to go and what to eat.","Finally, Chen Nan chimed in: \"Why not Unnamed Mountain Lake? Otherwise, only Luokui will have a man attending to us, and we'll have no one. I want to request a top server to accompany me.\"","The others immediately agreed, since Unnamed Mountain Lake had private dining rooms, and the food was quite good, prepared by renowned chefs.","When Song Luokui relayed this to Chi Yu, there was a long silence on the other end as Chi Yu rubbed his brow. \"Do they really want to request that?\"","Song Luokui: \"I won't request it.\"","Of course Chi Yu knew that if she dared to request it, he might have to take care of her that very night.","Sighing, Chi Yu still agreed, \"Okay, I'll have someone reserve a top server.\"","It was only then that Song Luokui realized Chi Yu had shares in Unnamed Mountain Lake.","\"Okay.\"","They booked it directly for Saturday evening at 7 PM. Everyone would just head over there then.","The next afternoon after school, Song Luokui met up with Wang Sisi and the others. Zhang Jingfeng and Su Ziyuan followed Song Luokui and had her driver take them, while Wang Sisi was driven by her boyfriend. Chi Yu came from the company.","When Wang Sisi and the others got out of the car, they saw a courtyard-style building with \"Imperial Private Cuisine\" written above the entrance. There was also a sign saying: \"No entry without reservation.\"","Song Luokui gave the room number, and the staff immediately led the group inside.","Lin Cheng whispered to Wang Sisi, \"I don't even have the means to make a reservation here.\"","Wang Sisi: \"Good opportunity to experience something new today.\"","The staff led the two of them to a room and then left. Chi Yu was already inside.","Seeing them arrive, Chi Yu stood up immediately. He first helped Song Luokui remove her coat and hang it up, then said to the others, \"Please, have a seat.\"","The others were still a bit reserved, only sitting down after Chi Yu and Song Luokui had taken their seats.","Chi Yu handed the menu to Song Luokui, \"I've ordered some dishes in advance, take a look and see if you'd like anything else.\"","Song Luokui glanced at it and passed it on to Wang Sisi and the others. After a while, they added two more dishes.","Chi Yu didn't know what he had ordered, but someone soon came to attend to them.","In less than ten minutes, dishes started arriving one after another.","Song Luokui didn't wait for the others and started eating right away, \"Let's eat, we're all hungry.\"","Worried that the atmosphere might be too awkward, Chi Yu spoke up and asked a question, he even remembered Wang Sisi, \"If you want to sponsor something next time, you can just let Chen Nan know.\"","Wang Sisi was delighted, \"Thank you, senior.\"","He also knew that Lin Cheng was starting a business, \"If you need investment, give Chen Nan your business plan.\"","Lin Cheng was also very excited, \"Thank you, senior.\""]},{"number":140,"title":"Chapter 140: Invite Sisters to Dinner","paragraphs":["After a delightful meal together, Lin Cheng saw off Wang Sisi and the others back to school, while Song Luokui went for a walk with Chi Yu.","Chi Yu: \"My brothers want to meet you too. Would you like me to introduce you to them next time?\"","Song Luokui: \"Are you referring to Ji Senior and others, or someone else?\"","Chi Yu: \"Chen Nan and his group.\" He was referring mainly to his subordinates.","Song Luokui: \"Sure.\"","Chi Yu pulled her close. \"Alright, I'll arrange it once I'm back from my business trip. I may need to travel for about half a month starting next week. I'll bring you a gift and video call you every day.\"","Song Luokui waved her hand dismissively. \"No need. Focus on your work. Besides, it's not like I have nothing to do. Just make more money to buy me gifts.\"","Chi Yu burst into laughter. \"Sure, I'll definitely get you gifts.\"","As the night grew colder, Song Luokui sneezed, and Chi Yu immediately took off his jacket and draped it over her shoulders. \"Let's head back.\"","\"Mmm.\"","Soon it was Saturday, and when Chi Yu brought Song Luokui to the private room, he didn't expect Lou Sasa and the others to have arrived early. \"Why are you here so early?\" They were half an hour ahead of schedule.","Lou Sasa: \"Since Chi the Prince is treating us, we thought we'd come a bit earlier.\" She looked at Chi Yu. \"I'm Lou Sasa. Although you're quite impressive, as Kuikui's sister, I still need to tell you to treat her well.\"","The girls had discussed this earlier, appointing Lou Sasa to convey the message to Chi Yu. After all, sisters should look out for each other.","Chi Yu nodded at her. \"I'm Chi Yu. I will.\"","Song Luokui was quite touched and joked, \"If he doesn't treat me well, will you all help beat him up?\"","Lou Sasa took a step back. \"Haha, I don't think I'd dare.\"","Song Luokui laughed. \"No need for you to intervene. My brother would take care of it.\"","Lou Sasa: \"That's right. We'll leave it to your brother.\"","Without further ado, everyone took their seats. The dishes had already been ordered, but the male models hadn't arrived yet.","Sitting next to Song Luokui, Weng Jiao tugged at her clothes and mouthed the words: \"Male models.\"","Song Luokui immediately understood and quietly told Chi Yu, \"Didn't you say we'd have male models?\"","Chi Yu suddenly remembered. \"Oh right, I almost forgot. The top model, right? I'll have him come over.\"","The private room was spacious, and several male models walked in from outside, bowing to everyone. \"Good evening, esteemed guests.\"","Song Luokui immediately noticed the Young Master Yu Tang whom Zhang Xiyue had requested for three million yuan. Before she could take a closer look, Chi Yu turned her head back towards him. \"Don't look at them, look at me.\"","Song Luokui: ...","Her small hand slid under his shirt and pinched his toned abdomen. \"Bossy!\"","Chi Yu felt her hand tickle his stomach. He leaned in and whispered something in Song Luokui's ear, causing her face to turn red instantly. She shot him a glare but didn't dare say anything else.","The others had already started selecting their companions.","Zhang Xiyue: \"The top model, Young Master Yu Tang. I requested him before. He's decent. I want him.\"","Song Luokui glanced over, surprised that this little vixen was still so brazenly eyeing male models despite having a boyfriend.","But Lou Sasa wasn't having it. \"No way. I came specifically for the top model this time. You had your turn last time. This time, it's my turn.\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"Fine, then let that second one, Yan Xing, attend to me.\"","\"As you wish, beautiful lady.\"","Song Luokui whispered in Chi Yu's ear, \"Do you think her boyfriend might find out?\"","Chi Yu: \"The confidentiality at Unnamed Mountain Lake is still quite good. Unless someone has a specific reason to investigate, it's unlikely he'll find out.\"","Each girl had a handsome man attending to her. The sisters were delighted, and occasionally, the male models would get up and dance to entertain everyone, creating a joyful atmosphere.","As they were eating, Weng Jiao suddenly asked, \"As Kuikui's family, we have a question for Mr. Chi.\"","Chi Yu: \"Go ahead.\"","Weng Jiao: \"We don't know if Mr. Chi has had any other women or people he's liked in the past, and how Mr. Chi came to like our Kuikui.\"","Chi Yu didn't hesitate in his response. \"No other women. Besides her, I've never liked anyone else. She's exceptional, so it's only natural for me to like her. I'm just afraid I was too late, so I hurried to secure her.\" He felt that if he didn't act quickly, he might lose his treasure to someone else's advances. Even if she wasn't lured away, he was afraid she might follow Lou Sasa and the others in requesting male models, which had happened before.","Weng Jiao and the others were quite satisfied with his answer.","Zhang Xiyue: \"What about Mr. Chi's family? How do they feel about this?\"","Chi Yu: \"My parents fully support my decision.\" His father was delighted that he had managed to pursue Song Luokui.","Lou Sasa: \"Mr. Chi and Kuikui's brother didn't get along well before. How will you treat her brother going forward?\"","This question caught even Song Luokui's attention as she looked at him. Chi Yu remained composed and turned to Song Luokui. \"However she wants me to treat him, that's how I'll do it.\"","\"Ooh~\" The others immediately teased and cheered.","Song Luokui smiled. \"Alright, alright. Aren't you going to watch the male models' performance?\"","\"Yes, let's watch.\"","After finishing their meal around 9 PM, everyone quickly left. Chi Yu took Song Luokui back and said, \"I'll be leaving for Country F tomorrow evening. I'll bring you a gift when I return.\"","\"Okay.\"","Chi Yu caressed her face, unable to resist the urge to kiss her a few more times. However, at that moment, Song Luosheng appeared expressionless at the door and knocked on the car window.","Chi Yu and Song Luokui froze...","Chi Yu: How to deal with a formidable brother-in-law who always seemed to mysteriously appear in front of them?","Song Luokui covered her face and whispered, \"I'll come see you in the morning.\"","\"Okay~\"","The next day, Song Luokui went to ChunWang Manor early to find Chi Yu and help him pack his luggage. She even saw him off at the airport before returning home.","With Chi Yu away, Song Luosheng wouldn't be as strict with her. Song Luokui went to the company whenever she had time and planned to stay at ChunWang Manor for a few days.","As she arrived at the company building, she noticed some people holding banners on the street, likely fans showing their support for a celebrity, though she wasn't particularly interested in following stars.","Song Luokui was wondering if some big celebrity had arrived upstairs or something when she came to the company and found that the people cheering below were actually from her own company.","\"An artist we signed previously named Zhou QingRong has starred in a drama as the second female lead, and she unexpectedly became an overnight sensation. Those people down there are cheering for her.\"","\"There's going to be a red carpet event a few days from now. As a newly popular artist, she'll definitely attend. Boss, would you like to go and take a look as well?\"","Song Luokui: \"Zhou QingRong? Is she at the company? Should I go see her?\"","Yu Hui: \"Of course we wouldn't dare to let you call her over directly. Let me summon her here.\"","Song Luokui: \"Wait a minute, send someone down to tell those fans not to block the way. I can see that some people have already expressed their displeasure about it. After all, this building also houses other companies.\""]},{"number":141,"title":"Chapter 141: Watching Celebrities Walk the Red Carpet","paragraphs":["It seems it's time to move to a better place.","\"Okay, I'll send someone over right away, and call Zhou QingRong too.\"","\"Mmm.\"","After a while, there was a knock on the door, and Song Luokui directly said: \"Come in.\"","Looking up, a beautiful woman walked in, accompanied by her manager Gao Fu and Yu Hui.","\"Boss, this is Zhou QingRong.\"","\"Hello Boss. I'm Zhou QingRong.\"","\"Hello Boss, I'm her manager Gao Fu.\"","Gao Fu had seen Song Luokui two or three times before, but Song Luokui probably didn't recognize her. As for Zhou QingRong, it was the first time she met her boss. She didn't expect her boss to be such a young and beautiful woman.","Previously, she'd heard that the company was all women, and even saw that employees could bring their children when she came for the interview. At the time, she thought there wouldn't be any unspoken rules or anything like that.","As it turns out, there were no unspoken rules, but the training was very strict. Of course, the company was also willing to invest heavily in nurturing them, and she was given the opportunity to audition.","She had also heard before that the company's boss was a lady, so all the talents were women. She thought it would be a middle-aged woman or something, but never expected her to be such a beautiful woman.","Her recent rise to popularity had gone a bit to her head. People online were calling her a celestial beauty, the most beautiful in the entertainment industry, and the like. Of course, there were also haters saying that although she was beautiful, her temperament didn't seem up to par. She was pleased to see the praise, but thought the negativity was just jealousy.","But now, taking one look, she immediately came back down to earth. Mainly because she felt her boss was even more beautiful than her - that skin, that exquisiteness, that temperament... she felt she still had a lot to learn. It was fortunate her boss didn't go into the entertainment industry as an actress.","Song Luokui smiled at them, \"Hello. I've heard you've been doing great work lately. Keep it up, and let the company know if you need anything.\"","\"Thank you Boss, I will work hard.\"","Song Luokui still had a very kind demeanor, \"Mmhmm, I also saw that you have fans supporting you down there, which means you must be truly outstanding. Don't let your fans down.\"","\"I won't.\"","Song Luokui: \"Mmhmm, go take care of whatever you need to do. I believe in you.\"","\"Okay, I will not let Boss down.\"","After encouraging her employee, Song Luokui told Yu Hui about relocating the company, \"The company has grown bigger now, so I'm looking for a better place. When it's time to move, I'll leave it to you.\"","\"Sure, no problem.\"","\"Okay, you can go take care of your work now.\"","\"Got it.\"","For the company's relocation, Song Luokui planned to ask her brother for help, as her brother had investments in real estate. Although she had a boyfriend now who could possibly help, Song Luokui still felt she should ask her brother first.","She wanted her brother to know that despite having a boyfriend, she would still come to him first when something came up, letting him know his importance and that she needed him.","Song Luosheng felt a bit resentful at Song Luokui's visit, saying: \"Why did you suddenly come over? Ever since you got a boyfriend, it seems like you don't like coming to see your brother anymore. Have you forgotten about your brother now that you have him?\"","Song Luokui went behind him and massaged his shoulders, \"Of course not, I'm here now, aren't I? There's something I want to ask for your help with.\"","Song Luosheng: \"What about Chi Yu? Why didn't you ask him?\" He eventually relented for her sake.","Song Luokui: \"He's on a business trip. But even if he wasn't, I'd still come to you first, because I think you're more capable, Brother.\"","Song Luosheng couldn't help but smile slightly, \"Tell me, what is it?\"","Song Luokui leaned over in front of him, \"There are quite a few people at the company lately, it's getting a bit cramped. I'm thinking of moving to a bigger place.\"","Song Luosheng: \"That's easy, just move into my company's building. I'll clear out two floors for you.\"","Song Luokui: \"Thanks Brother, but it's an entertainment company. When I went there before, I even saw fans supporting outside the building. I'm worried it might disturb the people at your company.\"","Song Luosheng: \"What's the problem with that? It won't be a disturbance.\"","Song Luokui: \"Still, even if you don't think it's a disturbance, there will still be people at the company who feel disturbed. Plus, I haven't even lived in the house at ChunWang Manor for long, I don't really want to move. It would be best to find a place nearby.\"","Song Luosheng thought for a moment, \"Okay, I'll have someone look into it and let you know when I find something.\"","\"Great, thank you Brother. I'll treat you to a meal when I have time.\" Song Luokui happily patted his shoulder.","Song Luosheng: \"Just don't make your brother angry again in the future.\"","Song Luokui felt a bit guilty, \"I know.\"","Not long after, Song Luosheng left for a meeting, and Song Luokui also left. On her way out, she unexpectedly ran into Mu Yinger and her manager.","\"Miss Song.\" The two greeted her respectfully.","Song Luokui smiled back at them, \"Thank you Miss Mu for speaking up for my brother before.\"","Mu Yinger was delighted that Miss Song remembered the incident, \"No need to thank me, I believe in Mr. Song's character.\"","\"Still, I must thank you. You two go ahead with your business, I'll be leaving now.\"","\"Okay, goodbye Miss Song.\" Mu Yinger was quite proud. She was here to discuss a renewal, having made the right gamble before. Not only that, but she was going to become the spokesperson for Hua Country! A title upgrade and more money. From now on, she would be the first choice for collaborations, as long as she didn't have any major negative publicity. So many people must be envious of her.","Meanwhile, Song Luokui received an invitation to the red carpet event that Yu Hui had mentioned before. Since she didn't have much going on lately, she thought she might as well go take a look. Of course, she had no intention of stealing anyone's spotlight and didn't plan to walk the red carpet herself, only to sit and watch from below.","She also invited her sisters Weng Jiao and Lou Sasa to join her. As for Zhang Xiyue, she was currently busy trying to put out the fire after her boyfriend found out about her dating a male model.","Yu Hui would also accompany her. Previously, Yu Hui was usually the one appearing in public, but this time, it would just be the three of them as eye candy, mainly there to have fun.","Recently the weather has been cold. Song Luokui was wearing a dress underneath a thick coat as she sat properly, watching the red carpet arrivals below. Next to her sat Lou Sasa and Weng Jiao, the three of them criticizing and commenting on the celebrities walking the red carpet.","\"I see that one is shivering from the cold yet still managing to keep smiling. No wonder she's become popular.\"","\"Who's to say otherwise? Look at that guy, it seems like he's not wearing anything underneath his suit jacket, exposing that much skin just to sell his sex appeal and have a spot on the trending list tonight.\"","\"Finally, we see someone decently dressed, wearing quite a lot. This one has a chance to trend, just for being different from the rest.\"","\"As for that previous one with the bird's nest hairstyle, I think she could trend too. Who did that hilarious hairdo?\"","\"You know, watching celebrities walk the red carpet is actually quite entertaining.\"","Zhou QingRong had also arrived, but since she's recently exploded in popularity, her spot was a bit further back and not as prominent. Today she was wearing a green floor-length gown, arm-in-arm with her on-screen love interest from her previous drama.","They could still hear fans calling out her name from behind.","\"So that's the big star from your company, huh?\""]},{"number":142,"title":"Chapter 142: Event Banquet","paragraphs":["\"Yes.\"","Weng Jiao: \"I've been watching that TV series recently, and I must say the acting is quite good.\"","Lou Sasa: \"What TV show is that? I should check it out when I get back.\"","Weng Jiao: \"It's called 'Lovers in Longing.' The male lead and his counterpart are both quite handsome. They just walked the red carpet, and you even praised one of them.\"","Lou Sasa: \"Really? Then I'll definitely have to watch it when I get back.\"","After the red carpet event, they entered the venue to enjoy some food and drinks, and watch the program. Their seats were relatively close to the stage, and Yu Hui joined them as well, though she soon left to socialize with some of the big names present.","Song Luokui and Weng Jiao kept their eyes and ears open, not wanting to miss any juicy gossip, as such events were prime breeding grounds for rumors.","They were seated at the same table as a few celebrities, though Song Luokui and her friends didn't really recognize them. The celebrities seemed a bit surprised to see the three girls, as they didn't know them either, but everyone maintained a polite demeanor.","Soon, the manager of one of the celebrities, Li Chen from Zhaoyang Entertainment, approached their table, hoping to introduce his client to some influential figures. Upon noticing Song Luokui and her friends, his eyes lit up. \"Excuse me, but I don't know which agency you lovely ladies are from. Or perhaps you're not signed with anyone yet? I'm Li Chen, a manager at Zhaoyang Entertainment. Let's be friends.\" Li Chen handed out his business cards to the three of them.","Song Luokui and her friends just smiled and accepted the cards without saying anything, much to the displeasure of the celebrity Li Chen was managing.","Satisfied with having handed out his cards, Li Chen left with his client. Shortly after, Zhou QingRong's manager, Gao Fu, heard that their boss was present and immediately brought Zhou QingRong over to Song Luokui's table. \"Boss, Zhou QingRong and I would like to toast you.\"","Song Luokui raised her glass. \"I'm not much of a drinker, so let's toast with tea instead of alcohol.\"","The other celebrities at the table were shocked to hear this. Their boss? The young woman was the boss of the recently famous Zhou QingRong? Weren't they told that the boss was a powerful woman over forty?","Weng Jiao: \"Luokui, can I take a photo with your artist?\"","Song Luokui looked at Zhou QingRong, who immediately smiled and said, \"Of course, it would be my honor.\" After all, this was the boss's sister, clearly from a wealthy family.","Lou Sasa: \"I want one too.\"","In the end, the three of them took a group photo with Zhou QingRong, and Weng Jiao and Lou Sasa each took an individual photo with her as well.","After that, Gao Fu left with Zhou QingRong. Lou Sasa looked around and said, \"I see some very attractive celebrities over there, so I'm going to go take photos with them.\"","With that, Lou Sasa left.","Song Luokui watched as Lou Sasa approached a male celebrity a few tables away and greeted him.","Lou Sasa: \"Hello there! May I take a photo with you?\"","The male celebrity was taken aback upon seeing Lou Sasa, though he maintained his politeness, as anyone dressed like her and able to attend such an event must be someone of importance. \"Of course.\"","The male celebrity quickly struck a handsome pose, and Lou Sasa happily took two photos with him before excitedly moving on to the next table.","The male celebrity was surprised to see her approach another handsome male celebrity for photos and grew even more surprised as she went from one attractive male celebrity to the next.","Weng Jiao also noticed this and said with a laugh, \"Sasa is collecting stamps, isn't she?\"","Song Luokui smiled. \"Let her have her fun.\"","However, it wasn't long before Song Luokui noticed a commotion happening where Lou Sasa was. She exchanged a glance with Weng Jiao, and they immediately headed over, worried that their sister might be getting bullied.","As they approached, they heard a woman say to Lou Sasa, \"Which agency are you from? You're not some crazy fan who snuck in here, are you? Don't you know that our Fu Si doesn't take photos with people?\"","Lou Sasa rolled her eyes. \"If he doesn't want to take photos, then fine. But why are you making such a big deal about it? Are you upset because you like him, but he doesn't pay any attention to you?\"","By this point, some people had come over to handle the situation. The woman arguing with Lou Sasa was Qiu SuEr, a second-tier celebrity and the daughter of a wealthy family. Rumor had it that she had entered the entertainment industry just to pursue her idol crushes. Since the person didn't recognize Lou Sasa, they assumed she couldn't be someone important and tried to ask her to leave, not wanting to offend Qiu SuEr.","Lou Sasa burst out laughing at the absurdity of the situation. \"Ask me to leave? And who do you think you are to make me leave?\"","Qiu SuEr: \"My father sponsored this event, so I have the right to ask you to leave.\" That's the only reason she was seated near Fu Si.","Fu Si stepped in to defuse the situation. \"I apologize for causing a commotion between the two ladies. Please, let's all be civil and let this young lady take a photo with me if she wishes.\"","Qiu SuEr: \"I won't allow it! Why should she be allowed to take a photo with you?\"","Lou Sasa crossed her arms, her expression cold. \"I don't even want a photo anymore. Either she apologizes to me, or I'll let her know why I'm so famous!\"","\"What's going on here? What happened?\" Weng Jiao immediately pushed her way into the crowd, with Song Luokui following closely behind.","Lou Sasa explained, \"I politely asked if I could take a photo with this gentleman, and if not, that's fine, I wasn't going to insist. But then this woman started calling me names, saying I'm a crazy fan who dreams of being with someone out of my league. I'm Lou Sasa, and this is the first time someone has dared to insult me like that.\"","Qiu SuEr noticed the backup arriving for the other side and eyed Weng Jiao before turning to Song Luokui. Upon seeing Song Luokui's face, she frowned. Who was this person? She had never seen her in the entertainment industry before. A newcomer?","If Song Luokui was a newcomer, then this could be troublesome.","Qiu SuEr turned to the person who had come to handle the situation. \"Well? Aren't you going to kick them out?\"","Weng Jiao gave Qiu SuEr a once-over. \"Wait, I know you.\"","Qiu SuEr arrogantly replied, \"Yes, you know me, so you'd better leave. I'm not someone you can afford to offend.\"","Weng Jiao: \"I also know your father. He used to follow my father around like a little sycophant.\"","Lou Sasa burst out laughing. \"Hahahaha!\"","Qiu SuEr's face suddenly flushed red. \"Who are you? You dare say anything with your flapping lips. Hurry and get the security guards to throw them out! What are you standing around for?\"","The people who had originally come over to handle the situation were a bit perplexed and found it difficult to deal with, mainly because they saw that the person on the other side didn't seem to be an ordinary person either. Besides, not everyone in the venue was a celebrity; there were also some sponsors, organizers, and some wealthy scions who just wanted to come and see the excitement.","The commotion had already attracted many onlookers. When the organizers saw the disturbance, they immediately came over. Yu Hui, seeing her boss present, quickly went over to him, fearing that if her boss suffered any disrespect here, his brother might get angry."]},{"number":143,"title":"Chapter 143: Red Carpet Gala","paragraphs":["The organizers quickly arrived and immediately zeroed in on Song Luokui. One of them approached her directly, \"Miss Song, I didn't expect you to come today! Your presence truly illuminates this event!\"","Instantly, all eyes turned towards Song Luokui, who was a bit dazed. \"Hello, who are you?\"","\"My name is Li Jiandang. You may not know me, but you should be familiar with my nephew Chen Nan.\"","Upon hearing this, Song Luokui understood. \"Then I should call you Uncle Li. Hello, Uncle Li.\"","\"Oh no, I can't accept that.\" He dared not take on that title, given his affiliation with the prestigious Chi Family.","Li Jiandang then turned to Lou Sasa and Weng Jiao. \"Are you ladies from the Lou and Weng families? I wonder what happened? Who has upset you?\"","Lou Sasa pointed her chin at Qiu SuEr. \"She upset me and wanted someone to take me out.\"","Li Jiandang took one look and immediately instructed someone nearby. \"Take that person away. Don't disturb our honored guests.\"","Qiu SuEr's eyes widened. \"But my father is...\" Before she could finish, her mouth was covered by the security guard on Li Jiandang's signal.","Li Jiandang said, \"It is our honor to have you three ladies here. I hope this small matter won't bother you.\" Although addressing all three, his main gaze was fixed on Song Luokui.","Lou Sasa and Weng Jiao also looked at Song Luokui, who replied, \"Of course, thank you Uncle Li.\"","Li Jiandang surveyed the room. \"All right, it was just a small incident. I apologize for the disturbance. I hope everyone enjoys the evening.\"","Li Jiandang quickly left, and Song Luokui's group returned to their seats. Many people around them secretly glanced in their direction, wondering which influential family's daughters were treated with such deference by Li Jiandang.","Yu Hui also approached Song Luokui. \"Boss, are you okay? I'm sorry, I was on the other side and didn't see what happened.\"","Song Luokui reassured her, \"It's fine, you couldn't have done anything even if you were here. Go back to work, we're alright here.\" Indeed, no one dared offend them now.","Not only were they untouchable, but many nearby were gleefully amused to see Qiu SuEr being unceremoniously removed by security.","\"The biggest news of the night!\"","\"It's a good thing it wasn't live-streamed. Otherwise, Qiu SuEr would have been utterly disgraced!\"","\"Even if not live-streamed, we can still...\"","\"Who are those three ladies? At first, I thought they were new celebrities.\"","\"They must be from some influential family. Qiu SuEr was too arrogant. Doesn't she know there's always someone more powerful?\"","\"What does she know? Her family's company isn't even in the top 200 in Hua Country. Why is she always so haughty?\"","\"Exactly, she got what she deserved.\"","...","Later, when Song Luokui went to the restroom, she witnessed an unsavory scene as she exited. A sleazy older man was harassing a young, beautiful woman. Though the woman kept rejecting his advances, she didn't want to create a scene.","Perhaps Song Luokui's gaze was too obvious, as the two immediately noticed her. The woman became flustered, while the sleazy man's eyes lit up upon seeing Song Luokui. \"Which company are you from? Why don't you come with me? I can help you get any role you want and make you a star. How about it?\"","This man hadn't been present earlier, so he was unaware of the previous incident.","Song Luokui looked at the woman. \"Aren't you leaving?\"","The woman quickly fled. \"Offending him could get me blacklisted.\"","Song Luokui shrugged. \"So be it. I'm not in the entertainment industry.\"","As the sleazy man approached Song Luokui, leering at her with lecherous eyes and reaching out to grope her, two bodyguards suddenly appeared beside him. They kicked and twisted him, eliciting pig-like squeals of pain.","Song Luokui ordered, \"Close the door and beat him up, then report him.\"","The door was quickly closed, and the sounds of a vicious beating could be heard from inside.","The woman nearby was stunned. Song Luokui left, saying, \"Let's go.\"","After the banquet ended and Song Luokui's group departed, another piece of gossip spread.","\"Did you hear? President Zhou from Jin Ding was beaten up in a hotel room.\"","\"Really? He deserved it! That sleazy old man has ruined so many people.\"","\"Well done to the person behind it. I call them a hero!\"","Within a week, news of President Zhou's illegal crimes reached the authorities, and everyone in the circle celebrated, especially female entertainers.","\"Chen Nan told me you attended a celebrity banquet?\" Chi Yu was video-calling Song Luokui. On the screen, he was shirtless, using a towel to wipe the water dripping from his hair down his neck and chest...","He was clearly trying to seduce her...","Song Luokui averted her gaze, not daring to stare. \"Yes, I just went to have some fun.\"","Chi Yu's eyes narrowed. \"I heard you encountered some trouble?\"","Song Luokui nodded. \"Yeah, I ran into a couple of troublemakers.\"","Chi Yu's expression turned cold. \"If they can't see clearly, then perhaps they shouldn't have eyes at all.\"","Sensing his warning, Song Luokui quickly reassured him, \"It's fine, they were dealt with. Don't do anything else, okay?\"","Chi Yu smiled. \"Don't worry, I won't. I'm just getting rid of some pests for the good of the country.\"","\"Alright then.\"","Chi Yu asked, \"Did you receive the gift I sent you?\"","On Song Luokui's table, the gift box he had sent was still open, containing designer bags, jewelry, cosmetics, and perfumes.","Song Luokui nodded. \"I got it.\"","To please him, she hinted at missing his company. \"When are you coming back? There are some new movies out. You could come back, and we could go watch them together.\"","Chi Yu's gaze immediately softened. \"I'll try to return soon.\"","Song Luokui offered, \"Okay, let me know when you're back. I'll pick you up from the airport.\"","\"Okay.\"","Suddenly, a foreign man entered from behind Chi Yu, carrying a sniper rifle and acting very familiar with him. He said something chilling in English, \"Hi, Bro, all the guys was killed...\"","*Click* Pool Yu immediately moved the camera down, turning off the sound as well. Song Luokui only saw Pool Yu's lower body wrapped in a towel and a glimpse of his abs...","Song Luokui: ???","Less than a minute later, Pool Yu moved the camera back up: \"Sorry about that, there was a little accident.\"","Song Luokui saw that the foreigner was gone.","Song Luokui: \"That guy earlier...\"","Pool Yu said seriously: \"He was holding a toy gun, saying he wanted to play a game.\"","Song Luokui: ...Do you think I believe that?","Pool Yu suddenly felt a bit awkward too.","Song Luokui: \"You're not in any danger, are you?\" She remembered that in the book, the male lead encountered many dangers on his way to becoming the world's richest man.","Pool Yu: \"No, I won't be in any danger.\" Even if there was danger, he would crawl out of hell for her.","Song Luokui was still a bit worried, afraid that because of her, there would be major deviations from the book's plot. \"You must be careful.\"","\"Okay~ I'll go home a little earlier.\"","\"Mmhmm.\""]},{"number":144,"title":"Chapter 144: Wei Qing and His Mother","paragraphs":["The weather has been quite changeable recently, with extreme day-to-night temperature differences. Song Luokui accidentally caught a cold, and her sneezing could often be heard in her school dormitory and at home.","Song Luokui's trash can in the dormitory was filled with tissues used for her runny nose. \"Achoo! Achoo! Sniff, sniff.\" Song Luokui's nose was bright red as she poured herself a cup of hot water and slowly sipped it while sniffling.","Wang Sisi: \"Luokui, did you take your medicine?\"","Song Luokui: \"I did, it's nothing serious.\" She just had a bit too much sneezing.","After taking medicine for two days, she felt much better. Sheng Rong touched her little face and didn't feel any sign of fever. \"Is your cold gone?\"","Song Luokui: \"It should be mostly gone. I only sneezed twice today, maybe someone was thinking of me.\" She held up two fingers.","Sheng Rong smiled and said, \"If you're feeling better, join me for an event.\"","Song Luokui: \"Okay.\"","It was a Chinese and foreign cultural exchange event, so they dressed quite formally, with Song Luokui wearing a small suit. She stood beside Sheng Rong, who was accompanied by several foreign friends, as well as an interpreter and camera crew.","At first, it was quite a joyous occasion, and Song Luokui experienced some small activities like embroidery, calligraphy, and lantern-making. But suddenly, a woman approached Sheng Rong and shook her hand, saying, \"Long time no see, Sheng Rong.\"","Sheng Rong glanced at her with a flash in her eyes. \"Luo Yuan, it has been a while.\"","Luo Yuan then looked at Song Luokui. \"This must be your young daughter. She certainly has your youthful charm.\"","Sheng Rong: \"Yes, this is my younger daughter. Her name is Luokui. Luokui, say hello.\"","Song Luokui politely bowed. \"Hello, auntie.\"","Luo Yuan looked at her with satisfaction. \"I have a son you may know, but it's okay if you don't. You two could become friends. My son is here, actually. Let me introduce you.\"","Luo Yuan then waved at a young man not far away. \"Xiao Qing, come over here.\"","Wei Qing walked over and, upon seeing Song Luokui, his eyes lit up. Before Luo Yuan could introduce them, he greeted Song Luokui, \"Luokui, you're here too.\"","Luo Yuan was surprised. \"You two know each other? Well, that's great. My son doesn't have many friends, so you two can be friends.\"","Song Luokui's mouth twitched: ...Not many friends? How is that possible?","Before Song Luokui could say anything, Sheng Rong pulled her close. \"When it comes to young people making friends, I don't interfere much. It's up to them to decide who they want to be friends with.\"","\"My Luokui just got a boyfriend recently, so if she becomes friends with your son, I'm afraid it might cause issues with her boyfriend.\"","Luo Yuan was surprised to hear that she already had a boyfriend. \"Oh? I wonder which outstanding young man from our circle it is? Or is he from outside our circle? No offense, but you know some outsider boys can be quite unsuitable.\"","Sheng Rong: \"You should know him too. It's the young man from the Chi family.\"","Upon hearing this, Luo Yuan's expression changed. \"The Chi family? You mean Chi Yu?\"","Sheng Rong nodded. \"Yes, him. He's a good boy.\"","Luo Yuan thought to herself that if the Song family and the Chi family were to unite, it would be very unfavorable for the Wei family. Her mind raced as she looked at her son. \"It's just about being friends, you know? Besides, girls should have a few friends so they don't get deceived.\"","Sheng Rong: \"It's up to the children themselves.\"","Luo Yuan immediately turned to Song Luokui, as did Wei Qing. \"Luokui, are you free later? There's a new amusement park in the west of the city. Would you like to go check it out together?\"","Song Luokui waved her hand. \"I'm sorry, I don't have much free time. I have to do homework tonight.\"","Luo Yuan: \"You're still a student? What grade are you in?\"","Song Luokui politely replied, \"I'm a junior.\"","Luo Yuan smiled. \"Perfect. My son owns a company. If you need an internship or anything, you can intern at my son's company. I'll have him arrange it for you.\"","Wei Qing rubbed his nose. \"Mom, Luokui's brother also runs a company, so she might not want to come to mine.\"","Song Luokui smiled: \"I have my own company, so I don't need an internship.\"","\"Oh, that's right. Didn't your son used to have a strained relationship with that boy from the Chi family?\" Luo Yuan turned to Sheng Rong. \"How did the two families become so close all of a sudden?\"","Sheng Rong waved her hand. \"That was in the past. Kids just like to compete and be number one in everything, but now they've grown up and matured. Besides, the boy from the Chi family is indeed quite decent.\"","Luo Yuan's expression darkened. \"Is that so?\"","After a few more casual exchanges, Luo Yuan excused herself and left with her son. As they were leaving, Wei Qing turned to look at Song Luokui one more time.","\"Mom, why did you seem so familiar with Wei Qing's mother?\" Song Luokui asked, puzzled.","Sheng Rong's expression turned serious again. \"She and I were classmates before.\"","\"I see.\"","\"Luokui, stay away from them in the future.\" Sheng Rong tidied her hair. \"The Wei family doesn't have good intentions toward us. What I said earlier was just for appearances. You've grown up, so I'll tell you some things. The Wei family wants to vie for that position, but the Chi family will definitely stand in their way. Now that you're dating Chi Yu, they might target you.\"","\"The incident with your brother before, your father and I suspect the Wei family was involved too. They want our Song family to side with them, and even if we don't side with the Chi family's camp, we absolutely cannot side with the Wei family's camp.\"","\"As for Wei Qing just now, you should stay away from him too in the future. I'm afraid they might try to pair you up with him to get our Song family to join their side.\"","Song Luokui solemnly stated, \"Mom, I understand. Brother and Chi Yu both told me to stay away from Wei Qing before. And I don't like him either. I think he seems a bit dangerous.\" Actually, a bit weird.","Sheng Rong patted her shoulder with relief. \"Your brother is right, as always.\"","\"Yes.\"","However, Song Luokui couldn't stop Wei Qing from appearing in front of her. On her way back from the restroom, she bumped into him.","Song Luokui planned to pretend she didn't see him, but of course Wei Qing directly pinned her against the wall. He even wanted to lift her hair and take a whiff. \"Why does little Luokui always look like she wants to run away whenever she sees me? Do I look that ugly?\"","Wei Qing stroked his chin. \"I consider myself quite a handsome guy.\"","Song Luokui ducked under his arm and walked away. \"Maybe it's because my brother and my boyfriend are too handsome, so other guys just look ugly in comparison.\"","Song Luokui said that line and quickly walked away. Wei Qing was even amused by her bluntness. He took large strides to follow behind Song Luokui. \"Little Luokui, don't be so cold. Big brother Wei Qing means you no harm, I just want to find you to play.\"","Song Luokui: \"Sorry, I'm not feeling well, so I don't want to go out and play. You can find someone else to play with.\""]},{"number":145,"title":"Chapter 145: Returning from a Business Trip","paragraphs":["Song Luokui tried to run away, but Wei Qing kept following her. Song Luokui couldn't find Sheng Rong for a while, so she could only walk around the venue, with Wei Qing trailing behind her. People around them found their rapid back-and-forth movement strange and glanced at the two of them.","Song Luokui was about to die of anger. This person really couldn't read the situation and was so thick-skinned. Recalling that Wei Qing had her photos in his phone before, Song Luokui felt a chill down her spine.","This person was a huge pervert. She had to stay away from him at all costs.","Wei Qing kept mumbling in her ear, \"Although you're dating Chi Yu, you know how he is. He often goes abroad, doing who knows what, and has many female companions overseas.\"","Remembering the time when Chi Yu had beaten him up, Wei Qing's eyes darkened. Chi Yu, one day he would make him taste the feeling of being beaten.","Song Luokui didn't believe Wei Qing's words. She recalled the time when a foreign man holding a sniper rifle suddenly appeared during a video call with Chi Yu... She felt that Chi Yu was doing something dangerous.","However, Chi Yu had always told her that he wouldn't do anything illegal, so she still believed him.","Song Luokui stopped in her tracks, \"If you keep following me, I'll tell my brother and Chi Yu to teach you a lesson.\"","As soon as the words fell, Wei Qing paused, because Song Luosheng and Chi Yu would indeed do that.","\"Luokui?\" At this moment, Song Luokui heard Sheng Rong calling her name.","Song Luokui felt relieved and immediately ran over, \"Mom, I was looking for you just now.\"","Sheng Rong took her hand, glanced at Wei Qing, \"Let's go, I'll introduce you to some friends.\"","\"Okay, Mom.\"","After the afternoon event ended, Sheng Rong took Song Luokui home. Song Luokui hadn't reported the incident yet, but unexpectedly Sheng Rong brought it up directly during dinner that evening.","\"Sheng, keep an eye on your sister. That kid from the Wei family kept following Luokui today.\"","Song Luosheng: ???!!!","Song Luosheng: \"I understand.\" He said it very calmly, but he wasn't calm at all inside. What was that Wei Qing trying to do? Why was he following his sister around? Chi Yu was one thing, but who was Wei Qing?","The more he thought about it, the more he felt Wei Qing had ulterior motives. Recalling Wei Qing's character, Song Luosheng lowered his gaze. He thought Wei Qing was too idle and needed to be given something to do.","Song Luokui: \"It's nothing. He said he wanted to take me out to play, but I rejected him.\"","Song Luosheng: \"Good rejection. If he dares to bully you, brother will help you teach him a lesson.\"","\"Mmhmm.\"","After dinner, Song Luosheng returned to his room and suddenly thought that since it was about Luokui, Chi Yu had to know as well. And he had to deal with Wei Qing himself, otherwise why should Chi Yu date his sister Luokui?","Song Luosheng directly called Chen Nan, \"It's me, Song Luosheng. Is Chi Yu there? I need to talk to him.\"","Chen Nan was quite surprised and asked him to wait a moment, then walked over to Chi Yu, who was talking to a client.","\"Boss.\"","Chi Yu excused himself from the client and followed Chen Nan to the side, \"What's up?\"","Chen Nan handed him the phone, \"It's Miss Song's brother.\"","Thinking that something might have happened to Luokui, Chi Yu immediately took the call, \"This is Chi Yu.\"","Song Luosheng directly asked, \"Where are you?\"","Although Chi Yu didn't know the reason, he still answered, \"I'm on a business trip abroad.\"","Song Luosheng: \"Since you're on a business trip abroad, didn't you arrange for someone to keep an eye on my sister?\"","Chi Yu's heart tightened, \"Did something happen to Luokui? Did she get into trouble?\" He was about to rush back.","Song Luosheng: \"How could anything happen to her? I'm here, so nothing would happen to her!\"","Chi Yu felt relieved, \"Then why did you say that?\"","Song Luosheng: \"Luokui was harassed by Wei Qing today! I want to deal with him, and you must deal with him too!\" His tone was very firm, \"If you don't deal with him, then it seems like you don't care about my sister.\"","Chi Yu: \"...I understand. I'll make sure Wei Qing has no time to stay in the country.\"","Song Luosheng was satisfied, \"That's it.\" Then he hung up directly.","Chi Yu: \"Find out what Wei Qing has been up to lately in the country.\"","\"Yes, sir.\"","After the meeting with the client, Chi Yu also video called Song Luokui. In the footage, Song Luokui's eyes were slightly red, with tears in the corners, and her nose was also red, as if she had been crying.","Chi Yu immediately became a little panicked, \"What's wrong? Did that bastard Wei Qing bully you?\"","\"Achoo!\" Song Luokui blew her nose with a tissue, \"No... no, how did you know about Wei Qing? I just have a cold.\"","She was getting better, thinking there was no problem, but unexpectedly it relapsed in the evening. Could it be because she went out today? Come to think of it, she didn't dress warmly enough at the venue, which had heating.","However, Chi Yu thought that maybe she caught a cold due to being frightened by Wei Qing, \"I'll be back in a couple of days.\"","Song Luokui was very happy to hear that, \"Then I'll go pick you up at the airport.\"","Chi Yu: \"You just rest well, don't come. I'll come see you.\"","Song Luokui: \"In a couple of days, I should be mostly recovered. If you come to see me, my brother might not let you in.\"","Chi Yu: \"Alright then, just rest well at home if you're not feeling well.\"","\"Mmhmm.\"","After chatting with Song Luokui for over an hour, Chi Yu hung up. Then he called someone, \"Stir up some trouble with the Wei family's overseas businesses. Give them something to deal with, so they won't have time to keep an eye on the domestic affairs.\"","Two days later, Chi Yu flew back from abroad. After learning his flight details, Song Luokui quickly went to the airport to wait for him.","She didn't go inside though, only waiting in the car. Her bodyguard said there seemed to be a lot of fans waiting inside to greet some celebrity, so it was too crowded and chaotic. To avoid trouble, she stayed in the car.","Song Luokui didn't make it difficult for them and sat in the car waiting. She even took out her homework to work on.","She still had a runny nose at the time, but she wasn't constantly sneezing anymore.","After getting off the plane, Chi Yu saw Song Luokui's message. He told the people around him to leave, while he went alone to Song Luokui's car.","When Song Luokui saw someone coming out, she stretched her arm out of the car window and waved at him continuously. Chi Yu noticed this and immediately hurried over with quick steps.","Once inside the car, Chi Yu pulled Song Luokui into his embrace, then said to Uncle An, \"Uncle An, please take us to ChunWang Manor.\"","Uncle An: ...This young man is really quite impolite.","Song Luokui smiled, \"Uncle An, let's go to ChunWang Manor.\"","Chi Yu even raised the privacy screen at the back. As the car started moving, Chi Yu tightly hugged her, taking deep breaths of her scent, feeling a sense of peace in his heart.","Chi Yu cupped her face, intending to kiss her, but Song Luokui covered his mouth with her hand, \"I'm still recovering from a cold, I'm afraid of passing it to you.\""]},{"number":146,"title":"Chapter 146: Back from Business Trip 02","paragraphs":["Chi Yu directly took her hand away, \"I'm fine, don't worry.\" After saying that, he directly restrained her hands and pressed her onto the seat to kiss her.","The slippery pythons entwined with each other, the two pythons wrestling with one another, surrounding and encircling, their tails entangled as they tried to swallow each other. But one of them was larger and more powerful, and the other was no match, instantly strangled and defeated.","After returning to ChunWang Manor for an hour, Song Luokui covered her mouth and directly hid behind the door. Her hair was now disheveled, her eyes slightly red, her coat thrown aside, her legs a little weak - mainly because Chi Yu had been too ferocious today, and she felt like he almost devoured her.","Song Luokui's voice softened, \"You're not allowed to come again~\"","At this time, Chi Yu wasn't much better off either. Unable to be seen by anyone for half a month, he finally came back and wanted to indulge himself fully, but now the fire couldn't be released, and it was truly uncomfortable.","On his neck, there was also a lip print left by Song Luokui, not to mention the lipstick stains on his face.","Chi Yu pulled her into his embrace, took a deep breath, \"Don't be afraid, I won't devour you now.\" Maybe later.","The car stopped at the ChunWang Manor parking lot. Chi Yu hugged Song Luokui upstairs, while the bodyguards took the next elevator.","Bodyguards: ...What could they do? They're just bodyguards.","As soon as they entered the room, Chi Yu picked Song Luokui up and sat her on the cabinet in the hallway. Song Luokui felt this action was a bit familiar, \"Didn't you say...\" you wouldn't devour me?","Before she could finish her words, her mouth was bitten.","The ferocious python instantly slithered in, almost causing Song Luokui to lose her breath...","The battle raged from the hallway to the sofa, and then to the bedroom...","At the last second, Song Luokui was almost completely devoured, but Chi Yu held back, his veins bulging, \"Baby, I'm sorry.\"","Nothing was prepared, and his precious baby hadn't graduated yet. What if she got pregnant? He had to consider her well-being.","Chi Yu heavily kissed her, then immediately ran into the bathroom.","Song Luokui covered her face, grabbed the blanket and buried herself in it, too ashamed to come out...","Perhaps it was because his cold hadn't fully recovered, or perhaps it was the exhaustion from their earlier entanglement, but before Chi Yu came out, Song Luokui had already fallen asleep.","When Chi Yu came out of the bathroom, he walked over, lifted the blanket, and saw the already sleeping girl with flushed cheeks, her shoulders slightly exposed from the blanket with red marks, looking extremely suggestive.","Her fair neck contrasted with the grey blanket, making the frail beauty even more delicate and tempting.","Chi Yu took a deep breath, slipped under the covers and directly held her in his embrace, tightly covering them both. Her sweet scent filled his nose, and finally unable to resist, he bit her shoulder several times before kissing her multiple times.","His actions made her sleep restlessly, and she pushed him away before he settled down, finally falling asleep while holding her.","They slept straight through until after 4 pm, having arrived around 10 am that morning. Song Luokui opened her eyes and blinked, suddenly sitting upright, the blanket slipping off and almost exposing herself. She quickly grabbed the blanket to cover herself.","Next to her, Chi Yu was still sleeping. Song Luokui didn't disturb him, thinking he must be tired from the long flight.","As for herself, she wanted to put on some clothes, but one glance showed the messy clothes at the end of the bed, with one item even fallen to the floor.","Song Luokui picked up a piece and found it terribly wrinkled, frowning - how could she wear this?","Just as she was wondering whether to walk over to her own house to change clothes or not wear these wrinkled ones and have someone bring clothes over - if she went over, would the bodyguards be outside? And if she had clothes brought over, wouldn't it be the same situation?","...Song Luokui sighed, she'd just take a shower and change into a robe first.","As soon as her feet touched the floor, she was pulled back onto the bed and tightly embraced by Chi Yu's arms and legs under the blanket. A slightly hoarse voice sounded in her ear, \"Where are you going?\"","Her earlobe tickled before being bitten, causing Song Luokui to shudder as she quickly covered her ear, afraid he would catch fire again, \"I want to take a shower.\"","Chi Yu hugged and kissed her several times before letting her go, \"Go ahead, I'll have someone make food.\" He was also afraid he couldn't resist.","\"Mm hmm.\" Song Luokui casually threw on some clothes and immediately ran into the bathroom.","Standing in front of the bathroom mirror, Song Luokui pulled at her clothes, examining herself in the mirror and even tilting her head to look at her back, blushing more and more - there were marks everywhere, not to mention her chest which was a little sore.","Then she thought, it's a good thing it's winter so she can cover up with more layers of clothing.","She hurriedly took a shower, but suddenly noticed an uneven spot down there - after twisting around for a while, she finally saw a bite mark...","Wearing her robe out of the bathroom, Chi Yu was now sitting on the sofa in a grey silk pajama, book in hand. Hearing the sound, he looked up to see Song Luokui tightly pursing her lips as she marched towards him.","Chi Yu: ?","Song Luokui then directly pounced on him, biting his face. Chi Yu grabbed her little butt so she wouldn't fall off, quite indulgent of her behavior. After she finished biting, he asked, \"Still angry? You can bite some more.\"","Song Luokui: \"Who... told you to bite me there.\" When she saw it, she almost combusted.","Chi Yu blinked, \"Where did you mean?\"","Song Luokui wanted to say it but didn't, lowering her head to pull open his clothes and bite his shoulder instead.","Chi Yu chuckled softly, leaning in to whisper in her ear, \"You can bite me wherever you want, even there.\"","Song Luokui turned as red as an apple, only able to mutter, \"Scoundrel!\"","He looked like a gentleman on the surface, but was actually domineering and unscrupulous!","Chi Yu hugged her, still laughing, \"Yeah, a scoundrel only for you.\"","Song Luokui hit him to let her go. Chi Yu released one hand but kept the other arm around her, \"Want to change clothes first? I had someone bring you some.\"","Song Luokui immediately noticed the folded clothes nearby, \"Brought over from next door?\"","Chi Yu shook his head, \"I had someone send them over.\"","Song Luokui stood up to get clothes and go to the dressing room, \"Then I'll go change clothes first.\"","Chi Yu watched her go in, thinking that he indeed needed to prepare her clothes in his room, and things like a vanity table might also be needed, so he started calling people.","After Song Luokui changed her clothes and came out, Chi Yu took her to the restaurant to eat. The chef had already prepared the dishes.","Song Luokui told him about what happened while he was away on business, and Chi Yu listened attentively, also responding to her. The atmosphere between them was excellent.","After finishing the meal, Chi Yu accompanied Song Luokui to watch a movie, then sent her home. It was impossible for him to have her stay, because if Song Luokui came back late, Song Luosheng would start calling nonstop."]},{"number":147,"title":"Chapter 147: Taboo","paragraphs":["Regarding the new address for the company, Song Luosheng gave his sister Song Luokui a choice. The first option was around one kilometer away from ChunWang Manor, where they could lease an entire floor, but there were also other companies nearby.","The second option was three kilometers away from ChunWang Manor, a three-story building with a moderate land area and spacious surroundings.","There were also options farther away that seemed decent, with shopping malls in the vicinity, and one was even located near the Mountain Group.","Song Luosheng also recommended a place not far from Song Hua's residence, and offered to give her an apartment nearby.","Song Luokui: \"The second one, I don't want to move too far.\" The second option was an entire building with just three floors, perfect for their company without disturbing others.","Song Luosheng: \"Okay, I'll have someone take care of it for you.\"","Song Luokui: \"Thank you, brother~\"","Song Luosheng: \"How will you thank me?\"","Song Luokui gave him a sly look, \"I'll cook dinner for you tonight.\"","Song Luosheng, who had been leaning on the sofa, immediately stood up straight. \"No, don't do that. Just buy me a gift or have Auntie Gui make something for you to bring over. Don't cook yourself.\" He remembered the incident when she nearly lost her life cutting fruit as a child, and his heart couldn't take it.","Song Luosheng suddenly asked: \"You haven't cooked for Chi Yu before, have you?\"","Song Luokui: \"No, I haven't. That was when I was a child. I'm not unlucky anymore.\"","Song Luosheng: \"Still, don't cook. It's dangerous. Be good and let Auntie Gui do it. Even if you're at ChunWang Manor, don't cook yourself. I remember arranging a maid for you.\"","Song Luokui: \"Okay.\"","Song Luosheng: \"I'll come home and have dinner with you tonight.\"","\"Okay~\" Looks like she couldn't go out with Chi Yu tonight.","After hanging up, Song Luosheng called Chen Nan and directly handed the phone to Chi Yu when he saw it was him.","\"Boss, it's your uncle-in-law's call.\"","Chi Yu took the phone, \"Hello? This is Chi Yu.\"","Song Luosheng was straightforward: \"I haven't fully agreed to your relationship with my sister yet. Even though I don't oppose it now since she likes you and I can't do anything about it, I still need to warn you about some things.\"","Chi Yu didn't get angry, \"Go ahead.\"","Song Luosheng: \"Never let my sister cook or handle knives, not even for cutting fruit. She also doesn't eat fish, coriander, or any weird foods. I hope you remember all this. If anything happens to her, I won't forgive you.\"","Chi Yu: \"Understood.\" He knew earlier that Song Luokui didn't eat fish, and he had observed some of her other habits, like her fondness for strawberries, cherries, and bananas, but she wouldn't touch apples or oranges unless they were sliced and peeled.","As for cutting fruit, he hadn't witnessed it, but since Song Luosheng mentioned it, he would follow his instructions.","Song Luosheng: \"There's a whole list of taboos. I'll write them down and send them to you. Hope you remember them all.\"","\"Okay.\"","When Song Luokui saw the list her brother sent to Chi Yu, she was shocked. She held her forehead and said, \"My brother wrote a lot, but you don't have to remember everything. If I like or dislike something, I'll tell you myself.\"","Chi Yu shook his head: \"It's fine, I've memorized them.\"","Song Luokui: \"And things like not being able to cut fruit or play ball, you don't need to pay attention to those. I can cut fruit and play ball now without any issues.\"","\"You should know that I was a bit unlucky as a child. When cutting fruit, I once cut my hand and got an infection that nearly killed me. And there were times when I would get hit by stray balls while walking past a court for no reason. But I'm not unlucky anymore.\"","\"It's probably because my family often goes to temples to pray for my well-being, and with their protection, I was able to grow up healthy and happy. Whenever something happened to me, my brother felt guilty, thinking he didn't take good care of me. So if he's harsh with you because of me, please don't blame him. It's all because of me.\"","Song Luokui leaned on Chi Yu's shoulder as she spoke. The luckiest thing in her life was to be surrounded by good people, whether family or friends.","Chi Yu hugged her tightly. Although she described it lightly, he could imagine how dangerous those situations must have been to make Song Luosheng cry. He had heard people say before that the Songfamily's daughter was really unlucky, but he didn't take it to heart at the time. Now, thinking about her frequent hospital visits as a child, he felt pained.","If something really happened to her and she was gone from this world, what would he do? A world without her would be gray and dull.","Chi Yu gripped her hand tightly, \"Anyway, you should stay away from anything in the kitchen.\"","Song Luokui: \"...\" Did he not hear anything she just said?","Chi Yu was already considering finding time to visit a temple and get her a protective amulet.","...","\"We absolutely cannot allow the Chi family and the Song family to unite.\"","\"So what do we do now?\"","\"Isn't the Chi family's boy dating the Song family's daughter? We need to split them up first. Find a few women to seduce the Chi family's boy. If the Song family's girl feels wronged, she'll surely blame the Chi family.\"","\"But... no one has been able to get close to the Chi family's boy.\"","\"There's no man who doesn't like beautiful women throwing themselves at them. If one isn't enough, find two. If two aren't enough, find three. They don't have to be from our circle; we can look in other circles.\"","\"Understood.\"","\"As for the Song family's girl, have Wei Qing befriend her. If we can marry into the Song family, dealing with the Chi family won't be a problem.\"","\"Wei Qing has gone abroad to clean up a mess with the overseas business. She may not be back for a while.\"","\"Then send other members of the Wei family! Or hire some people to test the waters.\"","\"Understood.\"","...","Before his business trip, Chi Yu said he wanted to have a meal with his brothers. Song Luokui agreed, and the day came when Chi Yu had arranged everything and Song Luokui had time. As soon as she finished class, Chi Yu picked her up.","As they entered the private room, a group of men stood up and bowed: \"Hello, sister-in-law.\"","Song Luokui was startled and clung to Chi Yu's arm, looking at him questioningly. Why did they seem like gangsters? Chi Yu patted her hand reassuringly.","Song Luokui: \"Hello, you don't need to be so formal.\"","Chi Yu led her to the middle and sat down, \"Everyone, have a seat.\"","Afterward, one by one, they all sat down.","Chi Yu: \"Have you ordered the dishes?\"","Chen Nan: \"I've ordered a few, but I'll need to check with the boss and the missus to see what else they want to eat.\" Chen Nan handed the menu over to him.","Chi Yu received it and placed it in front of Song Luokui, \"Take a look and see what you'd like to eat?\" The others, seeing the boss speak in such a gentle tone, exchanged glances with each other.","Song Luokui was oblivious to all of this. She flipped through the menu, ordered two dishes, after which Chi Yu ordered a few more dishes. He also ordered a hot drink for Song Luokui since her period was approaching and she couldn't drink anything cold. As for alcohol, she definitely couldn't have any of that."]},{"number":148,"title":"Chapter 148: Is She Flirting with You","paragraphs":["The dishes arrived swiftly, and the waitress poured tea, wine, and drinks for everyone. When it was Chi Yu's turn, the young waitress asked softly, \"Sir, would you like tea or red wine?\"","Chi Yu: \"Tea will do.\"","The waitress: \"Yes.\" As she carefully poured the tea, her hand suddenly became unsteady, and the teacup tipped over, spilling the warm tea onto Chi Yu's pants. It was just a little bit, as Chi Yu quickly stood up.","Before Song Luokui could even react, the waitress immediately apologized and began to dab at Chi Yu with a handkerchief, \"I'm so sorry, sir. It's my fault.\" Her voice was delicate and pitiful, her eyes brimming with tears, her clothing exposing a large portion of her skin as she bent over.","When she reached out to him, Chi Yu frowned and stepped back, calling out, \"Chen Nan!\"","Chen Nan, initially stunned, promptly stood up and kicked the waitress to the ground with one swift motion, \"Restrain her!\"","The men around them immediately pinned the waitress down. The other waiters stood dazed, with one of the leaders rushing to find the manager, \"We're dead, we're dead, we've offended an important person!\"","Song Luokui quickly took out a handkerchief to dab at Chi Yu's leg, \"Are you okay? Did it burn you? Let's go to the hospital right away!\"","Chi Yu held her hand, \"It's fine, not hot, just warm. Don't worry.\"","Song Luokui looked at the waitress, who was quite pretty, with a nice figure, big chest, slim waist, and tears staining her face, making her appear delicate as she looked at Chi Yu, \"I'm sorry, sir. It was my mistake. Please, spare me.\"","Song Luokui: ... Suddenly, it felt like we had stepped into a scene from some erotic novel.","\"Was she trying to seduce you?\" Song Luokui looked up at Chi Yu.","Chi Yu paused, \"... Perhaps she was trying to assassinate me.\"","Song Luokui: ... Does this look like an assassination attempt?","The waitress was also stunned, shaking her head, \"I wasn't. Sir, I wasn't...\" Before Chen Nan stuffed a cloth into her mouth, \"Too noisy.\"","Soon, the restaurant's manager arrived, appearing nervous and apologetic, \"Mr. Chi, I'm really sorry. We've given you a terrible experience. It's our fault. Today, your meal will be on the house, and you can have anything you want. Please, Mr. Chi, don't blame us. As for that waitress, we'll handle her properly.\"","Chi Yu: \"No need. I just hope you'll cooperate with the investigation, as I suspect she was trying to assassinate me.\"","The manager was sweating profusely, \"What... What?\"","Chi Yu: \"Let her go for now. As long as your restaurant operates legally, you have nothing to worry about.\"","The manager: \"No, no, that can't be. We follow all the regulations and pay our taxes on time.\"","Chi Yu: \"Serve the dishes now, my men are hungry.\"","\"Yes, yes.\"","The waitress was taken away, and Chi Yu's driver quickly brought a change of clothes as his pants were wet. Chi Yu took the clothes to change, and he even brought Song Luokui with him.","The reason was that he was afraid another woman might appear while he was changing clothes.","Song Luokui: ???","\"Wait, why are you bringing me in too?\" Song Luokui covered her eyes. \"Can't I stay outside?\"","She realized Chi Yu had already brought her into the changing room and even locked the door.","Chi Yu had started unbuckling his belt, and Song Luokui could hear the sound in the small space, where the temperature seemed to rise, with even the slightest noise carrying an air of intimacy.","Chi Yu: \"No.\"","Song Luokui: ...","Song Luokui then heard the rustling of clothes, the sound of a zipper, and the clinking of a belt. Next, her hand was taken and placed on the belt, \"Can you help me buckle it?\"","Song Luokui jerked her hand back, \"Chi Yu, be normal, you're scaring me.\" She still had her eyes closed.","Recalling the intimate spot he had bitten before, Song Luokui kicked him, \"Pervert!\"","Chi Yu had already dressed, but he wanted to tease her a little, \"Okay, open your eyes.\"","Song Luokui: \"Really?\"","She cautiously opened her eyes and saw that he was indeed dressed, though Chi Yu was smiling at her.","She kicked him again, \"Stop teasing me.\"","Chi Yu smiled and took her hand, \"Sorry, my bad.\"","As they left the changing room, there was actually another woman outside. She looked at them in surprise, her gaze lingering on Chi Yu's face for a moment before moving away. Chi Yu was quite perceptive and felt that this person might also be a problem.","After leaving, he immediately told Chen Nan to investigate her as well.","Back in the private room, the dishes had been served. Chi Yu picked up his chopsticks first, \"Let's eat.\"","The others then grabbed their chopsticks and started eating. Chen Nan stood up first, \"A toast to the Boss and future Sister-in-law, may you love each other forever, and grow old together.\"","Chi Yu seemed pleased and drank a cup.","Then the others came to toast them one by one, \"To the Boss and Sister-in-law, may you marry soon and have a precious child.\"","\"May the Boss and Sister-in-law live in harmony and happiness.\"","\"May the Boss and Sister-in-law have a blissful marriage filled with good fortune.\"","Song Luokui: ... Why does it sound like we're getting married?","She suddenly recalled when Chi Yu had confessed to her, and that scene also resembled a wedding...","Song Luokui kept sipping her drink, her face flushed with embarrassment. Chi Yu, on the other hand, seemed quite happy, though he didn't smile constantly. Yet, he downed each toast made to them in one gulp.","Song Luokui was a little worried about him, \"Drinking so much, you'll feel sick later.\"","One of the henchmen: \"The Sister-in-law is concerned for the Boss!\"","Song Luokui: ...","Chi Yu looked at her with delight, his arm still around her, \"It's fine, I won't get drunk.\"","Despite saying he wouldn't get drunk, his steps were indeed unsteady after leaving. Song Luokui couldn't support him, so Chen Nan helped by holding Chi Yu as they got into the car.","As soon as they were in the car, Chi Yu immediately embraced Song Luokui, burying his face in her neck, his warm breath tickling her skin.","\"Go to ChunWang Manor,\" Song Luokui instructed the driver, who wasn't Uncle An.","\"Yes.\"","They soon arrived at ChunWang Manor. Song Luokui patted Chi Yu, \"Are you still awake? Can you walk?\"","Chi Yu closed his eyes and let out an \"mmm\" sound. Song Luokui helped him upstairs, into the room, and laid him down on the bed. The aunt had already brought over the hangover soup, as Song Luokui had called ahead to have it prepared while they were in the car.","Song Luokui handed the hangover soup to Chi Yu, \"Drink the hangover soup.\"","Chi Yu immediately opened his slightly dazed eyes, sat up, and gulped down the soup in one sip. The aunt quickly left with the bowl, leaving only Chi Yu and Song Luokui in the bedroom.","Song Luokui thought she should get a towel to wipe him down, so she prepared to go to the washroom.","Chi Yu grabbed her hand, \"Where are you going? Don't leave.\" He kept his eyes open, staring at her.","The gaze made Song Luokui's face flush red. \"I'm not leaving, I'm just going to get a towel to wipe you down.\"","\"Mmm.\" It took Chi Yu a while before he released her hand.","Song Luokui returned with the towel and wiped his face, neck, then proceeded to unbutton his clothes."]},{"number":149,"title":"Chapter 149: Don't Leave","paragraphs":["Song Luokui helped him take off his coat, shoes, and socks, grabbed a blanket from the side to cover him, and saw that he was still staring at her with a slightly dazed look. Song Luokui couldn't help but smile, caressing his face. \"Go to sleep now, I'll leave first.\"","Song Luokui was about to leave when Chi Yu suddenly sat up, got off the bed barefoot, and hugged her from behind. \"Don't go.\"","Song Luokui was taken aback, turning her head to look at him. Chi Yu's arms encircled her waist from behind, and he leaned his head against her shoulder. \"Don't leave, I want you to stay with me a little longer.\"","Song Luokui placed her hands over his. \"Let me go first.\"","Chi Yu's voice still carried a hint of drunkenness. \"If I let you go, you'll run away.\"","Song Luokui stroked his face. \"I won't run, just let me go first.\"","Chi Yu finally obeyed and released her. Song Luokui turned around, took his hand, and led him back to the bed. \"Lie down first.\"","Chi Yu obediently lay down, even leaving space for her, looking at her expectantly. Song Luokui sighed, took off her shoes, and lay down next to him. The two lay on their sides, facing each other. Song Luokui caressed his eyes. \"Close your eyes and sleep.\"","Chi Yu grasped her hand with his. \"Mm.\"","Song Luokui yawned, thinking she would leave once he fell asleep, but before long, it seemed she had also drifted off until she vaguely heard the sound of her phone vibrating.","Song Luokui reached for her phone. \"Hello?\"","\"Luokui, where are you? Why haven't you come back yet?\" It was Song Luosheng's voice.","Song Luokui instantly became alert. Chi Yu lying next to her had fallen into a deep sleep, but one of his arms was now wrapped around her waist, and his head was buried in the crook of her neck, his breath tickling her skin.","\"I... I'm at ChunWang Manor. I won't be coming home tonight.\"","Song Luosheng frowned. \"ChunWang Manor? I thought you said you were having dinner with Chi Yu tonight? You didn't go to the office today either, so why are you at ChunWang Manor? Chi Yu isn't there, is he?\"","Song Luokui felt extremely guilty. \"No, he's not here.\" She glanced at the time - it was almost midnight. \"Brother, I'm really tired. Let's talk later, okay?\"","At that moment, Chi Yu suddenly stirred. His hand slid under her shirt, caressing the soft flesh of her waist, and he lifted his head, still groggy, and said, \"Who?\"","Song Luokui's heart nearly leaped out of her chest as she quickly covered his mouth, signaling him not to speak, before immediately getting off the bed and rushing to the living room.","Song Luosheng had vaguely heard a man's voice. \"Luokui, where are you? I think I just heard someone talking?\"","Song Luokui frantically turned on the TV. \"Huh? What sound? It must be the TV. I have it on.\"","Song Luosheng frowned. \"Why are you watching TV so late?\"","Song Luokui replied hurriedly, \"No, no, I just forgot to turn it off.\" She purposefully moved closer to the TV so Song Luosheng could clearly hear the sound.","\"Alright then, but get some rest soon. Let me know next time if you're not coming home.\"","\"Got it, got it. Good night, brother.\"","\"Good night.\"","After hanging up, Song Luokui wiped away the sweat from her brow, now fully awake.","Turning around, she was startled to see Chi Yu leaning against the wall, his hair tousled, barefoot, and his collar open, exposing a large expanse of his chest.","Song Luokui was nearly scared out of her wits. \"Why are you just standing there without saying anything?\"","Chi Yu replied calmly, \"You told me not to speak.\"","Song Luokui realized he was right. As she put on her shoes, she said, \"Well, you should go back and continue sleeping. I'm going home.\"","However, Chi Yu walked over and scooped her up in his arms. \"Why don't you just stay here tonight?\"","Song Luokui hesitated. \"But I haven't showered yet. I want to go back and take a shower.\"","Chi Yu reassured her, \"You can shower here. You have clothes here.\"","Song Luokui was perplexed. \"What? How do you have my clothes here?\"","Chi Yu admitted, \"I prepared them in advance.\" After their last encounter, he had someone prepare a set of clothes for her.","Song Luokui was still hesitant, but Chi Yu walked over, crouched in front of her, and kissed her forehead. \"Go ahead and shower. I won't touch you tonight.\"","Song Luokui's face flushed as she took the clothes. \"You better keep your word.\"","Chi Yu smiled. \"I will.\"","When Song Luokui came out after showering, she found that Chi Yu had also showered and was sitting on the couch reading a book. He had changed into blue pajamas. Seeing her, he closed the book, set it aside, walked over, and carried her to the bed.","Song Luokui's heart raced as he held her close. After settling her on the bed, Chi Yu lay down beside her, pulling her into his embrace and covering them both with the blanket. He kissed her cheek. \"Sleep now.\"","\"Mmm.\" Song Luokui gripped the blanket and soon closed her eyes.","Before long, she was asleep, but Chi Yu remained awake. Propping himself up, he gazed at her, gently brushing her hair aside. He took her hand in his, then pulled her entire body into his embrace before finally drifting off to sleep himself.","The next morning, when Song Luokui opened her eyes, she saw that Chi Yu was already awake and watching her. Feeling shy, she hid under the covers, but could still hear Chi Yu's soft laughter.","After a while, Chi Yu joined her under the covers...","After some time, the two finally got out of bed. Chi Yu walked Song Luokui to the university, and Chen Nan had some news. \"Boss, we've investigated that woman from yesterday.\"","\"Tell me.\"","\"Someone paid her to seduce you, promising three hundred thousand if she succeeded. The restaurant is going to fire her, as they found out she was working a shift there that day.\"","\"But how did she know I would be eating there?\"","\"An insider tipped her off. That person has been fired too. They were also bribed, but we're still investigating who was behind it all.\"","Chi Yu nodded. \"Keep looking into it. By the way, did you find out about the other woman who was outside the changing room?\"","Chen Nan replied, \"We're still looking into her too. So far, it seems like she just happened to be there by chance, but I still feel like something's off.\"","\"Mm, let me know if you find anything more.\"","\"Yes, sir.\"","...","Song Luokui had just finished her class and was heading to another building for her second class of the day. She was in a bit of a hurry as finals were just a week away, and everyone was already discussing their plans for the winter break.","\"Song Luokui, where are you going to play during the winter break?\"","Song Luokui: \"I'm not sure yet, let's talk about it later.\" Just as she finished speaking, a male student suddenly bumped into her, causing a loud \"crash\" as Song Luokui's textbooks fell directly to the ground.","\"Sorry, sorry.\" The male student immediately helped her pick up the books.","Xu Jiarong helped from the side, \"Can't you watch where you're going?\"","The male student kept apologizing: \"I'm so sorry, it's my fault, I wasn't looking where I was going.\"","Song Luokui took the books, feeling it wasn't a big deal, \"It's okay.\"","Xu Jiarong was about to say something, but when she looked up and saw a handsome young man, she swallowed her words.","The male student was very polite, with slightly messy hair, clean and delicate features, fair skin that didn't look effeminate, wearing a black coat and a plaid scarf, exuding a charming atmosphere.","Song Luokui, however, didn't take a close look, just took her books and left."]},{"number":150,"title":"Chapter 150: Who is Handsomer Between Me and Your Brother","paragraphs":["After walking away, Xu Jiarong said to Song Luokui, \"Wow, that guy was super handsome, a real winter dreamboat with an alluring aura.\"","\"Huh? I didn't notice,\" Song Luokui hadn't paid attention.","Xu Jiarong said, \"It doesn't matter for you anyway, he definitely couldn't compare to the dashing Chi Yu or your brother Song Luosheng.\"","Song Luokui smiled, \"If you're interested, why don't you run back and get his WeChat?\"","Xu Jiarong immediately waved her hand, \"No, no, guys like that are better appreciated from a distance. Getting closer would only shatter the illusion.\"","Song Luokui laughed, \"Why would the illusion be shattered?\"","Xu Jiarong said, \"Like if he picked his nose and you saw nostril hairs, or he looked fair-skinned but was just caked in makeup and actually has large pores and acne... Just think about it, no matter how handsome he is, he still has to poop...\"","Song Luokui thought it was a bit disgusting too. But she had seen Chi Yu with stubble in the morning, though he would quickly tidy himself up. As for other things... er...","She had also seen her brother looking haggard from overwork, and she had teased him about being a corporate slave, only to get her head rubbed vigorously by him.","\"So, it's better to just admire from afar,\" she said.","Song Luokui nodded, \"You make a good point.\"","That afternoon after class, Chi Yu came to pick her up. She kept glancing at him, until he turned and asked, \"What's wrong? Why do you keep looking at me?\"","Song Luokui shook her head, \"Nothing, nothing.\" She couldn't very well say she was checking his nostrils for hairs, could she?","As for pores... Song Luokui looked again, and Chi Yu cupped her face, \"If you want to look, then look properly. Why are you being so sneaky about it?\"","Chi Yu leaned in close to Song Luokui, \"Say, back when I was competing against your brother in class, didn't you record a voice message cheering for him, calling him the most handsome? Where do I rank in your eyes?\"","Song Luokui was still scrutinizing his face intently. His pores seemed fine, no makeup either, as she stroked his cheek, \"You're not wearing any powder.\"","Chi Yu looked puzzled.","Song Luokui remembered there were men's skincare products in Chi Yu's bathroom, though he seemed to have added women's products recently. But she had never seen any makeup.","Chi Yu tapped his forehead against hers, \"What's up with you today?\"","Song Luokui blinked, \"Nothing, I just noticed your skin looks great and wondered how you take care of it.\"","Chi Yu laughed and stroked her cheek with his thumb, \"Compared to yours, it's nothing special.\" Her skin was so smooth it seemed pinchable, and even the slightest touch left marks.","Song Luokui said, \"I go to the beauty salon regularly. We're different, I've never seen you go.\"","Chi Yu asked, \"Why are you asking about this today? Did someone say something to you?\"","Song Luokui immediately waved her hands, \"No, no, I was just curious.\"","Chi Yu said, \"Well, you still haven't answered my earlier question. You used to say your brother was the most handsome. What about me? How do I compare to him?\"","\"Um...\" Song Luokui blinked, \"Well... you're both handsome in different ways.\"","Chi Yu pressed his forehead to hers and looked into her eyes, \"Where do I rank in your heart now? If you didn't know me well before, I can understand your brother being first. But now?\"","Song Luokui thought for a moment before saying, \"You're first! Definitely first!\"","Chi Yu smiled, \"Really? You're not just flattering me?\"","Song Luokui hugged him and leaned against his chest, \"I'm not lying.\" She could just say her brother was first to him, and Chi Yu was first to her brother. She was a master at pleasing both sides.","That night when Song Luosheng returned home, Song Luokui also kept glancing at him. Puzzled, he asked, \"What's wrong? Why do you keep looking at me today?\"","Song Luokui said, \"Nothing, I was just checking if you have nose hairs.\"","Song Luosheng coughed violently, covering his nose and staring at her in shock, \"Are you still my sister? Are you possessed?\"","Song Luokui explained, \"I heard real handsome guys don't have those.\"","Song Luosheng said, \"Luokui, everyone has them. It's just a matter of whether they stick out or not.\"","Song Luokui nodded, \"You're right.\"","Once in his room, Song Luosheng immediately checked himself in the mirror. He was still handsome, but looking a bit haggard from being overworked lately. No, he needed to take better care of himself.","With finals approaching, everyone was studying hard, including Song Luokui and Xu Jiarong in the library. Suddenly, someone sat down in front of them. At first, Song Luokui didn't pay much attention.","But Xu Jiarong nudged her and passed a note: \"Isn't that the guy from last time sitting across from us?\"","Song Luokui looked up and saw the fair complexion, recalling Xu Jiarong's earlier comments about makeup. She studied him intently before writing on the note: \"Looks like he's caked in powder.\"","Xu Jiarong read it, glanced at the guy across from them, and covered her mouth to stifle a laugh, as if confirming Song Luokui's observation.","The guy suddenly looked up, seeming to casually glance their way before saying, \"Fancy meeting you here.\"","The guy said, \"I bumped into you by accident last time, sorry about that.\" He looked at Song Luokui.","\"It's okay,\" Song Luokui replied.","\"I'm Liu Yici from the Art Department. What about you two?\" he asked.","Xu Jiarong looked at Song Luokui, then at Liu Yici, \"I'm Xu Jiarong, we're both from the Literature Department.\"","\"And you?\" Liu Yici turned to Song Luokui.","Song Luokui replied flatly, \"Song Luokui.\"","Liu Yici said, \"Why don't we all go out for a meal later? It'll be my treat, as an apology.\"","Xu Jiarong immediately waved her hands, \"No need, no need. Luokui always goes home for meals.\"","Liu Yici looked at Song Luokui, \"So you're from Jing City? Which part are you from? I'm from the North District, we might have even gone to the same high school.\"","Song Luokui said, \"Sorry, but we're studying right now.\" Hinting for him to stop talking.","Liu Yici immediately apologized, \"My apologies for disturbing you. Please continue studying.\"","In the middle, Song Luokui could feel occasional glances coming from the front, a scrutinizing gaze that she had encountered many times before, but she still felt uncomfortable.","Not long after, Song Luokui stood up, \"Jiarong, I need to head back first.\"","Xu Jiarong: \"Alright. Will you come again tomorrow? Shall I save you a seat?\"","Song Luokui: \"No need, thank you. Bye.\"","\"Bye.\"","After Song Luokui left, Liu Yici suddenly said to Xu Jiarong, \"Classmate, can I add you on WeChat?\"","Xu Jiarong: ?","In the end, she didn't refuse adding him on WeChat, but within a couple of days, Xu Jiarong found that this person kept asking her about Luokui's information. If he simply had a crush on Luokui, she wouldn't think much of it, but if Chi Yu found out...","Eventually, Xu Jiarong told Song Luokui about this.","Song Luokui: \"Just ignore him for now, I'll have someone look into it.\" It wasn't that she was being overly sensitive, but she knew the situation wasn't particularly good recently, so she would be more cautious."]},{"number":151,"title":"Chapter 151: Someone Tempts Kui Kui","paragraphs":["When Song Luosheng returned home, Song Luokui immediately said to him, \"Brother, help me investigate someone.\"","Song Luosheng: \"Who? Has someone been bullying you?\"","Song Luokui: \"No, help me investigate a male student named Liu Yici from the Art College.\"","Song Luosheng raised his eyes immediately, \"A male student? Is he pursuing you?\"","\"No!\" Song Luokui denied right away, \"He's just an ordinary male student, you'll know once you investigate him.\"","\"Alright. I'll investigate him for you.\" Song Luosheng thought maybe Luokui wanted to recruit him for the company, so she wanted to investigate him first.","However, after investigating, he discovered that this male student had been paid by someone to seduce his sister. In the investigation materials Song Luosheng obtained, there were chat records between Liu Yici and someone else, asking him to seduce Song Luokui.","As for who the person behind it was, after tracing it back, it turned out to be a dummy number.","Song Luosheng's gaze grew colder as he looked at the investigation results. Why would someone want to seduce Luokui? What was the ultimate goal? Was it for Luokui? Or something else?","Recalling that his father had been unusually busy recently, not returning home for several days, Song Luosheng thought of something and called Chi Yu.","\"Hello? This is Chi Yu.\"","Song Luosheng was always direct: \"Do you know anything about someone at school trying to seduce Luokui?\"","On the other end, Chi Yu had just returned to the company from outside, surrounded by a group of people. He immediately stopped in his tracks, \"What? Who are you talking about?\"","The people around him instantly sensed the chill emanating from the BOSS, and they looked at each other, unsure who had angered the boss.","Song Luosheng smiled, \"Ha, you don't know?\" Luokui was still his little cotton jacket, going to him whenever something happened, instead of Chi Yu.","Song Luosheng was pleased, \"Then go investigate it yourself.\" He wouldn't tell him.","After hanging up, Chi Yu turned and gave a few instructions to someone before leaving.","Chi Yu went straight to Peking University. Song Luokui was still in class, the last lesson of the day. Xu Jiarong whispered to her that Liu Yici had been asking about her again.","Song Luokui: \"No need to pay attention to him. If you find him annoying, just block him.\"","Xu Jiarong: \"It's fine, I'll help you see what he's up to.\"","After class, as Song Luokui walked out of the teaching building, she heard someone nearby gasp softly, \"Who is that? So handsome.\"","\"Oh my god, it looks like Senior Chi Yu. I've seen him once from afar.\"","\"Why would he come to the Faculty of Liberal Arts' teaching building?\"","\"No idea.\"","Song Luokui looked up and saw Chi Yu leaning against the car door. She immediately bid farewell to Xu Jiarong and ran over to him, \"Why are you here?\" And being so conspicuous, too.","Song Luokui pushed him into the car as many people around were looking at them.","However, Chi Yu didn't get into the car right away. Instead, he stretched out his arms and pulled her into an embrace, saying openly, \"I missed you, so I came to find you.\"","There was another wave of gasps around them, and Song Luokui was stunned.","On the other side, Xu Jiarong covered her face, \"This is the scene from a romance drama, right? Aaah, I'm so moved, so moved. High-profile couples really make people swoon.\"","Song Luokui snapped out of it and pushed him away, \"Get in the car quickly, I don't want to be watched by everyone.\"","Chi Yu finally let her go, \"Okay.\"","Once inside the car, Chi Yu drove away from the teaching building and stopped at a relatively secluded place. Song Luokui looked at him: \"Why are you being so...\"","Chi Yu turned and took her hand, \"Why didn't you tell me?\"","Song Luokui didn't understand: \"What... what?\"","Chi Yu: \"About someone trying to seduce you.\"","Song Luokui widened her eyes, \"Ah? Someone's trying to seduce me? I didn't know about it.\"","Chi Yu: \"Your brother said someone at school is trying to seduce you.\"","Song Luokui stared at him, \"So this is why you were acting so conspicuously today?\"","Chi Yu caressed her face, \"I was just asserting my claim.\" Although they had shared their relationship on social media, only those in their circle knew about it. Some people might not know, especially at school.","Song Luokui's face turned red, \"Uh, what did my brother tell you? He said someone at school is trying to seduce me?\" Song Luokui suddenly thought of the person she had asked her brother to investigate. \"Could it be that person?\" Song Luokui frowned.","Chi Yu's gaze sharpened, \"What person?\"","Song Luokui gripped his hand tightly, \"There's someone I've felt was acting a bit strange lately.\" In the past few days, she always felt that person kept unintentionally appearing in front of her. On the surface, he seemed very polite and hadn't done anything to her, but she just felt something was off.","Chi Yu: \"Who is that person?\"","Song Luokui: \"A male student from the Art College named Liu Yici. I asked my brother to investigate him.\"","Chi Yu suddenly lowered his gaze, \"Why didn't you tell me?\"","Song Luokui felt a pang in her heart when she saw his expression, \"I'm sorry, I just... I'm used to going to my brother.\"","Chi Yu let out a sigh and hugged her, \"I hope that when you encounter a problem, I'm the first person you think of. I'm your boyfriend. Even if you tell your brother first, it's fine, but I want you to tell me next.\"","Song Luokui's face was against his chest, listening to the rhythm of his heartbeat, beat by beat, \"Mm. I'll definitely tell you next time.\"","After thinking for a moment, she raised her head and kissed the corner of his mouth, \"I'm sorry.\"","Chi Yu: \"I'll help you investigate.\"","\"Okay.\"","...","On Chi Yu's side, he quickly had Chen Nan investigate. A few days later, the results were similar to what Song Luosheng had found. \"Boss, that restaurant waitress tried to seduce you, and now someone is trying to seduce Sister-in-law. The person behind this...\"","Chi Yu looked at the file on Liu Yici, \"They're just trying to drive a wedge between the Chi family and the Song family.\"","Chen Nan: \"My investigation found that there might be more people coming to cause trouble.\"","Chi Yu: \"First, expose the person behind this. Whoever wants to separate the Song family and the Chi family, it's obvious who it is.\"","\"Yes.\"","As for Liu Yici...","In the student council office at the school, Liu Yici was brought there at that moment. Ji Senior was no longer the student council president, but the new president was one of their people.","Speaking of which, the previous person who came in for the same reason was still on a leave of absence.","At this moment, Liu Yici's forehead was sweating, although the people here didn't do anything to him, the surrounding atmosphere was quite oppressive.","\"What are you going to do? Hitting someone is against the law.\"","One of the people nearby sneered, \"We're not going to hit you. We just want to warn you openly not to covet what doesn't belong to you.\"","Liu Yici tried to remain calm, \"I haven't done anything.\"","Suddenly, a pile of photos were thrown at him, \"Haven't you? Isn't being a gigolo considered doing something?\"","The photos showed Liu Yici with multiple wealthy older women, each photo featuring a different woman of varying ages.","Liu Yici's pupils constricted, \"I'm just working, and I haven't done anything wrong. Is it illegal to have a job now?\"","\"It's not illegal, but the kind of work you're doing violates school regulations. Normally, if you didn't flaunt it, we wouldn't bother with you. But lately, what have you been up to? Who gave you the audacity to think you can go after anyone you want?\""]},{"number":152,"title":"Chapter 152: Untitled","paragraphs":["\"I... I...\" Liu Yici swallowed hard, immediately thinking of the recent request to seduce Song Classmate from the literature department. He only knew that Song Classmate's family was wealthy, and rumor had it that she was chauffeured to and from school in a luxury car.","Imagining numerous wealthy ladies swooning over his sleek suit, Liu Yici's vanity reached its peak. So when someone offered him money to seduce her, he quickly agreed.","\"I didn't do anything to her,\" Liu Yici said, beads of sweat rolling down his forehead, despite the mere few degrees outside. He was perspiring profusely.","Indeed, he hadn't done anything to Song Classmate. He had merely \"happened\" to appear before her, but she seemed rather indifferent, so he wasn't able to get close to her.","Although he had obtained her friend's messaging ID, that friend hadn't revealed anything useful either.","\"Is it that you didn't do anything to her, or didn't get the chance?\" Liu Yici's face was slapped by the man. \"With that appearance, you dare show your face to the lady? Aren't you afraid of offending her eyes? Who knows if you have any diseases?\"","Liu Yici felt deeply insulted but didn't dare say a word.","\"Brother, how should we deal with him?\" Liu Yici then realized that the person sitting in the chair was the one in charge. The man turned around, his jet-black eyes filled with cold intent. His lips parted, \"Follow the rules.\"","\"Yes. We will follow the rules.\"","Liu Yici suddenly felt the man seemed familiar, but couldn't quite place him. It wasn't until he was dragged out of the building that he realized - it was Senior Chiyu from Peking University, renowned throughout the entire nation.","It was said that Senior Chiyu's family was so powerful that he could make all of Hua Country tremble just by stomping his foot. So, had Liu Yici offended him?","Suddenly remembering something, a flash of fear crossed Liu Yici's eyes...","After the finals, the last campus gossip was about someone from the Art College becoming a gigolo, with photos of him and various wealthy ladies circulating. Not only that, but it was revealed that he had seduced and swindled others in the school out of their family fortunes for lavish spending.","In the end, this person caused such a severe scandal that he was expelled from the university.","After learning who it was, Xu Jiarong immediately blocked and deleted him. \"Oh my god, I hope he doesn't have any diseases that could transmit through his messages to me.\"","Song Luokui just laughed. \"How could that be possible? I've encountered him several times too, so wouldn't I be in worse shape?\"","Xu Jiarong: \"Oh right, we were sitting in front of him back then. Ugh, maybe we should get tested this weekend?\"","Song Luokui reassured her, \"It's fine. But if you're feeling uneasy, getting tested won't hurt. Let's focus on exams for now, though.\"","\"You're right.\"","After exams, everyone was relieved and able to return home. Xu Jiarong immediately went for a medical check-up and discovered she had some hair loss...","\"The doctor told me to get enough sleep and not stay up late...\" Xu Jiarong said.","Song Luokui stroked her own hair, realizing she had also been staying up quite late recently. \"I think I need to get enough sleep too. Can't afford to go bald.\" Her hair was absolutely not allowed to thin.","That night, while Chi Yu was still chatting with Song Luokui, she suddenly glanced at the time. \"It's bedtime for me. I should sleep.\"","Chi Yu looked at the clock, which showed only 10 PM...but Song Luokui had already hung up.","On Saturday, Chi Yu planned to take her to see a movie. Initially, he had arranged to have dinner first, then watch the movie, finishing around 10 PM. However, as soon as Song Luokui heard the timing, she felt it was too late.","\"Why don't we watch the movie in the afternoon, then have dinner and go home separately in the evening?\" Song Luokui suggested.","Chi Yu studied her for a moment. \"Have I done something unsatisfactory recently?\"","Song Luokui frowned. \"Why would you ask that?\"","Chi Yu replied, \"I wanted to spend more time with you in the evening.\"","Song Luokui pondered for a bit before explaining, \"I'm just afraid of staying up too late and losing my hair. What would I do if I go bald?\" She stroked her hair. \"My friend is already experiencing hair loss from staying up late.\"","Chi Yu: \"...\" No wonder she had been hanging up their video calls at 10 PM lately - she was genuinely going to sleep. He had worried she might be getting bored of him.","Chi Yu: \"Alright, let's skip the movie tomorrow. I'll take you somewhere else instead.\"","The next day, Chi Yu took her for a scalp and hair health check and treatment session that lasted three to four hours. The doctor told her, \"Miss Song, your scalp and hair are very healthy. It's clear you take excellent care of them, but regular maintenance would still be beneficial.\"","Song Luokui smiled happily. \"Thank you, doctor.\" As long as she didn't go bald, she was content.","Chi Yu: \"Are you happy now?\"","Song Luokui: \"Yes, thank you.\"","Chi Yu: \"Early to bed and early to rise is a good habit. Since we still have time, why don't we catch that movie first? Then we can have dinner, and I'll have you home before 10 PM. How's that?\"","\"Sounds good!\"","Over dinner, Chi Yu suddenly mentioned, \"Before the new year, my family may send your family a new year's gift. I'll deliver it in person.\"","Upon hearing this, Song Luokui responded, \"Then my family should reciprocate with a gift for yours.\"","With that, their relationship was brought into the open.","Song Luokui: \"My grandparents and great-grandparents will likely be present.\"","Chi Yu's grip tightened. \"I see. I'll prepare thoroughly.\"","Song Luokui squeezed his hand, seemingly sensing his nervousness. \"Don't worry, they'll be impressed by how accomplished you are.\"","Chi Yu smiled. \"Alright.\"","Song Luokui: \"Let me tell you about my family's interests...\"","\"Please do.\"","\"My grandfather enjoys playing chess, so you could play a game with him or gift him a chess set. My grandmother loves painting, and you're probably aware of her former position. As for my great-grandfather...\" Song Luokui frowned, feeling that her brother would likely find fault with anything Chi Yu gave him.","However, Chi Yu thought it was fine - among all those people, he considered Song Luokui's brother's opinion the least important. The others were the real decision-makers.","\"As for my brother... well... um...\" Song Luokui knitted her brows, thinking Chi Yu should understand her brother better than she did. The saying goes, 'Your enemy knows you best.'","Chi Yu: \"I'll prepare carefully.\"","After finishing their meal, the two walked hand-in-hand on the street. \"I remember the first time you took me out for a meal, I thought we would leave after eating, but I didn't expect you to walk with me and even buy me a sugar figure,\" Song Luokui said.","Chi Yu also recalled that there were vendors selling sugar figures on the side of the street. \"Would you like one now? I can go get one for you,\" he offered, about to head over.","Song Luokui quickly pulled him back. \"No need. We've just had a full meal. Besides, I don't want to carry it around. I just suddenly remembered how, back then, you...\"","Chi Yu looked at her. \"Back then, I wanted to spend more time with you.\" In truth, he had been a little nervous at the time, afraid she might reject his kindness. He had already known she was from the Art College, so to avoid any awkwardness, he had to find something to talk about."]},{"number":153,"title":"Chapter 153: Repayment","paragraphs":["\"So you didn't let me pay the bill back then on purpose?\" Song Luokui looked at him.","Chi Yu nodded, \"Yes.\"","Song Luokui kicked him lightly, \"I knew it, you had it all planned out.\"","Chi Yu pulled her into an embrace, \"Yes.\" If he hadn't planned it early, he was afraid that the possibility of holding her hand now might not have been him.","The two continued walking, fearing it was too cold outside. Chi Yu pulled her into a mall, where people were coming and going. They walked slowly, passing by a claw machine area. Chi Yu even exchanged coins for her and grabbed several plushies.","Song Luokui's eyes sparkled as she looked at him, \"How are you so good at this? It seems like you're good at everything.\"","Chi Yu: \"Not at all. I've just practiced for a long time.\"","Song Luokui didn't understand, \"Practiced?\"","Chi Yu: \"Yan Bei gave me one of these and told me to practice more, so that I wouldn't embarrass myself when I took you out to play.\"","Song Luokui: \"...You have quite a few strategists behind you.\"","Chi Yu didn't say anything, only tightening his grip on her hand. Seeing that it was about time, Chi Yu said, \"Let me take you back.\"","Song Luokui suddenly turned towards him, \"I'm going back to ChunWang Manor tonight.\"","Chi Yu paused, looking at her, his eyes seeming to light up, \"Okay.\"","Song Luokui took out her phone, \"Let me tell my brother that I won't be going home tonight.\"","Song Luokui sent a message to her brother. When Song Luosheng saw it, he frowned. Going to ChunWang Manor again? It couldn't be that she's with Chi Yu, could it?","Thinking that Chi Yu had already dealt with that person from school, Song Luosheng thought about it and decided to let it go. At least Chi Yu could get things done.","Back at ChunWang Manor, Song Luokui pointed towards her side, \"I'm going back this way.\"","Chi Yu: \"Okay.\"","Song Luokui thought she would go to her side and he would go to his, but he followed her in. Chi Yu blinked, \"Wherever you go, I'll go.\"","Song Luokui opened her eyes wide, \"No misbehaving.\"","Chi Yu chuckled softly, moving closer to her face, \"What misbehavior?\"","Song Luokui poked his face lightly with her finger, \"Like... seducing me.\"","Chi Yu gently pecked her lips, his tone full of temptation, \"This kind of misbehavior?\"","Song Luokui's ears and face immediately flushed red. Before she could say anything, Chi Yu kissed her again, \"If I seduce you, would you have your brother investigate me? Hmm?\"","\"I helped you deal with that seducer, so why don't I take his place?\" Chi Yu whispered enticingly.","Song Luokui blinked, \"You had someone spread those Liu Yici rumors...\"","Chi Yu: \"Yes, he really did that. And he shouldn't have tried to touch you.\" Chi Yu had longed for her for who knows how long, gradually luring her to his side bit by bit. How dare that person try to take her away?","Song Luokui: \"That person did look quite decent...\" Though he wore too much makeup. To be able to seduce so many rich ladies, he must have had some assets.","As soon as the words left her mouth, her wrist was tightly gripped, \"Decent?\"","Song Luokui looked up, seeing Chi Yu's gaze, and suddenly wanted to turn and run, but she was immediately scooped up, \"Okay, okay, he's definitely no match for you.\"","Song Luokui: \"I'm sorry, I'm sorry, he can't compare to you.\"","Song Luokui was placed on Chi Yu's lap as they sat on the couch. She stroked his face, \"He really can't compare to you.\"","Chi Yu wrapped his arms tightly around her waist, \"So since I've dealt with that person for you, how will you reward me?\"","Song Luokui's eyes rolled, \"What kind of reward do you want? Accompany you to work next week?\"","Chi Yu lifted her chin, \"Anything else?\"","Song Luokui looked at his eyes, then at his lips, her face flushing red again. She slowly leaned in and nibbled, \"Then I'll give you a kiss.\"","As soon as she finished speaking, her slender waist was tightly held, her whole body pressed against Chi Yu's...","Outside, a heavy snow began to fall. The snowflakes drifted past the window, through which the passionate couple inside could be seen tightly entwined...","The couch was stained in one corner. Song Luokui shyly buried herself in Chi Yu's embrace. Chi Yu carried her to the bedroom and set her down on the edge of the bed, kissing her several more times, \"Let me go draw you a bath.\"","Song Luokui finally looked up, her voice sweet, \"What about you?\" She accidentally glanced at a certain area and quickly looked away, afraid he might suffer.","Chi Yu: \"I'll go take a shower and then come keep you company, okay?\"","Song Luokui nodded, \"Okay.\"","...","Chi Yu returned to his side and entered the bathroom, immediately turning on the cold water. Outside, the temperature was probably around freezing, and although the indoor heating was on, that cold water was truly cold.","Chi Yu didn't seem to feel the cold at all. He was only afraid of losing control and hurting her. The water flowed down from his head, and it took a while for his heated body to cool down...","After Chi Yu had showered, he went back to Song Luokui's side. She was still bathing at that time. When she came out, she saw Chi Yu sitting there waiting.","He motioned for her to come over and took out a hair dryer from under the table, preparing to dry her hair for her. Song Luokui walked over, \"How are you always faster than me?\"","Chi Yu: \"What?\"","\"Showering faster than me.\"","Chi Yu: \"...Probably because I'm a guy.\"","Song Luokui thought about it and realized it made sense. He didn't need to remove makeup or do any other miscellaneous skincare routines. With short hair, a quick scrub would do.","But when she placed her hand on him, she suddenly felt a chill. She immediately turned to look at him, \"Did you take a cold shower?\"","Chi Yu paused, \"Yeah.\" He wouldn't lie to her.","Song Luokui was speechless for a moment, feeling guilty, \"That must have been tough?\"","Chi Yu turned off the hair dryer and set it aside, pulling her in for several more kisses, \"Consider this your compensation for me.\"","Song Luokui: ...Afraid it would arouse him again.","Chi Yu continued drying her hair.","After her hair was dry, Song Luokui lay down on the bed to sleep. Chi Yu turned off the lights for her, \"Good night, I'll have someone make your favorite breakfast tomorrow morning.\"","\"Okay.\"","Chi Yu closed the door after helping her turn off the lights, then went out to lock the door before returning to his own side.","The next morning, Chi Yu instructed the chef to prepare Song Luokui's favorite breakfast, planning to go over and wake her up. But as soon as he stepped out the door, he saw Song Luosheng coming out of the elevator, holding breakfast.","The two men made eye contact.","Chi Yu: ...","Song Luosheng looked at him, who was actually wearing casual clothes at home. He strode over, grabbed Chi Yu by the collar, \"Don't tell me you were at my sister's place yesterday.\"","Chi Yu: \"No, I was across the way.\"","Song Luosheng, \"Damn it!\" This made him even angrier. \"Since when have you been living over here?\"","Chi Yu told him a time period.","After Song Luokui woke up, she seemed to hear some noise from outside the door. She thought it was Chi Yu coming over, so she opened the door and came face to face with the two of them.","Song Luokui's first reaction upon seeing her brother was to close the door, and she actually did close it. Outside, Song Luosheng: ...","Chi Yu: ...","After a little while, Song Luokui opened the door again, revealing an ingratiating smile. \"Brother, why did you come over?\""]},{"number":154,"title":"Chapter 154: Big Brother is Moving In Too","paragraphs":["\"I've brought you breakfast, Kuikui. When did he move in?\" Song Luosheng asked.","Chi Yu opened his eyes and spoke nonsense: \"She didn't know when I moved in.\"","Song Luokui: ...She knew. She even went to eat the warm meal.","Song Luosheng looked at him, \"I knew you had ulterior motives!\" He suddenly realized that when he arranged this place for Kuikui, the two of them weren't together at the time. Song Luosheng widened his eyes, so this guy had planned this in advance!","\"Brother, why don't we go inside first?\"","Song Luosheng and Song Luokui went to her side, and Chi Yu immediately followed them inside. The two sat on the sofa, and Song Luokui poured them each a glass of water.","Song Luosheng noticed she was still wearing her pajamas, \"Kuikui, it's cold. Put on another layer.\"","Song Luokui glanced at the two of them, \"Then I'll go change into some clothes.\"","As soon as Song Luokui went into the room, Song Luosheng immediately stared at Chi Yu: \"Spill it, when did you plan this?\"","Chi Yu: \"It was just a coincidence.\"","Song Luosheng: \"What coincidence! Where did you sleep last night? Don't tell me you slept here.\" If he dared to say that, Song Luosheng could punch him. Recalling that Kuikui had told him before that she wouldn't go home and would stay at ChunWang Manor instead, so she must have been staying with this guy, right?","Song Luosheng thought that Chi Yu had seduced his sister Kuikui.","Chi Yu: \"No, I just came from my place. The chef made her favorite breakfast, so I just wanted her to come over and eat it.\"","Song Luosheng frowned, \"No need, I brought breakfast for Kuikui.\"","Chi Yu looked at what he had brought, \"The chef just made fresh and piping hot food, with a variety of her favorite dishes.\"","Song Luosheng gritted his teeth. This guy was showing off, wasn't he?","Song Luokui came out soon after, \"Brother, why did you come so early in the morning?\"","Song Luosheng immediately reverted to normal, \"I came to bring you breakfast. You didn't come home last night, were you with him?\"","Song Luokui felt a little guilty, but she had indeed slept alone last night. Fortunately, her brother didn't come over the previous time when she stayed at Chi Yu's place. If he had, and found out, tsk tsk tsk.","\"No, I slept at home by myself last night. You know I like to sleep early these days, by ten o'clock.\"","Song Luosheng thought about it, and it was true. He glanced at Chi Yu, \"That's good then.\"","Before he could ask anything else, Song Luokui quickly changed the subject to him, \"Brother, do you remember Su Congrong?\"","When Song Luosheng heard the name, he frowned, \"What about her?\" Of course he remembered her, they had only met briefly, and he had made himself very clear afterwards.","Song Luokui took a bite of the bun he had brought, \"She added me on WeChat before, asking me to hang out.\"","She thought Su Congrong probably wanted to get in touch with her brother through her. She didn't dislike the woman, but she didn't particularly like her either, since they weren't very familiar.","Song Luosheng liked whatever type of woman, it didn't matter to her, as long as her brother liked her. But it seemed her brother currently had no such interest.","Song Luosheng immediately said: \"No need to pay her any mind. Your brother doesn't like her.\"","Song Luokui: \"...Maybe she just wants to be friends with me?\"","She wanted her brother to know that he wasn't well-liked by everyone. When Su Congrong chatted with her, she did seem to be probing about her brother's information, so it was clear she was interested in him.","Song Luosheng paused, \"Kuikui, do you want to be friends with her? If you do, your brother won't object to you making friends, but I really don't like her.\"","He was just afraid his sister Kuikui would play matchmaker.","Song Luokui: \"Got it. But I'll still go out with her once to make things clear.\"","Chi Yu: \"I'll go with you.\"","Song Luosheng didn't object to that. At that moment, Song Luosheng received a phone call, and it seemed like there was some urgent matter. His expression wasn't very good. \"Book me a flight, I'll head over right away.\"","After hanging up, he looked at Song Luokui: \"Kuikui, your brother has to leave first. Don't stay here for the next few days. He doesn't have good intentions. Wait until I move in here too, then we'll talk.\"","With that, he left quickly.","Song Luokui: ......","After he left, Song Luokui looked at Chi Yu, \"What should we do? It seems like my brother wants to move in here too.\"","Chi Yu pulled her up, \"Let's go have breakfast first?\"","Song Luokui: \"What about the one my brother brought?\"","Chi Yu: \"I'll eat it.\"","Song Luokui: ...Her brother would definitely get angry if he found out.","On the other side, while rushing to the airport, Song Luosheng had someone buy the place above or below Song Luokui's residence at ChunWang Manor. He was planning to move in there.","\"Boss, won't that be too far from the company?\"","Song Luosheng: \"It's fine.\" He could just have the driver take him anyway. He wouldn't be staying there all the time, just when his sister was staying there. The main reason was to keep an eye on that guy Chi Yu. Kuikui hasn't even graduated yet, what if he seduces her into doing something bad?","Meanwhile, Song Luokui went to Chi Yu's place and ate breakfast, eating until her belly was round. Chi Yu ate the food that Song Luosheng had brought, and then joined her in eating what the chef had prepared.","The two lounged on the sofa watching TV, with Chi Yu rubbing her belly.","\"I was serious about going out with Miss Su this afternoon. Are you really going to accompany me?\" Song Luokui looked at Chi Yu.","Chi Yu: \"Mm-hmm.\" He didn't have anything else going on today anyway.","Song Luokui had arranged to meet Su Congrong at three in the afternoon, so they could still have lunch and take a nap at home first.","As Song Luokui was doing her makeup, Chi Yu watched her. Recalling that Chi Yu had mentioned he knew about makeup products before, so Song Luokui picked up an item and asked him what it was, unexpectedly he was able to answer correctly for all of them.","Song Luokui believed that he really did know about them.","\"I only know the names, but not how to use them,\" Chi Yu said.","Song Luokui looked at him, \"Of course you don't need to know how to use them.\"","They arrived at the equestrian club at 2:50 pm for their appointment with Su Congrong.","Chi Yu looked around the equestrian club, \"I have a horse kept here. Do you want me to take you riding later?\"","\"Sure.\"","Su Congrong had arrived early. She had originally thought only Song Luokui would come, and didn't expect the Chi family's young master to accompany her too. Recalling the recent gossip in their social circle, she looked at Song Luokui's face. This Miss Song's fortune was truly enviable.","\"Miss Song, Mr. Chi. Hello.\"","Song Luokui shook her hand, \"Hello, have you been waiting long?\"","With Chi Yu present, Su Congrong felt a bit awkward, \"No, I just got here not too long ago.\"","After Song Luokui let go of her hand, she looked at Chi Yu beside her and said, \"You go check on the horses first? I'll join you in a bit.\"","Chi Yu nodded and left.","After Chi Yu left, Su Congrong felt the air around her become much more open. This Chi family prince gave off such an oppressive presence. That casual glance of his made her feel as if she had done something wrong.","The saying \"A clear conscience fears no accusation\" didn't seem to apply in front of this man. Many in their social circle appeared afraid of him for some reason.","Song Luokui felt it too. She didn't know why Chi Yu made people feel so pressured, even though he had a rather pleasant appearance."]},{"number":155,"title":"Chapter 155: 《Riding Horses》","paragraphs":["Su Congrong and Song Luokui were walking slowly. \"Luokui, can you ride a horse? Do you want to try riding one?\"","Song Luokui shook her head. \"I can't.\" Who would have dared let her ride a horse when she was so clumsy as a child? Everyone was afraid she would be trampled by the horse.","Su Congrong was surprised, as she knew Song Luo was quite good at horseback riding. However, she also felt a bit awkward. \"Sorry, I arranged an unsuitable venue. I didn't know you couldn't ride. I thought you could since your brother is so skilled at it.\"","Song Luokui nodded. \"My brother is indeed good at horseback riding. It's okay, even though I can't ride, I can learn.\"","Su Congrong said, \"Shall we try? I'll ask the riding instructor to find you a small horse to ride and play around.\"","Song Luokui didn't refuse. \"Sure.\"","\"Let's go change into riding clothes first.\"","\"Okay.\"","The two soon changed into riding clothes and picked out a small horse. The riding instructor stood by to guide Song Luokui, while Su Congrong rode her large horse.","Song Luokui mounted the small horse, following the instructor's guidance. Afterward, the instructor walked in front, leading the horse at a slow pace. Su Congrong rode her horse alongside them.","Sitting high on the horse's back, Su Congrong had to look down to see Song Luokui. This elevated angle suddenly made her feel good.","Song Luokui didn't mind and kept petting the small horse. The instructor said the horse would listen to her after she became familiar with it.","As they walked and chatted, Su Congrong suddenly asked, \"I noticed Young Master Chi seems quite fond of you. How did you two meet?\"","She thought they might have met at a banquet or event.","Song Luokui replied, \"We've known each other since childhood. We lived in the same compound.\"","Su Congrong was surprised. \"So you two were childhood friends?\"","Song Luokui said, \"Not really. We weren't close as children but became familiar as we grew older.\"","\"Is that so? Did your brother have any female friends in the compound?\"","Song Luokui glanced at her. Actually, she wouldn't mind if Su Congrong became her sister-in-law, but it seemed her brother didn't have feelings for her. She thought it would be better to give up on the idea.","\"Of course he had many female acquaintances.\" However, her brother mostly played with boys, and the girls he knew were just acquaintances. The ones he was familiar with were the ones Song Luokui played with.","Su Congrong's smile suddenly froze on her face. \"Then... was there any girl he was particularly close with?\"","Song Luokui looked at her. \"Miss Su, I accepted your invitation today to clarify things with you.\"","Su Congrong looked down at her. \"What do you mean?\"","Song Luokui sighed. \"Miss Su, I know you like my brother, but trying to use me won't work.\"","Su Congrong's eyelids fluttered. \"I... I just want to be friends with Miss Song.\"","Song Luokui said, \"Miss Su, you don't need to be like that. Although my brother dotes on me, he won't listen to me in this regard. He even controls me. I told him about going out with you today, and he indeed doesn't stop me from making friends, but... he won't let me bring anyone to meet him.\"","\"Miss Su, you should understand. Actually, you're quite accomplished, Miss Su. There are beautiful flowers everywhere...\" She truly didn't want a beautiful woman to be heartbroken because of her brother.","Before Song Luokui could finish, Su Congrong interrupted, \"What if I ask you to give up Young Master Chi, would you be willing to if he doesn't like you?\"","The smile disappeared from Song Luokui's face. \"Miss Su, you probably don't know, but it was Chi Yu who pursued me, not the other way around. And the situation between my brother and you is nothing like the one between Chi Yu and me.\"","Su Congrong said, \"I want to ask Miss Song... um... what methods did you use to make Young Master Chi pursue you? Sorry, I may not have put it well, but that's what everyone in our circle says. I just want to learn from you.\"","Song Luokui's expression instantly turned cold. \"Methods? Everyone in the circle says that? Which 'everyone'? Who else said that?\"","Su Congrong shrank back. \"Just... the girls in our circle.\"","Song Luokui raised her eyes. \"I thought Miss Su was intelligent, but it seems...\" Song Luokui shook her head.","Su Congrong immediately apologized. \"I'm really sorry, I just heard it so much that...\" She originally wanted to say she wanted to learn some tips on pursuing men, like sharing strategies among girlfriends.","Song Luokui asked the riding instructor to stop. \"Miss Su, I'm a bit tired from riding. I'll go back and rest first.\"","Su Congrong didn't dare say anything. \"Oh, alright.\"","After dismounting and sitting down to drink some tea, Song Luokui saw Chi Yu riding a horse over. She told Su Congrong, \"I'll go find my boyfriend first. You can do as you please, Miss Su.\"","Su Congrong stammered but didn't say anything in the end. She watched as Song Luokui approached Chi Yu. Chi Yu immediately dismounted his horse, and the two said something she couldn't hear, but she could tell the Young Master Chi was truly gentle with Song Luokui.","Not only that, but he even picked her up and sat her on his large horse. After that, he mounted the horse himself, holding her as they rode off.","Having spent a long time in this circle, Su Congrong had seen many men who acted arrogant and superior. In her view, men of high status would never lower themselves for anyone, while their female companions would humble themselves before the men.","Of course, there were also normal ones, but from what she had seen, the men usually held the dominant position. Initially, she thought Song Luokui and the Young Master Chi would be like that, and some people in their circle thought so too.","But it seemed... she was mistaken. Recalling what Song Luokui had said earlier, \"It was Chi Yu who pursued me.\"","Su Congrong suddenly laughed at herself. Of course, why would a person like Song Luokui need to humble herself? It was just her own lack of experience. Thinking about her own family... Su Congrong couldn't even laugh. If she couldn't have this accomplished person who didn't like her, would she really have to let her family arrange for her to marry some undesirable options?","On the other side, Song Luokui was nestled in Chi Yu's embrace as the horse walked slowly. She said unhappily, \"Does everyone think I used some tricks to make you pursue me?\"","Chi Yu immediately turned to look at her. \"What's wrong? Who made you angry? Did that person say something to you earlier?\"","Song Luokui said, \"You tell me first if it's true or not.\"","Chi Yu stroked her face, \"Of course not, it was I who used tricks to reverse the situation.\"","Song Luokui tilted her head back and wrinkled her nose, \"I guess some people in the circle must think so, hmph, it's just that you're too attractive.\"","Chi Yu: \"It's my fault. I'll give myself to you as an apology.\"","Song Luokui burst out laughing, \"Is this how you apologize? You think too highly of yourself.\"","Seeing her laugh, Chi Yu also laughed, \"Don't mind those people, shall I take you for a ride?\"","\"Yes.\"","With a \"whoa,\" the valiant horse beneath them began galloping swiftly. Song Luokui faced the wind, occasionally turning her head to smile at Chi Yu, \"So refreshing.\"","She suddenly recalled the lyrics from the Red Dust Companions in the drama Pearl Xiaoxiao, hmm, she felt that song suited the occasion.","Chi Yu was delighted to see her happy, and increased their speed."]},{"number":156,"title":"Chapter 156: The Consequences of Riding a Horse","paragraphs":["Riding a horse is enjoyable for a moment, but afterwards the thighs ache.","After dismounting, Song Luokui's walk became slightly strange. Earlier, she had already ridden a small horse for two rounds, and then sat on Chi Yu's large horse for a few more rounds, causing her thighs to ache terribly. She felt that the area near the top of her thighs might have been chafed.","Chi Yu noticed, \"Are you alright?\"","Song Luokui felt that area was a little embarrassing, \"I'm okay, just a bit sore and achy.\"","Chi Yu simply picked her up, \"I'll massage you when we get back.\"","Upon returning to ChunWang Manor, Chi Yu took her straight to his quarters. On the way back, he had already instructed the chef to prepare a meal, so they could eat as soon as they arrived home.","During the meal, Song Luokui seemed a bit distracted, mainly because her thighs were truly aching. Seeing that she was eating little, Chi Yu did not force her to eat more, only instructing someone to make small cakes and place them in the fridge. There was still warm chicken soup on the stove, so she could eat if she got hungry later that night.","After the meal, Chi Yu placed his hand on her thigh and gave it a squeeze, causing Song Luokui to let out a painful yelp, her eyes welling up with tears.","Chi Yu sensed something was amiss and immediately guessed what it might be. He carried her straight to the bedroom, \"Be good, take off your pants so I can take a look.\"","Song Luokui's face turned beet red. The pain was no longer her concern as she folded her legs inward, \"I'm fine. No need to look.\"","Chi Yu frowned, \"Listen to me, let me take a look to help you.\"","Song Luokui: \"...But, but, it's so embarrassing.\" Her voice grew softer with each word.","Chi Yu seemed to realize something and suddenly felt a bit hot. He stood up, \"I'll go get you a dress.\"","Chi Yu went and brought her a short dress for her to change into. Song Luokui changed under the covers and only came out, red-faced, after putting it on.","As she moved, her legs ached terribly again, causing Song Luokui to furrow her brow and let out a pained \"Hiss hiss hiss.\"","Chi Yu immediately looked over, crouched down, and spread her legs to examine them. On her fair, creamy thighs was a reddened, bleeding spot where the skin had been chafed from horseback riding.","Chi Yu swiftly went to retrieve the first aid kit. Song Luokui's ears and neck were flushed crimson as she pressed down on her dress with her hands.","As the iodine solution was applied, Song Luokui's entire leg jolted, the pain causing tears to well up again. \"Ow~\"","Chi Yu's hand stopped, his heart aching for her, \"Should I call a doctor?\"","Upon hearing this, Song Luokui replied, \"It's fine, you can do it.\" It wasn't that serious, only that her delicate skin made it appear worse than it was. Song Luokui gripped a pillow with one hand, \"I can bear it, you can keep applying it.\"","Seeing her insistence, Chi Yu continued treating her. Song Luokui bit her lip, trying her best not to make a sound, only gripping the pillow tighter with the hand holding down her dress. With this motion, her dress rode up slightly. Chi Yu's hand paused as he swallowed hard...","After a long struggle, Chi Yu finally finished treating her wound. They were both drenched in sweat, one from pain, the other from...","Chi Yu cleaned up, washed his hands, then came over and gently wiped away her tears. Seeing her reddened, bitten lips, he leaned down and gave them a lick before deepening the kiss...","After a while, Chi Yu kissed her eyes, \"Want to rest for a bit?\"","Song Luokui shook her head, not feeling sleepy.","Chi Yu: \"Then watch TV?\"","Song Luokui nodded.","Chi Yu turned on the TV beside the bed. The two leaned against the headboard watching it. Midway, Chi Yu received a call, stepped out to get his laptop, and sat working on it while Song Luokui watched TV intently.","It got quite late. Song Luokui wanted to take a shower, or at least freshen up if she couldn't fully bathe. As she moved, Chi Yu looked over, \"What's wrong?\"","A little embarrassed, Song Luokui said, \"I want to freshen up a bit.\"","Chi Yu stood right up, \"I'll go draw you a hot bath.\"","The hot bath was ready quickly. Chi Yu carried her straight into the bathroom and sat her on a small stool by the tub, bringing her clothes and everything she needed in with them. \"Call me if you need anything, I'll be right outside.\"","\"Okay.\"","On the other side, Song Luosheng knew she was still at Unnamed Mountain Lake and called her immediately. Chi Yu answered and informed the Song Luokui inside, then put the call on speaker for her to listen.","\"Don't tell me you're in my sister's room right now,\" Song Luosheng said sternly.","Chi Yu: \"She chafed her legs horseback riding today, so she's with me as I care for her.\"","Song Luosheng thought about how Song Luokui had mentioned meeting up with Su Congrong that morning and immediately guessed they must have gone horseback riding together.","\"You should take her back home. Aunt Gui is there to care for her.\"","Chi Yu: \"The elderly can't be expected to watch over her all night, can they?\"","Song Luosheng: \"If not, there are still female bodyguards around. What business do you have getting involved?\"","Chi Yu: \"I'm her boyfriend, so it is my business.\"","As Song Luokui emerged, she overheard the two arguing. Seeing her, Chi Yu immediately put down the phone and carried her, \"Why did you walk out on your own? Let me carry you back to bed.\"","Song Luosheng shouted from the other end, \"What are you going to do to my precious Luokui?\"","Chi Yu: \"...She's injured. What could I possibly do to her? I'm not a beast.\"","Song Luosheng: \"...Fine, just take good care of Luokui. If anything happens to her, I won't let you off easy.\"","Song Luokui immediately took the phone from Chi Yu's hand, \"Brother, I'm fine.\"","Song Luosheng: \"Luokui, are you in pain?\"","Song Luokui: \"No pain, I'm alright. You're busy, Chi Yu will take care of me.\"","Song Luosheng sighed, \"My little sister is all grown up and doesn't need her brother anymore.\"","Song Luokui immediately turned coy, \"No way, I still need my brother. You're on a business trip, right? Remember to buy me a gift.\"","Song Luosheng: \"I will, I definitely will.\"","\"Thank you, brother.\"","Before hanging up, Song Luosheng issued another warning to Chi Yu.","After the call ended, Song Luokui looked at Chi Yu, \"Sorry about that, my brother just worries about me.\"","Chi Yu: \"I know.\" If he had a little sister, he would worry too. He stroked her head, \"Get some rest now.\"","\"Okay.\"","The next morning when she woke up, Song Luokui's legs felt even more sore and achy, but the wound had healed considerably. Chi Yu wanted to carry her, but she refused, \"No need, I can walk myself. I'm not that feeble.\"","Chi Yu supported her, \"If you want to be pampered, you have every right to be pampered.\"","Song Luokui thought it made sense but still didn't let Chi Yu carry her. Maybe walking a bit would help.","\"Why aren't you going to work today?\" Song Luokui asked curiously.","Chi Yu: \"If I'm not there, the company might as well not operate. It can't run without me.\"","Song Luokui thought to herself that she had been going to the company less often lately. However, today she didn't go to the company, and Li Bei brought some documents from the company. She also knew that her boss had a boyfriend, and she had even heard that he was the boss of the Shan Yu Group.","She had seen him a few times before, but she didn't expect that when she came to ChunWang Manor, she wouldn't be entering her boss's home, but rather her boss's boyfriend's home across the street.","Previously, she knew that someone had bought the place across the street, and it turned out it was her boss's boyfriend who bought it!","Just as she arrived, she saw her boss and her boyfriend, who was also the boss of the Shan Yu Group, sitting on the sofa. The Shan Yu boss was even peeling an orange for her boss, holding it in front of her so she could spit out the seeds.","When Li Bei came in, Song Luokui waved her over, \"Come and sit down.\""]},{"number":157,"title":"Chapter 157: Attending the Annual Conference","paragraphs":["Li Bei sat next to Song Luokui, taking out some documents and reporting the situation to her, also mentioning some matters within the company.","\"Someone is offering a high price to poach Miss Zhou. Although Miss Zhou's contract is still with our company, it will be useless if someone can help her pay the breach of contract fee.\"","Song Luokui: \"Which company wants to poach her? Zhou QingRong's thoughts are more important, what does she think about it currently?\"","Li Bei: \"For now, she doesn't seem to have any intention of leaving the company, but we can't be sure about the future.\" After all, their company is just a small one in the entertainment circle, and it's understandable if she wants to jump ship to a bigger company.","Song Luokui: \"If she wants to leave, there's nothing we can do about it. Let them poach her if they want.\"","Li Bei: \"It seems there's also someone threatening her that if she doesn't go, they'll release her dark secrets, though it's still unclear what those dark secrets are.\"","Song Luokui: \"Didn't we investigate her background before signing the contract? Is there something she hid from us or did something happen later on?\"","Li Bei: \"It's still uncertain, as we don't know what those dark secrets are. That side only made threats. But Yu Manager should be able to handle it properly.\"","Song Luokui nodded: \"That's good then.\" Picking up a pen, Song Luokui signed document after document, asking for clarification when she didn't understand something. Chi Yu stood by without a word, being the first time he saw his beloved working so diligently, which was quite attractive.","Li Bei stayed there for about two hours. During lunchtime, she also had her meal there. She noticed Chi Yu carefully supporting his wife, Song Luokui, as she walked with an awkward gait, Li Bei's gaze suddenly became somewhat suggestive...","As soon as Song Luokui turned her head and saw her look, she immediately said: \"I got hurt from horseback riding yesterday, haha.\"","Li Bei realized, thinking it was... excessive intimacy.","While eating, she noticed Chi Yu's attentive care towards his wife, it was natural care. She sighed at her boss's charm. Well, if she were a man, with her boss's appearance, she would want to cherish her in the palm of her hand too.","After finishing the meal, Li Bei left with a bag of fruits. Before leaving, she suddenly remembered something, \"By the way, Yu Manager said they will be preparing for the company's annual party before the new year. I wanted to ask if the boss will attend?\"","Song Luokui thought for a moment and nodded, \"I'll attend.\"","\"Okay, I'll report back to Yu Manager.\"","\"Mm-hmm.\"","After Li Bei left, Chi Yu asked: \"When is your company's annual party? Can I come along?\"","Song Luokui looked at his expectant gaze, \"You want to attend? What about your company's annual party?\"","Chi Yu grabbed her hand, \"I want to attend your company's annual party with you. Will you come to my company's annual party with me too?\" Last time, they didn't get a proper opportunity, so this year he wanted her to join him.","Song Luokui wanted to agree immediately, but then thought of her brother, \"Wait a moment, I think I need to ask Song Hua when his company's annual party is scheduled. If your two companies happen to have their parties at the same time...\"","Chi Yu also realized this issue, \"I'll ask about it.\"","Song Luokui: \"Yeah, I'll also ask when ours is scheduled. If all three happen to be at the same time, then it won't work.\"","\"Okay.\"","When Song Luosheng called again later, Song Luokui asked him about the annual party.","Song Luosheng: \"Should we continue going together with our brother this year?\"","Song Luokui: \"It depends on the situation. I also need to attend my own company's annual party.\"","Song Luosheng understood, \"We can arrange different schedules. Let me ask about it.\"","\"Okay.\"","Chi Yu directly had someone inquire about the timing of Song Hua's annual party, determined to schedule his event on a different date from Song Hua, so that his beloved could join him for the annual party.","February 8th was the Chinese New Year. Song Hua scheduled his party on January 28th, so Chi Yu scheduled his on January 31st, while Song Luokui's company scheduled theirs on January 26th.","Song Luokui's company took their vacation earlier, starting in February, unlike Shan Yu and Song Hua's companies, which followed the national holiday schedule but allowed for annual leave.","Chi Yu also told Song Luokui: \"On February 6th, my family will send New Year gifts to your family.\"","Song Luokui: \"I haven't told my parents about this yet. I'll let them know to stay home that day.\" As for the New Year gifts, she would need to prepare return gifts as well.","\"Okay.\"","After dinner that evening, Chi Yu changed her dressings in a suggestive manner and sent her back to her residence, as he had to go to the office the next day, and it was better for her to return home.","Back home, Song Luokui felt both embarrassed and annoyed upon seeing the bite marks on her thighs, pounding a pillow in frustration.","Two days later, Song Luokui's thighs had healed, and since she had agreed to accompany Chi Yu to work, she went to Tian Yu to handle some matters in the morning and then headed to Shan Yu in the afternoon.","The receptionist was already familiar with her and knew about her relationship with the big boss. Upon seeing her, the receptionist warmly approached her, \"Miss Song, you're here. The elevator is this way, let me take you up. The boss is waiting for you upstairs.\"","Song Luokui smiled at her: \"Thank you.\"","Taking the direct elevator to Chi Yu's office, as soon as the doors opened, she met his gaze. Chi Yu made a call to have tea and snacks brought in.","When Song Luokui arrived, she thought of a question and asked Chi Yu: \"Will that Miss Chen Xinyuan still be waiting for you downstairs?\"","Chi Yu thought for a moment before recalling who she was referring to, \"No, she has latched onto someone from the Wei Family and hasn't shown up here since.\"","Song Luokui: \"So does that mean the Chen Xinyuan family is now on the same boat as the Wei Family?\"","Chi Yu: \"Probably temporarily. After all, there are no permanent friends.\"","Song Luokui: \"You're right. But our families will be...\"","Chi Yu took her hand, \"We will have the most solid kinship relationship.\"","Song Luokui blushed, murmuring: \"It hasn't reached that stage yet.\" They were just dating.","Chi Yu: \"To outsiders, it already appears to be that kind of relationship. Otherwise, people wouldn't be so eager to break us up. Didn't someone try to... murder me when I treated my brothers to a meal at the restaurant before?\"","Song Luokui's mouth twitched, glaring at him, \"That should be called seduction.\"","Chi Yu chuckled lightly, \"Seducing me and trying to murder me are the same thing.\" If he seduced Song Luokui, wouldn't that mean trying to break up her relationship with her sweetheart? If his sweetheart broke up with him, he'd feel like it was no different from murder.","Song Luokui said, \"So someone was scheming behind the scenes.\"","Chi Yu nodded, \"Yes, and the person who tried to approach you at school before was the same. It was all premeditated, so don't trust other men easily, okay?\"","Song Luokui poked his face, \"You shouldn't easily trust other women either.\"","Chi Yu leaned in and kissed her cheek, \"I only trust you.\"","Song Luokui yawned, since she had to go to the company in the morning, she had woken up a little early today, and it was just noon now, the perfect time for an afternoon nap.","Chi Yu pulled her to a side resting room, \"Want to take a nap with me?\""]},{"number":158,"title":"Chapter 158: Attending Annual Conference 02","paragraphs":["Chi Yu didn't say that during her final exams those days, he had attended a private party where he encountered her, and he went straight into the restroom, but he was directly kicked unconscious by a kick from Chi Yu.","The party host came over immediately, Chi Yu said coldly that he suspected someone wanted to kill him. It was obvious to anyone with eyes that it was a seduction attempt, but Chi Yu insisted it was an attempted murder, and immediately had the person taken away.","One after another, Chi Yu now goes out surrounded by people.","Song Luokui took off her jacket and lay down on the bed, quickly falling asleep, and Chi Yu also lay beside her, hugging her for an afternoon nap.","By 2 pm, the two woke up at the same time. Chi Yu tidied up her clothes before taking her back to the office.","In the afternoon, Chi Yu had a meeting to attend. Song Luokui sat in his office playing games, reading books and the like. In the middle when she felt bored, she went downstairs for a walk, and Chi Yu had instructed a secretary to accompany her.","After work, Chi Yu hugged her and went for dinner. It was the peak commuting period, and many employees saw the scene of their boss hugging his girlfriend into the car at the gate.","\"No wonder Song Hua's boss was so angry. The boss's girlfriend is really beautiful, with a great temperament. I heard she's Song Hua's boss's younger sister.\"","\"Hahaha, can you imagine our boss seducing Song Hua's boss's younger sister? That's quite amusing.\"","\"I think it's not that simple, it's probably an arranged marriage between wealthy families. The emotions of the rich are never that pure.\"","\"I don't think so, I actually feel that the emotions of the rich are purer since they're not lacking in money. It probably arose from mutual interests.\"","\"I heard that the boss's family and the Song family used to live in the same place when they were young, so they probably knew each other since childhood.\"","\"I wonder if the boss will bring Song Xiaojie to the company's annual party this year.\"","\"He probably will.\"","...","That night, Song Moqian and Sheng Rong were both at home, and Song Luokui told them about Chi Yu coming to deliver New Year gifts.","Sheng Rong: \"That's great, we should invite your grandparents and parents over to meet him at that time.\"","Song Moqian: \"I got it, I'll be home then.\"","It was the end of the year, and Tian Yu was quite busy as well. Song Luokui only went to Chi Yu's place twice and didn't go again as she had her own matters to attend to.","As for the gossip about Zhou QingRong, there were rumors that she might have been kept by her own boss, saying things like Yu Hui wasn't the boss, but the real boss behind the scenes was a greasy middle-aged man with a big belly, and without his support, she wouldn't have become famous so quickly.","When Song Luokui heard this, she found it quite amusing. When did she become a greasy middle-aged man with a big belly?","In response to this gossip, the company directly issued a statement saying that all the company's employees were women, even the boss was a woman, and there wasn't a single man.","But then some people questioned it, how could a company not have a single man? Was this a scam? Even if they wanted to refute the rumors, this wasn't the way to do it.","Li Bei: \"The manager Yu Hui wants to do a live broadcast during the annual party, so everyone can see if there really aren't any men.\"","Song Luokui hesitated for a moment, \"But my boyfriend might come with me.\"","Li Bei: \"Manager Yu Hui has considered this issue and said that they will mosaic and label you and your boyfriend as 'the boss' and 'the boss's boyfriend' at that time.\"","Song Luokui: ...","\"Alright then.\"","Soon it was the day of Tian Yu's annual party. The company even set up a red carpet. Song Luokui walked down the red carpet arm-in-arm with Chi Yu, but their position was at the very back, with the company's artists walking in front.","Apart from Zhou QingRong, there were a few other artists who caused a bit of a stir, but this red carpet event was mainly for the employees to have fun, and some even started cosplaying.","During the live broadcast, a large wave of Zhou QingRong's fans swarmed in.","\"Where's my goddess Zhou QingRong?\"","\"Gorgeous goddess Zhou QingRong [heart] [heart] [heart]\"","\"A lifetime's beauty, eternally youthful, the super gorgeous Zhou QingRong.\"","\"This is the company's annual party, everyone please don't keep spamming.\"","\"This annual party seems quite grand.\"","...","At first, the employees walked quite properly, but later the vibe gradually changed, and those watching the live broadcast were laughing heartily.","\"Wow, is this company really that open-minded?\"","\"Did you all see? It seems they really are all women.\"","\"A women's company, I love it.\"","The host: \"... Now, please welcome our gorgeous beauty Zhou QingRong.\"","Zhou QingRong, wearing a sparkling sequined long dress, walked down the red carpet with a smile, waving at everyone. At this point, the live broadcast screen was filled with Zhou's fans spamming.","\"Ahhh, the baby is too beautiful!\"","\"Oh my god! Is that a haute couture dress? Wuwuwu, the baby is even wearing haute couture at the company's annual party now!\"","The fans kept praising her, and occasionally a troll would appear but was quickly flooded out.","After Zhou QingRong passed, the host solemnly said, \"Next, let us warmly welcome our boss, Ms. Song, and her boyfriend, Mr. Chi.\"","\"Here they come, didn't they say Zhou QingRong's boss was a greasy old man? It's clearly a woman, okay?\"","Song Luokui was dressed in a black women's suit today, with a cool makeup look. Her hair was all slicked back, hanging down to her waist, with a fringed earring. All in black, she looked both beautiful and cool.","Chi Yu was dressed similarly in all black.","As soon as the two appeared on camera, everyone only saw two frog heads.","???","\"Why did they mosaic the boss?\"","\"Does the boss not want to be seen?\"","At this point, management appeared: The boss is kind-hearted and of noble status, so she doesn't like to be on camera, hence the mosaic. Please understand.","\"But didn't you say there were no men? There's a man next to the boss.\"","\"Sister, that's the boss's boyfriend.\"","\"It's probably a kept boy toy, right? Otherwise, why wouldn't he appear on camera either.\"","Regardless of what the live broadcast viewers were saying, everyone in the company was quite excited when the two appeared, shouting loudly: \"Boss, boss, ahhhh!\"","\"The boss is so handsome!\"","\"The boss is so beautiful!\"","\"The boss is the handsomest, coolest, and most beautiful!\"","Live broadcast viewer: \"Why are they more excited than when Zhou QingRong appeared?\"","Someone retorted: \"Obviously, they're your breadwinners, the ones paying you. Of course everyone's excited. If it were me, I'd be excited too.\"","\"I checked this company on a job recruitment site, and their benefits and compensation are truly amazing.\"","After the red carpet event, the live stream shifted its focus to the audience. Song Luokui and Chi Yu were seated in the center, but whenever the camera panned over them, their heads were blurred, maintaining their absolute non-appearance on screen.","The annual gala commenced with a group singalong, followed by performances from the company's artists, including a solo singing act by Zhou QingRong, as well as skits and other acts. Interspersed throughout were raffle draws, with every attendee guaranteed a prize, and consolation prizes available for those who didn't win the main draws.","Viewers watching the live stream noticed that the giveaway prizes were either products from Song Hua or Shan Yu.","\"Have you noticed that it seems like both Shan Yu and Song Hua are sponsoring this event?\"","\"Wow, this company must be really impressive.\"","\"I heard Zhou QingRong was headhunted by a major company but turned them down. I think this company is no small fry.\""]},{"number":159,"title":"Chapter 159: Attending Annual Conference 03","paragraphs":["\"Although the boss and her boyfriend's faces are blurred, just from this view I think they must be a handsome guy and a beautiful girl.\"","\"Not necessarily, it could be an older woman with a young buck?\"","\"It's also possible that it's an older woman and an older man together, right?\"","...","Ignoring the online chatter, Song Luokui and Chi Yu were intently watching the performance on stage. Occasionally the two would lean in close and whisper to each other, while the employee Xin Xiaoxiao sitting behind them kept glancing at them.","She noticed that from the time they walked the red carpet to when they sat down, the two of them hadn't let go of each other's hands. The boss's boyfriend looked at her with such a gentle expression in his eyes.","When she found out that the boss's boyfriend was the boss of Shan Yu, she was quite shocked. But then again, her own boss was the younger sister of the wealthy and powerful Song Hua.","It seems the handsome guy with the beautiful girl gossip better be put to rest.","In the middle, Song Luokui went on stage to give a speech and draw prizes, and Chi Yu by her side kept holding her hand, not letting go. \"I'll be back soon,\" Song Luokui stroked his face, and he finally released her.","When she gave her speech on stage, her face was also blurred out. Tonight was mainly for the employees to celebrate, although Song Luokui participated, she mostly just watched.","It wasn't until 10 p.m. that the annual party finally ended, and Song Luokui took a group photo with everyone from the company.","\"Goodbye, boss.\"","\"Boss, we're leaving now, bye bye.\"","\"Bye, get home safely.\" Song Luokui bid farewell to everyone, and after most people had left, she and Chi Yu also left by car.","On the way back, she was still excited, chatting nonstop. \"I suddenly feel like it's great that I run such a company.\"","Tonight, many people thanked her when they spoke after their performances, thanking her for the opportunity she provided. Some even cried. It reminded Song Luokui of when she attended Song Hua's annual party before, and many people also expressed gratitude to the company then.","Now it was her turn, and she suddenly felt a sense of great accomplishment.","Song Luokui looked at Chi Yu, \"So it must be the same for you, right? Managing such a large company, providing jobs for thousands of people, and earning a lot of money for the country. Don't you feel happy too?\"","Chi Yu smiled at her, \"Yes. We're the same.\"","The two exchanged smiles, and Song Luokui leaned on his shoulder as Chi Yu immediately put his arm around her shoulders.","...","When Song Luosheng learned that Song Luokui had brought Chi Yu to Tian Yu's annual party, he was quite jealous. \"Why didn't you invite me to go along?\"","Song Luokui: \"...Because you just got back from a business trip, I didn't want you to be too tired.\"","Hearing this, Song Luosheng's mood improved. \"Remember to go with me to Song Hua's annual party.\"","Song Luokui: \"Yeah, yeah.\"","This year's Tian Yu annual party was different from previous years. In the past, they would sit and watch performances. But this year it was more like a banquet style, where everyone could also dance socially, and they even hired a live band.","There was food all around, and everyone could go up on the stage in the middle. Song Luokui entered hand-in-hand with Song Luosheng, and the department managers immediately came over to greet the boss.","After Song Luosheng said a few words, he went up on stage to announce the start of the night's annual party, followed by an opening dance which he performed with Song Luokui. Many people surrounded them, watching this pair of good-looking siblings.","The boss's younger sister had a boyfriend now, who was even the boss of Shan Yu company. Everyone thought it was quite exciting, but no one called her a traitor. After all, they were just employees, how would they know about the dealings of the upper social circles?","It was rumored that Shan Yu's boss was the crown prince of Jing City, and their own boss's family was no slouch either. Some guessed it was some grand aristocratic marriage alliance, so their own boss couldn't stop it either way.","As for the real situation, only those close to Song Luokui and Song Luosheng would know the truth.","After one dance ended, the two stepped off the stage to applause from everyone.","The second song began, and one by one, people took to the floor and started dancing. Some had even taken lessons beforehand. There were male-female pairs, male-male pairs, and female-female pairs. It didn't matter if they didn't dance well - it was just the annual party after all, just there to have fun, no need to take it too seriously.","Everyone was so happy. Song Luosheng led Song Luokui to sit on the side and brought her some food to eat. \"Have a good time tonight.\"","\"Got it, brother.\"","In the middle, Song Luosheng left for a while, and when the next song started, Song Luokui saw him go up and dance with one of Song Hua's celebrity endorsers - the actress Mu Yinger whom she had met before.","Although Song Luokui saw them dancing together, her brother remained quite the gentleman. After that dance ended, the atmosphere suddenly changed to a disco vibe.","The entire banquet hall was filled with colorful flashing lights, and some people were rapping on mics. Everyone excitedly jumped up and started dancing, cheering, singing loudly... Song Luosheng walked over smiling and pulled her into the fray...","In the middle, Song Luokui asked Song Luosheng, \"Brother, if you liked a celebrity, Mom and Dad probably wouldn't object.\" Their grandparents might have some objections, but would likely give in eventually.","Song Luosheng had been in a great mood, but upon hearing this, his brow immediately furrowed. \"Who told you what now?\"","Song Luokui looked confused, \"No one, I just had that thought when I saw you dancing with Mu Xiaojie earlier.\"","She wondered, since her brother didn't like people in their circles, did he perhaps prefer someone from the entertainment industry?","Song Luosheng ruffled her hair. \"I don't like them, don't overthink it.\"","Song Luokui frowned, \"But you're already in your mid-twenties, you've never liked a single girl before?\"","Song Luosheng: \"Don't worry about me, I just want to make a fortune. You focus on being happy. If Chi Yu treats you badly, tell me right away. Who knows how many more annual parties we'll get to attend together.\" He sighed.","Song Luokui: \"As long as you need me to, I'll come with you every year, if it doesn't conflict with my company's schedule.\"","Song Luosheng: \"Then it's a deal.\"","\"Yeah, it's a deal.\"","...By the time the annual party ended, Song Luosheng was drunk again, as many people had toasted him, unlike her company's party where most people just drank non-alcoholic beverages, though they could drink if they wanted.","As she helped the intoxicated Song Luosheng walk to the parking lot, unexpectedly Chi Yu showed up. Song Luokui was stunned, \"How did you get here?\"","Chi Yu took Song Luosheng directly from Zhou Yuan's hands, \"I'll pick you... up.\"","Zhou Yuan on the side: ... Mainly wanted to pick up Sister Luokui, right?","Chi Yu put Song Luosheng in the car, then Song Luokui followed him into the car as well.","\"You had an accident before, so I came over.\"","Song Luokui was still happy to see him, \"But the bodyguards have been following us all along.\"","Chi Yu patted her head, \"Yeah, I mainly wanted to pick you up.\"","On the side, Song Luosheng was sleeping like a log, oblivious to everything.","After returning to the mansion, the driver carried Song Luosheng back, while Song Luokui and Chi Yu talked outside for a long time before entering. In two days, she would attend Chi Yu's company's annual gala with him again, like going to a fair."]},{"number":160,"title":"Chapter 160: Attending Annual Conference 04","paragraphs":["The Shan Yu Group's annual meeting was actually held in the form of a banquet. Song Luokui entered the venue while hugging Chi Yu's arm, looking up at him and asking, \"Is this the trend for company annual meetings this year?\"","Chi Yu placed his hand over hers and said, \"No, I want to dance with you.\" He knew that she and Song Luosheng had danced the opening dance at the Songhua Technology annual meeting.","Song Luokui: ...","As someone announced \"The boss is here,\" everyone made way for them while applauding, some even cheering. Song Luokui and Chi Yu walked in the middle, with employees on both sides. For a moment, she felt like she was walking down the aisle at a wedding...","Song Luokui maintained a smile as she followed Chi Yu onto the stage to give a speech, after which they danced the opening dance to a light and relaxed tune. The two of them danced gracefully in the center of the stage, surrounded by people, some even recording videos.","When the dance ended, the crowd applauded wildly, and someone could even be heard saying, \"Let's have them get married right here!\"","Song Luokui instantly turned beet red, while Chi Yu seemed delighted as he looked towards the person who spoke and said, \"If you don't win the lucky draw tonight, we'll arrange one for you directly.\"","\"Wow!\" Everyone exclaimed in unison.","\"Get married! Get married! Get married!\" Suddenly, many people started chanting together.","Song Luokui: ... This is really too embarrassing.","Chi Yu raised his hand, and everyone quieted down. \"Tonight, I'll give out red envelopes to everyone.\"","\"Wow, wow, wow!\"","\"The boss is so generous!\"","\"Wishing the boss and his wife a blissful life together!\"","Chi Yu smiled and led Song Luokui away from the stage as the second dance song started playing. People went up to dance, while others ate snacks, gossiped, and took photos in the corner.","Chi Yu brought Song Luokui into a small room to rest, where a table was set with various foods and drinks.","Song Luokui covered her face, feeling it burning hot. \"You didn't put them up to saying that, did you?\"","Chi Yu peeled a sugar-coated orange for her. \"No, they did it on their own.\"","Song Luokui opened her mouth and bit into the orange he fed her. \"Sweet, you have some too.\"","Instead, Chi Yu leaned in and kissed her. \"It is sweet.\"","Song Luokui's face flushed even more, and she lightly kicked him.","After they ate some snacks, Song Luokui didn't dare eat too much for fear of getting a bloated stomach. When they heard cheering outside, they immediately followed Chi Yu out to join the fun.","\"When you all came in earlier, didn't you receive a number tag on your wrist? Please remember the number on your tag. Next, we'll be dividing into two teams...\"","At that moment, the lights went out, and everyone gasped as they couldn't see anyone anymore.","The host said, \"Don't panic, it's just the backstage crew turning off the lights. You've all remembered your number tags, right? Now, those with odd numbers form one group, and those with even numbers form the other group. When the lights come back on, try to rip off the other team's number tags. Let's see if the odd numbers or even numbers get more tags ripped off.\"","\"The winning team will each receive a prize, and those who rip off the other team's tags will also receive a prize, meaning some people can get double prizes. Does everyone understand?\"","\"Yes, we understand.\"","The host said, \"Okay, get ready. Remember to stay safe, safety is the top priority. Now I declare the Number Tag Protection War has begun!\"","As soon as the host said \"begin,\" the lights came on, and screams could be heard as people had their tags ripped off immediately.","\"Hahaha!\"","\"Quick, hide! Ahh!\"","\"Don't rip mine, ahhhh!\"","\"Go rip the managers' tags! It's time for payback, everyone go after the managers!\"","\"Hahaha!\"","Song Luokui and Chi Yu were in a corner. Song Luokui's number was odd, while Chi Yu's was even. As soon as they made eye contact, Song Luokui grabbed his hand, and Chi Yu immediately held out the hand with his number tag for her. \"Rip mine off.\"","Song Luokui smiled and patted his hand. \"I'll rip it off later.\"","On the other side, Chen Nan was knocked down, having been surrounded by a group of big guys who ripped his number tag right off his wrist.","After his tag was ripped off, Chen Nan felt both angry and amused. \"We're all on the same team, and yet you ripped my tag off.\"","Someone nearby said, \"Hahaha, no one really cares. It's just a rare chance to get back at you.\"","The host kept announcing the situation. \"Manager Chen, Manager Lin, and Manager Fan have all had their tags ripped off. Which manager hasn't been ripped yet? Everyone, go after them quickly!\"","\"Those who rip off a manager's tag will get a big prize.\"","This got everyone more excited. \"Quick, quick, which manager is left?\"","Someone piped up, \"If we rip off the boss's tag, wouldn't the prize be even bigger?\"","The host said, \"Of course, but first you have to be able to rip it off.\"","\"Where's the boss? Where's the boss at?\"","\"Quick, find the boss!\"","\"The boss is by the pillar! Everyone charge!\"","However, before anyone could charge, they saw the boss's girlfriend rip off the boss's number tag and hold it up for everyone to see.","The host immediately announced, \"The boss is out! The boss is out!\"","\"Hahahahaha!\" The crowd went wild with laughter.","The host said, \"There are five minutes left, five minutes until the end of the game. Everyone, hurry and use this time!\"","Chi Yu held Song Luokui tightly in his embrace, afraid that someone would try to rip her tag off too.","\"Five, four, three, two, one... The game is over! Everyone, quickly bring the tags you ripped off to exchange for prizes. Afterwards, we'll count to see if the odd numbers or even numbers won.\"","Song Luokui happily went to claim her prize. When the girl at the prize booth saw her, she took the number tag from Song Luokui's hand and immediately gave her a big prize.","Song Luokui thanked her happily and hurried back to Chi Yu's side to show off her prize – a camera designed and developed by the Shan Yu Group.","Chi Yu smiled at her. \"I'll give you another gift tonight since you were the one who ripped off my number tag.\"","Song Luokui was delighted. \"What is it? What is the gift?\"","Chi Yu said, \"You'll find out tonight, but you'll have to come back to ChunWang Manor with me.\"","After thinking for a moment, Song Luokui agreed, \"Okay.\"","They put the prize in the small room first, and as the music started playing again, everyone continued dancing. Song Luokui pulled Chi Yu onto the dance floor for another song.","When the song ended, the host announced the results of the previous competition: \"I declare that the people with odd-numbered cards have won! Please come forward to claim your prize, even those whose odd-numbered cards were taken off.\"","Song Luokui pushed Chi Yu, \"You too, you too, hurry up.\"","Chi Yu took her to claim the prize, and said to the staff: \"Give my prize to her.\"","Staff: \"Okay.\"","Song Luokui received another product, a set of bowls. Although not very valuable, it still made her happy.","Afterwards, various activities were held, such as team-based pictionary, ring toss, and riddle guessing. Each activity allowed participants to win prizes, and the ultimate grand prize was a lucky draw.","The annual party was a great success. Everyone received at least one gift to take home, in addition to the red envelopes that Chi Yu mentioned would be given to each person."]},{"number":161,"title":"Chapter 161: Gift","paragraphs":["After the annual party, Chi Yu took Song Luokui back with him. Chi Yu had drunk quite a bit that night, but he was still sober.","The two of them returned to ChunWang Manor with their gifts. Song Luokui snuggled into Chi Yu's embrace, \"Didn't you say you had another gift for me tonight?\"","Chi Yu: \"Yes, I'll give it to you when we get back.\"","Song Luokui kept guessing, \"What is it? Jewelry? A bracelet, a necklace? Or maybe cosmetics, a plush toy?\"","Chi Yu looked at her, loosening his tie slightly, \"Why don't you keep guessing?\"","Song Luokui shook her head, \"Never mind, I'll like whatever you give me.\"","Chi Yu lowered his head with a low chuckle, his voice deep and husky, \"Really, you'll like anything?\"","Song Luokui looked up, and her lips grazed his chin. Her face flushed, \"Of course, I've liked all the gifts you've given me before.\" Who doesn't like receiving gifts?","Chi Yu nuzzled her neck, his breath brushing against her skin, \"Hmm, I hope you'll like it...\" His latter words were mumbled and unclear. Song Luokui couldn't quite make them out as she was watching the snow falling outside.","Back at Chi Yu's side of ChunWang Manor, Aunt had prepared a detox soup. Chi Yu took a sip without being told, then told Aunt she could leave and get some rest. He also had the driver take her home.","\"Thank you, sir.\"","As soon as Song Luokui entered, she changed into slippers. She was now quite familiar with this place. Tonight, she was wearing 10cm high heels, and frankly, her feet were aching.","Chi Yu crouched in front of her and massaged her feet, \"Do you want to soak your feet later?\"","Song Luokui: \"A bath would be better.\" And she could soak her feet too.","Chi Yu: \"I'll draw you a bath.\"","\"Okay.\"","After Chi Yu had prepared the bath, Song Luokui took her clothes into the bathroom, which was even scented with aromatherapy candles, clearly set up by Chi Yu.","Song Luokui undressed and sank into the bathtub, instantly relieving much of her evening fatigue.","Outside, Chi Yu went to another bathroom to shower. By the time he finished, Song Luokui would be soaking for at least another half hour.","She had already dried her hair inside. When she came out, she looked sleepy. As soon as she emerged, she saw Chi Yu sitting nearby, and he immediately looked over at her.","Song Luokui blinked, \"Where's my gift?\"","Chi Yu suddenly extended his hand to her, a ribbon tied around his wrist. Song Luokui was a little puzzled as she took his hand. \"Huh?\"","Chi Yu looked at her, \"I am the gift. Do you want me?\"","Song Luokui glanced at him, then at the ribbon on his wrist. With a snort of laughter, she noticed another ribbon around his neck, his chest exposed, his gaze burning as he watched her.","Song Luokui's heart skipped a beat as she swallowed, \"Are you... trying to seduce me?\" She had to admit, Chi Yu looked irresistible like this.","Chi Yu: \"Yes.\" His voice lowered seductively, \"Do you want me?\"","Song Luokui slowly approached him, their eyes locked as if joined by an invisible thread. Chi Yu pulled her hand, suddenly tugging her into his embrace. Song Luokui steadied herself, straddling him. Chi Yu offered his hand, \"Do you want to unwrap your gift?\"","Song Luokui's gaze fell on the ribbon around his wrist. With one tug, the blue ribbon fell to the floor. Chi Yu then guided her hand to his neck. Song Luokui saw his Adam's apple bob.","Song Luokui stroked his Adam's apple, and Chi Yu let out a low groan. Song Luokui's face flushed, but instead of pulling the ribbon off his neck, she leaned in and pressed her lips against his throat...","She felt his hands grip her waist tightly. Smiling, she stopped teasing and bit down, pulling the ribbon off with her teeth.","Chi Yu immediately cupped her face and kissed her deeply... After a moment, he pulled a ring from his pocket and slid it onto Song Luokui's finger, their hands entwined.","When they parted, Song Luokui caught her breath, admiring the sparkling diamond on her finger.","She looked at Chi Yu, who wiped her lips, \"Since you've accepted this gift, there's no returning it.\"","With that, he kissed her again. Song Luokui closed her eyes and succumbed to his embrace.","Outside, the snow fell heavier, while inside, warmth enveloped them...","A tall figure carried a smaller one to the bed, and they soon tumbled onto the sheets together...","After a night of heavy snowfall, the entire city of Jing was blanketed in white. Inside, Song Luokui thought she heard the sound of snow-laden branches cracking and falling. Her eyelids fluttered, and she squinted as she opened her eyes.","The room was warm. Soft light filtered in through the tightly drawn curtains. She felt Chi Yu's chin resting on her head, one arm wrapped around her waist as he slept, his breathing faint.","The ring on her finger proved last night's events were real. The pleasant ache in her body was further evidence of their passionate lovemaking.","She stirred slightly, and the arm around her tightened, pulling her closer. Chi Yu seemed to wake, nuzzling downwards until his breath tickled her shoulder blades, making her shiver...","Her hands were pinned above her head as she blinked dazedly, the light above appearing to sway...","When she awoke again, it was nearly noon. Chi Yu coaxed her to get up, \"Are you hungry? I had Aunt make that soup you like.\"","Song Luokui murmured assent, letting him dote on her like an invalid.","After lunch, Song Luokui sat on the balcony, admiring the snowy landscape. Chi Yu joined her, hugging her from behind and kissing her cheek, \"Do you want to go out and play, or stay in today?\"","Still feeling a little tired, Song Luokui shook her head, \"Stay in.\"","They snuggled together for a while until, half an hour later, Song Luokui dozed off again. Chi Yu carefully carried her back to the bedroom and tucked her in.","...","The festival atmosphere was getting stronger. The Shan Yu Group and Song Hua Group were already practically in vacation mode, and Chi Yu had returned to the manor. Regarding the matter of sending New Year's gifts, Chi Yong said, \"Do you want me to go with you?\"","Chi Yu replied, \"No need. I may need to help out over there.\"","Chi Yong: ?","Chi Yu: \"Maybe I'll help with cleaning.\"","Chi Yong: ...He wanted to say that there were maids at home, but considering he was going to the Song family, he decided against it. He would likely need to do more work and give a good impression.","On the morning of February 6th, Chi Yu set out from home with gifts. At the Song residence, Grandpa Song, Grandma Song, as well as the Maternal Grandfather and Paternal Grandmother were all there. They were all spending the New Year together this year.","Moreover, it was said that Kuikui's boyfriend, the son from the Chi family, would be coming to give New Year's greetings today, so everyone had woken up early.","However, they usually woke up early, except for Song Luokui. Today, since Chi Yu was coming, she was a bit nervous, so she woke up early too.","The family had just finished breakfast when Chi Yu arrived."]},{"number":162,"title":"Chapter 162: Gifts for the New Year","paragraphs":["Chi Yu drove directly to the place, although it was nearby, but because he was bringing quite a lot of things. As soon as the car arrived, Song Luokui, who had been paying attention to the outside, immediately saw him. She immediately ran to the door and when she saw Chi Yu getting out of the car, she ran out, \"You're here.\"","On the other side, Sheng Rong also walked out of the entrance and looked over. Chi Yu did not dare to touch her in front of the elders, so he first went to the trunk to take out the gifts.","Song Luokui immediately offered to help, but Chi Yu said, \"No need for you, you go inside first, it's cold outside, I can manage myself.\"","On the other side, Sheng Rong urged Song Luosheng, \"Sheng, go help him.\"","Of course, Song Luosheng did not want to go. He was not happy that Chi Yu had come to give New Year's gifts, but he had no choice since everyone else in the family did not object, and seeing that Song Luokui had already gone to help, he had to reluctantly go over.","Aunt Gui and Uncle Kang also went to help bring the things inside. Chi Yu placed the items in the living room of the Song family's home, and as Song Luokui's family members stood there, he greeted them, \"Auntie Sheng, Uncle Song, and also grandparents and great-grandparents, hello. I am Chi Yu, Kuikui's boyfriend. I've brought some gifts today as an early New Year's greeting for you.\"","Sheng Rong said politely, \"How thoughtful of you, please have a seat.\"","Song Luokui immediately pulled him to sit beside her, while on the other side, Song Luosheng snorted but didn't say anything else, nor did he dare to, since the elders were present and he couldn't appear too impolite.","Sheng Rong first asked about Chi Yu's parents, and he answered accordingly. On the side, the four elders also scrutinized him. Chi Yu appeared calm on the surface, but inside he was quite nervous, sitting upright with his back straight.","Grandfather Song Ruhui asked, \"Little Yu, what kind of work do you do?\"","Chi Yu: \"I've started a company that invests in various things, but the main business is research and development of technology products, some domestic project investments, and some overseas heavy metal investments and the like.\" In fact, he was involved in a lot, but he only mentioned a little bit.","Song Luokui: \"Similar to my brother's.\"","Song Luosheng cleared his throat and looked at Song Luokui, signaling her not to speak. Song Luokui pouted but didn't say anything further, only taking Chi Yu's hand, then realizing that his palm was a bit sweaty.","It was then that Song Luokui noticed his nervousness. The usually arrogant and assertive Chi Yu was actually getting sweaty palms because of her. Thinking of this, she wiped his palm to comfort him.","Chi Yu gripped her hand tightly while answering the questions from the grandparents and great-grandparents.","\"How about a game of chess with me?\" Song Ruhui said.","Chi Yu stood up, \"Yes.\"","Song Luokui immediately wanted to follow, but Sheng Rong held her back. After that, she could only watch as Chi Yu was surrounded by the men in the family, observing him play chess with Grandfather.","Meanwhile, she was on the couch, entertaining Grandmother and Great-Grandmother.","The two asked her how Chi Yu treated her, when the two had met, and also inquired about Chi Yu's background.","Grandmother Lin Xianyuan and Great-Grandmother Jun Lin knew about Chi Yu's family background. If the two were to end up together, it would likely become a matter for the two families.","\"If you really stay with him, you may have to take on greater responsibilities in the future. You won't be able to be so willful anymore.\"","Song Luokui: \"I know. Grandma, Great-Grandma, I've grown up. I'm not afraid. You don't know, but I'm already managing a company now.\"","\"Oh?\" The two were quite surprised. \"Our Kuikui is managing a company now?\"","Song Luokui told them about the entertainment company, \"Although it's still small, and maybe you think it's just a hobby, but I'll make it bigger and stronger.\"","Grandmother Lin Xianyuan lovingly hugged her, \"We only hope that you can always be happy. If you get bullied in the future and don't want to live with him anymore, I'm afraid it won't be easy to handle then.\"","The Chi family was too special in their status and had too many rules. Although the Song family was also of high status and authority, they didn't have as many rules, and they were also simpler people. They were afraid that with the Chi family's many rules and people, their pampered Kuikui might not be able to handle it.","However, Sheng Rong was not too worried, \"Mom, you don't have to worry. Kuikui knows her limits. From a young age, she has never caused us any concerns.\"","\"That boy Chi Yu seems to treat Kuikui well too. Don't worry. Besides, there's me and Moqian. If we can't handle it, aren't there still you two?\"","Lin Xianyuan nodded, \"You're right. We're not afraid either.\"","On the other side, Jun Lin said, \"Kuikui, as long as you're happy, Great-Grandma supports you.\"","Song Luokui happily hugged her, \"Thank you, Great-Grandma, and of course, Grandma too.\"","The atmosphere was good on this side, but on the other side, it was as if they were on a battlefield. Chi Yu was playing chess with Grandfather Song Ruhui while also having to answer questions from the four men.","Questions about family circumstances, how to ensure their daughter/granddaughter/sister's future well-being, and whether he had thought about the future, and so on.","Just ordinary questions, but Chi Yu answered them very carefully, afraid that if they were unsatisfied, they wouldn't allow him to be with Kuikui.","One game of chess took an hour, and Chi Yu felt that this was more tiring than his business battles overseas.","Until Sheng Rong came over, \"Alright, are you done? It's time for dinner.\" Then she looked at Chi Yu, \"Little Yu, you stay for dinner too.\"","Chi Yu immediately stood up, \"Yes, Auntie.\"","Song Ruhui placed a chess piece, \"Alright, let's leave it at that. Time for dinner.\" Being able to play with him for that long, and even letting him have an advantage, this young man was quite capable.","The table was a large round one. Chi Yu sat beside Song Luokui, with Song Luosheng on Song Luokui's other side. Next to Chi Yu was Sheng Rong, then Song Moqian, followed by the grandparents and great-grandparents.","The elders took food first, then Song Luokui and the others picked up their chopsticks to eat. In the middle of the meal, Chi Yu served Song Luokui a piece of chicken meat, just like before. Of course, others saw it, but no one said anything. Song Luosheng snorted and served Song Luokui a chicken leg, \"Kuikui, eat more. You've lost weight recently.\"","Song Luokui looked down at her body with a frown. She had lost weight? She felt she had gained weight recently.","Chi Yu moved his mouth but ultimately didn't say anything. He had wanted to say that she wasn't fat or thin, but just right, but he was afraid her family would think he was being flirtatious, so he didn't dare say anything.","Sheng Rong indeed told Chi Yu not to feel restrained and to eat more. Hearing what her mother said, Song Luokui quickly put a piece of meat on his plate and winked at him. The corners of Chi Yu's mouth curved up slightly.","Chi Yu ate two bowls of rice straightaway, not daring to stop. After finishing, he felt a bit stuffed but didn't dare say so.","After the meal, Sheng Rong said, \"The New Year is coming soon. You two should check if your rooms are cleaned and organized.\"","Song Luokui immediately took Chi Yu upstairs, saying, \"Let me take a look and have Chi Yu help me.\" With that, she went upstairs.","Song Luosheng was about to follow them, but Sheng Rong gave him a look, \"Luosheng, you need to organize your own room too.\"","Song Luosheng paused and mumbled, \"I know.\""]},{"number":163,"title":"Chapter 163: Organizing the Room","paragraphs":["Song Luokui brought Chi Yu to her room and closed the door behind them. \"Earlier, did my dad and the others give you a hard time?\"","Chi Yu shook his head. \"No, we were just playing chess.\"","Song Luokui: \"They must have asked you a lot of questions.\"","Chi Yu: \"Just the expected ones. It's okay.\"","Chi Yu looked around her room. This was the first time he had entered her room. Unlike at ChunWang Manor, this place bore traces of her growth from childhood to adulthood.","On one wall hung awards she had won previously. On the bedside table were photos of her with her family. Chi Yu picked one up and stared at it for a while. \"Can I put my photo here in the future?\"","Song Luokui walked over, blinking. \"Of course. Let me get it out. I had put it away before.\" She had been worried her family would discover it.","Song Luokui retrieved a photo of the two of them from a box in the corner and placed it on the bedside table. It was their graduation photo taken when Chi Yu graduated, given to her by Senior Jixiao. She had been so nervous when she received it.","Chi Yu gazed at the photo for a long while before setting it on the bedside table. He then examined her small study desk, imagining her sitting there studying from childhood. He even envisioned how nice it would have been if they had known each other well back then and could have studied together.","To tidy up her room, Song Luokui began taking out the disorganized items from her boxes and cabinets to arrange them properly. Chi Yu came over to help. He even found a photo album containing pictures of her from childhood to adulthood.","Chi Yu couldn't stop flipping through the photos - her as a newborn, in a floral dress at her first piano lesson, on her birthdays, winning first place as a little red flower in kindergarten, and then in elementary school...","From a young age, she was adorable and pretty, always surrounded by a group of little friends. In some photos, Song Luosheng and other playmates from the compound appeared, referring to Song Luosheng as the leader.","There were also photos of her bravely enduring injections without crying, in the hospital, wiping tears from Song Luosheng's eyes... Starting from elementary school, the hospital photos became more frequent... Chi Yu recalled people mentioning that she was unlucky and had health issues.","While Song Luokui was tidying up, she didn't notice Chi Yu looking at her childhood photos until she turned and saw him touching a photo of her smiling in a hospital bed.","Song Luokui's heart softened. \"Back then, I thought I might not make it, but I persevered and slowly recovered.\"","Chi Yu looked up, his eyes glistening with tears. Song Luokui was taken aback and immediately hugged him tightly. \"What's wrong?\"","Chi Yu: \"I just suddenly wondered why we weren't familiar back then. If we had been, maybe I could have accompanied you.\"","Song Luokui smiled. \"It's not too late for you to accompany me now. I wouldn't have wanted you to see me in such a wretched state back then.\"","Chi Yu held her close, regretting that he hadn't been present in her life during her most difficult times. But from now on, he would never allow such regrets again.","They parted, and Chi Yu cupped her face, kissing her forehead, then her nose, and finally capturing her lips in a passionate kiss...","*Knock knock knock* Just as their kiss was deepening, a knock on the door interrupted them. Song Luokui immediately pushed Chi Yu away, rushed to the mirror to fix herself, wiped her mouth, and wiped Chi Yu's mouth too - all within five seconds - before going to open the door.","It was Song Luosheng. \"Brother, what's up?\" Song Luokui feigned composure. Song Luosheng entered and noticed Chi Yu helping to tidy up. He glanced around. \"Nothing, just checking if you need any help here.\"","Song Luokui blinked. \"No, just organizing some odds and ends. We'll be done soon.\"","Song Luosheng circled the room, pulling the curtains. \"Do these curtains need to be taken down for washing?\"","Song Luokui: \"I just had them washed a few days ago.\"","\"What about wiping the cabinets?\"","Song Luokui: \"I'll wipe them after tidying up, so I don't have to do it twice.\"","\"Should we change the bedsheets and covers?\"","Song Luokui: \"...Aunt Gui just helped me change them.\"","Suddenly, Song Luosheng's gaze fixed on the photo on the bedside table. Seeing Chi Yu in a graduation gown with his sister Song Luokui, his pupils dilated, and he immediately grabbed the photo. \"When was this taken? Don't you need to explain this to me?\"","Song Luokui's heart sank, and she laughed nervously, scratching her head. \"That... it was taken when he graduated from his bachelor's program.\"","But Chi Yu's bachelor's graduation wasn't at the same time as his own graduation, when Song Luokui had taken a photo with him.","Why would she...?","Recalling how Song Luokui had later declined to have a meal with him, saying it would be too conspicuous, Song Luosheng asked, \"Did you go find him after taking the photo with me back then?\"","They must have been close from such an early time, with their bodies pressed together in the photo.","Song Luokui looked apologetically at her brother. \"That... well...\"","Chi Yu stepped forward, facing Song Luosheng. \"Back then, I threatened her. Don't blame her.\"","Song Luosheng's voice rose sharply. \"Threatened?!\" His fists clenched, ready to punch again.","Song Luokui immediately hugged him. \"No, no, Brother. He didn't threaten me. I couldn't resist his advances and went to see him. It was my fault.\"","Song Luosheng: \"Luokui, you don't need to defend him. I know what he's like.\"","Song Luokui: \"Brother~ It was a long time ago, and I wasn't unwilling either.\"","Upon hearing that, Song Luosheng deflated. Since Chi Yu was already here, any further objection was futile, especially since his sister liked him.","\"Just don't hide anything from me again in the future.\"","\"Got it, got it.\" Song Luokui placated him with an adorable tone.","Song Luosheng's gaze towards Chi Yu held a hint of pride. Hmph, no matter what, he was still his beloved sister Luokui's favorite brother.","Soon after, Sheng Rong called Song Luosheng away, and he had no choice but to leave. After seeing him off and closing the door, Song Luokui grabbed Chi Yu's hand. \"Phew, that was intense.\"","Chi Yu raised an eyebrow: \"Hmm?\"","Song Luokui's face flushed. \"Let's continue tidying up.\"","Song Luokui tried to hold her hand, \"I want to keep kissing you.\" The thrill was real, and even more so when kissing her.","Song Luokui didn't know why Chi Yu suddenly acted like this, \"Just now...\"","Before she could finish, Chi Yu kissed her again, kissing her in the room where she grew up from childhood, making him extremely delighted in both body and soul. Moreover, her family was outside, and they were secretly intimate here...","For Song Luokui, it was also super thrilling, because Chi Yu was holding her sitting on the desk by the window, and the curtains weren't drawn. If anyone looked up from downstairs, they would definitely see the man fiercely kissing the woman, grasping her waist...","After the room was tidied up for a long time, when Chi Yu left, Song Luokui didn't go to see him off, because her lips were a little swollen."]},{"number":164,"title":"Chapter 164: Strolling in the Courtyard","paragraphs":["When Chi Yu returned home, Chi Yong looked up and glanced at the time, \"Finally back? How was it?\"","Chi Yu didn't answer, only asking, \"Where's Mother?\"","Chi Yong: \"Your mother is still busy. She may not be back until New Year's Eve dinner. It's the Lunar New Year soon, so of course she's busier.\"","Chi Yu: \"Mmm.\"","Chi Yong: \"You haven't told me how it went with the Song Family yet. When will you bring her home?\"","Chi Yu: \"I'll ask her later.\"","Chi Yong: \"Mmm, let your mom know in advance so she can clear some time.\" If he can bring someone home, it seems there's no issue with the Song Family.","\"Mmm.\"","Unlike the lively atmosphere at the Song Family, the Chi Family was relatively quiet. There were just the two of them, father and son. They didn't need to do any housekeeping or buy New Year's supplies - the maids and bodyguards had taken care of everything.","Chi Yu went into his room and took out the photos of him and Song Luokui, arranging them one by one. He felt he had returned too early and should have stayed longer.","Chi Yu thought about it and walked out of the house, strolling around the courtyard and occasionally greeting others there.","He walked all the way to the small store in the courtyard, recalling his previous encounter with her there. He took out his phone and messaged her, \"Want some candy? I'll buy some for you.\" He also sent her a photo of the small store.","Upon seeing the message, Song Luokui pondered for a moment, quickly put on her clothes and wrapped a scarf around herself, and immediately ran out.","When she arrived at the small store, she saw Chi Yu standing there. Song Luokui smiled and ran towards him. Chi Yu opened his arms and hugged her. The two entered the small store, and Chi Yu directly bought her a whole bag of candies.","Song Luokui: \"That's too much, I can't finish it all.\"","Chi Yu: \"Then take it home and store it. You can eat it when guests come over.\"","\"Mmm hmm.\"","The old shopkeeper occasionally looked at the two of them. Everyone said the young lady of the Song Family and the young master of the Chi Family were together. The shopkeeper had never seen them before, but today, she finally did. And the Chi Family's young master was so considerate - the atmosphere between them seemed great.","When she went home tonight, she would gossip about it with her family. Life in the courtyard was like that - people loved to gossip.","As they left the small store with the candies, they encountered some children in the courtyard. The children recognized Song Luokui and saw her with Chi Yu. \"Sister Luokui, is this your boyfriend?\"","Song Luokui squatted down and gave the child a handful of candies. \"Yes. Here, these are candies Brother bought for you. But remember to brush your teeth after eating them, okay?\"","\"Okay~ Thank you, Sister Luokui and Brother.\"","\"Go and play.\"","They encountered several more children, all of whom called her Sister Luokui. Chi Yu's candies for her were given to these children.","Chi Yu: \"The children in the courtyard seem to like you a lot, but... it seems they don't really recognize me?\"","Song Luokui said proudly, \"I often stay in the courtyard, but you rarely come back here, right? Of course they don't recognize you if they've hardly seen you.\"","Whenever Chi Yu returned to the courtyard, it was usually at night, and he would leave again early in the morning when the children were still asleep, so they seldom saw him.","The two held hands and strolled around the courtyard. When they reached a certain spot, Song Luokui suddenly remembered something. \"There was almost a kidnapping here in the courtyard when I was little. A trafficker tried to take me away.\"","Chi Yu also recalled it. \"Yeah, I hit the trafficker with stones at the time.\"","Later, thinking back on it, he was truly grateful that he had been there and helped.","Song Luokui didn't know this and was surprised. She smiled and said, \"So you've saved my life before.\"","Chi Yu gripped her hand tightly and drew her closer. \"Yeah, so you'll have to repay me with your body.\"","Song Luokui nodded. \"I'll have to repay you with my body.\" They both laughed after saying that.","The two continued strolling around the courtyard until it was time for dinner. Chi Yu sent Song Luokui to the Song Family's door before returning.","That evening, their little stroll was the hot gossip at every family's table.","\"I saw them today - the Chi Family's young master was holding hands with the Song Family's young lady as they walked around the courtyard.\"","\"How did they seem?\"","\"They seemed great. The Chi Family's young master was really considerate. The shopkeeper said they went to the small store, and the Chi Family's young master bought candies for the Song Family's young lady.\"","\"Hey, the candies my kid got were from the Song Family's young lady. She called herself Sister Luokui and him Brother - it was those two.\"","\"He's handsome, she's beautiful, their family backgrounds match. They're quite well-matched.\"","\"I also heard the Chi Family's young master has already sent New Year's gifts to the Song Family today. The big day must be coming soon - I wonder if they'll invite us?\"","\"They probably will. The bride's family would definitely invite us. My family has a decent relationship with the Song Family.\"","\"The groom's family would probably invite my family too since my kid follows the Chi Family's kid.\"","...","Leaving aside the courtyard gossip, the New Year soon arrived. On New Year's Eve, as the Song Family ate their dinner and watched the Spring Festival Gala, after finishing the meal, Zhou Yuan and others called to ask if they were going to let off fireworks and count down to the new year.","Song Luosheng immediately asked Song Luokui if she wanted to go. Song Luokui hesitated for a moment, then suddenly noticed the car outside and pointed, \"That... Chi Yu will take me.\"","Song Luosheng: ...Damn, that's heartbreaking.","He delivered Song Luokui directly to Chi Yu's car, warning Chi Yu to protect her, before closing the car door and watching Chi Yu take her away.","Song Luosheng gazed at the departing car, suddenly feeling a sense of melancholy. It was cold outside, and his breath came out in white puffs. He kicked a pebble on the ground. His little sister had grown up and truly had another man in her life now.","At that moment, Zhou Yuan's call came again. \"Big bro, you coming or not? Everyone's here.\"","Song Luosheng said, \"Coming, wait for me.\"","\"Got it!\"","The family had no objections to the young people going out to have fun - after all, it's what young people liked to do. The parents, of course, preferred staying home and watching the Spring Festival Gala.","Chi Yu took Song Luokui to a place where they could set off fireworks. The car's trunk was loaded with many fireworks. There were also many other people setting them off. Later, the skyscrapers in the distance would have a countdown display.","At first, they played with those small handheld sparklers, with Song Luokui excitedly waving her sparkler and exclaiming like a child, while Chi Yu took pictures of her with his camera.","Occasionally, they would see others setting off super large and beautiful fireworks in the distance, and there was even a drone performance celebrating the festival.","Afterward, they started setting off those big fireworks, and each time Song Luokui would gasp in awe as the fireworks blossomed in the sky like scattered celestial maidens.","As time went on and more people gathered, the weather grew colder, so Song Luokui snuggled under Chi Yu's down jacket, with just her head poking out as they embraced and enjoyed the scenery.","When the final countdown began, everyone shouted together, \"Ten, nine... three, two, one, Happy New Year!\"","At the last second of the countdown, Chi Yu suddenly leaned down and kissed her, while other couples around them also shared kisses.","After the kiss, Chi Yu directed her gaze toward the drone performance, where the drones had rearranged themselves to form the shape of a heart pierced by an arrow, with words below: \"Kuikui, I love you [Heart]\"","On the other side, Song Luosheng and the others also saw it. Zhou Yuan said, \"Kuikui? Could that be our little Sister Song? Brother, did Chi from the Chi Family arrange this?\""]},{"number":165,"title":"Chapter 165: Chinese New Year","paragraphs":["Song Luosheng felt there was a high possibility, but he wasn't sure. Thinking about how flamboyant Chi Yu was, he scoffed lightly, \"I don't know.\"","It was already late when they returned home. Although Chi Yu was reluctant, he still sent her back. Song Luosheng had returned earlier and had been waiting for Song Luokui to come back.","\"Happy New Year, Kuikui,\" Song Luosheng gave her a big red envelope.","Originally a little tired, Song Luokui perked up when she saw the red envelope. She took it and immediately hugged Song Luosheng's arm, \"Thank you, brother. I hope you'll have a safe and smooth year ahead!\"","Song Luosheng ruffled her head, \"I hope my Kuikui stays healthy and that everything goes smoothly for her.\"","The two exchanged smiles. Song Luokui patted her head, \"Go rest now.\"","\"Okay~\"","Back in her room, Song Luokui took out another red envelope from her pocket, the one given by Chi Yu. She placed both red envelopes directly into her cabinet. On her hand was the New Year's gift from Chi Yu - a green bracelet.","After the incident, Chi Yu frequently came to the Song Family's home. Although Song Luosheng would roll his eyes every time, he gradually became numb to it.","It was the New Year holidays, so Chi Yu would come find Song Luokui every day to take her out. Sometimes when Song Luokui went for gatherings with her sisters, he would come pick her up afterward.","Sitting in Chi Yu's car, Song Luokui mentioned Zhang Xiyue's matter, \"Zhang Xiyue is still keeping everyone in the dark about her relationship with her junior. No one knows anything about it. Did you know?\"","Chi Yu: \"No, I haven't been paying much attention.\"","Song Luokui: \"I see. I was wondering if she would keep it secret like I did.\"","Chi Yu paused and looked at her, \"So... you originally intended to keep it secret forever?\"","Song Luokui gave an awkward laugh, \"Well, that was the plan at first...\" Although when he first approached her and she agreed to go out with him, her intentions weren't pure. Back then, she only wanted to ensure that her brother wouldn't be targeted by Chi Yu.","But later on...","Chi Yu raised his eyebrows, \"At first?\"","Song Luokui felt she needed to be honest, \"When you first approached me, you had ulterior motives, didn't you?\"","Chi Yu: \"Mmhm.\"","Song Luokui: \"Well, when I didn't reject you back then, I also had ulterior motives. I thought that if I got close to you, maybe you'd spare my brother if he ever crossed you, or I could get information from you that would be disadvantageous to my brother.\"","She didn't take their interactions seriously at first, and was even a little afraid because her intentions weren't pure. But she didn't expect to get to know him better and better, and on top of that, he treated her so well that she eventually convinced herself.","Chi Yu squeezed her hand, \"I know, but it doesn't matter.\" As long as she was hooked in the end, it was all fine.","Song Luokui: \"So I originally planned to keep it secret slowly, but later I felt it was unfair to you, so...\" So even when everyone found out later, it didn't matter.","Chi Yu looked into her eyes, \"I want you to say you love me.\" To ease my heart.","Song Luokui's face turned red. She moved her mouth but no words came out. Lowering her eyes, she said softly, \"I like you.\"","Chi Yu leaned closer, \"Say it again.\"","Song Luokui looked up at him, his eyes reflecting her image, \"I love you.\"","She thought saying those three words would feel very embarrassing, but after saying it out loud, she felt nothing.","\"I love you too,\" Chi Yu whispered contentedly, cupping her face and kissing her.","After the kiss ended, Chi Yu started the car, but he didn't drive back to the mansion. Instead, he went to ChunWang Manor. \"Don't go back tonight, okay?\"","Song Luokui lowered her head shyly, \"Let me send my brother a message first.\"","\"Okay.\"","Their parents had already started getting busy since the 4th day of the New Year, and their grandparents had returned to their hometowns. So the only ones left at home were Song Luosheng and herself, not counting Aunt Gui.","Song Luosheng knew that she was going to play with Lou Sasa, Weng Jiao and the others that day, so he didn't ask in detail, thinking she was just with her sisters.","At this moment, in Chi Yu's room, Song Luokui was standing by the floor-to-ceiling window, gazing at the distant lights. Chi Yu came up from behind and hugged her, taking in her scent with a satisfied sigh. The two stood silently for a while before Chi Yu spoke, \"The hot water is ready. Shower?\"","Song Luokui responded with a sound of affirmation. Chi Yu immediately carried her bridal-style into the bathroom. At the window, the curtains had automatically closed...","Thirsty and hot, Song Luokui felt like she was trapped in a large oven. Her thirst woke her up - it was currently 4 AM, and she had only slept for two hours.","Song Luokui's fair, slim arm emerged from under the covers. A small lamp lit up one corner of the room, so it wasn't completely dark. Song Luokui opened her heavy eyelids and sat up, only to freeze - it didn't seem like the right time yet.","She wanted to put on her clothes, but the man next to her, Chi Yu, had also woken up and hugged her. His voice was still a bit hoarse, \"What's wrong?\"","Song Luokui wanted to speak but couldn't get the words out. She let out an \"ah\" before finding her voice again, but it was raspy, \"I want to drink some water, and I need to use the restroom. Could you go get me something? Or buy something? Can you turn the AC down a bit too? I feel a little hot.\" She had even started sweating.","As soon as Chi Yu heard this, he turned on the light immediately, understanding her meaning. He first carried her to sit on the toilet before leaving the bathroom.","Chi Yu was about to have someone go buy what she needed. He even brought a cup of warm water, but Song Luokui had already come out, her face flushed, \"No, that's not it.\"","Chi Yu was completely confused until he finally understood and immediately hugged her.","It turned out to be a false alarm, but Chi Yu's shoulder was bitten several times. In the end, he had to coax her into drinking the warm water before carrying her back into the bathroom...","After another long struggle, the two finally fell asleep again around 6 AM.","The next day at noon, Song Luokui returned to the mansion. Luckily, Song Luosheng wasn't around. She was afraid her brother would notice something off about her. Aunt Gui even asked if she had been too cold outside since she was bundled up so tightly, especially around her neck area.","Song Luokui felt a little embarrassed, \"I'm fine.\" In the end, she hurried back to her room and didn't come out until dinner.","The holidays ended quickly. Although she hadn't started school yet, the company had resumed operations, so she needed to go back to work too.","There wasn't much to do, so she would get off work on time, occasionally going to the Shan Yu Group to pick up a certain someone. But after that certain someone had eaten meat a couple of times, they became a bit addicted and kept persuading her to go to ChunWang Manor. Song Luokui couldn't resist, because she had tasted the delicacy as well.","They stayed at ChunWang Manor for several days in a row, until Song Luosheng came looking for her, \"You're no longer my adorable little sister. You used to say you would wait at home for me and our parents.\"","Song Luokui felt guilty, \"...Um...I thought you were all busy?\"","With one glance from Song Luosheng, Song Luokui immediately said, \"I've been staying home recently, I really have.\"","Song Luosheng was satisfied, but Chi Yu wasn't too pleased. The two had just harmonized so well..."]},{"number":166,"title":"Chapter 166: Song Moqian's Accident","paragraphs":["Until the start of the school year, Song Luokui didn't return to ChunWang Manor, much to Chi Yu's dismay, but there was nothing he could do about it.","Song Luokui patted his head, \"It'll be better once school starts.\"","After school began, when Song Luokui didn't go home, she'd say she was staying in the dormitory. She really was staying there, except sometimes Chi Yu would secretly whisk her back to ChunWang Manor.","One day, after an intimate moment, Chi Yu suddenly said, \"Someone's renovating the floor above. It's probably your brother.\"","Song Luokui: ...","Chi Yu played with her hair, \"Want to come to my place?\"","Song Luokui was confused. Wasn't she already at his place?","Chi Yu: \"I mean where I originally lived.\" He had moved here for her.","Song Luokui: \"Where did you live before? In the old courtyard house?\"","Chi Yu: \"No, near the Shan Yu Group. Want to go see it next time?\"","\"Sure.\"","Before they could visit, trouble struck at home.","Song Luokui was still in class when her bodyguard, Elder Sister Wen, came directly to her classroom and knocked on the door. \"Excuse me, teacher. I apologize for the interruption. I'm here for our young lady, Miss Song Luokui.\"","Song Luokui stood up, puzzled. \"I'm sorry, teacher. They're here for me. I'll step out for a moment.\"","As soon as she left, some classmates whispered, \"It's the first time we've seen Song Luokui's family.\"","\"That's not family. Didn't you hear her say 'young lady'?\"","\"I knew Song Luokui came from a distinguished family, but I didn't realize her family actually uses the term 'young lady.'\"","\"You can't really tell usually.\"","\"What can't you tell? It's because you're not close to her and haven't seen her much.\"","\"True, haha.\"","\"I've seen her family's chauffeur. He's a standard chauffeur, you know, wearing white gloves and a suit. I heard he often picks her up from school, but it seems less frequent lately.\"","Outside, Song Luokui had just heard Elder Sister Wen say, \"Young lady, Mr. Song has been in an accident.\"","Song Luokui's mind went blank, and she ran out.","On the way to the hospital, Song Luokui bit her lip, took deep breaths to calm herself, and listened to Elder Sister Wen's news: \"It seems there was a serious mudslide disaster in the suburbs. Mr. Song was on his way back after handling it when he encountered an out-of-control truck.\"","Song Luokui's eyes reddened, \"How bad are his injuries?\"","Elder Sister Wen: \"We're not sure yet. We'll know once we get to the hospital.\" She had rushed to fetch the young lady as soon as she received the news.","\"Okay.\"","Just then, Song Luokui received a call from Chi Yu. \"Hello?\"","Hearing her tearful voice, Chi Yu's heart ached. \"It's okay, don't be scared. I'm heading to the hospital now. Don't be afraid, I'm here for you.\"","\"Mm.\" Song Luokui sniffled, tears suddenly streaming down her face. Elder Sister Wen handed her tissues.","Chi Yu kept comforting her over the phone, but soon Song Luokui had another call. \"My brother's calling. I'll answer it first.\"","\"Okay.\"","She hung up on Chi Yu and answered Song Luosheng's call. \"Brother, Dad...\"","Song Luosheng also heard Song Luokui's sobs. \"Don't cry. Dad's not in serious danger. I'm already at the hospital. Don't be afraid.\"","Song Luokui wiped her tears, \"Okay, I'll be there soon.\"","The car sped along the road and quickly arrived at Nanshan Hospital. Song Luokui ran inside as soon as she got out, swiftly reaching the floor where Song Moqian was. Outside the emergency room, a crowd had gathered, including Chi Yu, Song Luosheng, and some special staff members. Even the hospital director was there.","Chi Yu embraced Song Luokui, wiping her tears. \"Don't worry, it'll be okay.\"","On the side, Song Luosheng hesitated with outstretched arms, then dropped them with a sigh. He walked over and patted Song Luokui's head. \"It's okay, don't be scared.\"","\"Mm, mm.\" Song Luokui nodded obediently but was still very worried.","Soon, Sheng Rong also rushed over. Her hair was slightly disheveled, but her expression remained composed, or perhaps she didn't dare show her fear.","Song Luokui immediately went to hug her. \"Mom.\"","Sheng Rong held her, patting her back. \"Your father will be fine. Don't worry.\"","The other staff members also hurried over to greet Sheng Rong, who shook hands with each of them.","After an anxious half-hour wait, the emergency room light finally went off. The doctor walked out, removing his mask. \"The patient is out of danger. We'll move him to a ward soon. Family can visit, but please keep quiet...\"","The doctor said a lot more, but everyone's hearts were relieved. Being out of danger was all that mattered.","When Song Moqian was wheeled out and into a private room, Sheng Rong first asked everyone to leave. They would be fine here; too many people would be inconvenient.","Those with business left first. Song Moqian's secretary, Zhang Secretary, stayed. Fortunately, he had been assigned other tasks and wasn't in the same car as Song Moqian. Otherwise, he'd be in the emergency room too.","Song Luokui thought of something else: \"What about Uncle Kang? How is Uncle Kang?\"","Zhang Secretary: \"Uncle Kang is fine. He was with me doing tasks assigned by Mr. Song. A bodyguard was driving.\"","Song Luokui: \"Then how's the bodyguard?\"","Zhang Secretary: \"The bodyguard is also fine. Everything's been taken care of.\"","\"That's good.\"","Song Luosheng: \"What exactly happened?\"","Zhang Secretary: \"According to the surveillance footage, the minister's car was driving on a rural road when suddenly an out-of-control truck appeared, heading straight for them. At the last moment, the bodyguard swerved into a field. The truck also overturned into the field, lightly hitting the minister's car.\"","There should have been cars protecting him from the front and back, but Song Moqian found it troublesome. He was there for work, not for anything else, so he had sent some people off to do tasks. He just didn't expect such an incident to occur.","\"The truck driver is also injured and in emergency care. I've already asked people to investigate the accident quickly.\"","Sheng Rong: \"Thank you for your hard work.\"","\"Not at all. The minister had it much harder.\" Zhang Secretary, a middle-aged man, felt his legs go weak when he heard the news. He was truly frightened.","\"Director Sheng, there's something I may need to discuss with you privately,\" Zhang Secretary said after some thought.","Sheng Rong glanced at Song Luokui and the others. \"You stay here and keep Dad company. I need to step out for a moment.\"","Song Luokui obediently complied, while Song Luosheng, though frowning, had no choice but to stay. He felt that his father's accident was far from being a mere coincidence.","Outside, Zhang Secretary spoke to Sheng Rong in a hushed voice: \"Just a few days ago, the Minister had a heated argument with Minister Lin. Minister Lin warned that he would regret it.\"","Sheng Rong's face turned grim. \"Do you know what it was about?\"","Zhang Secretary replied, \"It might be about choosing sides. The Minister didn't share the details with me.\"","Sheng Rong nodded. \"I understand. Don't take any action for now.\"","\"Very well.\""]},{"number":167,"title":"Chapter 167: Settle Down","paragraphs":["In the hospital room, Song Luokui held Song Moqian's hand. Ever since she was young, Song Moqian had always obliged her wishes. He treated her and her brother quite differently - he was strict with her brother, but a compassionate father to her.","When she was a child and got injured, Song Moqian would swiftly arrive unless it was absolutely necessary not to, even if he was delayed due to work duties. In that case, he would send someone over before later apologizing to her.","Whenever he returned from a business trip, he would bring her gifts. He never attended Song Luosheng's parent-teacher meetings, but he made time to attend hers when she was young.","Although he was busy with work and couldn't always be there for her, she knew he loved her dearly.","Beside her, Chi Yu sat comforting Song Luokui. He too had been pondering this matter, not because he was overly sensitive, but because he felt there was something amiss - there had to be more to this incident than met the eye.","Until late at night, Song Moqian had not regained consciousness. Sheng Rong told them to leave first, saying she would take care of him overnight and that they should go home and rest, returning the next day.","Chi Yu took Song Luokui home and stayed with her until she fell asleep before preparing to leave. As he exited her room, he saw Song Luosheng.","The two exchanged glances before Chi Yu spoke first, \"I will investigate this matter.\"","Song Luosheng replied, \"I will too.\"","\"I'll go back first, and I'll inform you if I find anything,\" Chi Yu said.","Song Luosheng hesitated for a moment, then said, \"Thank you.\"","Chi Yu raised an eyebrow. \"No need to thank me, just don't come out next time when I'm with her.\"","With an expressionless face, Song Luosheng retorted, \"Get lost!\"","Chi Yu remained unruffled, the corner of his mouth curving upwards as he left the Song Family home.","Back at his own home, Chi Yu entered the study and found his father, Chi Yong. \"Father, Uncle Song had an accident and is in the hospital.\"","Chi Yong looked up. \"I'm aware of this.\"","Chi Yu asked, \"Was this someone's doing?\"","Chi Yong gave him a serious look. \"It's a complex matter. You needn't concern yourself with it.\"","Chi Yu frowned. \"I will investigate it.\"","With a sigh, Chi Yong said, \"You may investigate, but don't be rash. A single strand can unravel the entire tapestry - you must exercise restraint.\"","Chi Yu took a deep breath. \"I understand.\"","\"Don't be hasty,\" Chi Yong advised. \"Those causing trouble will be dealt with.\"","Once back in his room, Chi Yu immediately made a phone call...","The next day at the hospital, Song Moqian had finally regained consciousness, though he was still physically weak. The doctor said he would recover fully with some rest.","Song Luokui stayed at the hospital for most of the day. Song Moqian then told her, \"Dad is fine. Don't you have school? Go back to class first.\"","Song Luokui pouted, \"Dad, I took the day off.\"","Sheng Rong chimed in, \"Go back to school now, and come back after classes. Your mom and brother are here with me.\"","Song Luokui hesitated for a moment. \"Okay, I'll come back after school then.\"","\"Alright.\"","Sheng Rong looked at Chi Yu. \"Chi Yu, could you please take her back to school?\"","\"Sure, Auntie.\"","Since Song Luokui hadn't returned to class after leaving last time, her classmate Xu Jiarong asked if everything was alright at home and if she needed any help upon her return.","\"Something came up, but it's fine now. Thank you for your concern,\" Song Luokui replied.","Xu Jiarong said, \"I'm glad it's okay now. Let me know if you need anything.\"","\"Mmhmm, thank you.\"","After school, it was Chi Yu who came to pick her up again. As Song Luokui fastened her seatbelt, she asked, \"Don't you have to go to work?\"","\"There are plenty of people at the company,\" Chi Yu replied. \"If they can't function without me, then they're not much use.\"","\"I suppose.\"","...","While Chi Yu took Song Luokui to school, Sheng Rong also sent Song Luosheng away. Only then did she quietly ask Song Moqian, \"Is this related to that scoundrel from the Lin Family?\"","Song Moqian wrote something on her palm with his finger. Sheng Rong's expression turned cold, her hand gripped tightly by Song Moqian's. \"Don't worry. They won't be able to cause much more trouble.\"","\"You can't let this happen again,\" Sheng Rong said worriedly. \"You need to have more people with you. If something happened to you... what would Luokui and Luosheng do?\"","Song Moqian smiled and squeezed her hand. \"Don't worry, I won't leave you a lonely widow.\"","Tears welled up in Sheng Rong's eyes as she tightened her grip on his hand. She was scared too, but she had to remain calm.","Song Moqian helped wipe her tears. \"I'm sorry for worrying you.\"","\"Just rest and recover soon,\" Sheng Rong said. \"There are still many matters that need you.\"","\"I know.\"","Watching him fall asleep, Sheng Rong went to wash her face. They had been together for most of their lives - if something happened to Song Moqian, she probably couldn't accept it.","After resting for over a month, Song Moqian had mostly recovered, though he still couldn't be discharged. However, he could freely wander around the hospital every day.","When Song Luokui arrived at the hospital, she saw her father sitting on a chair by the flower bed, basking in the sun, with Uncle Zhang beside him. The two seemed deep in conversation.","Song Luokui called out to them, and they paused their chat.","Spotting her, Song Moqian immediately smiled. \"Luokui's here. How were your classes today?\"","Song Luokui approached. \"Pretty good.\"","Song Moqian didn't see Chi Yu, who had been following her. \"Where's Chi Yu?\"","\"He went to park the car.\"","Speak of the devil - Chi Yu soon joined them. After some casual conversation, Song Moqian went back to his room to rest.","\"My father said he might come to see you tomorrow,\" Chi Yu told Song Moqian.","Song Moqian seemed a bit surprised. \"He's finally showing some concern.\" However, he knew that aside from visiting him, Chi Yong likely had other matters to attend to. Although he hadn't returned to work yet, Song Moqian was still receiving updates, and the investigation into this incident was still ongoing.","The next day, when Chi Yong visited, neither Chi Yu nor Song Luokui were present, nor was Song Luosheng - only Sheng Rong was there.","The three spoke in the hospital room for about half an hour before Chi Yong left.","After his departure, Sheng Rong said quietly, \"I suppose we've truly boarded the Chi Family's ship now.\"","\"As long as Luokui and Chi Yu are together for a day, we're all on the same boat,\" Song Moqian replied.","\"Children are a debt, after all!\"","\"But it's no matter,\" Sheng Rong said. \"The Chi Family has been around for so many years - no one will dare bully Luokui anymore.\"","\"You're right,\" Song Moqian agreed. \"As parents, don't we just want our children to be comfortable and able to do as they please?\"","\"He did mention wanting Luokui and Chi Yu to settle down soon, though.\"","Song Moqian nodded. \"They can settle down, but Luokui hasn't even graduated yet. We'll also need to pick an auspicious date. Luokui's opinion is the main factor.\"","\"Mmhmm, I'll ask Luokui about it later,\" Sheng Rong said.","\"Alright.\"","Song Luokui still didn't know about the plan for her and Chi Yu to get engaged, because they hadn't been dating for very long.","She thought she should at least wait until graduation.","So when Sheng Rong asked her, she was confused, \"Isn't it too soon?\"","Sheng Rong: \"Then when do you think is a good time?\"","Song Luokui lowered her head: \"...At least until graduation. What if...what if we have a falling out and break up in the meantime?\"","Sheng Rong: \"...You're still thinking about breaking up?\" She knew how Chi Yu felt about her dear Luokui.","Song Luokui: \"It's just a possibility.\" Her voice grew quieter as she spoke, mainly because she felt it was a bit too soon. She didn't expect Chi Yu to come to her family with gifts and then propose so quickly.","On the side, Song Luosheng chimed in: \"Exactly, if they're rushing it so fast, what if the Chi family looks down on us? Maybe it would be better if Luokui just dumps him one day if she falls out of favor with him.\"","Sheng Rong looked at him: \"You, someone without a girlfriend, shouldn't be talking.\"","Song Luosheng: ...He didn't have a girlfriend, so what?"]},{"number":168,"title":"Chapter 168: Settling Down 02","paragraphs":["Sheng Rong continued, \"It's Little Yu's father who hopes you two will settle down soon.\"","Song Luokui bit her lip. \"I... haven't specifically visited Uncle Chi and Aunt Yan yet.\"","Sheng Rong said, \"It's okay if you don't want to settle down yet. After all, you're still young.\" She patted Song Luokui's head. \"You can do whatever you want, it's up to you.\"","Song Luokui's mind raced through several thoughts. \"I'll talk to him about it.\" She wanted to communicate with Chi Yu, after all, it was a matter concerning both of them. Come to think of it, she was still wearing the ring he gave her.","\"That's fine, it mainly depends on you two.\"","\"Mm-hmm.\"","...","Song Moqian stayed in the hospital for another week before he could finally be discharged. Both Chi Yu and Song Luosheng had investigated the Lin Family—not Lin Cheng's family, but Minister Lin's family.","Now, in Song Luosheng's room at the Song residence, Chi Yu and Song Luosheng sat face to face. This was the first time the two had sat together without any disagreements.","Chi Yu handed over his findings. \"Although it appears to be the Lin Family on the surface, the Wei Family is behind them.\"","Song Luosheng also pushed his own investigation results to Chi Yu. As he flipped through Chi Yu's materials, he said, \"Wei Qing is still trapped abroad by me.\"","Chi Yu: \"Someone who can orchestrate such a big event—it's not something he could pull off.\"","Song Luosheng directly wrote a name on a blank paper with his pen. Chi Yu nodded, \"There's a high possibility. He and my father have vastly different opinions.\"","Song Luosheng: \"My father doesn't like him either.\"","Chi Yu took a sip of tea. \"For the next election, I think...\"","The two chatted in the room for quite a while. Song Luokui knocked on the door and brought in some fruit. \"You two haven't started fighting yet, that's really rare.\"","Song Luosheng picked up an orange and started peeling it. \"Who do you think it's for?\"","Song Luokui was a bit embarrassed. \"For me, of course. My brother is being gracious. Hehe, quickly eat some fruit.\"","Chi Yu also picked up an orange and started peeling. When both had finished, they simultaneously offered their oranges to Song Luokui, followed by another intense eye contact. Sparks seemed to fly in the air.","Song Luosheng looked at Song Luokui: \"Kuikui, which one do you choose?\"","Song Luokui: ... Why did she come to deliver fruit?","Song Luokui chuckled twice, taking both oranges. \"I can eat two. I'll eat both, both.\" She began eating a slice from the left, then a slice from the right.","Song Luosheng: \"At least you have a conscience, starting with the one I peeled first.\"","Song Luokui: ... Do they have to compete over everything?","Chi Yu didn't say anything, just poured a cup of tea for Song Luokui.","Song Luokui gave each of them a piece of fruit. \"You two eat, I brought these especially for you.\" In the end, she ate first.","\"What were you two discussing earlier?\" Song Luokui asked while eating, her cheeks puffing out.","Chi Yu: \"Nothing much, just talking business.\"","Song Luosheng nodded. \"Yes, business.\"","Song Luokui was surprised. \"You two are going to collaborate in business?\"","Chi Yu: \"Yes, we can cooperate in certain areas.\"","Song Luosheng: \"That's right.\"","Song Luokui looked at her brother strangely. Why was her brother constantly agreeing? Shouldn't he be refuting Chi Yu? Why was she so disbelieving?","But it was good that they weren't arguing or fighting. As for what they were saying, she didn't want to delve too deeply.","The three stayed in Song Luosheng's room for a while before going out, as it was time for dinner. That evening, Chi Yu simply had dinner at the Song family's home.","After dinner, Song Luokui brought him to her room. She wanted to ask him about settling down.","Chi Yu sat on a chair to one side, and Song Luokui sat on his lap, leaning against him. \"Mom said Uncle Chi wants us to settle down soon. What do you think?\"","Chi Yu played with her hand. \"What do you think?\"","Song Luokui mumbled, \"I think... it's a bit too soon.\"","Chi Yu leaned in, his nose tip touching hers. \"Then when do you think would be better?\"","Song Luokui: \"At least wait until I graduate.\"","Chi Yu kissed her once. \"But I want to marry you right after you graduate.\"","Song Luokui covered her mouth, her eyes wide. \"Wouldn't that be too fast?\"","Chi Yu interlocked their fingers tightly. \"Too fast? If possible, I'd like to marry you this year. That way, you can come straight home to our place every day, without needing to find excuses.\"","Song Luokui: \"...That's too fast. I'm not ready yet.\"","Chi Yu kissed her hand. \"Okay, I'll wait until you agree. No problem. Whenever you want.\"","Song Luokui: \"But Uncle Chi...\"","Chi Yu: \"My father is just looking out for me. But could you find some time to come back with me to meet my parents?\"","Song Luokui was a bit nervous. \"After some time. I think it's too fast, and I'm a bit nervous.\"","Chi Yu: \"Don't be nervous. My parents like you a lot.\"","Song Luokui: \"How do you know?\"","Chi Yu: \"Because you're the prettiest girl in the compound. My parents are both looks-obsessed. They've even talked about you at home before.\"","Song Luokui found it a bit unbelievable. \"What did they say?\"","Chi Yu: \"They said the Song family's girl is as cute and pretty as a little dumpling, and it would be great if our family could have one too.\"","Song Luokui: \"How did you feel at that time?\"","Chi Yu: \"I didn't feel much, but later I thought having one at home would be nice. Now, I'm about to fulfill this wish.\" Chi Yu looked at her, smiling.","Song Luokui felt less nervous. \"Then... after some time? A month? See if your parents have time.\"","\"Okay.\"","The two cuddled together, chattering about many things. But not long after, Song Luosheng came knocking. Chi Yu immediately let go of her and stood up, holding her hand. \"I want to get married quickly so I won't be interrupted by your brother anymore.\"","Song Luokui: ...","Opening the door, it was indeed Song Luosheng. He looked at Chi Yu: \"You should go now.\"","Chi Yu also felt it was about time. But the two walked downstairs hand in hand. Song Luokui only returned after seeing him off.","Song Luosheng crossed his arms. \"Kuikui, you're not being tempted by him to settle down quickly, are you?\"","Song Luokui shook her head. \"No, not that fast.\"","Song Luosheng let out a sigh of relief. \"That's good.\" Thinking about his own sister actually settling down with another man, he felt a pang in his heart. His sister was still young.","In the weeks following the New Year, the situation grew increasingly turbulent. One day you'd hear about someone being taken away, the next you'd see another under investigation. The compound had become noticeably quieter, with even the gossips keeping their voices down. Moreover, there seemed to be more visitors than usual, though they were all there to see her father or mother.","The phone at home was ringing more often too, but never for Song Luokui.","Song Luokui paid little attention to all this. However, she did notice that Chi Yu and her own brother seemed rather busy lately. In fact, Chi Yu had only been calling her recently, no longer picking her up for classes or driving her home from school.","Song Luokui didn't mind, though. She wasn't the type to cling to her boyfriend constantly. She only reminded both of them to eat their meals on time and get enough rest, while she herself had plenty to keep her occupied."]},{"number":169,"title":"Chapter 169: Not Pregnant No. 01","paragraphs":["Since Song Luokui had been busy with family and company matters, she hadn't met up with her sisters for a long time. They were complaining in the group chat that she had abandoned her sisters after getting a man.","She was planning to meet up with her sisters when Zhang Xiyue secretly came to her with a question.","Zhang Xiyue looked pale and absent-minded. Song Luokui immediately asked, \"What's wrong? Are you feeling unwell?\"","Before Zhang Xiyue could speak, tears started rolling down her cheeks. Song Luokui thought something serious had happened and helped her to a chair. \"Quick, tell me. Did someone bully you? I can ask my brother to send someone over.\"","Zhang Xiyue wiped her tears and said, \"My period is several days late.\"","Song Luokui was puzzled. \"Then go see a doctor.\"","Zhang Xiyue cried again. \"I'm scared...\"","Song Luokui: ?","Zhang Xiyue: \"I should apologize first. I've been hiding something from you.\"","Song Luokui was perplexed. \"What have you been hiding from me? Don't tell me it's about having a boyfriend?\"","Zhang Xiyue froze. \"How did you know?\"","Song Luokui sighed. \"I knew earlier but didn't say anything since I was hiding it from you too. Now we're even.\"","Zhang Xiyue looked embarrassed. \"I didn't mean to hide it. Our relationship wasn't stable at first, and then I found out he's from the Chi Family, so...\"","Song Luokui handed her a tissue to wipe her tears. \"Well, I'm with Chi Yu now too. Forget about that, look at how pale you are. What's really going on? If you've broken up, there are plenty more fish in the sea.\"","Upon hearing this, Zhang Xiyue's face went paler as she clutched her belly. \"My period is late, and I'm scared.\"","Song Luokui didn't understand. \"Scared of what? Just go see a doctor.\"","Zhang Xiyue panicked. \"No, I can't see a doctor. I'm afraid...\"","Song Luokui: ?","Zhang Xiyue looked at her. \"Have you and the one from the Chi Family... you know?\"","Song Luokui: \"Know what? Don't beat around the bush.\"","Zhang Xiyue closed her eyes and blurted, \"Have you two slept together?\" She opened one eye to look at Song Luokui.","Song Luokui blushed and nodded hesitantly. \"So what?\"","Zhang Xiyue leaned closer, her eyes glinting with curiosity. \"How was it? Is the one from the Chi Family any good?\"","Song Luokui blinked. \"Ahem, what are you trying to say?\" He was more than good, strong and powerful, gentle and considerate, taking it step by step... ahem.","Zhang Xiyue: \"Did he take any precautions?\"","Song Luokui nodded. \"Yes.\" He took great precautions every time, never running out of protection in the nightstand. Suddenly realizing something, she looked at Zhang Xiyue's belly. \"Don't tell me you...\"","Zhang Xiyue clutched her belly, about to cry again. \"I... just once last month, and now my period is late... I'm scared.\"","Song Luokui: \"Didn't you take the pill?\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"I thought one time wouldn't get me pregnant.\"","Song Luokui sighed. \"...Let's go to the hospital first and get checked. It might not be anything. It's too early to worry. You're just scaring yourself.\"","Song Luokui stood up. \"I'll go with you.\"","Zhang Xiyue was afraid. \"But what if...\"","Song Luokui: \"Will he marry you?\"","Zhang Xiyue seemed lost. \"I don't know. I just wanted to date. I haven't thought about the future...\" She hadn't considered marriage at all.","Song Luokui: \"If you are pregnant and want to keep it, you can afford it. It doesn't matter if the man wants it or not. If you don't want it, you can terminate it.\" If Zhang's family couldn't afford it and the man wasn't reliable, she wouldn't recommend keeping it.","Zhang Xiyue hugged her belly. \"I want to keep it.\"","Song Luokui: \"If you want it, let's get checked first. What if you take the wrong medicine or do something harmful without knowing? I'll go with you to the hospital.\"","\"Okay.\" Zhang Xiyue didn't refuse. \"Let's go to a hospital farther away.\"","Song Luokui: \"Alright, but it has to be a top-tier hospital. Don't even think about going to some small clinic - that's dangerous.\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"I know, I'm not that stupid.\"","The two got ready and left the Song residence, with Song Luokui driving and the bodyguards following in another car.","After driving for over an hour, they reached a top-tier hospital on the other side of the city. The bodyguards didn't follow them inside as the two went to the gynecology department.","Little did they know, although the bodyguards didn't go in, Chi Yu and Song Luosheng found out that Song Luokui had gone to the hospital and registered in the gynecology department.","Since the two were discussing something related to the situation in an office, upon hearing this news, Song Luosheng grabbed Chi Yu's collar and punched him without a word...","Chi Yu was dumbfounded for a moment before running out, with Song Luosheng following...","...","Meanwhile, after several tests, Song Luokui and Zhang Xiyue found out that Zhang Xiyue's late period was only due to irregular sleep and lifestyle, and she wasn't pregnant.","Both breathed a sigh of relief. Song Luokui said, \"I told you not to scare yourself. Just go to the hospital and get checked if there's an issue.\"","Zhang Xiyue felt relaxed and hugged Song Luokui. \"You're the best. Woo woo, I was so scared. Let's go eat hot pot later. I had no appetite these past few days because of the worry.\"","Song Luokui: \"Okay, but be more careful next time and take proper precautions. Don't let this happen again. If the man doesn't take precautions, then he's not worth keeping if he only cares about his own pleasure and not your wellbeing.\"","Zhang Xiyue nodded shyly. \"I know. He was being careful before, it's just that we ran out, so...\"","Song Luokui: \"Anyway, be more cautious in the future. Let's go now.\"","\"Mm hmm.\"","Before they could leave the hospital, Fan Yilu, Zhang Xiyue's younger boyfriend, came running over in a panic. Seeing Zhang Xiyue, he immediately hugged her. \"What's wrong? I heard from a friend that you went to the gynecology department. Is it... don't be scared, we'll get married right away.\"","Zhang Xiyue stared at him, confused... How did he find out?","Song Luokui clicked her tongue, observing Fan Yilu's urgency and realizing he was a decent person, and he even proposed marriage, indicating he was a responsible man.","Fan Yilu thought she didn't want to when she didn't speak, his eyes almost welling up, \"You don't...\"","Zhang Xiyue immediately covered his mouth, \"I'm fine, I've just been staying up late and eating irregularly, so my stomach hasn't been great. I don't have any issues.\"","Fan Yilu paused, \"So you...\"","Zhang Xiyue shook her head.","Fan Yilu let out a sigh of relief, \"I thought... Nevermind, what did the doctor say?\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"The doctor said I need to eat properly.\"","Fan Yilu took her hand and started walking, \"Let's go eat, you scared me to death.\"","Zhang Xiyue frowned, \"Scared you to death? What if I'm pregnant, you don't want it?\"","Fan Yilu immediately reassured her, \"No, no, if you're pregnant, of course I want it, we'll get married right away.\"","Zhang Xiyue: \"...Aren't you a bit too young though?\"","Fan Yilu: ..."]},{"number":170,"title":"Chapter 170: Not Pregnant Again","paragraphs":["Song Luokui and Fan Yilu were still showing their affection in front of Zhang Xiyue. After Song Luokui coughed twice, they restrained themselves. Fan Yilu greeted Song Luokui somewhat embarrassedly, \"Hello, Sister-in-law. Thank you for accompanying her here.\"","Zhang Xiyue immediately pinched him, \"What do you call me if you call her Sister-in-law? Kuikui is my sister.\"","Fan Yilu was momentarily stunned, that was true. Otherwise, what should he call her? Fan Yilu was a bit conflicted since he called Chi Yu \"Brother\".","Song Luokui waved her hand dismissively, \"It's fine, just call me whatever. Fan can call me Senior Sister.\"","Zhang Xiyue nodded, \"That's better.\"","Fan Yilu had no objections, \"Senior Sister. Then let's go eat, I'll treat you.\"","\"Okay.\"","Just as they were leaving the hospital, two figures drenched in sweat ran towards Song Luokui. Chi Yu's mouth was even bruised and purple.","Song Luokui: ??","Chi Yu rushed in front of Song Luokui first, \"What's wrong? Are you... should we get married right away? I've already prepared the betrothal gifts, and I'll have my parents go for the marriage proposal immediately.\"","Song Luosheng pulled Chi Yu away, \"You wish! My sister hasn't even graduated yet, you beast. How could you do such a thing? Kuikui, come with your brother, let's go home?\"","Song Luokui: \"Ah? Did you guys misunderstand something?\"","Song Luosheng: \"What's there to misunderstand? He's just a beast. Kuikui, let's go home and break up with him. I'll help you raise the child! He's no good since my sister hasn't graduated yet!\"","At first, Chi Yu didn't refute him, but when he heard Song Luosheng mention breaking up, he immediately grabbed Song Luokui's hand, \"No breaking up. Marriage!\"","Song Luosheng retorted from the side: \"I don't agree!\"","Song Luokui: \"...Alright, alright, I'm not pregnant! What rumor did you guys hear?\"","Zhang Xiyue and Fan Yilu nearby were also dumbfounded, and they kept their distance, afraid of getting involved.","\"Not... not pregnant?\" Song Luosheng and Chi Yu both looked at Song Luokui's belly.","Song Luokui was so angry that she kicked each of them once, \"How did you know I was here?\"","The two immediately became uneasy. Song Luokui's forehead twitched as she said, \"Speak!\"","Chi Yu put his hands down in front of his belly, standing obediently in front of Song Luokui with his eyes downcast, \"The situation hasn't been good lately, I was afraid something would happen to you, so...\"","Song Luosheng also answered obediently, \"The bodyguards told me... I asked them to report your whereabouts to me. You know the situation hasn't been good lately...\"","Song Luokui folded her arms across her chest, \"Then how did you come to think I was pregnant?\"","Chi Yu: \"...The message said you went to the gynecology department.\"","Song Luosheng: \"I heard the same thing.\"","Song Luokui sighed, she looked at Chi Yu's bruised mouth, \"What happened to your mouth?\"","Chi Yu immediately pointed at Song Luosheng beside him.","Song Luosheng immediately became uneasy, \"Well, I heard you... so I thought he was a beast?\"","Song Luokui pinched the bridge of her nose, \"I just came with Xiyue to see the doctor.\"","Zhang Xiyue quickly said, \"Yes, yes, it's my fault. I asked Kuikui to come with me to the hospital.\"","Song Luosheng blurted out, \"Then why the gynecology department?\"","Zhang Xiyue's face turned red. Did she have to say she suspected she was pregnant, so she came...","Song Luokui: \"Brother, the gynecology department doesn't only treat that one thing. Women also have their own privacy, okay?\"","Song Luosheng immediately apologized, \"Sorry.\"","Chi Yu also apologized from the side, \"Sorry.\"","Fan Yilu also apologized, \"It's my fault. Xiyue wasn't feeling well, I should have accompanied her. Chi Yu and Song, I'm sorry.\"","Song Luokui: \"It's not your fault. You guys go ahead, we can have that meal another time. I'll go back with them.\"","Zhang Xiyue quickly nodded, \"Okay, bye.\"","\"Bye.\"","Song Luokui got into her car, and Chi Yu and Song Luosheng immediately rushed to take the front passenger seat. In the end, Song Luokui put her bag in the front passenger seat, forcing the two men to sit in the back.","Song Luosheng: \"Kuikui, let me drive. Your brother will serve you.\"","Song Luokui: \"You think my driving skills aren't good?\"","Song Luosheng: \"No, no. Kuikui's skills are great.\"","Chi Yu nodded from the side, \"It's an honor for you to drive for us.\"","Song Luosheng glanced at him, what a brown-noser!","Song Luokui didn't say anything. After a while, Song Luokui braked hard, causing Chi Yu and Song Luosheng to lurch forward in the back.","Neither Chi Yu nor Song Luosheng dared to speak after that, even though they had just praised Song Luokui's driving skills.","Song Luokui's driving skills were indeed fine, but she had been sideswiped by another car. The other driver, a woman, got out and yelled loudly, \"How can you drive like that! Can't you see where you're going!\"","Song Luokui didn't say anything, she just rolled down the rear window. The man immediately saw the two men in the back staring at him intently.","The bodyguards also got out of the car and surrounded the man.","The man's legs immediately went soft, \"I'm sorry, I'm sorry. It's my fault, my fault. I'm sorry.\"","After a while, the traffic police arrived and investigated the incident. They determined that the man was at fault. This was Song Luokui's luxury car, and even with insurance, the man would have to pay a hefty sum.","On the way back, neither Chi Yu nor Song Luosheng said another word, and they behaved obediently.","When they returned home and sat on the living room sofa, one of them poured her tea, and the other washed fruits for her. Song Luokui had calmed down as she sipped her tea and ate the fruits, asking, \"Aren't you two going to work?\"","Chi Yu: \"Nothing much going on at the company. It's been several days since I've accompanied you, so I wanted to be with you today.\"","Not to be outdone, Song Luosheng said, \"Brother doesn't have much going on either. Kuikui, if you want to go out and play somewhere, I can take you.\"","Song Luokui: \"No, I'm tired today and want to rest.\"","Song Luosheng: \"I'll check if Aunt Gui has finished cooking and get you some chicken soup to supplement you.\"","Chi Yu sat beside her and held her hand, \"It's good that nothing's wrong.\" He had even thought of names for the child.","Song Luokui looked at him and touched his bruised mouth, \"Does it hurt? Do you need to put some medicine on it?\"","Chi Yu: \"It's fine, it doesn't hurt.\"","Song Luokui remembered what he had said earlier, \"You really did prepare the betrothal gifts?\"","\"Yes,\" Chi Yu didn't lie. He had not only prepared them but would occasionally add more items to them.","Song Luokui also thought about the idea of visiting Chi Yu's family, \"See when we can go and visit your family?\"","Chi Yu tightened his grip on her hand, \"Sure, I'll ask them when they're available.\"","\"Okay.\"","Song Luosheng came out of the kitchen and saw the two sitting very close together, not knowing what they were talking about. Chi Yu was even smiling. He immediately spoke up, \"Kuikui, dinner is ready.\"","Song Luokui looked over, \"Okay.\" Song Luokui stood up, and Chi Yu rose with her.","Song Luosheng: \"Why don't you go home for dinner? You're always eating at my place.\"","Chi Yu: \"Aunt Gui's cooking is better.\"","Aunt Gui laughed from the side, \"Eat more if it's good.\"","Song Luosheng: ...Brownnoser!"]},{"number":171,"title":"Chapter 171: Visiting","paragraphs":["Regarding Song Luokui going to visit the Chi Family, Chi Yu informed his parents about it soon, and they scheduled it for Saturday.","On Friday evening, Song Luokui was a bit nervous. She had seen Chi Yu's parents in the estate before, but she only treated them as ordinary uncles and aunts in the estate, perhaps exchanging polite greetings on the street.","However, this time she was going to visit them, which was a different identity, so Song Luokui tossed and turned almost until midnight before falling asleep.","It was unknown whether Chi Yu knew she was nervous, but at this moment he sent her a message: \"Are you asleep?\"","Song Luokui immediately picked up her phone when she saw it light up and replied: \"No, I'm a little nervous.\"","Chi Yu: \"Want to voice call?\"","After thinking for a moment, Song Luokui picked up her earphones and answered Chi Yu's voice call.","\"Hello?\" It was Chi Yu's smooth voice on the other end.","\"Hmm.\" Song Luokui responded, playing with a small plush toy on her bed.","Chi Yu: \"Should I tell you a story?\"","Song Luokui immediately smiled, \"I'm not a kid anymore.\"","Chi Yu: \"Who said only kids can listen to stories? You're my big kid, you can listen too.\"","The smile on Song Luokui's lips didn't fade. \"Then sing for me. You sang very well when we were in Banras before.\"","Chi Yu didn't hesitate, \"Okay.\"","Song Luokui closed her eyes and listened to Chi Yu singing a slow foreign song. She didn't understand the language, but it sounded beautiful, and her head started to feel heavy.","After a while, Chi Yu finished singing and called out to Song Luokui, \"Luokui?\"","There was no response from the other end, so he called again, \"Baby?\"","Turning up the volume to the maximum, Chi Yu could faintly hear Song Luokui's breathing – she had fallen asleep. He then softly said, \"Wifey, good night.\"","Song Luokui knew nothing about it and almost overslept the next day. When she went downstairs, Chi Yu was already sitting in their living room, while Song Luosheng was sitting by the side, looking displeased but saying nothing.","Song Luokui: \"Sorry, I overslept.\"","Chi Yu: \"It's okay, take your time, no rush. It's just a few steps away anyway.\" He stood up. \"Should we have breakfast first?\"","Song Luokui: \"Hmm.\"","From the side, Song Luosheng said, \"Brother, you can accompany her.\"","Song Luokui: \"...Brother, don't cause trouble. How would that look?\" If it wasn't for the two families meeting for their marriage.","Song Luosheng realized it would be inappropriate, so he picked up a newspaper and started reading it.","After Song Luokui finished breakfast and got ready, she and Chi Yu took the gift and left the Song Family to visit the Chi Family.","At this time, the Chi Family home had already been cleaned spotless by the maid Aunt Qian early in the morning. There was not a single piece of trash on the table or in the trash cans, and Aunt Qian kept looking outside to see if they had arrived.","Chi Yong seemed quite composed, reading a newspaper, \"No need to rush, our son hasn't been gone for long.\"","From the side, Yan Sui said, \"Hmm, no need to rush, so you can turn the page of your newspaper now.\"","Chi Yong: ...","\"They're here, I see the young master and the young lady from the Song Family walking over,\" Aunt Qian came in and said.","Chi Yong immediately put down the newspaper and straightened his collar. \"How do I look today?\"","Yan Sui: \"You look fine.\"","As she said this, she also stood up and looked out the window. When Song Luokui and Chi Yu walked to the door, the two of them immediately stood up.","As the door opened, Chi Yu came in first with the gifts. \"Father, Mother.\"","Song Luokui followed behind, greeting them a bit shyly, \"Uncle Chi, Aunt Yan.\"","Yan Sui immediately took the gifts from her hands. \"You're here, and you even brought gifts. How thoughtful of you. Come in and sit down. Have some fruit – Little Yu said you like cherries and strawberries, we have those here, as well as bananas, apples, oranges, buddha's hand fruits, and more. Tell Auntie what you'd like to eat.\"","From the side, Chi Yong said, \"Yes, yes, come and sit down. Have you had breakfast? I'll ask Aunt Qian to make something for you.\"","Song Luokui nodded obediently, \"I ate before coming.\"","Yan Sui: \"Then have some fruit.\"","Aunt Qian also quickly brought tea and a few plates of pastries and small cakes, filling the coffee table in the living room with delicious food.","Chi Yu sat beside Song Luokui. This was the first time he had seen his parents so enthusiastic.","They both smiled warmly at Song Luokui, speaking in a gentle tone, asking her some questions, mainly about whether her studies were stressful, if anyone at school bullied her, if their son had bullied her, and so on.","Afterwards, they also inquired about Song Moqian and Sheng Rong.","Soon after, Yan Sui brought out a photo album and showed Song Luokui pictures, most of which were of Chi Yu from childhood to adulthood.","There were more photos from his childhood, but fewer as he grew older.","\"He didn't like taking pictures after growing up, so there are fewer photos,\" Yan Sui said.","Song Luokui looked at Chi Yu and raised her eyebrows – he didn't like taking photos? They had a lot of couple photos together. Chi Yu hooked her finger.","Song Luokui turned back and continued looking. Yan Sui pointed at one photo and said, \"This was taken after he got into a fight with your brother and was caught. Isn't he cute? He was in pain then, but he didn't cry.\"","From the side, Chi Yong added, \"I punished him severely afterwards.\"","Yan Sui: \"Speaking of which, he and your brother fought from childhood to adulthood. Your brother must have resented him going to your family's home, right? He deserved it. If I had known this earlier, I wouldn't have let him be so arrogant when he was young.\"","Song Luokui smiled, \"A little bit.\" Chi Yu, eating fruit on the side, didn't refute.","Afterwards, Song Luokui also saw his high school photos. In the pictures, Chi Yu had already started showing hints of his stunning looks as an adult – aloof, wearing a school uniform, holding a basketball.","There were also group photos of him with the basketball team, with Chi Yu in the center, wearing a sweatband on his forehead and a basketball jersey, his muscular arms visible, standing out from the crowd at a glance.","After chatting with Yan Sui and Chi Yong for a while, Chi Yu took Song Luokui upstairs to his room.","Chi Yu directly let her sit on his bed, while Song Luokui was still holding the photo album. \"I don't think I saw you much when you were in high school. Or did we ever meet?\"","Song Luokui pointed at a photo of him in his high school uniform. \"You looked quite fresh at that time, very handsome.\"","Chi Yu moved closer to her: \"I've seen you before, but you probably haven't noticed me. Don't I look good now?\"","Song Luokui raised her eyes: \"You look good, but now you look mature, while before you seemed a bit younger.\" There is a difference between being a tall young man and being out in the world.","Chi Yu put his hand on his head, \"You mean I look old now? I think I need to prove otherwise.\" With that, he leaned in towards her.","Song Luokui fell back on the bed, pushing him away, \"No, no, you're more attractive now, not old at all.\"","Chi Yu gave her a light kiss without teasing her further, then pulled her up. It was only then that Song Luokui took a good look around his room. His room was about the same size as hers, as the rooms in the large courtyard house were all similar in style, but the layouts were a bit different.","Apart from a single bed, there wasn't much else in the room, just a desk, a cabinet, and some models displayed on one side.","Chi Yu: \"I started moving out during college, so I don't have many belongings.\""]},{"number":172,"title":"Chapter 172: Traveling","paragraphs":["Song Luokui nodded, \"Same as my brother, his room is pretty much the same too.\"","Song Luokui put down the photo album and took out a book from the desk, surprisingly it was a textbook from when Chi Yu was in high school. She casually said, \"There won't be any love letters in there, will there?\"","Chi Yu was just about to say, \"No.\"","The next second, Song Luokui took out a paper heart from between the pages of the book...","Song Luokui looked at the paper heart and then at Chi Yu, who was dazed for a moment. Song Luokui let out a \"pffft\" of laughter.","Song Luokui: \"Can I open it up and look?\"","Chi Yu frowned, \"I didn't know it was there, if I had known I would have thrown it away for sure.\"","Song Luokui: \"So can I open it?\"","Chi Yu scrutinized her expression, \"You... will you get mad?\"","Song Luokui shook her head, \"No, why would I? You said you didn't know about it, right? My brother often has stuff like this too.\"","Chi Yu: \"Okay then, go ahead and open it.\"","When Song Luokui opened it up, she found that it wasn't a love letter, or rather, it wasn't a love letter someone had written to Chi Yu, but rather a sketch of her.","Song Luokui's expression froze for a few seconds as she looked at Chi Yu, \"When did you draw this?\"","Chi Yu leaned in to take a look, \"What?\" Then he remembered, there was a date in the bottom right corner, from two years ago.","As he recalled, Chi Yu felt like he was transported back to that night when he had woken up from a dream in the middle of the night, picked up a pen and paper, and sketched her before folding it into a heart shape and putting it inside the book.","Song Luokui blinked, \"Huh?\"","Chi Yu looked at her and leaned down to whisper a couple of sentences in her ear.","Song Luokui's face instantly flushed with a light blush. She immediately reached out and pinched his muscular arm. However, Chi Yu grabbed her hand and slid it under his shirt, \"Feel free to pinch wherever.\"","Song Luokui gave him a stern look, but couldn't stay mad, tilting her head up to bite his Adam's apple...","Chi Yu's hand immediately tightened around her...","It wasn't until lunchtime that the two emerged from the room, Song Luokui's eyes were slightly red and her blush hadn't faded, but her clothes were perfectly in place. Yan Sui looked at the two standing together with satisfaction, thinking about how their children would be the cutest in the whole manor when they had them.","After finishing lunch and staying for a little while longer, Chi Yu said he wanted to take her out to play, and the two left.","\"Where are we going?\" Song Luokui asked as the car left the manor.","Chi Yu: \"To my place?\"","Song Luokui: \"You mean the place you moved to after leaving the manor?\"","\"Yeah.\"","\"Okay.\" Song Luokui had no objections.","They soon arrived at a single-floor apartment unit, with an overall gray and black color scheme. Although Chi Yu rarely came back, it was always kept clean by the staff.","Chi Yu pressed a few buttons, and all the curtains opened, lights turned on, and the air conditioning started, with an electronic voice at the entrance: \"Welcome home, master.\"","Song Luokui walked up to the floor-to-ceiling windows and looked outside at the towering skyscrapers. This was the most prosperous area of Jing City, and she could even vaguely make out the figures of corporate workers toiling away in the distant buildings.","Song Luokui: \"Can people outside see through this glass?\"","Chi Yu pressed a button, \"They can, if you switch to window mode they can see in. But for privacy reasons, it's usually set so they can't see in.\"","Song Luokui: \"It's better if they can't see in.\" She wouldn't want someone taking photos of them from across the way if they were doing anything... that would be so embarrassing.","After looking out for a while, she walked over to the couch and sat down, leaning her head back and letting out a yawn.","Chi Yu stood in front of her and reached his hand out, \"Want to go check out the bedroom?\"","Song Luokui: ?","When they got to the bedroom, Song Luokui realized why he had wanted her to see it - there were photos of the two of them hanging on the walls, and in the walk-in closet there were even some of her clothes, with makeup and toiletries set up in the bathroom too...","\"Wait, when did you prepare all this? I've never even been here before.\"","Chi Yu: \"Since I had everything set up at ChunWang Manor, I prepared a set here too. I figured you'd come here eventually.\"","Song Luokui gave him a look without saying anything, just marveling at his thoughtfulness.","It wasn't until that night when she stayed over that she realized it wasn't just thoughtfulness, but rather ill intentions. Thinking about it, Chi Yu ended up with a few more bite marks, which he accepted with satisfaction as he held her and let her bite wherever she wanted.","The weather was starting to get hot. In the dorm room, Wang Sisi came back from outside drenched in sweat, \"It's so hot, this awful weather. Good thing the dorm has air conditioning. Ah, finally cool. This is the worst time for job interviews.\"","Song Luokui was puzzled, \"Interviews?\"","Wang Sisi nodded, \"Yeah, for internships.\"","Song Luokui: \"Why didn't you go to your family's company in Lin Cheng?\"","Wang Sisi: \"I just wanted to try things out for myself first, you know? Try different things to see what suits me best. Plus it's just an internship, I'm still planning to go to grad school.\"","Song Luokui thought about it and agreed it made sense, \"You're right.\"","Next semester would be their senior year, and many people were already looking for internships. Even Song Luokui's company had taken on a few interns.","\"If you think it might work out, you could try applying to my brother's company or Song Luosheng's. Or even mine, the benefits are pretty good,\" Song Luokui said.","Wang Sisi: \"Okay, I'll look into it.\"","Song Luokui was the most relaxed in the whole dorm, with not too many classes at school. Besides attending classes, she would occasionally go to the company.","Recently, Chi Yu had been taking her to attend banquets and events. Now that they had met each other's parents, he felt more at ease bringing her along to social gatherings. At these events, his hand never left her waist, except when she needed to use the restroom and he would wait for her outside the door.","People gradually came to understand the nature of their relationship, as they had never seen Chi Yu speak so gently to anyone else before. They would often spot the two in a corner, Chi Yu leaning down to say something to Song Luokui, the two appearing exceptionally intimate.","Of course, there were also those who didn't approve, even harboring resentment - probably due to differing standpoints, as the alliance between the Chi and Song families would inevitably bring misfortune to certain parties.","During the May Day holiday, Chi Yu took Song Luokui abroad to travel, no longer needing to find excuses now that their relationship was out in the open. It was simply a trip to have fun.","At home, only Song Luosheng was relatively opposed, saying that who knows what Chi Yu would do when the two of them went out! But when Song Luokui acted coquettishly, Song Luosheng couldn't resist and had to agree, only threatening Chi Yu not to bully Song Luokui.","Chi Yu wondered in his heart what kind of bullying it would be.","Because of the hot weather, the two went to the beach again, but of course not just the beach. On this trip, Song Luokui experienced for the first time what it meant to move at the speed of life and death, what it meant to have a heart-pounding thrill..."]},{"number":173,"title":"Chapter 173: Attacked","paragraphs":["On the first day, the two spent their time directly at the beach hotel. This time they were not afraid of being seen at all. They boldly played on the beach, with many tourists around them. However, the two could brazenly sit on one side, applying sunscreen to each other without any concern.","Song Luokui still had a camera hanging around her neck, and Chi Yu kept taking pictures of her from time to time. They had a seafood feast for lunch and went for a massage in the evening. The happy day passed quickly.","On the second day, Chi Yu took Song Luokui shopping at the mall. However, on their way to the mall, Chi Yu noticed that they were being followed by another car.","What kind of car would follow them in a foreign country? The first possibility was kidnappers who wanted to abduct wealthy people. They might have taken an interest in them on the way, perhaps due to their luxurious attire.","The second possibility was Chi Yu's enemies – either foreign businessmen or officials who resented his rapid expansion and market dominance abroad, or someone from their home country who wanted to harm them. In any case, there were people with plans and malicious intentions to eliminate him.","Chi Yu was most concerned about the second possibility. At least with the first scenario, the kidnappers would delay for money, but with the second, money would be useless – they simply wanted him dead.","This time, when Chi Yu went out with Song Luokui, he had brought bodyguards with him – four of them, following them from behind.","When Chi Yu noticed the car following them, he immediately called the head bodyguard, \"Lin, someone is following us.\"","Lin: \"Boss, we have three cars trying to ambush us from the sides. Boss, you two get away quickly, we'll hold them off.\"","Chi Yu hung up the phone with a grave expression, \"Baby, hold on tight.\"","Song Luokui: ?","The next second, their car sped forward, with the scenery outside blurring past. Song Luokui's heart leapt, her eyes wide open. She glanced at Chi Yu, then looked in the rearview mirror and saw the cars behind them.","Song Luokui sensed something was amiss. One hand gripped the overhead handle tightly, the other clutching her safety belt. She watched the speedometer on the dashboard climb higher and higher, past 200 and still rising...","Their car was originally a convertible sports car. Chi Yu had raised the top at the start, probably because Song Luokui was wearing a strapless dress, and her chest was quite prominent. When they first came out, some people had looked over, so Chi Yu immediately raised the top. Little did he expect they would encounter pursuers later on.","Song Luokui kept glancing in the rearview mirror. Initially, she could see the front of the car behind them, but eventually, it disappeared from view.","The car's speed continued to climb as it sped along the winding mountain road. Chi Yu reached out and held Song Luokui's hand, \"Don't be afraid.\"","Song Luokui gripped his hand tightly, \"I'm not afraid. Just focus on driving, I trust you!\" She knew she couldn't be a burden now, and as the male lead, she felt Chi Yu would be alright.","Chi Yu grasped her hand and kissed it, \"I'm sorry.\" He let go and stepped on the gas, the car's speed now exceeding 300 mph...","Song Luokui had thought such high speed would leave the car behind, but soon enough, she saw the familiar front of that car again.","Her heart tightened, \"They've caught up.\"","Chi Yu gave a calm \"Hmm,\" and turned onto another road, soon merging into a stream of traffic. He overtook cars, changed lanes, driving rapidly forward...","\"Beep beep beep beep—\"","Various car horns blared, and people shouted curses, but Chi Yu paid no heed, continuing to weave through traffic at high speed. The car behind them did much the same, the two vehicles speeding one after the other.","\"Bang bang bang\" – the sound of gunshots rang out. The car swerved abruptly, causing Song Luokui to lurch forward. Her hands gripped tightly, her face pale, but she remained silent.","Chi Yu: \"Baby, keep your head down, don't be afraid.\"","Song Luokui did as he said.","The next moment, \"Bang,\" a bullet struck the rear window, but surprisingly, the car had bulletproof glass, leaving only a dent in the window.","Song Luokui didn't scream, but she had bitten her lip until it bled. This was simply too intense – her heart could barely take it. But she couldn't cry out or be afraid, nor could she panic, or she might distract Chi Yu.","Other cars weren't so calm, some emergency braking and causing various traffic accidents.","Some people, frightened, called the police, but this was a foreign country, and the police response wasn't very quick.","Chi Yu was still desperately trying to shake off the pursuers behind them. With a few more \"Bang bang bang\" sounds, not just the rear window but the front windshield had been shot at too.","Tears streamed down Song Luokui's face, but she dared not cry out.","This chase lasted over an hour before several more cars appeared. The car behind them vanished from the rearview mirror, having been rammed and its tires shot out by the other vehicles.","It was then that Chi Yu received a message, \"Boss, we got them.\"","Chi Yu: \"Talk later. Tie them up!\"","\"Yes.\"","Chi Yu immediately turned the car and headed for a wealthy neighborhood. It was only then that he paid attention to Song Luokui, seeing her with eyes closed, lips bitten bloody, her face pale, hands still gripping the armrests tightly.","She hadn't even let out a sound. Chi Yu's heart ached, and he quickly pulled over, grasping her hand, \"It's over now, don't be afraid.\"","Chi Yu held her in his embrace, and Song Luokui collapsed, trembling as she hid in his arms, her tears finally flowing unchecked.","Still somewhat afraid, she cried, \"Will it be safe for us here? Can we go back?\"","Chi Yu hugged her, gently kissing her tears away, \"Don't be afraid, it's all over now, I'm sorry.\" He rubbed her back soothingly.","Song Luokui: \"Let's go back.\"","\"Okay.\" Chi Yu wiped her tears, then started the car again, driving into the wealthy neighborhood and directly into a villa.","After the car stopped in the garage, Chi Yu helped unbuckle Song Luokui's seatbelt, then carried her upstairs to the villa. There were servants in the villa, and Chi Yu instructed: \"Bring a hot glass of milk to the room, and prepare some food.\"","\"Yes.\"","Chi Yu placed her on the bed and was about to get a towel to wipe her face, but Song Luokui kept holding onto him tightly, looking like a frightened little rabbit. Chi Yu had no choice but to keep embracing her, kissing her continuously.","\"I'll make them pay for this.\"","\"Don't be afraid, we're safe now.\"","\"Baby was very brave just now, super brave and obedient. It was my fault.\"","Chi Yu kept kissing her forehead, eyes, nose, and then licked her lips before kissing her deeply.","Soon after, a servant knocked on the door, and Chi Yu finally released the flushed Song Luokui."]},{"number":174,"title":"Chapter 174: Comfort","paragraphs":["Chi Yu brought in some food, and first handed Song Luokui the milk, \"Drink some milk first.\"","Song Luokui took it and drank the milk in one gulp, but a drop remained at the corner of her mouth. When Chi Yu saw it, his eyes darkened, and he immediately moved in to kiss her.","Song Luokui tightly embraced his neck. Although she had put on a good show earlier, she was truly terrified afterwards. She clung to Chi Yu like a baby kangaroo, even following him to the bathroom.","Chi Yu: ...","What could he do?","He held her in his arms on the bed and comforted her for a long time until Song Luokui became drowsy and fell asleep. Suddenly, she opened her eyes again, \"I want to take a bath, then sleep after a bath.\"","She wanted to wash away her bad luck. She had forgotten to check the calendar before going out today.","Chi Yu hesitated, \"Are you sure?\"","Song Luokui: \"Yes, I am!\"","Chi Yu picked her up and carried her straight into the bathroom...","When the two came out, Song Luokui had fallen asleep in Chi Yu's arms, her whole body aching. Chi Yu was only wearing a towel around his waist. He laid her on the bed and held her for a while before Lin called.","Chi Yu: \"Understood, wait for me downstairs.\"","Chi Yu kissed Song Luokui on the forehead, got out of bed, changed his clothes, and carefully left the room.","Downstairs, a group of men in black suits stood in the hall, with a few others bound and kneeling on the floor in front of them.","As soon as Chi Yu went down, the men in black greeted him: \"BOSS.\"","Chi Yu made a sound of acknowledgment and sat on a sofa. He showed no expression, slowly poured himself a cup of tea, took a sip, and then spoke, \"Is the interrogation done?\"","Lin walked over and whispered in Chi Yu's ear, \"They were paid to do a job, related to the Mandela Family.\"","Chi Yu's eyes turned cold. \"The Mandela Family? Isn't the Mandela Family on good terms with the Wei Family?\"","Lin: \"The Wei Family Master and the Mandela Family leader shook hands on a partnership a long time ago, according to news reports, but it was said later that the two families were not on good terms.\"","Chi Yu: \"That's impossible, there are no permanent enemies. Look into it further. As for these men, don't leave any of them.\"","\"Understood.\"","\"Also, have someone take care of something else for me...\" Chi Yu instructed.","\"Chi Yu?\" On the stairs, Song Luokui, wearing a nightgown and barefoot, stood on the steps, rubbing her eyes.","The little one's exposed skin was as white as snow, with faint traces of kiss marks even visible on her ankles, hinting at someone's tender kisses...","A green jade bracelet adorned her slender, snow-white wrist, making her look like an ethereal fairy.","The group of men in black suits immediately lowered their heads, not daring to look further. Was this to be their future lady boss?","Over there, when Chi Yu heard her voice, he immediately stood up. \"Why did you come down?\" His voice was completely different from the earlier coldness and indifference.","Chi Yu gently took off his coat and wrapped it around her before picking her up in a princess carry. Turning to Lin, he said, \"You take those men away.\"","\"Yes.\" With a wave of Lin's hand, the men were quickly taken away, though many guards remained at the villa.","Chi Yu carried her back to the room. \"Why did you wake up?\"","Song Luokui was still a bit dazed, \"I was scared when you weren't here.\"","Chi Yu kissed her cheek. \"I'm sorry.\"","Song Luokui: \"Did you finish your work? Did I disturb you?\" She had just noticed all the people downstairs.","Chi Yu: \"It's done. Shall I stay with you and let you sleep for a while?\"","\"Mm.\"","Chi Yu put her back on the bed, changed his clothes right next to her, then got into bed and held her, lulling her back to sleep.","Song Luokui didn't sleep very well. She seemed to have a dream where the script writer had returned. She felt like someone was constantly chasing her and Chi Yu. Suddenly, there was a \"bang\" sound, and Chi Yu's whole head exploded.","Song Luokui's eyes widened as she grabbed him and shouted, \"He's the male lead, isn't he? Why did he die? Why, why?\"","The script writer: \"Because of you.\"","\"Ah!\" Song Luokui immediately sat up in bed. Beside her, Chi Yu quickly embraced her. \"Were you scared? Don't be afraid.\"","He comforted her, but in his heart, he thought those men had gotten off too easily.","Song Luokui clutched Chi Yu's shirt, breathing heavily. \"You're okay.\"","Chi Yu: \"Yes, yes, I'm fine, you're fine too. Don't be afraid, we're both fine.\"","Song Luokui's pounding heart finally calmed down. She lay back down and wiped the sweat from her forehead. \"That scared me to death.\"","She had dreamed the script writer had returned, which truly terrified her.","After lying down for a while, Song Luokui let out a breath. \"I'm okay now. What time is it?\" They were supposed to go shopping today, but the whole day had been wasted.","Chi Yu: \"A little past three in the afternoon.\"","Song Luokui tried to get out of bed. \"I slept for so long? No wonder I feel my whole body is soft. I need to get up and exercise.\"","Chi Yu raised an eyebrow. \"Exercise in bed?\"","Song Luokui kicked him. \"You wish. You're becoming less and less of a gentleman. You're just a rascal now.\"","Chi Yu chuckled. \"When you're in my arms, if I were any more of a gentleman, I might not be a man anymore. But since you put it that way, I don't mind being a rascal for now.\"","\"Ah ah ah ah, get away from me.\" The two playfully wrestled on the bed for a while before Song Luokui finally got out, her spirits much improved.","After washing her face, Song Luokui stood in front of the floor-to-ceiling window and began exercising.","Watching her move, Chi Yu noticed the pool downstairs and suggested, \"Why don't we go swimming?\"","Song Luokui saw it too. \"Sure.\"","The two changed into swimsuits and went down. Song Luokui immediately jumped into the pool with a \"splash\" and swam back and forth for several laps before finally getting tired. She walked up and sat in a chair by the side, drinking some fruit juice to rest.","Chi Yu also swam a few laps before coming up. \"Should I give you a massage?\"","Song Luokui lay on the lounger. \"Okay.\"","...","\"Where are you putting your hands?\"","\"Don't those areas need a massage too?\"","Song Luokui: \"...You big rascal!\"","They didn't go shopping, but Chi Yu had someone call her over to the hall, where service staff displayed exquisite clothes, bags, and models showcasing the outfits for Song Luokui.","In addition to clothes and bags, there were also various pieces of jewelry, and servants had prepared desserts and milk tea.","Song Luokui pointed at two handbags and asked Chi Yu, \"Which one looks better?\"","Chi Yu replied, \"They both suit you. Just buy them both.\"","Song Luokui glanced at them and didn't hesitate further, \"Alright.\"","She got a whole pile of clothes, several of the latest handbags, and countless other items. Chi Yu directly handed over his card, and the servants collected all the purchases.","After dinner that evening, Chi Yu took Song Luokui to the basement level. At first, Chi Yu felt a bit puzzled, but when Song Luokui saw the real firearms, she was dumbfounded.","Song Luokui looked at Chi Yu with a questioning expression.","Chi Yu asked, \"Shall I teach you how to use them?\""]},{"number":175,"title":"Chapter 175: The Gun Practice","paragraphs":["Song Luokui looked at him steadily for a while, and finally nodded, \"Okay.\" Relying on others for protection was not as good as becoming stronger herself, Song Luokui's heart softened, Chi Yu understood her.","First, he started teaching from disassembling and assembling, and then shooting.","Chi Yu stood behind Song Luokui, grabbed her hands, and helped her correct her posture. From a distance, the two were pressed together, hands forward, focused...","\"Bang\" a sound, \"Bullseye!\" the electronic voice sounded.","Song Luoying turned to look at Chi Yu, Chi Yu nudged her, \"Your turn?\"","Song Luokui: \"Mm.\"","Chi Yu let go, Song Luokui started the movements according to Chi Yu's instructions, \"Bang bang bang...\"","\"Miss, one ring, miss, miss, three rings...\"","Song Luokui finished shooting, her score was tragic, she reloaded and continued...","Chi Yu just stood by and watched her.","\"Miss, three rings, four rings...\"","\"Two rings, three rings, five rings...\"","\"Miss, three rings...\"","She shot several times, the highest being six rings, with three rings being the most common.","Song Luokui was about to continue when Chi Yu came over and pulled her hand, \"Isn't it sore? Let's take a break first?\"","Song Luokui sighed, \"Okay, time to review.\"","The servants brought over food, and the two rested on the sofa, Chi Yu helped massage her hands, \"Don't rush, it's just for fun.\"","Song Luokui looked at him, \"You... didn't encounter this kind of thing often before? When you were abroad.\"","Chi Yu: \"Not too often, I had bodyguards.\"","Song Luokui hugged him, \"There must have been many, I remember you had a scar on your back, was it a gunshot wound? Show me now.\"","Song Luokui tried to open Chi Yu's clothes as she spoke, but Chi Yu held her back, blinking, \"Being a rascal?\"","Song Luokui glared at him, \"Yes, I want to be a rascal to you, hurry up!\"","Chi Yu let go of his hands, allowing her to open his clothes. Song Luokui's hand went straight to his back, quickly feeling a protrusion, which was indeed a scar upon inspection.","\"Is this a gunshot wound? When did it happen?\" Song Luokui caressed the wound.","However, Chi Yu felt her hand on it was ticklish, he turned to look at her, \"I forgot, it might have been a few years ago.\"","Song Luokui let out a low \"mm\" sound, \"You've been through a lot.\" Yet Chi Yu suddenly felt a tightness in his lower abdomen, he turned his whole body and grabbed her hand, \"Do you want to see my other wounds?\"","Song Luokui: \"Hm?\"","Chi Yu exposed his upper body, Song Luokui saw scars of varying degrees on his abdomen, below the collarbones, chest, and arms.","Song Luokui touched each one, \"You said it wasn't much, how is this not a lot of wounds?\"","Chi Yu: \"Perhaps I got them during training, do you... want to kiss them?\"","Song Luokui slapped him on the back with a \"pa\" sound, \"Put your clothes back on, who are you trying to seduce?\"","Chi Yu smiled and hugged her, \"Seducing Miss Song, that beautiful, gracious, lovely, and adorable Miss Song.\"","Song Luokui's face reddened, and Chi Yu kissed her...","When they resumed shooting practice, Song Luokui's face was still red.","The electronic voice kept announcing the ring numbers she hit, suddenly a \"Bullseye\" came, Song Luokui thought she had misheard.","She looked at Chi Yu, Chi Yu nodded and made a cross sign, \"Bullseye!\"","Song Luokui smiled, but never scored that high again, that bullseye was just a fluke.","That night while resting, Chi Yu grabbed her, \"Want to count my wounds again? Mm, want to count the ones below too?\"","Song Luokui: \"...\"","For safety reasons, Song Luokui wasn't able to go out shopping or sightseeing the next day either, but Chi Yu took her to a place.","In a dim warehouse, many people were guarding, all dressed in black suits, with both foreigners and Chinese personnel who had gone out with Chi Yu.","Walking to the innermost part, they saw several people tied up, all of them sitting on chairs, with dejected and dazed expressions, their faces suggesting they had been beaten.","Song Luokui tightly gripped Chi Yu's hand, she felt like she had entered Chi Yu's other world, a world filled with conflict and danger.","Chi Yu patted her hand, \"I'm bringing you to get revenge.\"","The two approached those few people, with bodyguards quickly bringing chairs for them to sit.","With a wave of Chi Yu's hand, \"Begin.\"","Those people were immediately kicked to the ground and beaten for a long time, their heads trampled by feet. Someone handed Chi Yu a gun, which he passed to Song Luokui, \"Want to have some fun? Let them be your targets.\"","Recalling her skill level, Song Luokui shook her head vigorously, \"No, I'm afraid... I'll kill them.\"","Chi Yu let out a cold laugh, \"So what if they die?\"","He cocked the gun, the other bodyguards moved aside, \"Bang bang bang\" a few shots, the bullets landed right next to those people, not harming them, but forming the outline of a human figure.","Two of them immediately wet their pants.","Chi Yu sneered, \"Such cowardice to attempt an assassination?\"","A bodyguard then came over and whispered to Chi Yu, pointing at a bearded man: \"This one is the eldest son of the Mandela Family.\"","Chi Yu: \"He was one of the masterminds?\"","\"No, but that side might negotiate with you, sir.\"","Chi Yu: \"Then spare his life for now, the rest can be sent to Africa, they're short of miners.\"","\"Yes.\"","Next, Song Luokui watched as the people branded those few with a mark on their faces, further tormented them, and then left with them, leaving only the Mandela eldest son behind.","Chi Yu then took Song Luokui away.","Back at the villa, Chi Yu asked: \"Are you afraid of me?\"","Song Luokui shook her head, \"No fear.\" Evil people deserved punishment, those who could do such things should know the consequences.","Chi Yu embraced her, \"I'll gradually introduce you to my other world so you can understand me better. If you're afraid, then I won't let you leave.\"","Song Luokui nuzzled his chest, \"Mm, I won't leave.\"","Chi Yu kissed her forehead, \"I love you.\"","Song Luokui hugged him tightly, \"Me too.\"","The two embraced each other, enjoying this quiet moment.","After lunch, Chi Yu took Song Luokui to get makeup done, he was taking her to a party that evening.","The scale of this outing was quite grand. Bodyguards cleared the path ahead, with several escort vehicles following behind. Song Luokui and Chi Yu were in the middle, occasionally switching positions.","From the outside, nothing could be seen through the bulletproof glass windows. The side compartments of the vehicles held fully loaded firearms.","While Song Luokui previously thought this was an overreaction, she no longer felt that way, although being unable to freely go out and play still made her a little unhappy.","Sensing this, Chi Yu tightened his grip on her hand. \"Once I deal with these people, you can play however you want.\"","Song Luokui looked at him. \"I believe you.\""]},{"number":176,"title":"Chapter 176: Your Son is Not Here with Me","paragraphs":["The car arrived at a private estate. Chi Yu held Song Luokui's hand as they entered the magnificent grand hall, where they were immediately greeted by an attendant.","Chi Yu spoke with the attendant for a while before proceeding inside. Song Luokui looked around, noticing that everyone was holding a glass of wine. Well-dressed gentlemen in suits and ladies in beautiful gowns filled the ornately carved and brightly lit hall, reflecting the noble status of the host.","As Chi Yu talked with a gentleman, a towering foreigner approached them with two women and a man in tow.","Nan whispered in Chi Yu's ear, \"Boss, it's Mandela.\"","Chi Yu and Song Luokui immediately turned their attention towards them.","Abadde Mandela, the current head of the Mandela Family at the age of 52, had a wife, multiple mistresses, and numerous illegitimate children. His eldest son, born to his wife, was the one currently locked in a warehouse.","According to reports, Abadde had a penchant for young girls – a scandalous predilection that certainly would not be exposed to the public. Frowning, Chi Yu thought of the twisted tastes of some members of high society in foreign countries.","Abadde had his arm around a young woman, clearly his mistress. The couple trailing behind him bore some resemblance to Abadde, leading Chi Yu to assume they were his children, though uncertain if they were from his wife or mistresses.","The four approached Chi Yu's group, leading to a standoff. Despite being outnumbered four to three, Chi Yu's side did not appear disadvantaged.","Abadde broke into a smile first, extending his hand towards Chi Yu. \"Mr. Chi, it's an honor to finally meet you.\"","Chi Yu scrutinized Abadde, then his outstretched hand, before slowly reaching out to shake it. The others held their breath as the two men's hands met.","Rumors had circulated that Abadde's eldest son had offended Mr. Chi and was currently in his custody. Those in the know could not fathom why the son would dare provoke the formidable Mr. Chi.","Mr. Chi's ruthlessness was well-known. Even in Hua Country, he was someone not to be trifled with. Many had underestimated him due to his youth and attempted to eliminate him, only to suffer dire consequences themselves. No one dared to take him lightly.","After a prolonged handshake, Chi Yu and Abadde finally parted, with Song Luokui noticing the reddened marks on Abadde's hand.","Abadde's expression remained unchanged, but his eyes lit up when he turned to Song Luokui, extending his hand towards her. \"So this is Mr. Chi's companion? I wonder which esteemed family this outstanding young lady hails from.\"","Sensing Abadde's ill intent, Song Luokui swiftly hid behind Chi Yu, who patted her hand reassuringly. \"My wife is a bit shy.\"","Upon hearing this, Abadde looked at Chi Yu. \"Oh? I'm not familiar with her family from Hua Country. Perhaps I know her parents?\"","The Mandela Family had business interests in Hua Country, and Abadde had met many prominent figures as a foreign guest.","A smirk formed on Chi Yu's lips. \"You certainly know them – Mr. Song, whom your family has had conflicts with in the past.\"","Abadde's expression changed as he realized the two families he despised most in Hua Country had joined forces, despite rumors of their long-standing feud.","However, he quickly regained his composure. \"Mr. Chi, I apologize for my son's offense against you. I trust you have disciplined him sufficiently these past few days. When might he be allowed to return home?\"","Chi Yu's expression turned cold. \"So you expect me to let the person who tried to kill me go unpunished? Moreover, your son is not in my custody. I have no idea where he is. If you find him, please inform me.\"","Who could prove he had imprisoned Abadde's son?","Abadde replied, \"Mr. Chi, we are all intelligent people. My son will face legal consequences for his crimes.\"","Chi Yu's face remained impassive. \"Oh? So you do understand the concept of law? I thought that word wasn't in your dictionary. Let me reiterate – your son is not in my custody.\"","Abadde didn't believe him. \"I can offer you half of our tin mining business in the Americas.\"","Upon hearing this, the two children behind Abadde reacted negatively, particularly the son, who seemed about to protest until the daughter swiftly stopped him with a shake of her head.","Chi Yu shook his head. \"Your son is not with me.\"","Seeing his offers dismissed, Abadde forced a smile. \"Well, I hope you enjoy your evening, then.\"","\"You too,\" Chi Yu replied.","As Abadde and his group passed by, his mistress threw a seductive glance at Chi Yu, which he pointedly ignored.","After Abadde left, Chi Yu instructed Nan, \"Have our men and gear ready later. I fear he might try something after the party ends.\"","\"Understood.\"","Song Luokui clung tightly to Chi Yu's arm as he led her into a side lounge to rest. \"Are you hungry? Let me get you something to eat.\"","\"Sure.\"","Chi Yu returned shortly with food and, unexpectedly, a gun for Song Luokui. She blinked in surprise, unsure where to conceal it while wearing a gown.","\"I'll help you,\" Chi Yu assured her, proceeding to strap the gun to her thigh.","The intimate positioning flustered Song Luokui, though her dress's slit would allow easy access if needed. Chi Yu gave her a reassuring kiss. \"Don't worry, I won't let you get into danger.\"","Song Luokui squeezed his hand. \"Okay.\"","After a light meal, they rejoined the party, with Chi Yu introducing her as his fiancée to several acquaintances.","Once the event concluded, they departed in a different vehicle from their arrival, with several escort cars accompanying them. They switched vehicles midway, obscuring which one they occupied.","Two kilometers outside the estate, Nan suddenly warned, \"They're here!\"","They suddenly found themselves surrounded and intercepted by several cars on the road. One car from behind deliberately rammed into one of their vehicles with great force. A bodyguard immediately took out his weapon and fired at the tires of the attacking car, \"Bang!\"","The car's tire burst, and it crashed into the side.","The kill was on!","A fiercer assault ensued in the pitch-black night on the broad road, with a dozen cars chasing and ramming each other. Sounds of screeching tires, emergency braking, and bullets hitting the cars filled the air.","Chi Yu held Song Luokui tightly in his embrace, covering her ears, while she nestled against him, her hand caressing the weapon on his thigh.","Nan, seated in the front, kept a close watch on the situation, occasionally issuing commands.","The car carrying Song Luokui and her companions remained unscathed, speeding along the road. Yet, with Chi Yu's firm embrace, Song Luokui felt no trembling."]},{"number":177,"title":"Chapter 177: Solution","paragraphs":["Suddenly, two cars collided and exploded, causing a loud noise. Song Luokui lifted her head from Chi Yu's embrace and glanced at the rearview mirror, seeing thick smoke billowing.","Song Luokui was somewhat worried, \"Was it our people...?\"","Chi Yu: \"No.\"","Song Luokui tightly gripped Chi Yu's clothes, \"That's a relief.\"","The order of the cars was suddenly disrupted, with an enemy car ramming through the middle. A foreigner on board cursed loudly, and upon spotting Chi Yu's car, he swerved and collided right into it.","Chi Yu and Song Luokui felt their car get hit from behind. They quickly leaned forward, fortunately both wearing seatbelts. As the other car prepared to ram them again, Nan rolled down the window, aimed at the rear, and shot out one of the tires with a loud \"bang.\"","The enemy car swerved and crashed into their own vehicle.","The situation was intense, yet no one reported it to the police and no cops arrived, nor were there any other cars around. It seemed Mandela had coordinated with local authorities.","Their car continued forward while the enemy pursued. The car ahead suddenly braked, switching positions with Chi Yu's car and placing them at the front.","Song Luokui's car sped up, quickly creating distance from the pursuers.","After some time, Nan received a message: \"Boss, Bei's side is taken care of.\"","Chi Yu: \"Good, let's head back then.\"","\"Understood.\"","Song Luokui lifted her head from Chi Yu's embrace, \"What's taken care of?\"","Chi Yu turned on the car radio, and Song Luokui soon heard: \"Breaking news, Abude Mandela, the head of the Mandela Family, has been in a severe car accident and is in critical condition...\"","Song Luokui looked at Chi Yu, \"Was it...\"","Chi Yu played with her hand, \"No, he has too many enemies. I merely gave things a push.\"","Although Chi Yu said it lightly, the complexity was evident. As the male lead, he handled everything with ease.","Chi Yu: \"We can go out and play tomorrow. Where would you like to go?\"","Song Luokui: \"I want to buy gifts for everyone.\"","Chi Yu pondered, \"I can have the local specialties delivered. Tomorrow, we can go somewhere else to play.\" He knelt down, removed her shoes, and massaged her feet on his thigh. \"Wearing high heels is tiring.\"","Song Luokui hadn't realized it earlier, but now that the danger had passed, she felt the ache in her legs.","\"So, where would you like us to go play? Anywhere you say is fine.\"","Chi Yu looked up at her with a smile, \"Not afraid I'll sell you?\"","Song Luokui huffed, \"I'm not worth anything.\"","Chi Yu: \"You are a priceless treasure.\"","They returned to the villa, leaving the other cars and people to be dealt with by Chi Yu's subordinates. He only needed to focus on the outcome.","Back at the villa, Song Luokui went to take a shower while Chi Yu arranged the next steps with Nan in the living room.","\"Boss, how should we handle Mandela's eldest son?\"","Chi Yu: \"Same as before. Was the previous incident related to the mainland?\"","\"Yes, we traced it to several companies there.\"","Chi Yu: \"Give me the list.\"","\"Yes.\"","...After Song Luokui finished her shower, Chi Yu had come upstairs carrying food. \"You didn't eat much at the banquet. Would you like some more?\"","Song Luokui walked over, \"Yes, thank you.\"","The next day, to Song Luokui's surprise, Chi Yu took her to a casino. She frowned at him, \"Gambling isn't good.\"","Chi Yu pulled her close as they entered, \"I know, just for fun. Nothing big.\"","Song Luokui: \"Alright then.\"","Chi Yu exchanged for chips and led her to try various games, winning some and losing some, but overall winning more. Song Luokui thought about leaving, lest they lose everything.","Instead, Chi Yu brought her to a private room where a man in a blue suit stood to greet them, complimenting Song Luokui's beauty and how well she matched Chi Yu.","Chi Yu was pleased and had Song Luokui sit at one end of the table while the blue-suited man took the other end. Song Luokui immediately sensed they were about to gamble big.","Sure enough, when asked how many chips to exchange, Chi Yu casually said one billion.","Song Luokui's eyes widened as she stared at him. So much for \"just for fun\"? Spending a billion was not her definition of playing around, considering she had thought tossing out a few thousand earlier was already playing.","Chi Yu stroked her head, \"Want to play together?\"","Song Luokui felt she couldn't bear the pressure of losing a billion, even though she could afford it. The thought of losing that much for no reason pained her.","\"You play, I'll just watch.\"","Chi Yu didn't insist. Soon, the dealer asked if they were ready, and Chi Yu nodded. The dealer began shuffling and dealing cards.","A simple high-stakes game - highest hand wins, with a straight flush being the best and a high card the worst.","The dealer first gave them hole cards, then one more card each. Chi Yu's side had the nine of hearts, while the opponent had the three of diamonds.","\"Please declare,\" said the dealer.","Chi Yu looked at Song Luokui, \"How much do you want to bet?\"","Song Luokui held up one finger.","Chi Yu: \"Alright, ten million then.\"","Song Luokui: ...She meant one million, but oh well. She had mentally prepared to lose a billion anyway.","The other side called the ten million bet.","The dealer continued dealing until each hand had three cards. Chi Yu's side had the ten of hearts, jack of hearts, and queen of hearts. The opponent had the four, five, and six of diamonds.","Chi Yu tapped his hole cards, offering them to Song Luokui, \"Want to take a look?\"","Song Luokui: \"What if I see them and you don't like it?\"","Chi Yu chuckled, \"It's fine, just playing.\"","Song Luokui took a peek, and her eyes widened in delight. If there were no issues, they would win.","Chi Yu didn't need to look at his hole cards, already knowing he would win. He simply revealed them.","The opponent chuckled upon seeing Chi Yu's hand, \"It seems Mr. Chi has won.\"","The opponent directly pushed one million chips to Song Luokui's side of the table. The game continued.","In the second round, Chi Yu went all-in with fifty million, and Song Luokui touched the hole cards for luck, but she lost.","Song Luokui pouted, \"Next time I won't touch them.\"","Chi Yu consoled her, \"Perhaps we lost a little to win a bigger prize.\"","In the third round, Chi Yu persuaded Song Luokui to touch the hole cards again, and this time he went all-in with everything he had left. The opponent called.","Song Luokui was very nervous. If they lost, they would lose one hundred million, but if they won, they would gain one hundred million.","The opponent revealed his hole cards first, showing three of a kind with one pair. Chi Yu's side currently had three of a kind with one card left.","Chi Yu peeked at the last card and looked at Song Luokui, \"You are my lucky goddess.\"","The last card was revealed, making it four of a kind with one kicker, and they won.","At first, Song Luokui couldn't believe it, then she exclaimed: \"We won!\" She immediately hugged Chi Yu.","Chi Yu hugged her back joyfully, \"Yes, that's why you are my lucky goddess.\""]},{"number":178,"title":"Chapter 178: The Book of Rites","paragraphs":["They actually played for a while and won a billion!!!","No wonder some people are willing to gamble away their entire fortune, but is it really that simple?","In the private room, Song Luokui heard Chi Yu chatting with that man and soon they started signing a contract with a contract amount of five billion. After that, the man even invited the two of them to have a meal.","Until two o'clock in the afternoon, the two sat in the car, and Song Luokui thought about it and said, \"So...that one billion wasn't actually won by us, was it?\" She suddenly felt a bit disappointed, as she had thought they were truly lucky today.","Chi Yu held her hand and kissed it, \"We did win it, you're my lucky goddess.\"","\"But just now...\"","Chi Yu: \"We did indeed win it, but if we hadn't won, he would still have given us that one billion.\"","Song Luokui: \"So he set up this scene just to please you and make the project successful?\"","Chi Yu shook his head and then nodded, \"Not to please me, but to please you. Because you were happy, I was happy too. He did it to make sure the project went through, which is quite normal. Should I bring you along more often in the future?\"","Song Luokui frowned, \"You'll bring me along for business deals in the future? Wouldn't that be inappropriate? And I might not always be available.\"","Chi Yu: \"If you're there just to have fun, then come along.\"","Without further considering the matter, Song Luokui changed the subject, \"When are we going back?\" The vacation was ending and she had to attend classes again.","Chi Yu: \"Tomorrow morning. Do you want to go back and rest or go sightseeing somewhere?\"","Song Luokui: \"Let's go back and pack first, and we can go out for a stroll in the evening.\"","\"Okay.\"","The next day, the two flew back to their country. The new Tian Yu office address had been renovated, and the formaldehyde and other safety inspections had been completed. Li Bei came over and asked Song Luokui when they would move in.","Song Luokui: \"Find an auspicious date for us to move in. As for how to move, you can make the arrangements. Once we've moved in, we'll hold a celebratory event with food and drinks for everyone in the company. Those who are really too busy can skip it. Just let me know when it's set.\"","\"Okay!\"","\"By the way, someone has been pursuing Zhou Qingrong recently,\" Li Bei added.","At first, Song Luokui didn't know who Zhou Qingrong was. \"The Zhou Qingrong you're talking about is...\"","Li Bei: \"Oh, it's Zhou Qingrong.\"","Song Luokui: \"For this, just let her manager handle it. Is there a no-dating clause in her contract?\"","Li Bei shook her head, \"No, but the person pursuing her seems to come from an influential family, but Zhou Qingrong isn't very willing. She has had meals with him twice, which were photographed and made entertainment news, even becoming a hot topic previously.\"","\"The company was initially going to handle it calmly, but fearing fans would make too much noise, they said it was just a friendly meal, though some people didn't believe it. The person pursuing her has been in the news before, and Manager Yu wants to ask if you know him.\" She then showed Song Luokui a photo.","Song Luokui took a look and found the person somewhat familiar, but she didn't actually know him.","Li Bei: \"Tonight that person has invited Zhou Qingrong out again, and it's hard for her to refuse. Previously when Zhou Qingrong refused, all her subsequent endorsements and resources were withdrawn.\"","Song Luokui stood up, \"Tonight, huh? I'll go to the company tonight. I want to see what kind of person is forcing a girl to have meals with him. Is he coming to the company to pick her up directly? So shameless.\"","\"I'll call and have them arrange for it to be at the company.\"","That evening, Song Luokui came to the company dressed in a black suit. Zhou Qingrong was already waiting for her and greeted her immediately, \"Boss.\"","Song Luokui: \"Has that person arrived yet?\"","Zhou Qingrong glanced at her watch, \"He said he'd be here at six. It's still a few minutes away. He might ask me to go down to the underground parking lot.\"","Song Luokui: \"Just have him come up here. Tell him you won't go down if he doesn't come up.\"","Zhou Qingrong bit her lip, \"But he...\"","Song Luokui put her hand on Zhou Qingrong's shoulder, \"Don't worry, let's see who dares to mess with my people.\"","Zhou Qingrong: Suddenly felt that the boss looked really handsome!","She glanced at Song Luokui's side profile again. Her makeup today looked quite bold and handsome. If the boss weren't a woman, Zhou Qingrong might even want to marry her.","A few minutes later, Zhou Qingrong received a call. She looked at Song Luokui as she spoke on the phone, \"You come up. Come up here to get me to go down. If you don't come up, I won't go down.\"","The person on the other end of the line was surprised. Was she threatening him? It sounded like a threat. So bold today. The man smirked, his smile laced with a hint of coldness. He would go up and see for himself.","Song Luokui sat in the lounge area near the entrance of the company, sipping a cup of hot tea. Zhou Qingrong in front of her looked a bit tense.","A man in a gray suit walked out of the elevator. He had his hands in his pockets, his hair slicked back with pomade. He looked decent enough. He walked straight through Tian Yu's entrance and told the receptionist, \"Where's Zhou Qingrong? I'm looking for her.\"","Song Luokui immediately noticed the man and found him somewhat familiar, but she couldn't quite place him. He also had a rather unsavory look about him.","Zhou Qingrong stood up, \"President Wei.\"","Song Luokui also stood up, \"President Wei? Surname Wei?\" The Wei family? Song Luokui frowned. If so, she knew why he was being so arrogant.","Zhou Qingrong: \"Yes.\"","Wei Li, upon hearing the voice, immediately looked over, \"Let's go.\"","Zhou Qingrong glanced at Song Luokui, who immediately stood in front of her, sizing up Wei Li. \"So you're the one forcing my employee to have meals with you? How thick-faced are you?\"","Wei Li's eyes lit up when he saw Song Luokui. He also checked her out, then asked Zhou Qingrong, \"Is this a new artist you just signed? She looks so good. Forget you, she can have a meal with me today.\"","Song Luokui: This person must be deaf, not hearing her say \"my employee\" earlier.","Song Luokui smiled, \"You want to have a meal with me?\"","Wei Li: \"Yeah. Is that not okay?\"","Song Luokui nodded, \"Of course it's okay. But I'll decide the venue.\" She wanted to invite him to eat stir-fried bamboo shoots with meat.","Wei Li: \"Fine!\"","Song Luokui started walking towards Wei Li. Zhou Qingrong immediately called out, \"Boss.\"","Song Luokui turned to look at her, \"Go back to work. Don't worry.\"","Wei Li followed beside her, \"Boss? You're the boss of this company, but I thought you were a new signee. Are you interested in entering the entertainment industry? I can make you famous and let you experience being adored by thousands. Jewelry, accessories, you can choose whatever you want.\"","Song Luokui didn't speak to him. The two went straight to the underground parking lot. She got into her own car and told Wei Li, \"Just follow my car.\"","Wei Li lowered his head and smiled, \"So proud? I like that!\"","He got into his own car and quickly followed her. What he didn't know was that another car was following behind him."]},{"number":179,"title":"Chapter 179: Untitled 02","paragraphs":["The car was cruising on the road when Song Luokui gave Chi Yu a direct call, \"There's a guy who wants to have dinner with me. I'm going to eat at the place near your building. Are you free to join us?\"","Chi Yu: ???","\"Who?\" How could he not be free! Even if he wasn't free, he had to make himself free.","Song Luokui: \"You'll know when you see him. Gotta hang up now, I'm driving.\"","Chi Yu stared at the disconnected call for two seconds, immediately stood up and headed for the elevator downstairs. His secretary knocked on the door to remind the boss about an upcoming meeting, but found that the boss was no longer in his office.","In the end, the secretary learned from the receptionist that the boss had left. He had no choice but to postpone the meeting.","Half an hour later, Song Luokui arrived at the parking lot of Shan Yu Group. Wei Li, who was there, spotted her too, though he didn't know why she had come to this place - he knew what Shan Yu Group was.","Could it be that the restaurants nearby were particularly good?","After getting out of the car, Song Luokui looked towards the alighting Wei Li and said, \"Come with me, it's nearby.\"","Song Luokui led him straight into the lobby of Shan Yu Group. Those who had been waiting for Chi Yu immediately noticed them, including the man trailing behind her.","Wei Li asked in puzzlement, \"Isn't this Shan Yu Group's office building? What delicacies can there be here?\"","Song Luokui turned and replied, \"The food in the cafeteria is pretty good.\"","Wei Li: ?","By then, Chi Yu had reached Song Luokui's side, embracing her while glaring at Wei Li, \"Is that him?\"","Song Luokui nodded, \"Yes, he even threatened my employee.\"","With a wave of Chi Yu's hand, a group of men in black suits immediately seized Wei Li, who struggled and cried out, \"What are you doing? How dare you lay hands on me? Do you know who I am? Do you know who my father is?\"","Chi Yu said disdainfully, \"Unsurprisingly arrogant, being from the Wei Family. Take him away!\"","\"Yes, sir!\"","The man was promptly taken away.","Chi Yu brought Song Luokui back to his office. \"What happened?\"","Song Luokui recounted how Wei Li had forced her employee to comply. \"He wanted me to accompany him for a meal, so I brought him here.\" Song Luokui looked innocently.","Chi Yu sighed, \"Next time, just call me directly. I was worried he might do something to you.\"","Song Luokui blinked, \"There'll be a next time?\"","Chi Yu paused, then replied, \"Of course not.\"","Song Luokui said, \"Let me call my company first.\"","...","After the call, Chi Yu had her sit beside him. \"Are you heading back today?\"","Song Luokui nodded, \"Yes, I have to.\"","Just then, the secretary came in to summon Chi Yu for a meeting. He told Song Luokui, \"I have a meeting now. Shall we have dinner together later? I can send you back in the afternoon, okay?\"","\"Sure, no problem.\"","After sending Song Luokui back to her company that afternoon, Chi Yu went to deal with Wei Li's matter.","Wei Qing had just finished handling some overseas business when someone called and asked him to pick up his cousin. \"If you don't come, I'll send him to mine in Africa.\"","Upon hearing it was Chi Yu, Wei Qing immediately rushed over. On the ground, Wei Li lay with his mouth gagged, his face bruised and swollen, though still conscious. But his limbs were bound.","Wei Qing glared at Chi Yu, \"What's the meaning of this? Unlawful detention!\"","Chi Yu sneered, \"Unlawful? So you know what's unlawful? Why don't you ask him what he did?\"","The guards removed the gag from Wei Li's mouth. He immediately shouted, \"Brother, avenge me! Kill him for me!\"","Wei Qing squatted down. \"What did you do?\"","Wei Li still didn't understand what had happened. \"I just wanted to have a meal with a beautiful lady. She wouldn't dine with me, disrespecting me, Wei Li.\"","Wei Qing asked, \"A beauty? What's her name?\"","Wei Li paused, seeming to not know her name.","Wei Qing looked towards Chi Yu.","Wei Li then recalled, \"She's probably the boss of Tian Yu, that Zhou QingRong's boss, a woman.\"","Wei Qing slapped him hard across the face. \"Didn't you remember which people in the Capital Circle are untouchable?\"","Wei Li froze in shock.","Chi Yu waved his hand dismissively. \"You can take him away now. But I hope I won't hear his name again from Luokui, otherwise I might need more workers for those mines abroad.\"","The guards immediately untied Wei Li. Wei Qing shot Chi Yu a glance before leading his cousin away, gritting his teeth to endure a while longer.","But before the two could leave, Chi Yu added, \"Oh, someone from Song Luosheng's side might be coming soon.\"","Wei Qing's expression changed, and he promptly took Wei Li away.","However, they hadn't driven far when two cars blocked their way. Song Luosheng got out of one and dragged Wei Li from the car. \"So you're the one who wanted to make a move on my sister?\"","Wei Li cried, \"No, who are you?\"","With a loud \"Ah!\", his hair was seized and he was stuffed into the other car. Wei Qing made to move but was immediately restrained by the men. Song Luosheng looked at him coldly. \"You can act, but I don't think you'd want to keep dealing with overseas matters after just returning from abroad!\"","Wei Qing froze, making no further move as he watched Song Luosheng take Wei Li away.","Wei Li yelled, \"Brother! Hel-\" before being muffled by a foul sock.","It was evening before Wei Qing finally went to retrieve his cousin. Song Luosheng remarked, \"Your brother is quite the idiot. I suggest sending him back abroad.\"","Wei Qing walked away with an ugly look, gritting his teeth to endure a while longer.","That night, Chi Yu took Song Luokui to attend a party in their social circle. Ever since they had been together, Song Luokui found that Chi Yu often took her to various events.","At the banquet, she reunited with her sisters, breaking away from Chi Yu to join them. \"You're here too?\"","Weng Jiao laughed, \"Just here to have fun. Look at you, ever since getting together with your man, when was the last time you paid attention to our news?\"","Song Luokui smiled sheepishly. \"Well, I do have other things going on. I'm not always with him either.\"","Just then, Lou Sasa nudged Song Luokui conspicuously, indicating someone was trying to seduce her man.","Song Luokui immediately turned to see a woman in a white dress conversing with Chi Yu. There was something odd about her face that made Song Luokui feel strange.","Zhang Xiyue immediately said, \"Luokui, isn't she imitating you? She even does her makeup to look like you, though she still doesn't match your beauty.\"","Song Luokui finally realized why she felt it was strange when Zhang Xiyue said that - the person did look a bit similar to her.","Chi Yu was very annoyed on his side. Previously, there were people who tried to seduce him, but he had them directly taken away. However, he didn't expect to encounter someone like that at the banquet, and she was even putting on airs and graces. Who gave her the nerve to imitate his precious one?","\"Dear Brother Chi, my father is Wu Ping. I'm Wu Moli. I just came back from abroad and heard that you started a company that's doing very well. I've recently graduated and am staying at home with nothing to do. Can I go work at your company and do odd jobs?\""]},{"number":180,"title":"Chapter 180: Untitled 03","paragraphs":["Of course Chi Yu knew Wu Ping. By convention, he should have called him uncle, but only when Wu Ping was being polite to others.","Chi Yu directly and coldly refused: \"No way.\" He then turned to find his girlfriend, but saw Song Luokui watching him from the side.","Chi Yu immediately went over, \"Someone I don't know.\"","However, Wu Moli followed him, pouting, \"Big brother Chi, how can you say you don't know me? Didn't we meet when we were little? And didn't I call you when I was going abroad, saying I'd be waiting for you when I came back?\"","Upon hearing this, Song Luokui immediately looked at Chi Yu, \"Don't know her?\"","Chi Yu was on the verge of swearing, \"I really don't know her. I didn't receive any calls either.\"","Wu Moli started stomping her feet in a tantrum, \"That's impossible, I called your house back then.\"","Chi Yu: \"I moved out of my parents' house in college. Anyway, I didn't receive any calls.\"","Wu Moli pouted, \"Okay, well, now you know.\" Then she scrutinized Song Luokui, \"So you're Song Luokui? Everyone says you're very beautiful, but I think you're just average. Not as pretty as me.\"","Song Luokui: \"...You're quite pretty, but our tastes are clearly different. I think I'm better looking than you.\" Song Luokui was confident as she hugged Chi Yu's arm. \"And he's my boyfriend, so don't call him like that. I won't allow it!\"","The Song Luokui of today looked like an arrogant and confident lady, dressed in a long black dress that made her skin appear even more snow-white and smooth.","Chi Yu, standing beside her, was pleased to hear her say that. He liked her possessiveness.","Chi Yu nodded in agreement: \"Yeah, don't call me that. I find it quite disgusting!\"","Wu Moli was immediately angered, \"Big brother Chi, how can you say that! You said I was cute when we were little.\"","Chi Yu frowned, feeling that he probably didn't say that when he was little. Just as he was about to say something, Song Luokui patted his hand, signaling him not to speak, and addressed Wu Moli herself: \"Miss Wu, you're beautiful and come from a good family. You should know the difference between dreams and reality. Why don't you tell us what you're really up to? Trying to steal someone else's man?\"","Song Luokui looked Wu Moli up and down while clicking her tongue, saying, \"I've always thought a well-educated lady from a prestigious family wouldn't stoop to such undignified behavior. In our circles, people like that are looked down upon.\"","\"I'm quite curious how your parents raised you. Besides embarrassing yourself in public, what other benefits could there be from acting like this?\"","Wu Moli was instantly enraged, \"What do you mean? How dare you say I'm ill-mannered? Embarrassing myself? Who dares criticize me?\" She looked around.","Lou Sasa burst out laughing, \"I dare criticize you, Wu Moli. Do you remember me?\"","Wu Moli finally recognized her after a while, \"You're Lou Sasa?\"","Lou Sasa: \"Yes, it's me. Do you remember when you used to cry after I beat you up when we were kids? I didn't expect you to still be this stupid after growing up. Were you raised like this by your stepmother?\"","Lou Sasa shook her head in disappointment.","Wu Moli's face flushed red, her eyes flashing, \"What's it to you? My stepmother treats me well!\"","Lou Sasa: \"Only an idiot like you would think that.\" She didn't want to say any more.","Song Luokui nodded from the side, \"I see. Miss Wu, it seems your intelligence is lacking.\"","Wu Moli angrily looked at Chi Yu, \"Big brother Chi, did you hear how they're talking about me!\"","Chi Yu: \"They're right. And I really don't know you.\"","Song Luokui suddenly recalled someone trying to seduce Chi Yu before, \"Could it be that she received some task to come and seduce you?\"","As soon as those words came out, Wu Moli unexpectedly showed signs of guilt, \"Who... what task? Big brother Chi, I knew you when we were little!\"","Song Luokui looked into her eyes, but Wu Moli didn't dare to meet her gaze.","After pondering for a moment, Song Luokui said, \"Are the Wu family and the Wei family on good terms?\"","Chi Yu also thought it over, \"Uncle Wu often came to our house when I was little, and he had a good relationship with my family. But after I grew up... he stopped visiting as often.\" Later on, he was considered neutral, but with the current situation, many neutrals have chosen sides. Chi Yu suddenly wondered if the Wu family had also taken a side.","Chi Yu and Song Luokui exchanged a glance. Song Luokui immediately said, \"I'm feeling a bit tired. I want to go home.\"","Chi Yu: \"Then let me take you home.\"","\"Okay.\" Song Luokui looked at Lou Sasa and the others, \"Call me next time you have a gathering. I'll definitely attend. I have something to take care of tonight, so I'll leave early.\"","\"Sure.\"","Wu Moli saw them leaving and tried to follow, but by the time she reached the door, Song Luokui and Chi Yu had already gotten in their car, and she was stopped by the bodyguards.","Behind her, some people were whispering.","Chi Yu took Song Luokui back to the mansion, and then returned home himself. \"Where's father?\"","The maid: \"Sir hasn't come back yet tonight.\"","Chi Yu checked the time - it was almost 10 PM, and his father still wasn't back? He picked up the house phone and called Chi Yong, but no one answered.","At that moment, Chi Yong was in a tense standoff, with both sides facing each other. If one person moved, it could escalate into a major conflict.","Fortunately, both sides restrained themselves, each letting out a \"hmph\" before dispersing.","After getting into the car to leave, the secretary finally told Chi Yong, \"The young master called earlier.\"","Chi Yong: \"Was there any urgent matter?\"","The secretary: \"The young master didn't say.\"","Chi Yong: \"Wasn't he going to attend some banquet with the Song family's little lady tonight? Give him a call.\"","\"Yes.\"","Soon, Chi Yu was on the phone with Chi Yong, and he immediately asked about Wu Ping.","Chi Yong frowned, \"Him?\" Chi Yong suddenly realized that Wu Ping was indeed not present at the meeting tonight.","\"I understand.\" After hanging up, Chi Yong immediately called Song Moqian.","At the Wu residence.","Wu Moli angrily returned home, where Wu Ping and his second wife Ma Shu came downstairs. Seeing the fuming Wu Moli, they immediately inquired about the situation. \"What happened? Why are you so angry? Didn't you go to attend some banquet?\"","Wu Moli angrily tilted her head, \"Hmph! Father, you asked me to get acquainted with Brother Chi, but Brother Chi said he doesn't know me.\"","Wu Ping: \"Is that so? But didn't you two play quite well together when you were little?\"","Wu Moli thought back to her childhood and avoided his gaze, \"No way. When we were little, he never played with me.\" In reality, Chi Yu never played with her at all. Chi Yu was always surrounded by boys, and those little girls could never enter their play circle.","Wu Ping: \"That's what you say. But that was a long time ago. You've grown up now, and it would be good for you to get to know him.\"","Wu Moli: \"But... but... but Brother Chi already has a girlfriend. If I pursue him now, I'll be called a homewrecker, just like Mom.\"","Ma Shu's face instantly darkened at those words."]},{"number":181,"title":"Chapter 181: Engagement of Tu Shanxue","paragraphs":["Ma Shu quickly regained her usual expression. \"A mistress? Wu Ping's relationship with his ex-wife wasn't good back then. She didn't do anything wrong. It was only after they divorced that the two of them got together.\"","Wu Ping was a bit angry. He patted Ma Shu's hand. \"Don't be so naive.\"","Ma Shu scoffed to herself. Naive? They were both over twenty years old.","Wu Ping then said to Wu Moli, \"It's just a friend. Nothing dirty about it. Isn't Chi Yu's brother a good guy?\"","Thinking of Chi Yu's face, Wu Moli blushed quickly. \"He is good, but he ignores me. And that girl from the Song family said I have no manners. I think she's the one without manners. I even heard that she's supposedly the best-looking girl in their circle.\"","\"I'm clearly the best-looking in the circle. What taste do they have? Daddy, when will you take down the Song family? I don't like that girl from the Song family.\"","Wu Ping said, \"Don't be impatient. Wait a little longer.\"","Wu Moli replied, \"Okay then. Anyway, I don't like that girl from the Song family. It would be best to banish them all to the south. Oh, and that girl from the Lou family too.\"","Wu Ping frowned. \"Who else did you provoke?\"","Wu Moli thrust out her chest and put her hands on her hips. \"What do you mean 'provoke'? Lou Sasa and I never got along. She even hit me when we were kids. I don't like her either. Banish them all to the south!\"","Wu Ping said, \"Alright, be patient a while longer!\"","Wu Moli huffed and went upstairs.","Ma Shu looked at Wu Ping. \"What about us...?\"","Wu Ping lit a cigarette, took a puff, and said, \"Wait a little more. Everything will settle down in half a year!\"","Chi Yu and Song Luosheng took their graduation photos again, having completed their master's degrees.","This time, Song Luokui didn't need to hide. She stood between the two brothers. Zhang Xiyue even remarked that she looked like a king with a beauty on each arm.","Song Luokui thought Chi Yu and his brother would continue for their doctorates, but neither of them did. They hardly came to school during their master's program either.","Song Luosheng said, \"I never planned to be a researcher. A master's degree is enough.\"","As for Chi Yu, he patted Song Luokui's head and said, \"I've graduated. Now I'll wait for you to graduate.\"","Song Luokui asked, \"Wait for me to graduate to do what?\"","Chi Yu replied with two words: \"Get married.\"","Song Luokui: ...","Song Luosheng glared angrily. \"Marry who? My sister is still young.\" He grabbed Song Luokui's hand. \"Let's go. He can marry by himself.\"","Chi Yu: ...","Chen Nan said, \"Boss, should we prepare a proposal ceremony?\"","Chi Yu thought about it. They did need to do that, but not right now. At the moment, he wanted to settle down first, but his precious one might not agree yet. He needed to wait a little longer.","\"We'll do it, but not now. You can start planning ideas in advance.\"","Chen Nan said, \"Got it. I'll find people to work on it.\"","Chi Yu added, \"Get professionals.\" He didn't want to leave it to Li Yanbei's group again. The previous confession ceremony they organized was passable, but then he heard Song Luokui say it felt like a horror movie...","\"No problem.\"","While Chi Yu and Song Luokui hadn't settled down yet, Tu Shanyue already had her engagement ceremony.","\"Really? That was so fast!\" everyone was surprised.","Song Luokui was surprised too. \"Didn't you just meet a few months ago? Three months?\"","Tu Shanyue waved her hand dismissively. \"Our families introduced us. We know each other's backgrounds well. It's an arranged marriage, so perfection isn't required. His overall conditions are decent enough.\"","Song Luokui said, \"Actually, I don't even know what he looks like.\"","Tu Shanyue replied, \"Perfect timing. He'll be here to pick me up soon. You'll all get to see him then.\"","After their group meal ended, they stood outside the restaurant entrance waiting. Chi Yu arrived first to pick up Song Luokui, but she told him to wait in the car for a bit. \"You've all seen him before, so it's not new.\"","Chi Yu: ?","He didn't get in the car. Instead, he stood next to Song Luokui and waited with her, listening to the girls chat about manicures, good food places, and vacation plans for the summer.","He even acted as a cameraman of sorts, taking group photos for the girls... Who could imagine the CEO of the mighty Shan Yu Group standing outside a restaurant, taking pictures for a group of girls?","Soon after, Tu Shanyue spotted a familiar car. \"He's here. That's the one with the license plate starting with 88.\"","A Mercedes pulled up and parked beside them. A man stepped out - broad shoulders, slim waist, handsome features. He carried himself with dignity and an aura of authority.","He glanced at Tu Shanyue first, then at the others. Tu Shanyue introduced him. \"My girlfriends wanted to meet you.\"","The man nodded at them. \"Hello, I'm Qi Zheng.\" He suddenly noticed Chi Yu and paused. \"Mr. Chi, I didn't expect to see you here too.\"","Chi Yu replied, \"I'm quite surprised as well. I'm here to pick up my girlfriend.\" He looked at the woman whose hand he was holding.","Qi Zheng's gaze moved briefly to Song Luokui before shifting away. \"What a coincidence.\"","Everyone realized the two men knew each other. Qi Zheng soon left with Tu Shanyue, while Chi Yu took Song Luokui home. The other girls were picked up by their family drivers too.","In the car, Song Luokui asked Chi Yu, \"You know him?\"","Chi Yu answered, \"Yeah, we've dealt with each other in business.\"","Song Luokui asked, \"What's he like as a person?\"","Chi Yu explained, \"As a person, he's fine. He's actually an ex-military man, so his character is solid. But as a boyfriend or husband, I'm not too sure.\" Being a good person doesn't necessarily mean being a good partner.","\"Someone might not break the law, but they could still have moral issues.\"","Song Luokui said nonchalantly, \"If he's not a good partner, she can just break up with him then. It's not a big deal.\"","Chi Yu looked at her. \"What if I'm not a good partner? Would you break up with me too?\"","Song Luokui gazed out at the city lights. \"Yes!\" Then she turned to him again. \"If I'm not happy being with you, I would break up. But I'm very happy with you.\" She wasn't the type to tolerate unhappiness.","Chi Yu pulled her into an embrace and nuzzled her face.","A week later, Chi Yu and Song Luokui attended Tu Shanyue's engagement ceremony. Song Moqian and Sheng Rong were present too, along with Song Luosheng, since the Song and Tu families had good relations.","Watching the grand engagement ceremony, Chi Yu felt envious, not knowing when he would also get engaged to his beloved.","Soon, the summer vacation arrived. However, Song Luokui did not go out to play. Recently, Song Moqian and Sheng Rong had been very busy, sometimes not returning home for several days. One day, when Song Moqian came back, his arm was bandaged.","\"I didn't expect someone would be so eager to eliminate me,\" said Song Moqian. Then, looking at the worried Song Luokui, he added, \"Luokui, don't be afraid, but for now, it's better not to go out and play.\"","\"If you need to go out, remember to bring Chi Yu or your brother along, and bodyguards must accompany you.\"","Song Luokui replied, \"I understand.\"","Although nothing happened to Song Moqian, Chi Yu's father, Chi Yong, had an incident. He suffered a serious head injury and was admitted to the hospital."]},{"number":182,"title":"Chapter 182: Chiyong Injured, Engaged in Advance","paragraphs":["Song Luokui was very worried, but she didn't expect when she went to visit Chi Uncle with Chi Yu that Chi Yong's health was not good and he wanted to see her and Chi Yu get engaged.","It wasn't a marriage, as Song Luokui hadn't graduated yet.","\"Is Chi Uncle's condition serious?\" Song Luokui looked at Chi Yu.","Chi Yu nodded heavily, \"The doctor says it's very serious.\"","Yan Sui came to the hospital looking anxious, and Song Luokui immediately went to comfort her, \"Auntie, Uncle will be fine.\"","Yan Sui wiped the corners of her eyes and held Song Luokui's hand, \"Yes, I know what Chi Uncle said about you. He was just talking casually, don't listen to him. You two can decide when to get engaged, don't mind him.\"","Song Luokui hesitated for a moment and shook her head, \"It's okay. If Chi Uncle wants to see it, I have no problem.\" Song Luokui looked up at Chi Yu again.","Chi Yu put his arm around her shoulders, \"Then let's get engaged first.\"","Yan Sui: \"Then I'll discuss it with your parents.\"","Just like that, they decided to get engaged. The next day, Song Luokui's home was filled with betrothal gifts. Not to mention the gold and silver money, there was a courtyard house in XXX area, a large apartment in XXX area, a villa in XXX, a Mercedes car, a Porsche, 20% share of the Shan Yu Group, various precious jewels, famous paintings and antiques...","The entire living room couldn't even fit them all.","And as for the dowry from Song Luokui's side to match the Chi family's betrothal gifts, there were houses, cars, money, jewels, and various shares as well.","Finally, after exchanging marriage deeds, they only needed to wait for the upcoming engagement ceremony.","\"Luokui, you can start inviting your guests and pick an auspicious date, let's do it next month.\"","Song Luokui: \"...So soon? Will there be enough time?\"","Sheng Rong: \"There will be enough time, the team is all ready, you just need to choose a dress.\"","\"Okay.\"","For invitations, her roommates Wang Sisi and others were definitely coming, class president Xu Jiarong and a few closer classmates, then from her company there was Yu Hui, assistant Li Bei, a few managers...","Lou Sasa and the others from the Ji Family compound didn't need to be invited, a large portion of the compound would be invited, as well as Song Luosheng's good friends and so on.","On Chi Yu's side, there were also a bunch of good friends, his family would invite people from the compound as well. Putting the two families together, probably the entire Ji Family compound would be invited.","Then there were some outside relatives and such, Chi Yu even wanted to invite his retired grandparents from S City back.","It was quite sudden, as Song Luokui had never met the two elders before, mainly because they didn't live in the same city. But Chi Yu said the two old people had seen her photos and liked her very much.","Song Luokui got tired from writing out all the invitation cards, and she had to take breaks to attend classes. After class, she would go and try on wedding dresses, with several dresses in total.","Recently, Chi Yu had handed over his work to others so he could accompany her to choose the dresses.","Song Luokui tried on a red toast dress and came out. It was off-the-shoulder with a large exposed back, sexy and beautiful.","She spun around, \"Does it look good?\"","When she came out, Chi Yu was stunned. Today, Song Luokui had also done a special princess hairstyle, which complemented the dress beautifully.","Seeing that Chi Yu didn't say anything and was just staring at her, she waved her hand in front of him, \"I'm asking if it looks good?\"","Chi Yu snapped out of it, \"It looks great, extremely good, I was totally entranced.\"","Song Luokui tugged at the hem of the dress, \"It keeps dragging on the floor, it feels a bit heavy. Let me go change into another one.\"","She went and changed into another one... and another one... and another one...","Song Luokui flopped onto the sofa, \"I'm tired, you pick for me.\"","Chi Yu: \"Every single one looked great, why don't we just buy them all?\"","Song Luokui: \"...Don't you know how tiring it is to keep changing clothes?\"","Chi Yu: \"Sorry, how about these few? Since we're pressed for time, I'll have someone design custom dresses for you for the wedding, okay?\"","Song Luokui: \"Okay.\"","With the dresses sorted out, she and Chi Yu went to visit Chi Yong at the hospital, as he was still in the ICU and mostly just sleeping, occasionally waking up recently.","At his age and after the issue with his brain, it was understandable.","Zhang Xiyue and the others were a bit surprised to hear about Song Luokui's engagement, \"I thought you'd get engaged after graduating.\"","\"It feels like you two have been dating for about a year already? It's been long enough.\"","Song Luokui: \"Chi Uncle fell ill, so...\" Her parents also agreed, since it was just an engagement, they decided to go ahead with it.","Zhang Xiyue and the others knew about this news and offered their consolations, \"He'll be fine.\"","The engagement day soon arrived, and the Chi family booked an entire hotel, setting up nearly 500 tables, adding more if needed.","The Shan Yu Group organized many celebratory events that day, all to celebrate the engagement of the chairman and chairwoman. Not only that, the company cafeterias also offered many delicious dishes, across all headquarters and branches.","The Shan Yu Group made a huge impression. Someone tagged Songhua Technology, \"How come the Songhua family has no reaction?\"","\"Songhua Technology's little sister is about to become someone else's family, they should be sad but I guess they're handling it well, hahaha.\"","\"The two companies have been feuding, but who knew they'd end up becoming in-laws?\"","\"It seems Songhua Technology is the one at a disadvantage.\"","\"Disadvantage? I heard the chairman of Shan Yu Group gave his company's shares as the betrothal gift.\"","\"The bride's family must be powerful to get the Shan Yu Group's shares as a betrothal gift?\"","\"Bro, the Songhua boss is from an elite family, this is just a small deal for them.\"","...","At the engagement, even Chi Yong appeared in a wheelchair, looking decent in spirit.","However, Song Luokui, sitting in the hotel room as the makeup artist applied her exquisite makeup, felt a bit dazed as she looked at her reflection. She was getting engaged? She was also a bit worried...","Because it was just an engagement and not as elaborate as a wedding ceremony, by the time Chi Yu knocked and entered, Song Luokui had composed herself.","Chi Yu looked very handsome that day as well. He held Song Luokui's hand, and the two greeted guests arriving at the hotel entrance alongside their parents from both families.","Firecrackers kept going off outside as guests steadily arrived, each one praising the lovely couple.","Every small circle was live streaming the grand occasion.","\"Sisters, I've arrived at the venue, guess who I saw?\"","\"Who else could it be? The ones from the news, obviously.\"","\"You guessed right! And there are so many handsome guys too, all the brothers of Young Master Song and Prince Chi Yu, hehehe, each one so charming.\"","\"Ah ah ah ah women, wipe your drool, I want to go too! Wuwuwu, why wasn't my family invited?\"","\"My family wasn't invited either...\"","\"Envious, jealous, hateful!\"","Outside, the media also came over after hearing the commotion, but they were all blocked by uniformed guards at the hotel entrance. The entire security system was tightly secured, and those without an invitation were absolutely not allowed in.","Videos that didn't conform were also not allowed on the internet, and any that appeared were immediately deleted.","On one side was the grand banquet, while on the other, they were plotting something even bigger.","\"It seems Chi Yong's health really isn't well.\"","\"I heard he's enduring it for the celebration. Chi Yong's health isn't too good.\"","\"I have information that he actually pushed himself to come out today, and even coughed up blood last night.\"","\"Since they're holding the engagement ceremony now, how about we... take them all out in one fell swoop?\"","\"Brother! This is a great opportunity! The Chi Family, the Song Family, the Yan Family, the Ji Family, and others are all here.\""]},{"number":183,"title":"Chapter 183: Setting a trap","paragraphs":["The man in the middle pondered for a while, then made a firm decision, \"Let's do it!\"","\"I'll arrange it right away!\"","However, Wei Qing felt it wasn't the right time, \"Father, I think we need to wait a little longer.\"","Her uncle Wei Zhongliang said, \"What are we waiting for? This is a good opportunity! I'll arrange it right away.\" He then left.","Wei Qing frowned, \"Father!\" Were the people from the Song and Chi families really that simple?","Wei Zhongcheng raised his hand, \"No need to say more, let's do it this way.\"","At the hotel, everything was going smoothly for now. On the stage, Song Luokui and Chi Yu were reading their wedding vows. After that, the two gave a brief speech, expressing their happiness that everyone could attend to witness their engagement ceremony, and hoping everyone would enjoy the food and drinks.","While they were on stage, someone walked over and whispered something to Song Moqian and Chi Yong separately.","Chi Yong and Song Moqian exchanged a glance. After Song Luokui and Chi Yu finished, it was the parents' turn to give speeches. The parents from both families went on stage.","\"We hope our children will walk through all the ups and downs of life hand in hand from now on, respect and love each other, and grow old together... We are also very grateful for your presence today, for this is our daughter/son's joyous occasion... Thank you all.\"","Just as the words were spoken, a group of people suddenly entered from outside, walking straight to the front of the stage. \"We're sorry to interrupt, but we need to investigate something.\"","Chi Yong and Song Moqian exchanged another look. Chi Yong spoke first, \"Today is a happy occasion for the children. If you need to investigate something, I'll go with you.\"","The investigation team said, \"Sir Song may need to come along as well.\"","Sheng Rong immediately gripped Song Moqian's hand tightly. Song Moqian patted her hand, \"It's alright, I'll be right back.\"","Many people in the audience were watching the investigation team. The team members felt a lot of pressure, considering the people present here... But they had no choice!","Alas, they hoped the Chi and Song families wouldn't blame them.","Apart from Chi Yong and Song Moqian, several others were also taken away, including Ji Xiao's father.","Song Luokui was dumbfounded by this scene. She froze for a moment, about to step forward, but Chi Yu immediately embraced her, \"Don't move. Your father and the others will handle it.\"","Song Luokui looked up at him, \"You know something, don't you?\"","Chi Yu shook his head, \"I'm not entirely clear, but I can guess. I'll apologize to you later, but for now, it's too dangerous outside. Why don't we stay here and entertain the guests?\"","The remaining guests were confused, unaware of why this sudden incident occurred during the otherwise pleasant engagement ceremony.","Sheng Rong was the first to step forward, \"It's alright, everyone enjoy the food and drinks. They'll be back soon.\"","Yan Sui also said, \"It's nothing serious, don't worry. Are the delicacies not enticing enough today? Please savor them at your leisure.\"","The host promptly livened up the atmosphere, playing upbeat music. Since the Song and Chi families seemed so calm, the guests assumed it couldn't be anything serious and continued eating and drinking.","Those with weaker resolve left quickly, but Sheng Rong and Yan Sui didn't force them to stay. Some who knew the specifics remained nonchalant, continuing to eat and merely reminding their family members, \"Just enjoy the food, don't pry too much. It's nothing serious.\"","Hearing this, their family members relaxed, for they were part of the Song/Chi family's circle. If something happened to the leaders, then they...","Since the family leaders said it wasn't a problem, then it must not be a problem.","Loulishu and Zhang Xiyue had no idea what was going on, so they could only look to their fathers or mothers. However, seeing their calm demeanors, they also felt reassured that nothing serious had occurred.","However, even until the end of the engagement ceremony, Song Moqian, Chi Yong, and the others hadn't returned. Song Luokui sat in her room, looking at Sheng Rong, \"Mom, what about Dad...?\"","Sheng Rong hugged her, \"It's alright. I'm sorry such an incident occurred on your engagement day.\" Sheng Rong's expression held some guilt. \"You'll know tomorrow. Your father will be fine.\"","Song Luokui looked at Chi Yu, feeling that everyone was hiding something from her.","But she had no choice but to stay in the room.","After comforting her, Sheng Rong and Yan Sui left. Chi Yu stayed in the room with her. Suddenly, Song Luokui thought, \"What about my brother? Where is he?\"","Chi Yu replied, \"He probably went to help.\"","\"Help?\" Song Luokui didn't understand.","Chi Yu said, \"I can't tell you now. You'll know tomorrow.\"","Song Luokui was dissatisfied. \"Why is everyone hiding things from me? I'm not a child anymore. I can help too.\" She felt defeated.","Chi Yu stroked her head, \"Everyone mainly wants to protect you.\" If the enemy retaliated, he was afraid they might do something if they caught Song Luokui, using her as leverage against the two families.","That night, Jing City was shaken. Many people were unaware, still asleep. Song Luokui had also fallen asleep after waiting until midnight for Song Moqian and the others to return, but they never showed up.","Chi Yu stayed with her, comforting her until she finally fell asleep around 1 AM. He held her, caressed her hair, kissed her forehead, tucked her in, and then got up.","He carefully stepped out of the room, unaware that Song Luokui had woken up shortly after. She sat up, quietly walked to the door barefoot, and opened a small crack to eavesdrop on Chi Yu's phone conversation.","Chi Yu said, \"How are things? Have you captured everyone?\"","\"Wei Qing escaped? Where could he have gone? Not abroad, the flight routes have been suspended. Check the borders?\"","\"What about the other members of the Wei family?\"","\"I didn't expect them to cause trouble during the engagement ceremony. My father is alright...\"","Listening, Song Luokui vaguely guessed that this engagement was part of a setup. So everything was just a ploy? And they were hiding it from her?","Song Luokui walked back to the bed in a daze and sat there, staring blankly.","When Chi Yu finished his call and returned to the room, he saw Song Luokui sitting on the bed. \"Why are you awake?\"","Song Luokui looked up at him with no expression, \"So the engagement and the injuries were all part of a setup?\"","Chi Yu walked over, squatted in front of her, and held her hands, \"You know now?\"","Song Luokui took a deep breath, \"So you knew about this all along too?\"","Song Luokui shook her head, \"I didn't know about it before, I only guessed it later. My father didn't tell me either.\"","At this point, Song Luokui couldn't help but let a tear roll down, and Chi Yu immediately panicked, \"What's wrong? What's wrong? I'm sorry, it's my fault, I shouldn't have hidden it from you.\"","Song Luokui kept shaking her head, \"I know I shouldn't be sad, you all did it mainly for the greater good, but I still feel like I don't know anything, everything is arranged by you, I'm just like an obedient doll.\"","Her original plan was to get engaged after graduation, or maybe even get married, but now everything has been brought forward. She didn't know what happened either, and she didn't dislike Chi Yu, but she just felt that everything was too fast, as if she had blinked and entered another stage.","On the day of the engagement, she was very confused. Was she just going to get engaged and then get married after graduation and become a mother? Was this the life she wanted?","She felt it shouldn't be like this, she should be unrestricted, doing whatever she wanted, and not confined to a role.","She thought she must have had commitment phobia, and if there was a fear of marriage, there must also be a fear of engagement, after all, she wanted to be unrestricted but also in a safe environment to be unrestricted. She understood the reasoning, but she couldn't help but feel sad, probably because she felt everyone was hiding things from her, and she couldn't help at all.","Song Luokui cried, and Chi Yu frantically wiped her tears, \"It's our fault, I should have told you from the beginning instead of letting you worry without knowing anything, it's our mistake.\"","\"Using the engagement as a ploy was my fault, I apologize to you.\" Chi Yu hugged her tightly.","Actually, the \"ploy\" wasn't Chi Yu's doing, it was something that Chi Yong and Song Moqian had discussed and decided on, and Sheng Rong also knew about it. Chi Yu and Song Luosheng didn't know about it at first, but they later guessed it.","After all, with such a big commotion, they had their own people to investigate, so they figured it out themselves. The only one who didn't know was Song Luokui.","The reason they weren't told was to prevent too many people from leaking the news. Some high-profile figures at the engagement banquet were also aware of it, otherwise, chaos would have erupted. Song Moqian and Chi Yong had both made arrangements with the relevant parties.","Song Luokui wiped the corner of her eye, \"I was just a little sad for a moment, I'm fine. I also know that the situation hasn't been too good lately.\"","Not just not good, it was extremely dangerous. One misstep and everything would be lost, and both the Chi Family and the Song Family would fall.","\"And I'm a little scared.\" Song Luokui lowered her eyes.","Chi Yu gently asked, \"Scared of what?\"","Song Luokui raised her eyelids, \"Maybe I'm scared of entering a new stage, afraid that after our engagement, I won't be able to be like before.\"","When they were just boyfriend and girlfriend, it was fine, they could break up if they wanted to, but with Chi Yu coming to her family, and her visiting Chi Yu's parents, the two families were closely tied together, they were on the same boat, and if one side had trouble, the other side would lend a hand.","This feeling didn't just appear recently, it had been there from the beginning, probably because she felt like things were progressing too fast, and she hadn't had time to transition into her new role.","Song Luokui really admired Tu Shanyue's courage, she had decided in just three months. She had asked her why she wasn't afraid, and Tu Shanyue told her, \"Because I knew from the beginning that I was going to have an arranged marriage, and since it was going to be an arranged marriage, feelings had to be put aside first. It's not wrong to cultivate feelings, but I would still pursue the maximum benefit. In the face of benefits, I think feelings aren't worth mentioning.\"","Tu Shanyue was very clear-headed, her family didn't raise her to be a romantic.","Her situation was different from Song Luokui's. Song Luokui and Chi Yu got together because they had feelings for each other, so she would also think about what would happen if their relationship broke down. With the two families tied together like this, she felt like they couldn't separate even if their feelings weren't good in the future.","\"Don't be afraid, you're still you, you're Song Luokui, the precious daughter of the Song Family, and now you've just added another identity, the precious daughter of the Chi Family. Whatever you want to do in the future, just do it. If you want a career, go for it, if you don't, you can travel the world freely.\"","\"After you graduate from university, if you want to go for a master's degree, go for it, if you don't want to, that's fine too. Even if you get married in the future, you can still do whatever you want. If you don't want to live in the main residence, then don't, you can live anywhere you want in Jing City. Even if you don't want to have children, that's fine too. As long as you're happy.\"","\"I will remove any obstacle that makes you unhappy!\" Chi Yu promised.","He knelt on one knee in front of Song Luokui, resting his head gently on her thigh, \"I am your captive, so you can do whatever you want.\"","Song Luokui lowered her head and caressed his face, \"Thank you.\"","Chi Yu stood up and hugged her, \"It's late, shall we rest?\"","Song Luokui: \"Okay.\"","The next morning, Chi Yu and Song Luokui returned to the main residence, originally to have a meal with both families, but Song Moqian and the others hadn't returned yet, so Chi Yu sent Song Luokui home and left to help out.","This time, the Wei Family, the Chen Family, and those people wouldn't be able to escape!","Yesterday afternoon, while Chi Yu and the others were at the engagement banquet, Wei Zhongliang had arranged for people to arrest Chi Yong, Song Moqian, and others, and even sent people to their offices to steal seals and documents.","So that's why Chi Yong and Song Moqian were taken away at the engagement banquet, but what they didn't know was that those who went to steal weren't able to steal anything and were caught red-handed. Not only that, as soon as Song Moqian entered the interrogation room, even before being questioned, he directly said: \"I have evidence of the Wei Family colluding with foreign enemies and committing treason!\"","Piles of evidence were immediately presented, including collusion, assassination attempts, bribery, and more.","Soon after, the Wei Family was surrounded. Wei Zhongcheng first arranged for Wei Qing to leave and find someone, then he went with the investigators.","But as soon as Wei Qing left the Wei Family, he was tailed. It took him great effort to finally escape. When he called his brother, he found out that he had been betrayed and was almost caught. When he tried to contact people on his mother's side, the phones were unreachable.","After running all night, Wei Qing discovered that the company had been sealed off, and even he, the boss, had to be investigated. Furthermore, his father and uncle had not called back.","Not long after, when he went to a supermarket to buy some water, he found that the early morning news surprisingly reported that the Wei Family had committed treason by selling out the country!","It even mentioned him as a fugitive, not just him, but also Wei Li whom he had sent abroad.","Other close associates of their family were all subject to investigation.","Wei Qing hurriedly paid, but the checkout girl looked at his face and then at the TV, \"Hey? Are you the one on TV?\"","Upon hearing this, Wei Qing threw down ten dollars, \"No.\" Then he left, but people had already started chasing him as he fled.","Wei Qing had no choice but to keep running...","However, he couldn't get away and was soon surrounded...","Song Luokui had been watching the news at home to keep up with recent events. When she saw Wei Qing being arrested, she suddenly felt it was quite dramatic. However, she remembered that Wei Qing had some cooperation with her brother, so it shouldn't affect her brother, right?","Then she thought that her brother hadn't called back home recently either. Song Luokui had tried calling him, but it wasn't her brother who answered, it was his secretary. She didn't know what her brother was up to.","After that day, Chi Yu hadn't come back either, but he would send her messages every day to let her know he was safe. Due to the confidentiality of the matter, he couldn't say too much."]},{"number":184,"title":"Chapter 184: Bound","paragraphs":["Of course, Song Luokui could only wait for them to return home. She didn't expect to be alone at home after the engagement though, which was quite a fresh experience.","She originally wanted to invite her sisters to go shopping together, but they all said their parents wouldn't let them go out recently because it was unsafe. They couldn't even hold gatherings, fearing being accused of corruption.","In short, it was a time of great caution and unease. Everyone kept an extremely low profile. The bars in Jing City had far fewer patrons. Many young people from high society circles behaved exceptionally obediently - some because their families had run into trouble, others out of fear that their families might encounter problems, and still others due to their families' strict control.","Chi Yu's cousin Yan Ye, who had been exiled to plant trees in the northwest, appeared at the engagement banquet. He had become tanned and lost a lot of weight, transforming from a handsome fair-skinned young man into an unkempt, middle-aged-looking fellow. The gatekeepers almost wouldn't let him in.","When he saw Song Luokui, he politely called her \"Sister-in-law,\" in stark contrast to his arrogant demeanor of the past. Originally, he was supposed to return to the northwest after the banquet, but ended up staying due to this incident.","Now, he obediently stays at home and dares not venture out. His former wayward friends have invited him, but he didn't dare go. Previously, he was foolish, but with his current appearance, he dares not be foolish anymore. He feels that if he creates any more trouble, his cousin Chi Yu might kill him.","Only heaven knows what he went through in the northwest. Due to tree planting, water was very precious. He couldn't bathe for half a month. Although he was wealthy and could have bathed daily, Chi Yu deliberately wanted him to suffer hardship. Daily baths? Don't even think about it. In winter, even if his hands and feet were cracked from the cold, he had to find a way to cope himself.","Just when Song Luokui thought everything would settle down, Uncle Zhou at the gate said she had an express delivery. Song Luokui hadn't ordered anything, but Uncle Zhou insisted the package was addressed to her name, and after inspection, it contained no dangerous items.","Puzzled, Song Luokui went to the entrance of the compound. The delivery person wore a hat and mask, holding out the package for her to sign. Uncle Zhou and other guards were watching nearby.","As Song Luokui was about to sign, the person suddenly pulled out a dagger and grabbed her, pressing the blade against her neck. The pen dropped to the ground with a \"thud.\" Before the guards and Uncle Zhou could react, the delivery person shouted, \"Don't move or I'll stab her!\"","They froze, and a car immediately stopped at the entrance. The delivery person dragged Song Luokui into the car and sped away. Uncle Zhou immediately gave chase while reporting the incident and notifying the Song family.","When preparing to sign, Song Luokui's heart suddenly felt anxious. She even felt like she was back in her childhood when the Grand Scenarist wanted to kill her. True to her intuition, the delivery person pulled out a knife...","Song Luokui's neck was punctured and bleeding. She didn't dare move at all and was directly abducted.","Upon hearing that Song Luokui had been kidnapped, Chi Yu panicked. \"Why was she taken from within the compound?\"","\"Someone posing as a delivery person lured her out of the gate and then abducted her.\"","Chi Yu was furious. \"What about the others? The bodyguards? Why didn't anyone notice?\"","However, saying this now was pointless. \"What car? Where did it go? Did anyone follow? Was the police notified?\"","\"The police have been notified, and Uncle Zhou is in pursuit.\"","Song Luosheng's side also panicked upon hearing the news. While he was fighting on the frontlines, he didn't expect a fire to break out in the backyard.","\"What happened? Where are the bodyguards and others? How could she be taken away?\" Song Luosheng was also enraged.","\"Has the culprit been identified?\"","On Song Luokui's side, after getting into the car, she was held at gunpoint. \"Slap!\" She was even slapped across the face. \"It's because of you that I had to flee the country before.\"","Song Luokui's mouth bled, her face bearing a clear slap mark. Looking up, she recognized the man who had previously tried to force her company to let him dine with her and then demanded her companionship.","She remembered letting Chi Yu handle him, and her brother had also dealt with him once. She only knew that the man had fled abroad.","Moreover, he was from the Wei Family, so... now that the Wei Family was about to fall, had he returned for revenge?","Song Luokui lowered her head and remained silent, fearing provoking him. The man looked particularly haggard, his skin darkened, and his hair unkempt. If not for a closer look, one might not recognize him.","Wei Li grabbed her hair and pulled her close. \"You think keeping quiet will save you? Let me tell you, the Chi and Song families have brought ruin upon my Wei Family. If they don't back off, I'll take your life as compensation.\"","Song Luokui let out a muffled groan as he painfully pulled her hair, her hands clenched into fists but not daring to move. Wei Li then released her, tied her up with ropes, gagged her mouth with tape, and blindfolded her.","Afterward, he took a photo and sent it out: \"Drop all charges against my Wei Family, release my brother first. I want to see my brother in an hour, or I'll kill her.\"","Chi Yu immediately received this message and quickly forwarded it to Song Moqian and the others, informing everyone of Song Luokui's abduction.","At the time, Song Luokui had gone out wearing only slippers, one of which fell under the car. So now, one of her feet was bare.","Unable to speak or see, with a madman nearby who might kill her at any moment, it was natural to feel afraid. But there was no choice. Song Luokui could only sense the car continuing to move.","After an unknown amount of time, she was dragged out of the car. The man treated her roughly. Song Luokui smelled the scent of grass, so they must be in the suburbs.","She then heard foreign voices.","\"We must leave immediately. They'll come if they discover us.\"","Wei Li: \"No, wait another hour. I'm betting my brother will definitely come. Kidnapping this woman was my brother's idea before - to use her as leverage against them if anything happened. So my brother will definitely come.\"","He couldn't save the others, but he had to rescue his brother. With his brother, they could rise again.","\"Then just wait an hour. Keep a close watch on the hostage, don't let her slip away at all costs, she's our lifeline now.\"","\"Yes.\"","Song Luokui felt herself being thrown into a room, or perhaps it was a warehouse, and it seemed there were quite a few people around.","After a while, she heard a loud \"thud\" as the door was shut, the kind of sound made by an iron door, but there was probably someone beside her, someone smoking, likely the people guarding her.","Wei Qing was indeed released, but she was directly dragged to the warehouse area where Song Luokui's location had already been determined. Now the fear was that the hostage might escape."]},{"number":185,"title":"Chapter 185: Saving","paragraphs":["The two sides were in a standoff.","Wei Li was grabbed by the collar by a foreigner, \"You said your brother would come, but now not only your brother came, everyone came. What's going on? What exactly did you say? You fool!\"","Wei Li: \"I didn't expect them to react like this. I thought they would be cautious... Now, take that woman out, and we can use her to threaten them so we can escape.\"","The foreigner pushed him away, \"I'll trust you one more time, you damn fool!\"","Song Luokui's eyes were covered, and her heart was pounding. To be honest, she had been kidnapped before, but this time she had a very bad feeling, as if the scriptwriter was lurking in the shadows.","But she was already in her twenties, wasn't the scriptwriter supposed to be gone? How could they still be around?","Although puzzled, Song Luokui had a strong feeling that the scriptwriter might kill her, just like she had once been on the brink of death.","As she was thinking, Song Luokui was suddenly lifted up, with a gun pointed at her temple, and was dragged outside. Although her eyes were covered, she could feel the glaring sunlight.","\"Release your people, or I'll blow her brains out right here. In fact, I'd be quite happy to have such a beauty accompany me in my grave,\" said a foreign voice that Song Luokui heard.","The foreigner even leaned closer to Song Luokui's ear and sniffed her, then said, \"Oh, she smells so good, a real delicacy.\" His disgusting nose was sniffing around Song Luokui's neck.","Song Luokui shuddered and struggled, but was immediately slapped, \"Don't move! Stay still.\"","\"Don't touch her!\" Song Luokui heard Chi Yu's anxious voice.","The foreigner sneered, \"If you want me to leave her alone, release your people! I'm not a patient man.\"","On Chi Yu's side, there was Song Luosheng and some other plainclothes officers, and even snipers on higher ground. However, the foreigner was clever enough to hide behind Song Luokui, making it impossible for the snipers to get a clear shot.","Song Luosheng and Chi Yu exchanged a glance, and Song Luosheng nodded, \"Release him.\"","Chi Yu pushed Wei Qing out.","Wei Li immediately removed the handcuffs from Wei Qing. Wei Qing stretched her arms, glanced at Wei Li, and then turned towards the foreign leader Nuo Hansi.","\"Is the helicopter ready?\"","Nuo Hansi: \"It's all set. Why are you in such a mess?\"He tossed a gun to Wei Qing.","Wei Qing lowered her eyes, \"Merely a temporary defeat. Let's leave first.\"","Nuo Hansi said something into his earpiece, and soon a helicopter began preparing for takeoff. Nuo Hansi kept dragging Song Luokui towards it, while Wei Qing and Wei Li also headed for the helicopter.","Wei Qing glanced at Song Luokui, \"As long as we have her, they won't dare shoot at the helicopter or vehicles. We'll head to the northern border first, and once we're in Country E, we'll be fine.\"","\"Yeah.\"","Song Luokui was taken onto the helicopter, and soon she felt it taking off.","Although Chi Yu and his team didn't take action, they immediately gave chase after the helicopter left.","During the pursuit, Chi Yu was worried, \"We can't let them reach the neighboring country.\" That would put his precious one in even greater danger.","Song Luokui's brow was constantly furrowed, as she hadn't slept well for days, just like Chi Yu. They both looked haggard.","\"They'll have to go through customs when crossing the border. That's when we'll catch them.\"","After three days and nights on the run, Song Luokui was taken to the border. Her situation was dire, and she could feel the onset of fever, her body burning hot, but no one cared.","The others weren't faring much better either, as they had been hiding and running the entire time. Chi Yu's tracking methods were relentless, and they soon found their trail and caught up.","It was now night, and they were heading towards the border, driving through the jungle. Suddenly, the vehicle shook violently, and with a \"thud,\" it came to a stop, seemingly suffering a breakdown.","\"Change vehicles!\" Wei Qing ordered immediately, but as soon as they got out, gunshots rang out, \"Bang bang bang!\" Many of Wei Qing's men fell to the ground in the darkness.","Wei Qing grabbed Song Luokui and started running, \"Head for the border!\"","Song Luokui was choked by his grip, but it seemed someone aimed for Wei Qing's shoes, as he felt a sharp pain in his foot. He stumbled and fell, loosening his hold on Song Luokui.","Finally, Song Luokui could breathe properly, having nearly suffocated.","On the ground, Song Luokui kept trying to untie the ropes binding her hands, but Wei Qing quickly got back up, grabbed her, and continued running while using her as a shield.","Song Luokui stumbled along, already ill and unable to move quickly, with Wei Qing dragging her as he ran.","\"Song Luokui, if I die, you'll join me in the grave. It would be fitting for you to die with my brother Wei Qing, since you're the most precious person to the Song family and Chi Yu.\"","\"Come to think of it, you've never called me 'Brother Wei Qing.' Call me that, and maybe I'll let you go.\"","Song Luokui remained silent.","But Wei Qing kept rambling, \"It would've been better if the Song and Wei families had formed an alliance through marriage. Why didn't your family agree? We did send you a message about it.\"","Song Luokui: ...What kind of dream is this? She had someone she liked, whose family was decent. Why would she need to ally with the Wei family through marriage? How arrogant of them!","Wei Qing stroked her face, \"But it doesn't matter. Once we're out of the country, you'll only be able to be with me. If we can't leave the country, we can be husband and wife underground. Doesn't that sound nice?\"","In truth, he didn't particularly like Song Luokui either. He mainly wanted to upset Chi Yu and Song Luosheng out of lust and spite, as he had been sent abroad by them to handle some matters.","Song Luokui and he didn't have much interaction, and in fact, it was because of her that Wei Qing had been sent overseas by Song Luosheng and Chi Yu.","Amidst the incessant chatter, gunfire, and shouts, Song Luokui felt the pain of branches scratching her face as she struggled to free her hands from the ropes.","Not far away, only a kilometer from the border, Wei Qing started to lose her composure. However, at this moment, Song Luokui suddenly broke free from the ropes binding her hands and snatched the gun from Wei Qing's grip. \"Bang!\" With a loud sound, Wei Qing's eyes widened as she fell to the ground.","Song Luokui also collapsed to the ground. She felt the gun being seized from her hand again. Wei Qing was only wounded in the abdomen, but Song Luokui's mind became hazy and her vision blurred. She felt the muzzle of a gun pressed against her head, realizing that perhaps this life would end right here.","Forgive me, father and mother. Forgive me, brother. Forgive me, Chi Yu. Forgive me, all those whom I love and who love me. I'm sorry, I can't hold on any longer."]},{"number":186,"title":"Chapter 186: Prayer to the Heavens","paragraphs":["With a resounding \"thud\", Song Luokui had completely fainted, and Wei Qing, who was next to her, also collapsed onto her.","The gunshot that had sounded was not from Wei Qing's gun, but simultaneously fired by Chi Yu and Song Luosheng. Both of them were now so filthy that they hardly looked human. Their eyes were filled with bloodshot veins, and their hands were still trembling slightly.","They quickly rushed to Song Luokui's side, \"Kui Kui/Baby!\"","Wei Qing was abruptly pushed aside. Song Luokui was lifted by Chi Yu, \"You'll be okay, you'll be okay. Where's the ambulance? Ambulance!\" Chi Yu bellowed.","Song Luosheng's eyes were turning red. It was as if he was reminded of the time when Song Luokui was hanging by a thread. His beloved Kui Kui's body was burning hot, so hot it made him tremble.","The hospital walls were a stark white, and the lights in the corridor were somewhat dim. Chi Yu sat on the ground, his eyes vacant as he watched a moth fluttering around a light. His hands were covered in blood. Song Luosheng was off to the side, covering his face. The atmosphere was heavy and silent.","Inside the emergency room,","\"The patient is convulsing, quick!\"","\"Administer adrenaline, now!\"","\"Where's the defibrillator?\"","\"The patient has lost consciousness, quick!\"","\"Call her name, call!\"","\"Song Luokui! Song Luokui! Song Luokui...\"","On the monitor, the data was fluctuating abnormally; suddenly, with a \"beep\", the line indicating heart activity went flat.","\"Cardiac arrest!\"","On the bed, a doctor straddled the patient, vigorously pressing on her chest, performing CPR...","Outside, Song Moqian, Sheng Rong, Chi Yong, and Yan Sui had all rushed over. Sheng Rong's lips were trembling uncontrollably, \"How is my Kui Kui?\"","Song Luosheng shook his head with difficulty. Sheng Rong nearly collapsed to the ground, but Song Moqian caught her. Song Luosheng was startled, \"The doctors are still trying.\"","Sheng Rong recovered slightly. She thought Song Luosheng's head shake meant that Kui Kui was gone. But if they were still trying, there was still hope.","Outside, the atmosphere was heavy, but inside, the battle was still raging. Song Luokui, as if experiencing a brief resurgence, opened her eyes. A blinding white light was overhead, but she didn't squint. It was as if a voice kept echoing in her head.","\"You have lived for so many years, that's your honor! You have to die!\"","\"Just die! Then the plot will be back to normal!\"","\"My male lead should have been slaughtering left and right by now, even your brother, this villain, should be defeated, not entangled with you. You trash, just die. You shouldn't exist in the first place.\"","\"Die, die, die.\"","That voice was terrifying, if it had a face, it would surely be twisted in malice. But finally, it seemed to vanish with an \"ah\".","Song Luokui closed her eyes again. Die? Why should she die? What would happen to her parents if she died? What about her brother? Would her brother become the big villain? Her brother, such a good person, why should he become a villain?","What would happen to Chi Yu if she died? What about the many, many people who loved her?","Suddenly, a few \"beep, beep, beeps\" rang out from the side. A nurse announced, \"The heart's rhythm is back to normal.\"","Outside, everyone was extremely anxious, each person consumed by fear.","At this moment, the light in the emergency room finally turned off. The doctor emerged, but he looked rather solemn.","\"The patient's heart stopped beating for a while... we managed to resuscitate her, but about regaining consciousness...\" The doctor heaved a sigh, \"There's a possibility she may never wake up. I say possibility, because miracles can happen.”","“The patient will be moved to the ward soon, but family members can only watch from the window, they can't go in.\"","The doctor gave further instructions, but everyone's mood was heavy. Not wake up?","Why wouldn't she wake up?","Song Luosheng, with tears in his eyes, approached, \"Why won't she wake up?\"","Doctor: \"The condition is quite complex, it mainly depends on the patient herself.\"","...","Chi Yu quickly contacted numerous medical experts. The conclusion was similar for each doctor who came, the patient's awakening largely depended on her will.","\"You can talk to her every day by her side, call out to her, maybe she'll wake up.\"","Sheng Rong said, \"I'll find a master to get a peace charm, when Luokui had a peace charm in her childhood, she would feel much better.\" As she spoke, she went to contact someone.","Chi Yu, holding Song Luokui's hand, his eyelashes flickered. He suddenly remembered that Song Luokui once told him about how her family often went to the temple to pray for her, which enabled her to grow up safely.","Song Luokui had been transferred back to Jing City, and early in the morning, Song Luosheng came, but Chi Yu was not there. He thought he had gone to rest.","However, he didn't appear for three consecutive days, which made Song Luosheng very angry. Did Chi Yu think that with his sister like this, he would show his true colors? He directly called Chen Nan, \"Where's Chi Yu?\"","Chen Nan hesitated and didn't speak.","Song Luosheng: \"Does he think he wants to call off the engagement because my sister is like this? If he wants to, just say it. I'll let him.\"","Song Luosheng's eyes were cold. If Chen Nan said yes, he felt he could go and confront Chi Yu directly.","Chen Nan finally said, \"No, the boss has gone to Huai'an Temple.\"","Song Luosheng: ?","Chen Nan: \"I heard that Huai'an Temple is very efficacious. As long as you kneel and worship all the way up the mountain, any wish can come true. The boss... he has been worshiping for three days now.\"","Inside Huai'an Temple, Chi Yu's clothes over his knees were already torn, and his knees were somewhat bloody. He was kneeling up one step at a time, taking a day to reach the top, and then spent two more days praying in the main hall.","His face was pale and devout, his lips were cracked and dry, unmoving, his eyes closed.","The Abbot walked over to him and told him that everything was destined and asked him not to be so persistent. Chi Yu replied, \"If I'm not persistent, what will happen to her? What will happen to me?\"","The doctors had made it clear. If she didn't wake up, within less than a year, she might just die one day.","Chi Yu had never understood so clearly before, that if he didn't have her, he wouldn't care either, he might just go to accompany her directly.","\"Sigh!\" The Abbot could only sigh, powerless to help.","She should have led a beautiful life, so why must she suffer? Why couldn't it be him instead? He would exchange anything for her safety, anything at all!","Chi Yu even regretted that their engagement was late, they should have married earlier, then she would be his wife now.","Chi Yu looked at the Bodhisattva, he wanted to ask why, but he found himself unable to speak, having not eaten for days, he could barely stand, collapsing on the ground. As he fainted, he seemed to see Song Luokui smiling at him.","In the hospital on the other side, Song Luokui's fingers twitched. Song Luosheng was with her, telling her about recent events, \"That guy is praying fervently, I heard he's been kneeling for three days and nights, he must not be devout enough so that's why you haven't woken up, when your brother goes to pray for you, you'll surely feel it and wake up, right?\"","Just as Song Luosheng finished speaking, he saw Song Luokui's fingers twitch."]},{"number":187,"title":"Chapter 187: She Wants to Win","paragraphs":["Song Luosheng was stunned for a moment, but quickly pressed the button. As soon as the doctor came, he said hurriedly, \"Doctor, doctor, my sister just moved her fingers. Does this mean she's going to wake up?\"","After examining her, the doctor said, \"Some patients may move even though they don't regain consciousness. It doesn't necessarily mean she's waking up. However, you can try talking to her more, like mentioning what you said when she moved her hand. This might stimulate her body.\"","Song Luosheng felt a little disappointed but nodded, \"I understand.\"","After the doctor left, Song Luosheng held Song Luokui's hand. \"I was just telling you about Chi Yu, and you moved. You little brat. If you don't wake up, I'll beat Chi Yu up. No, not just once, but many times. And since you're not here to stop me, I'll definitely wage a terrible business war against Chi Yu, one to the death...\"","As he spoke, Song Luosheng's eyes reddened. \"Kuikui, wake up. From now on, whatever you want to do with Chi Yu, I won't interfere. Do as you please.\"","He hadn't finished speaking when Chi Yu was rushed to the hospital. Song Luosheng learned that he had fainted from kneeling too long without food or water.","Song Luosheng returned to Song Luokui's room. \"Chi Yu has fainted. If he doesn't wake up, and you don't wake up either, you two can be buried together. Then the Shan Yu Group will collapse, and I'll be the biggest beneficiary.\"","Song Luokui's fingers moved again.","Song Luosheng grasped her hand tightly. \"I know you care about him. So wake up.\"","At that moment, Song Luokui was fighting someone in a virtual space. She felt like there was someone trying to kill her. She couldn't see their face clearly, but they were trying to strangle her.","Though Song Luokui had never fought before, she used every trick - pinching, scratching, biting, punching, hair pulling, and gouging. \"You want to hit me? You think I'm afraid of you? I'll kill you, I'll kill you!\"","Song Luokui gritted her teeth as she battled.","This was why Song Luosheng saw her fingers move. As for what he said, Song Luokui couldn't hear it at all right now, or rather, she had no mind to listen as she fought for her life.","Chi Yu woke up soon after. His spirits were good, but the doctor advised him not to walk for the time being to avoid crippling his legs.","The first thing Chi Yu asked was, \"How's Kuikui?\"","Chen Nan was so moved by his boss that he almost cried. Wiping his eyes, he said, \"The young madam hasn't woken up yet, but I heard her fingers moved. It must be because you touched Heaven's heart, boss.\"","Upon hearing this, Chi Yu tried to get up. \"I need to go see her.\"","Chen Nan immediately brought over a wheelchair. \"Boss, the doctor said you shouldn't walk for now. I'll push you there.\"","Chi Yu didn't insist and soon sat in the wheelchair. Chen Nan quickly pushed him to Song Luokui's room, where Song Luosheng was still chattering to her.","Seeing Chi Yu, Song Luosheng asked flatly, \"You're here?\"","Chi Yu had Chen Nan push him to the other side of Song Luokui's bed. \"Yeah, how is she?\"","Song Luosheng said, \"Her fingers moved twice. The doctor said we should talk to her more to stimulate her and maybe she'll wake up.\"","Chen Nan chimed in, \"Why don't we turn on the TV and let the young madam hear about the consequences for those criminals? Maybe hearing their fate will make her happy enough to wake up.\"","Song Luosheng and Chi Yu both thought it was a good idea, so they quickly turned on the news channel. It was reporting on some recent events, though without too many details or being too explicit - just that so-and-so was under investigation, so-and-so was arrested, and so on.","The next news item mentioned changes in the positions of Song Moqian and Chi Yong.","At this point, both of Song Luokui's hands lifted up. Song Luosheng and Chi Yu shouted excitedly, \"Kuikui! Kuikui! Are you going to wake up?\"","Chen Nan was also excited. \"See, I told you it would work! Boss, the news wasn't too clear, so why don't you two just tell the young madam the ultimate fate of those criminals directly?\"","Song Luosheng immediately said, \"Kuikui, all the people who captured you have been brought to justice. Wei Qing and Wei Li were both sentenced to death. That bastard Wei Qing is already gone.\"","Chi Yu added, \"Kuikui, all the masterminds and accomplices have been arrested. From now on, everything will be peaceful. You can go wherever you want to play, even without bodyguards.\"","Song Luosheng added, \"But it's still better to have bodyguards.\"","Chi Yu said, \"I'll be your bodyguard. It doesn't matter whether we have them or not. I know you don't really like having bodyguards.\" But Kuikui had never objected to having bodyguards so as not to worry her family.","Song Luosheng said, \"I can also be Kuikui's bodyguard. Oh, your company's relocation is done, but we haven't held the relocation celebration party yet. We'll do it once you wake up.\"","Chi Yu replied, \"I'll definitely send a lot of gifts to your company then.\"","Song Luosheng said, \"I'll send gifts too. Whatever you want.\"","Chi Yu continued, \"The latest Dignifi jewelry collection has already been sent to me. When you wake up, I'll put it on you. You'll definitely love it.\"","Song Luosheng scoffed, \"It's just jewelry. Big brother can buy you a whole bunch. There's a jewelry auction coming up. I'll bid on some for your dowry.\"","Chi Yu said, \"I've already had someone design and make your wedding dress. You can see it when you wake up.\"","Song Luosheng retorted, \"What wedding? We don't have to get married right away. Whatever clothes you want to wear, big brother will buy them for you. I'll have the latest designs from D Store, L Store, and A Store brought over today and put them in your closet. Wear whichever one you like when you wake up.\"","Chi Yu went on, \"I've also had your wedding rings designed and made. I didn't know if you preferred rubies or emeralds, so I had them make both. I think a purple one would be nice too.\"","Song Luosheng: \"If you want a particular kind of ring, Brother can have someone deliver it to you right away. Brother can also personally go to the mines and pick out the finest and most beautiful gemstones to make one for you.\"","The two exchanged words, seeming to engage in a competition, but in reality, their eyes never left Song Luokui's face. They eagerly awaited any flutter of her eyelids, hoping she would fully regain consciousness. However, Song Luokui was still struggling and battling someone, as her raised hands indicated she was strangling that person.","As the two strongest Chi Yu brides-to-be in the grand courtyard, as well as Song Luosheng's sister, how could she lose in a fight? Absolutely not!","She had to win!"]},{"number":188,"title":"Chapter 188: Awakening","paragraphs":["Over the course of several days, Song Luokui's bedside was never empty. When it wasn't Song Luosheng chattering away with her, it was Chi Yu reading her the news, books, and occasionally even cold jokes.","Song Moqian, Sheng Rong, and others had all paid visits. Lou Sasa and her friends had come by, as had Xu Jiarong. When Xu Jiarong had attended the engagement ceremony, she had finally witnessed what it truly meant to be a young lady from a super-elite family, and she had been utterly shocked to see various figures from high society.","To her surprise, all sorts of important people had appeared in the news as well. It turned out that Song Luokui's parents and Senior Chi's parents were actually famous figures. They had no idea about this at school; everyone just knew that Senior Song and Senior Chi came from extraordinary families, but they hadn't realized just how extraordinary.","It was beyond extraordinary, in fact.","However, she hadn't expected the unexpected incident that occurred midway through. At first, she had been somewhat worried, but she soon learned of the major event from the news.","Then Song Luokui was hospitalized due to an injury. So much had happened in such a short time that Xu Jiarong mused that being a young lady from a super-elite family wasn't as easy as it seemed.","In the evening, Chi Yu was alone in the hospital room. He took some warm water and carefully wiped Song Luokui's body, meticulously cleaning her face, hands, and feet...","After finishing, Chi Yu held her hand, their fingers intertwined. He adjusted her hair and kissed her cheek. \"Baby, wake up soon.\"","Song Luokui's eyelids fluttered, but Chi Yu didn't notice. He kissed her hand again before taking the water to dispose of it in the bathroom.","By now, Song Luokui had been in a coma for a month. The doctors said that the longer she remained unconscious, the harder it would be for her to wake up.","After emptying the water in the bathroom, Chi Yu brought in some clothes. He planned to sleep here tonight, so he would take a shower first.","There were still large scars on his knees and hands, looking somewhat frightening. As warm water cascaded over him from head to toe, Chi Yu wiped his face and reached for the shampoo to lather up...","When he finished showering and stepped out, he suddenly noticed that the person lying on the bed was gone. Chi Yu thought his eyes were playing tricks on him and rubbed them, hearing a noise from the side. Just as he turned, there was a \"bang\" and his head was struck, leaving him bleeding.","Chi Yu shook his head, his vision blurry, but he could still see the now-awake Song Luokui standing there in her striped hospital gown, barefoot, holding a teapot and staring at him with a cold expression.","With a thud, Chi Yu immediately collapsed. Song Luokui blinked, her eyes rolled back, and she fell on top of Chi Yu. It wasn't until the staff came to check on them that they were discovered.","This incident jolted everyone awake.","The original luxurious private room had two beds: a hospital bed and a companion bed. Now, both had become hospital beds.","When Chi Yu regained consciousness and saw the crowd gathered in the room, he felt bewildered. He thought he had seen Kuikui wake up. He sat up abruptly, but due to his head injury, his vision suddenly went dark. It took a while for him to recover.","Yan Sui said, \"Don't rush. What happened earlier? The doctor said you and Kuikui were both found collapsed on the floor?\"","Chi Yu walked to Song Luokui's bedside and grabbed her hand. \"She woke up. She really woke up.\" Chi Yu was extremely excited.","Song Luosheng grabbed him. \"What exactly happened? How did my sister end up on the floor with you? Did someone attack you or what?\"","Chi Yu organized his thoughts and shook his head. \"No. She woke up. She... I had just come out of the bathroom when she hit me with a teapot...\"","The doctor, listening to the account, said, \"The patient may have woken up due to stimulation but fainted again because of further shock. Her attack might have been a result of dreaming or a strong stress response upon waking.\"","\"You should continue to talk to her frequently in the coming days.\"","\"Alright, thank you, doctor.\" Sheng Rong saw the doctor out, and they discussed the next steps among themselves.","Chi Yu, however, kept thinking about the situation. Why had his sweetheart looked at him so unfamiliarly?","As it was late, everyone eventually left to rest, as they all had many matters to attend to. Since Chi Yu was also injured, Song Luosheng stayed behind.","Song Luosheng and Chi Yu ended up lying on the same bed to rest. Neither had ever imagined they'd one day be sharing a bed.","Song Luosheng asked, \"Kuikui really woke up, didn't she?\"","Chi Yu replied, \"Yes, I promise.\"","Song Luosheng said, \"Then she'll definitely wake up again.\"","Chi Yu agreed, \"She will wake up.\"","Both firmly believed this. Soon after, they closed their eyes, though it was uncertain if they actually fell asleep.","Meanwhile, Song Luokui was viciously beating something, which kept begging for mercy. \"Stop hitting me, please stop!\"","Song Luokui, her face contorted with rage, shouted, \"I'm hitting you and I'll keep hitting you! Die!\"","\"Ahhh!\"","\"Ahhh!\"","Screams of agony echoed through the boundless room!","The next morning, Chi Yu and Song Luosheng woke up simultaneously, their bodies jerking awake. As soon as they opened their eyes, they both looked towards the other bed. The person was gone!","\"Where's Kuikui?!\" Song Luosheng immediately flipped off the bed, walked to the opposite bed, and started feeling around. He even lifted the bed to check underneath.","Chi Yu quickly checked the bathroom and toilet. \"Kuikui?\" His head was still wrapped in bandages.","\"Kuikui?\"","\"Kuikui?\"","They called out. Just as Song Luosheng was about to run out to search, Chi Yu suddenly spotted someone on the balcony. \"Kuikui's here! Kuikui?\"","On the balcony stood Song Luokui. Sunlight illuminated her face, making even the fine hairs on her skin visible. She said nothing, just standing there with her hand stretched out towards the sun, as if about to ascend...","Chi Yu, heart pounding, rushed over and embraced her. \"Don't go!\"","Song Luokui suddenly turned to look at him. Her eyes no longer held yesterday's coldness. She stared at him for a long while before finally placing her hand on his face. \"Is this real?\"","Chi Yu grabbed her hand and pressed it to his cheek. \"It's real, it's real.\"","Song Luokui suddenly smiled, tears streaming down her face. \"I dreamed that someone kept me trapped in a room and tried to beat me to death, but in the end, I killed them instead.\"","\"The room was very dark, and I was so scared, I...\" Song Luokui's legs suddenly gave way, as if overcome by exhaustion. Chi Yu immediately scooped her up in his arms, carried her into the room, and gently laid her on the hospital bed. \"Don't be afraid,\" he reassured her. \"You're safe now. If anyone tries to bully you, I'll protect you.\"","Chi Yu then turned to Song Luosheng, who stood frozen in shock. \"Hurry, call a doctor!\" he commanded.","\"Oh, right, right!\" Song Luosheng snapped back to reality. He spun around and dashed out of the room, nearly slipping in his haste. \"Doctor! Doctor!\" he shouted as he ran. \"My sister's woken up!\""]},{"number":189,"title":"Chapter 189: Awakening 02","paragraphs":["The doctor quickly came to examine Song Luokui. Her legs had given way because she hadn't stood up for so long. As for why Song Luokui was standing on the balcony as soon as she woke up, it was because she felt she had been in a dark room for too long and hadn't seen sunlight in ages.","So when she woke up and saw sunlight, her first thought was to walk into it. Only when the sun's rays fell on her did Song Luokui feel truly alive again. Anyone trapped in a perpetually dark room without sunlight would break down.","Her consciousness supported her legs, allowing her to walk to the balcony and stand there, basking in the sunlight.","She had woken up once before and thrown something at Chi Yu, mistaking him for the villain trying to kill her. At that time, her mind saw everyone as someone who wanted to end her life. As for their faces? The people trying to kill her were faceless in her mind.","Now, Song Luokui lay in bed, her mind fully clear at last. A crowd of people surrounded her, including the examining doctor, her parents, her brother, Chi Yu, Chi Yu's parents, as well as Aunt Gui, Uncle Kang, Song Moqian's secretary, and the Chi family's housekeeper.","After the examination, the doctor addressed the group: \"She's awake and there's no major issue, but her body functions haven't fully recovered after lying down for so long. She'll need proper massage therapy and then some walking exercises. I'll write out a list of suitable food and drinks for you.\"","\"The patient also needs plenty of rest. Don't let her do anything strenuous. When possible, you can take her outside to get some sun...\"","The doctor gave a litany of instructions, to which everyone nodded in agreement.","After the doctor left, Song Luokui held Sheng Rong's hand in one of hers and Song Moqian's in the other. \"Dad, Mom.\"","Sheng Rong wiped the corner of her eye and smoothed Song Luokui's hair. \"It's good that you're awake. It's so good you're awake.\"","Song Luokui's lips were still very pale. \"Mom, Dad, I'm sorry I worried you. I'm fine now.\" She had killed the plot god! That wretched thing shouldn't appear again. She hadn't expected it to resurface after so long, still intent on killing her.","But now it was gone for good!","Song Luokui looked at the others. \"I'm sorry for worrying all of you.\"","Song Moqian, his voice a bit choked, patted her hand. \"Just rest well.\"","Sheng Rong looked at Chi Yu. \"Little Yu and your brother have been watching over you this whole time. You must repay them properly in the future.\"","Song Luokui looked at Chi Yu and then at her brother. \"I understand.\"","As the hospital room couldn't accommodate too many people, everyone soon left except for Chi Yu and Song Luosheng. The others, after all, had important matters to attend to, and it was already challenging for them to spare time each day to visit their daughter.","Song Luokui held Song Luosheng's hand. \"Brother, I'm sorry I worried you.\"","Song Luosheng's eyes were still red. \"It's okay, it's okay. It's my fault for not protecting you well enough.\"","Song Luokui shook her head. \"It's not your fault. What happened to those people?\"","Song Luosheng's eyes turned cold. \"They will all face justice!\"","Song Luokui lay back down. \"That's good.\"","Song Luosheng glanced at Chi Yu, then stood up. \"I'll step out and ask the doctor if there's anything else we need to avoid.\"","After Song Luosheng left, only Chi Yu and Song Luokui remained in the room. Chi Yu crouched down, burying his face in the crook of Song Luokui's neck, one arm embracing her. He said nothing, but Song Luokui felt the wetness on her neck.","They held each other for a long time before Song Luokui spoke. \"At one point, I thought I was going to let you all down. But then I wondered, what would happen to you if I was gone? Would you be with another girl in the future? I would allow that, of course.\"","Chi Yu, his voice still nasal, replied, \"Never. There will never be anyone else.\"","Their fingers intertwined as they gazed at each other. Suddenly, Chi Yu leaned down and kissed the corner of her mouth. As he moved to kiss her fully, Song Luokui turned her head, her face reddening. \"I... haven't brushed my teeth yet.\"","Chi Yu didn't force the issue, just smiled. \"I don't mind.\"","Song Luokui: \"But I mind.\"","Chi Yu: \"Then we'll kiss when you're better.\"","Song Luokui felt shy. \"How can you say such things?\"","Chi Yu: \"Mm, it's what I want.\"","Song Luokui tried to cover his mouth, but Chi Yu caught her hand and kissed it. Outside, Song Luosheng watched for a moment before leaving.","As long as his sister was alright, that was all that mattered.","Song Luokui chatted with Chi Yu for a while before resting. She had just woken up and was still very tired. Chi Yu, however, was terrified she might fall asleep and not wake up again, so he kept watching her, constantly checking the time. Occasionally, he would place his hand under her nose to make sure she was still breathing.","His behavior was somewhat foolish, but he was simply afraid. Afraid that all of this was just a dream. He even pinched his own thigh hard, only believing it was real when he felt the pain.","It wasn't until Song Luokui woke up again that he finally relaxed. But when she fell asleep again that night, Chi Yu still stayed by her bedside, watching over her without sleeping.","The next morning, when Song Luokui woke to see Chi Yu with dark circles under his eyes and bloodshot eyes, she asked, \"Didn't you sleep last night?\"","Chi Yu caressed her face. \"I was afraid.\"","Song Luokui understood what he feared. She sat up and hugged him, and Chi Yu immediately hugged her tightly in return, inhaling her scent to reassure himself this was real.","Song Luokui stroked his head. \"I promise, I'll take good care of myself from now on. I'll always wake up, so please go rest, okay?\"","Chi Yu didn't move. Song Luokui continued, \"You look a bit ugly now, and I don't like seeing you like this. Why don't you go freshen up and come back?\"","Chi Yu: \"Okay.\"","When Chi Yu returned after washing up, the others had arrived. Song Luokui saw him and said, \"Why don't you go rest now? You didn't sleep all night.\"","The others assumed he had been taking care of Song Luokui all night. \"Little Yu, go rest first. You look so haggard. Good boy, go get some sleep.\"","Chi Yu looked at Song Luokui, who smiled at him. \"Go rest for now. I'll be right here.\"","Chi Yu nodded and went to rest, but after only half a day, he returned. At this time, only Aunt Gui and Song Luosheng remained in Song Luokui's room. Song Luokui was drinking the meat soup made by Aunt Gui. Seeing him approach, Song Luokui put down her bowl and asked, \"Why are you back so soon? Have you rested enough?\"","Chi Yu: \"Mm, I'm fine.\"","Song Luokui didn't think he was fully rested but knew his personality. \"Have you eaten then? Aunt Gui brought plenty. You can eat with me. I can't finish it all anyway, so let's not waste it.\"","\"Alright,\" Chi Yu said as he walked over.","Song Luosheng, standing to the side, was unhappy. \"Why didn't you ask your brother, Kuikui?\"","Song Luokui blinked. \"Huh? Didn't I just ask earlier? Brother, you said you had already eaten.\"","Song Luosheng was taken aback. Indeed, Kuikui had asked him earlier. What a misstep!","Chi Yu, who was nearby, took a sip of the soup and exclaimed, \"Delicious.\"","Song Luokui: \"Of course it's delicious. Aunt Gui made it.\"","Aunt Gui, standing to the side, smiled so broadly her eyes turned into slits. \"If it's good, Miss and Young Master Chi, please drink more. I'll make it again next time.\"","\"Okay.\""]},{"number":190,"title":"Chapter 190: Discharged","paragraphs":["Song Luosheng left after staying for over half an hour, mainly because Song Luokui and Chi Yu kept smiling at each other while eating, which he couldn't bear to watch.","However, remembering his promise not to interfere with whatever Song Luokui and Chi Yu did once she woke up from her coma, he didn't say anything more. After the couple finished eating, Song Luosheng stayed for a bit longer before leaving with Aunt Gui.","With only Song Luokui and Chi Yu left in the room, Song Luokui looked at Chi Yu and asked, \"Don't you need to go to the company?\"","Chi Yu shook his head, \"There are so many people at the company. If they can't manage without me, I'd have to replace all of them.\"","Song Luokui hugged him, \"Thank you for your hard work.\"","Chi Yu looked at the sunlight outside the window, remembering when she had just woken up. \"Would you like to go out and soak up some sun?\"","Song Luokui nodded, \"Sure.\"","Chi Yu quickly brought over the wheelchair. He carefully lifted Song Luokui into it, draped a jacket over her shoulders, and hung a water bottle on the chair before pushing her out.","As soon as they left the room, they encountered a nurse who greeted them. Since Song Luokui's hospitalization, all the nurses in the hospital had learned about the incredibly beautiful young woman in the VIP ward who had finally awakened after a month-long coma.","Everyone said it was her handsome fiancé's daily care that had moved the heavens. The nurses had never seen such a well-matched couple before, and now they were all peeking out from the nurses' station to watch as the man pushed his partner out for a walk.","Chi Yu wheeled Song Luokui to a small garden nearby. The sun was quite strong at that moment, so Chi Yu, worried about the heat, positioned Song Luokui under a tree. \"Shall we stay here?\" he asked.","Song Luokui nodded, \"Yes.\"","She lifted her head to look at the leaves above. Sunlight filtered through the gaps between the leaves, casting dappled shadows on the ground and across her body.","Song Luokui squinted, shading her eyes with her hand as she gazed at the blue sky, occasionally spotting a low-flying airplane.","It felt so good to be alive.","Chi Yu crouched beside her, holding her hand as they looked up together. Song Luokui finally spoke, \"When I was in a coma, there was this faceless thing trying to kill me. It trapped us in a dark room, but in the end, I killed it and escaped. I finally saw the sunlight again.\"","\"The sunlight on my skin... it really is quite warm,\" Song Luokui mused.","Chi Yu tightened his grip on her hand, resting his head on her leg. \"You were so brave!\"","Song Luokui chuckled, \"I learned how to fight from watching you and my brother when we were kids. Aren't I awesome for taking that thing down?\"","Chi Yu agreed, \"You are.\"","Song Luokui continued, \"Back then, I should have teamed up with my brother to fight you. Hehe, maybe you wouldn't have been able to beat us both.\"","Chi Yu nodded, \"Mm-hmm, you'd definitely win every time.\"","Song Luokui responded confidently, \"Of course I would.\"","Worried that Chi Yu had been crouching for too long, Song Luokui patted him. \"Let's go to that bench over there so you can sit down too.\"","Chi Yu stood up and pushed her to the bench, then sat down beside her. They chatted quietly, while passersby instinctively lowered their voices, not wanting to disturb the beautiful scene before them.","After an hour outside, Chi Yu, concerned about tiring her out, wheeled Song Luokui back to her hospital room. As Song Luokui lay down to rest, she held onto Chi Yu's hand and patted the space next to her. \"You should rest well too. You need to be in good shape to take care of me. Why don't you lie down and sleep here?\"","The bed was quite large, after all – they were in the VVVIP ward.","\"Alright,\" Chi Yu agreed. He took off his jacket and shoes, then lay down next to Song Luokui. He wrapped one arm around her, and Song Luokui yawned, quickly falling asleep. Chi Yu propped his head up with his hand for a while, kissed the corner of her mouth, and then slowly drifted off to sleep as well.","A nurse came to check on them once but didn't dare disturb them. In the afternoon, Song Luosheng also came by, saw the two sleeping on the bed, and left without waking them.","In the days that followed, Song Luokui slowly recovered, gradually regaining her ability to walk. Each time she tried, Chi Yu would either support her or follow closely behind. Zhang Xiyue, Lou Sasa, and others also came to visit her.","They hugged her tearfully, exclaiming, \"You really scared us to death!\"","Zhang Xiyue said, \"I was supposed to be your bridesmaid. And I wanted to be the godmother to your child, or have you be the godmother to mine.\"","Lou Sasa chimed in, \"I want to be the godmother to Kuikui's child too.\"","Zhang Xiyue retorted, \"You should find a boyfriend first.\"","Lou Sasa shot back, \"I haven't even mentioned that you secretly got a boyfriend. And he's from... \" the Chi Family Heir's side.","Song Luokui laughed, \"Sure, sure, you can all be godmothers.\"","The hospital room was lively for two hours, but not wanting to hinder her recovery, they left, promising to throw a grand celebration when she was discharged.","Song Luokui smiled and waved goodbye to them. Later, she met with Yu Hui from the company to inquire about the business situation.","Yu Hui reported, \"The company is doing fine, everyone's just been worried about you. Here are the paper cranes that everyone folded for you.\" Yu Hui handed over a bottle filled with paper cranes.","Song Luokui was pleasantly surprised, \"Everyone made these?\"","Yu Hui nodded, \"Yes. Everyone prayed for your safety. President Song also came to check on the company, so everything's under control.\"","Song Luokui said, \"My brother has worked hard too. Please thank everyone for me. When I'm better, I'll come back to the company and treat everyone to a meal.\"","Yu Hui smiled, \"I'll definitely convey the boss's feelings to everyone.\"","Later, Zhou Yuan and others, even Li Yanbei from Chi Yu's side, came to visit. Song Luokui spent almost the entire day receiving visitors.","However, Chi Yu and Song Luosheng eventually became concerned about disturbing her rest and stopped allowing further visitors, saying they could all have dinner together after she was discharged.","Song Luokui counted on her fingers, \"I haven't even left the hospital yet, and I already owe so many meals.\"","Chi Yu reassured her, \"It's fine, I'll accompany you to all of them.\"","\"Mm-hmm.\"","After waking up, Song Luokui stayed in the hospital for another month. When the doctor finally cleared her for discharge, she wore a red outfit, crossed over a pan of fire, and firecrackers were set off. Both the Song and Chi parents happily came to pick her up.","The two families had a feast at the Song residence, with a large table laden with delicacies such as abalone, shark fin soup, roast suckling pig, roast duck, roast goose, roast chicken, lobster, hairy crabs, and many more dishes.","\"Cheers!\" Everyone clinked glasses happily. Song Luokui was drinking a soft drink, while the others were drinking alcohol.","Song Moqian said, \"I hope everyone will have peace and success in the future.\"","Chi Yong added, \"I hope our two families will live in harmony and be blessed with good fortune.\"","\"Let's toast again!\" they exclaimed.","Today, everyone was in high spirits. At the dinner table, Song Moqian and Chi Yong were talking and drinking simultaneously. Sheng Rong and Yan Sui tried to persuade them to slow down, but to no avail. Sheng Rong even wiped the corner of her eye; they were truly happy.","At their age, isn't the greatest wish for their children to be safe and happy? Thankfully, thankfully, it seemed to be coming true.","Song Luokui poured a glass for Song Luosheng, saying, \"Thank you for taking care of me, brother. I'd like to propose a toast to you.\"","Chi Yu chimed in, \"I'd also like to propose a toast to my brother.\"","Song Luosheng got goosebumps, \"Who told you to call me brother?\"","Song Luokui playfully coaxed, \"Brother~\"","Song Luosheng relented, \"Alright, alright. I'll return the toast to you both.\""]},{"number":191,"title":"Chapter 191: Massage","paragraphs":["School had already started, but since Song Luokui was in her senior year, there weren't many classes. Some students were looking for internships, others preparing for graduate school exams or civil service exams. Everyone had their own plans.","Song Luokui had already secured admission to a graduate program, so she didn't have much to do at school. While things were quiet on campus, the company kept her busy. After the company's relocation celebration party, Yu Hui informed her that several people in the company were showing signs of becoming minor celebrities.","As a result, the company was expanding, work was increasing, and they were hiring more people. The recruitment policy remained unchanged - only women.","Song Luokui had been spending several days at the company. Now, Chi Yu would drop her off at the company every morning and pick her up after work in the evening. Some of the new employees who hadn't seen Chi Yu before thought the company had started hiring men when he came to the office.","They were surprised to learn from the receptionist that he was the boss's fiancé. Everyone marveled at how both of them looked like they could dominate the entertainment industry with their faces - truly a matching pair.","As soon as she got in the car, Song Luokui leaned back in her seat and let out a relaxed sigh. She felt like she was showing signs of becoming a corporate slave.","Chi Yu asked, \"What's wrong? Are you tired? Do you want to get a massage?\"","Song Luokui replied, \"No need, let's go home.\"","Chi Yu checked the time - it was past six. \"Shall we go for dinner and then head back to ChunWang Manor?\" Now that they were engaged, living together wasn't an issue for anyone. Even her brother, who might have objected before, didn't dare say much now.","Song Luokui didn't mind, \"Mm-hmm.\"","They had dinner nearby and then went home. As soon as they entered the house, Song Luokui immediately threw off her high heels, tossed her bag aside, took off her coat, and collapsed on the sofa. Finally comfortable.","Chi Yu, walking behind her, first put away her high heels, then hung up her coat. Seeing that Song Luokui had taken off her earrings and watch and left them on the table, he picked them up and put them away too.","Song Luokui had already turned on the TV. Chi Yu finally sat down next to her, resting her head on his lap, and began massaging her neck and shoulders to help her relax.","Song Luokui hadn't expected him to be so skilled at this. She let out a comfortable moan, causing Chi Yu to pause. He leaned down and kissed her forehead, saying, \"Don't tempt me.\"","Song Luokui: ???","Song Luokui had recovered well these past few days, but the couple hadn't been intimate. Chi Yu had been concerned about her and wanted her to rest properly. Tonight was the first night they were living together since Song Luokui's full recovery.","Song Luokui turned over and pointed at her waist. \"I've been sitting for too long today. Could you massage it for me?\"","Chi Yu changed position, his large hands easily encompassing her slender waist. He began massaging from top to bottom with his thumbs, continuing for about ten minutes.","Song Luokui was getting so comfortable she was almost dozing off. She turned her head and asked, \"Are you tired? Want to rest for a bit?\"","Chi Yu suggested, \"How about a bath?\"","Song Luokui agreed, \"Sounds good.\"","Chi Yu went to run the water, then picked her up and carried her straight into the bathroom...","When Song Luokui tried to climb out of the tub, a large hand on her waist pulled her back in...","\"More massaging makes it feel better,\" Chi Yu said in a husky voice.","Song Luokui's face turned red. \"You beast.\"","He wrapped her in a towel, leaving only her head exposed, and carried her out to the bed. Song Luokui was already half-asleep.","Chi Yu put a nightgown on her, tucked her under the covers, and kissed her several times. \"Sleep now.\" After all, tomorrow was the weekend. There would be more time.","The next morning, Song Luokui drowsily rolled over. Her hand seemed to hit something. Hm? She felt around and squeezed. Hm?","Suddenly, her hand was caught, and a voice from above her head said, \"Awake? Shall we continue?\"","Song Luokui: ???","She realized what was off - she had been squeezing his abs and woke him up.","Song Luokui tried to move away and escape, but there was no getting away. She was pulled back under the covers. One of her hands escaped, clutching the duvet cover, but a large hand caught it and pulled it back in, giving her no chance to run.","Song Luokui quickly fell asleep again, exhausted.","When she woke up again, it was already noon. Chi Yu came in from outside. \"You're awake?\" Before Song Luokui could say anything, he gave her a long kiss.","Song Luokui slapped his chest repeatedly until he finally released her. \"Can we be normal? I can't take it anymore.\" He was acting like a kiss-obsessed maniac.","Chi Yu buried his face in her shoulder, laughing. \"I love you.\"","Song Luokui paused, then stroked his head. \"I love you too.\"","Chi Yu finally raised his head. \"Are you hungry? Let's eat.\"","\"Mm-hmm.\"","When Song Luokui got out of bed, her legs were so weak she almost fell. Chi Yu quickly caught her and lifted her up, eventually carrying her to the bathroom.","After eating, the two sat on the sofa to rest. Chi Yu had his arm around her shoulders. \"Shall we go out for dinner tonight? Yan Bei and the others said they want to treat us.\"","Song Luokui replied, \"Sure. Let's go out now then. I have a beauty treatment appointment.\" Beauty treatments usually took several hours.","\"Alright.\"","At the beauty salon, Song Luokui entered the VIP room with Chi Yu sitting beside her. There were snacks and drinks available, and a large screen for watching TV.","Song Luokui changed clothes and lay on the bed. Two therapists came in, one to wash her hair and one to give her a full-body massage. This was followed by facial cleansing, full-body care, and other treatments...","The massage therapist blushed a little seeing the marks on Song Luokui's body, but being used to such things, she quickly returned to normal.","By the time the whole process was finished, Song Luokui had taken a nap. When she woke up, she saw Chi Yu working on his laptop.","\"Do you want a massage too? Are you busy?\" Song Luokui suggested.","Chi Yu shook his head. \"Not busy, just some minor things.\"","\"Okay.\" Song Luokui had just asked casually.","After the whole treatment, Song Luokui felt fully energized. In the evening, they arrived at a private room in a restaurant. As soon as they entered, they heard two \"pop\" sounds - Li Yanbei and the others had set off party poppers. \"Congratulations to the boss's lady on her safe return.\"","\"Thank you,\" Song Luokui said with a smile.","Everyone exchanged greetings and sat down. The food was soon served, and they all chatted about various topics while enjoying the delicious meal. Song Luokui's smile never faded throughout the evening. It was truly wonderful to savor good food, be with the person she liked, and spend time with friends.","As dinner came to an end, Song Luokui gathered the gifts everyone had given her, said her goodbyes, and got into the car. Chi Yu held her hand and said, \"I've got a gift for you too.\"","Song Luokui remembered he had said the same thing before... which had led to her being \"tormented\" for quite a while. So she looked at him suspiciously and said, \"I don't want that kind of gift.\"","Chi Yu immediately realized what she was thinking and chuckled, \"It's not that.\"","\"You'll see when you get home,\" he added.","Song Luokui retorted, \"That's what you said last time.\"","Chi Yu insisted, \"It's a real gift this time.\"","Song Luokui decided to trust him one more time."]},{"number":192,"title":"Chapter 192: Graduation","paragraphs":["This time it was indeed real. As soon as Song Luokui returned to Chi Yu's place, she saw the room filled with boxes.","All kinds of gold and jewelry, set after set... Among them, only that bouquet of 999 big red roses was the most ordinary.","Song Luokui looked at him, \"Why are you suddenly giving me so many things?\"","Chi Yu: \"I said I would when you were unconscious.\"","Song Luokui: ...She didn't know that.","However... Song Luokui stood on her tiptoes and kissed him, \"Thank you, my fiancé.\"","Days passed by peacefully. One day, Song Luokui was watching the news when she unexpectedly saw the day Shan Yu Group collaborated with Songhua Technology.","It was a financial interview program. Chi Yu was actually sitting on stage with her brother Song Luosheng. The host started by asking very professional questions, but towards the end, during a relaxed moment, the host asked a few personal questions: \"I'd like to ask both of you, I heard that you were previously considered rivals, and although you weren't fighting to the death in the business world, you were in a state where kings didn't meet kings.\"","\"Everyone is curious about what made you sit down calmly and discuss cooperation. Recently, everyone is quite curious about the robot jointly developed by Shan Yu and Song Hua.\"","Song Luosheng picked up the microphone, \"After all, I'm considered the elder, so I don't quibble with the younger generation.\"","Host: ?","Chi Yu directly said: \"I'm his brother-in-law.\"","Song Luosheng: \"Please add the word 'future' in front, it's not official yet.\"","Chi Yu: \"Mm, I'm his future brother-in-law.\"","The host laughed, \"So the rumors are true, Director Chi won over Director Song's sister, and that's why the two companies reconciled?\"","Song Luosheng wanted to say something, but Chi Yu beat him to it: \"No, it's that I was won over by her. I love her, and it has to be her.\"","There was even a \"wow\" from the audience.","Song Luosheng looked away in disgust, this guy was being flirtatious again, this is how he seduced his sister!","Host: \"I'm quite curious about what kind of girl could make Director Chi so head over heels that he insists it has to be her.\"","Chi Yu: \"I can invite you when we get married.\"","Song Luosheng: \"My sister is the best in the world.\"","The host became even more curious. He suddenly felt that he should have invited Director Song's sister to the show as well, but it was too late now.","\"I wonder if Director Chi could tell us how you met Director Song's sister?\"","Chi Yu: \"We lived in the same compound, we've known each other since childhood.\"","Song Luosheng: \"...You're telling a barefaced lie, how did you know each other when you were little?\" He and Chi Yu had known each other since childhood.","Chi Yu: \"We knew each other, we just didn't talk. We only started talking when we grew up.\"","Host: \"So you lived in the same neighborhood?\"","Chi Yu: \"Yes. Our parents knew each other too.\"","Host: \"So it seems you were childhood sweethearts.\"","Song Luosheng: ...What kind of childhood sweethearts?","This kind of financial interview program doesn't usually have many viewers, but because it featured two handsome men who were also the bosses of Shan Yu Group and Songhua Technology, the program exploded in popularity after it aired.","Hearing the two men's words at the end of the interview, everyone became super curious about Song Luosheng's sister. Of course, internet users have good memories.","\"I remember Director Song's sister seems to be a super beautiful girl. At that time, I think Director Song even hit Director Chi, but the trending topic was removed super fast.\"","\"Now that you mention it, I remember seeing that too. I thought it was quite funny at the time, but the trending topic was indeed removed very quickly.\"","Regardless of what was being said outside, Song Luokui was currently lying on the couch, leisurely eating fruit and watching the program.","Sacrificing herself alone had changed her brother's villainous fate and business, changed her family, oh, and she had also gained the male lead's things. Thinking about it, it seemed she hadn't lost out.","\"What are you watching?\" Chi Yu casually asked as he came back. Coming closer, he saw it was his interview program.","Song Luokui: \"I didn't expect you could appear on a program so harmoniously with my brother. And you've even collaborated?\"","Chi Yu: \"Yes, it's called the Sunflower Plan.\"","Song Luokui was stunned. Chi Yu walked over and embraced her, kissing her forehead, \"It's a plan named after you.\"","Because of her, there was such a plan, and the money earned, both Song Luosheng and he would donate in her name.","They just wanted to accumulate blessings for her, so that she would have enough good fortune to be safe and sound, smooth and successful in the future.","Song Luokui was silent for a while, then hugged him tightly, \"Thank you both.\"","She felt that she must have accumulated virtue in her previous life to meet such good people, such a good family.","Soon, it was time for Song Luokui to take her graduation photos. In June, the campus was full of youthful vigor, with lush green trees. Everyone threw their mortarboards in the air, shouting \"We've graduated!\"","\"Click\" - the moment was captured.","At this time, Song Luokui was holding a bouquet of flowers. Song Moqian and Sheng Rong had come too, though they came quietly, fearing that coming openly might draw the attention of school leaders.","Song Luosheng didn't even get this treatment; at his graduation, neither Song Moqian nor Sheng Rong had shown up.","Not only that, but Yan Sui had also come. Chi Yong couldn't make it due to some matters, but of course, Chi Yu and Song Luosheng were there.","The two families took a big group photo. Chi Yong even sent a message to Chi Yu, telling him to photoshop him into the picture.","Chi Yu: ...","In the photo, Song Luokui stood in the middle, wearing her graduation gown and holding a bouquet of flowers. You could see a ring on her middle finger. Chi Yu stood next to her with his arm around her shoulder, wearing a matching ring on his middle finger.","Song Luosheng stood on her other side, with Song Moqian, Sheng Rong, and Yan Sui standing behind. Because Chi Yu and Song Luosheng were so tall, the two of them were crouching, otherwise they would have blocked the three people behind.","Song Moqian, Sheng Rong, and Yan Sui had to leave quickly due to other matters. Chi Yu took Song Luokui to the student council office. They took another photo in the same position, but this time, it was Song Luokui who was graduating.","That evening, the two families reserved a private room for dinner to celebrate Song Luokui's graduation. Chi Yong rushed to arrive on time, handing Song Luokui a box, \"Uncle wishes you a happy graduation.\"","Song Luokui accepted it, \"Thank you, Uncle.\"","After graduation, Song Luokui focused on her career, going to the company punctually every day. On Chi Yu's side, he was already preparing for the proposal.","Unlike the previous confession, this time he wanted it to be open and grand. He wanted everyone to witness his and Song Luokui's love.","Chi Yu had already told Chi Yong and Yan Sui about his proposal plans, of course asking them to keep it a secret. Fearing they might leak the information, he had recently asked them not to meet with Song Luokui.","As for Song Luokui, since graduation day, she had been living with Chi Yu at ChunWang Manor and hadn't returned to the family compound.","Chi Yu also told Song Luosheng: \"I'm going to propose to Kuikui.\"","Song Luosheng's eyes widened: ???!!!","Chi Yu: \"I've also told uncle and auntie. If you try to sabotage this, I'll report you!\"","Song Luosheng gritted his teeth: \"You! You're really something!\"","Chi Yu: \"I will love her well, even more than you all love her.\" Chi Yu lifted his head to look at the sky.","Song Luosheng crossed his arms over his chest: \"That's easy to say. If you dare to mistreat her, I won't hesitate to separate you two.\"","Chi Yu: \"That will never happen.\""]},{"number":193,"title":"Chapter 193: Female Entrepreneurs Networking Event","paragraphs":["As a result, everyone around Song Luokui knew about Chi Yu's plan to propose to her, except for Song Luokui herself, who was still in a meeting with employees at the company.","Moreover, due to the company's excellent performance in the previous year, invitations to events like \"Outstanding Entrepreneur Sharing Sessions\" were being delivered to Song Luokui.","There were also activities like \"Women Entrepreneurs Exchange Meetings.\" Yu Hui even asked Song Luokui if she wanted to attend.","Song Luokui looked at the invitation for the Women Entrepreneurs Exchange Meeting and said, \"Let's go with this one. I'll attend this.\"","\"Alright.\"","Hair tied up, dressed in a suit, wearing black high heels, with Li Bei carrying her bag beside her, the two got into the chauffeur-driven car.","In the car, Li Bei briefed Song Luokui about the meeting's agenda and who would be attending, highlighting several key figures.","\"President Li is one of the most prestigious attendees at this gathering. She's fifty years old and is the wife of Sun Jingwang, also known as the 'King of Snacks'. She doesn't like being called Mrs. Sun; she prefers to be addressed as President Li. She's also a Peking University graduate, which makes her your senior alumna, boss.\"","\"Rumor has it that she came from a humble background and met Sun Jingwang at university. After marrying into the Sun family, she gradually developed her own career to become the President Li we know today. However, there are recent rumors that Sun Jingwang has an illegitimate child.\"","Song Luokui remarked admiringly, \"She must be very capable and charismatic.\" As for the illegitimate child, she thought that intelligent people probably wouldn't care too much about it; they had more important things to focus on. If that Sun was smart, he should know how to handle it.","\"There's also President Hua. The Hua Guardian sanitary napkins we often use were created and developed by her. Her father is Hua Yi, the textile tycoon. She's considered a successful second-generation entrepreneur.\"","Song Luokui: \"I've used their products. They're quite good.\"","\"Then there's...\"","Song Luokui: \"It seems I'm one of the youngest there?\"","Li Bei: \"Yes, you are.\"","Song Luokui: \"That's alright. I'm going there to learn anyway.\"","Arriving at the venue, she signed in, entered the hall, and found her seat. Song Luokui's seat was relatively towards the back, but she didn't mind, considering she was indeed a junior.","She arrived relatively early, and others gradually started to arrive. Someone sat next to Song Luokui, and she smiled at them as a greeting.","The person looked at her, slightly surprised, and then said kindly, \"This is the first time I've seen you. You must be new here?\" The reason for saying \"kindly\" was because the person looked to be about fifty-five years old.","Song Luokui didn't understand what \"new\" meant in this context, but she replied, \"This is my first time attending such an exchange meeting.\"","The person had an expression of \"I thought so\" and said, \"I thought I hadn't seen such a beautiful young lady before. Which company are you from?\"","Song Luokui mentioned her company's name, and the person responded, \"No wonder you're so beautiful. As expected from an entertainment company.\" The person quickly introduced herself, \"My name is Wang Daling. I'm in the feed business. You can call me Sister Wang.\"","Song Luokui: \"I'm Song Luokui. Nice to meet you, Sister Wang.\"","Wang Daling: \"I often attend these exchange meetings, so we regulars have a group chat. Let me add you to it. We can all communicate in the future.\"","Song Luokui: \"Sure. I'll scan your code.\"","After chatting for a while, Song Luokui found that this Sister Wang was indeed quite talkative and even wanted to set her up with someone.","\"I know quite a few handsome young men. Little sister, do you have a boyfriend? I can introduce you to someone. Any type you like. It doesn't necessarily have to lead to anything serious. After all, we're successful in our careers, so having some fun is okay too.\"","Song Luokui admired her open-mindedness, thinking it befitting of a successful female entrepreneur. \"I'm sorry, Sister Wang, but I already have a fiancé.\"","Wang Daling: \"That's alright. If you ever fall out of love with your fiancé, you can let me know. I'll introduce you to someone even better.\"","Song Luokui couldn't help but laugh, \"Thank you, Sister Wang.\"","Soon, the exchange meeting was about to begin. The host went on stage and gave an opening speech, then invited people to come up and share their experiences or visions for the future. After all, the main focus of such exchange meetings was sharing – people could talk about whatever they wanted.","The first person to take the stage was President Li, whom Li Bei had mentioned to Song Luokui earlier. She was dressed very professionally, with short hair and a serious expression that commanded respect without even trying. However, when she smiled, she looked quite amiable.","Song Luokui noticed that Sister Wang beside her had taken out paper and a pen and started taking notes, looking very studious. Seeing Song Luokui watching her, she said she would share her notes with her after the meeting.","\"Thank you, Sister Wang.\"","\"You're welcome.\"","After President Li's sharing, President Hua, whom Li Bei had also mentioned, took the stage, followed by others.","Host: \"This year, we also have some new blood joining us. Now, let's welcome our President Song Luokui to introduce herself. The Tian Yu company she leads is the only company in the industry with only female employees, which is very special. Let's give her a warm welcome.\"","Song Luokui stood up and walked to the stage. \"Respected seniors, hello everyone. I'm Song Luokui from Tian Yu. I'm very happy to participate in this exchange meeting. Every outstanding senior here is worth learning from, and I've already learned a lot from everyone's sharing just now...\"","Host: \"May we ask what inspired President Song to create a company with only female employees?\"","Song Luokui: \"I guess it was because I saw how some women were struggling so much, so I had that idea.\"","Host: \"President Song's idea is truly admirable.\" The host was also a woman, and she understood the difficulties faced by women.","...","After the sharing session ended, it was time for the banquet. With delicious food and wine, everyone chatted freely while eating.","Wang Daling introduced her to other attendees, who all seemed quite caring towards her, probably because of her young age.","Besides discussing business matters, they also talked about their children at home, with some even expressing interest in introducing their children to Song Luokui.","Wang Daling: \"Little sister already has a fiancé. You all don't need to make introductions.\"","Song Luokui just smiled and nodded on the side, while others wondered aloud which family's child was so outstanding.","They thought, what a beautiful and capable young woman – how great it would be if she could improve the genes of their next generation.","Song Luokui hadn't expected President Li to come over and talk to her. \"I think your idea of creating a company with only female employees is really excellent. In the future, if you encounter any business matters you're unsure about, you can ask me. We can also exchange ideas.\"","Song Luokui: \"Then I'll be shamelessly seeking your advice in the future.\"","President Li: \"I heard you're also from Peking University. As it happens, I'm your senior. You can just call me 'senior' in the future. I was in the School of Economics and Management.\"","Song Luokui: \"Hello, senior!\"","...","President Li chatted with her for a while before leaving. President Hua, who was over there, naturally saw this and asked President Li, \"Why did you go out of your way to talk to that young girl?\"","President Li, holding a champagne glass, said, \"Do you know Songhua Technology?\"","President Hua nodded, \"Yes, I do.\"","President Li: \"That girl is the sister of Songhua Technology's boss. By the way, you should know the recent financial news - the owner of Shan Yu Group is going to be Songhua Technology's boss's future brother-in-law. So...\"","President Li had the fortune of attending a very high-level banquet with her husband once, where her husband told her this. It was just that one time. Mainly because some people were of such a high social class that she couldn't just enter their circles at will.","President Hua's eyes widened: \"I understand now.\" Although her father was a textile tycoon, he truly paled in comparison to some people."]},{"number":194,"title":"Chapter 194: Marriage Proposal","paragraphs":["Soon after, that Mr. Hua also came over to chat with Song Luokui. Although Song Luokui was surprised internally, she engaged in friendly conversation with him. Despite the significant age differences among everyone, they all shared the same desire to make money.","After the networking event ended, Song Luokui had added several new contacts.","Meanwhile, Chi Yu was in the midst of planning the proposal ceremony. He was keeping a close eye on everything, wanting it to be perfect.","That evening, when he returned to the home he shared with Song Luokui, she was already lounging in her pajamas watching TV. Seeing him come in, she asked, \"Have you been very busy lately? It seems like you've been working overtime these past few days.\"","Chi Yu walked over and kissed her, saying, \"I'm sorry, it has been a bit hectic recently. Once this period is over, I'll spend more time with you, okay?\"","Song Luokui shook her head, \"I'm not asking you to accompany me, I just see how hard you're working. Tomorrow, I'll ask the housekeeper to make you some chicken soup to help you recover.\"","Chi Yu kissed her again, \"Thank you, wifey.\"","Song Luokui pushed him away, blushing, \"We're not married yet, don't call me that.\" She was shy.","Chi Yu replied, \"Alright, baby.\" After all, it wouldn't be long now.","\"Didn't you attend some networking event today? How did it go?\" Chi Yu inquired.","Song Luokui answered, \"It went well, I added a few people on WeChat.\"","\"Oh, and someone tried to set me up with a boyfriend,\" Song Luokui poked his cheek, \"but I told them I have a fiancé, so they dropped it.\"","Chi Yu held her tightly, \"You're mine.\"","Song Luokui patted him, \"Go wash up and get some rest. Are you hungry? Should I ask the housekeeper to make you something? There's also cake in the fridge.\"","Chi Yu stood up, \"I'm not eating, I'll go take a shower first.\"","\"Okay.\"","For the next two weeks or so, Chi Yu came home quite late. Song Luokui assumed he was busy and didn't say anything. Plus, her brother hadn't called her recently either.","Song Luosheng: ...It wasn't that he didn't want to call, he was just afraid he might accidentally let slip about not wanting his sister to accept the proposal so easily.","But he couldn't... if their parents found out he leaked the news, he might face a double beating.","On this Saturday, Song Luokui woke up from her warm bed. Chi Yu wasn't there, but she saw an invitation on the nearby table.","Dear Ms. Song Luokui:","Your fiancé, Chi Yu, cordially invites you to dinner at XX Restaurant this evening. If you accept the invitation, please send him a heart emoji. If you decline, please give him a kiss.","Your fiancé: Chi Yu","Date: XX/XX/XXXX","Below the invitation was a complete set of evening wear, including shoes. Song Luokui smiled and picked up her phone to send Chi Yu a red heart emoji.","Chi Yu received it quickly. He was currently overseeing the final preparations at the proposal venue. The flowers he had specially ordered from abroad, his most desired blooms, were to cover the entire venue. There were countless flowers, too many to count, worth who knows how many tens of thousands.","After sending the message to Chi Yu, Song Luokui went to freshen up, did some exercise, and had breakfast. Later, someone came to give her a massage and skincare treatment. She had a sumptuous lunch, though Chi Yu wasn't there.","During this busy period for Chi Yu, she thought he was working overtime, so she had the housekeeper prepare some delicious food to be sent to him.","After waking from her afternoon nap, a makeup artist arrived to do Song Luokui's makeup. Then she put on the evening gown and chose some exquisite jewelry. Amidst the admiration of the makeup artist and housekeeper, she got into the chauffeur-driven car and headed to the restaurant Chi Yu had mentioned.","When she arrived, Chi Yu was already waiting at the entrance. He personally opened the car door for her and helped her out. Then, with Song Luokui holding his arm, they entered the restaurant.","Chi Yu had also dressed up for the occasion. Although he looked good without any effort, it was clear that today he had styled his hair with gel and was wearing a pleasant cologne.","Upon entering the restaurant, Song Luokui realized that Chi Yu had rented out the entire place – it was just the two of them.","After sitting down, Song Luokui asked him, \"What's the special occasion today?\"","Chi Yu replied, \"I'm in a good mood today, and I haven't been able to spend much time with you lately, so this is also to make it up to you.\"","Song Luokui smiled, happy to be constantly on his mind, \"I forgive you.\"","Chi Yu poured her a tiny bit of champagne, \"How about a small drink tonight?\"","Song Luokui looked at the minuscule amount in the glass, aware of her low alcohol tolerance, \"Sure.\" She picked up the glass and clinked it with Chi Yu's.","Soon after, the band began to play, and the couple enjoyed their meal while listening to the pleasant music.","They dined for an hour in a lovely atmosphere. Afterwards, Chi Yu took her hand and led her to the chauffeur-driven car, \"I have another surprise for you.\"","Song Luokui raised an eyebrow, \"Oh?\"","Chi Yu said, \"I feel like one meal isn't enough to make up for my absence. But I hope you'll come with me somewhere.\"","As it was still early, Song Luokui naturally agreed, \"Alright.\"","The driver headed towards their destination. Song Luokui asked him, \"Why so mysterious? Are you planning to sell me off?\"","Chi Yu was actually feeling a bit nervous now, but he didn't show it outwardly. He had one hand in his pocket, touching a small box.","They reached their destination in half an hour. Chi Yu led her to the gates of an estate, \"We're here, let me help you out of the car.\"","Chi Yu held Song Luokui's hand as she got out. She was puzzled why they didn't drive directly into the estate. Just then, the grand gates opened, and Song Luokui saw that the path leading to the castle inside was lined with flowers on both sides, with a red carpet laid out in the middle.","Song Luokui looked at Chi Yu. She felt this scene was somewhat familiar, but couldn't quite place it. Chi Yu was also nervous. He held Song Luokui's hand and asked, \"Shall we go in?\"","Song Luokui nodded, and they walked onto the red carpet. The lights along the path were as bright as day, and the flowers on either side looked beautiful to Song Luokui, with dewdrops glistening on them.","As they walked, Song Luokui gradually began to suspect something. She glanced at Chi Yu, then looked ahead, then up at Chi Yu again.","Chi Yu noticed and asked, \"What is it?\"","Song Luokui started, \"You...\" but then lowered her eyes and said nothing.","Chi Yu's hand tightened, \"We're almost there.\"","Song Luokui continued walking with him. Suddenly, a large screen appeared in front of them, displaying photos of the two of them. Even childhood photos had been edited to show them together, chronicling their journey from youth to adulthood.","Song Luokui watched for a moment, then suddenly heard a series of \"boom boom boom\" sounds coming from ahead. It was fireworks, grand and beautiful, even forming shapes—heart shapes, to be precise.","At that moment, Chi Yu dropped to one knee and pulled out a ring box from his pocket, opening it. \"Darling, will you marry me?\"","The diamond on the ring inside the box was enormous and dazzling, almost blinding Song Luokui. She had actually guessed what was coming earlier, but now that the moment had truly arrived, she found herself at a loss for words. The crowd hiding nearby held their breath in anticipation.","Chi Yu's hand trembled slightly. Seeing her lack of response, his heart began to race even faster. \"Will you marry me?\" he asked again, his voice filled with hope and nervousness."]},{"number":195,"title":"Chapter 195: Do You Have a Boyfriend, Senior Sister","paragraphs":["People hiding around whispered silently, \"Say yes, say yes.\"","Only Song Luosheng gritted his teeth in the corner, \"Refuse!\"","However, Song Luokui suddenly covered her mouth, feeling like she might cry. She had originally thought she wouldn't cry, but at this moment, she was unexpectedly moved to tears. She extended her hand and nodded, \"Yes!\"","Chi Yu immediately broke into a smile, the kind of smile that showed genuine happiness, his eyes tender and loving. The people around them, upon hearing this, burst out with a \"Wow!\" and started applauding enthusiastically.","Song Luokui was suddenly at a loss, not realizing there were so many people around. She turned to look and saw her parents, brother, friends Zhang Xiyue and Weng Jiao, classmate Xu Jiarong, roommate Wang Sisi and others had all arrived.","Chi's parents, Li Yanbei, Ji Xiao, Chen Nan, and other brothers of Chi Yu were also present.","Chi Yu was still kneeling, \"Let me put the ring on your finger.\" He took Song Luokui's hand and slipped the ring on, then took out another ring for her to put on his finger.","After they both had their rings on, they embraced and kissed amidst everyone's cheers and applause.","Then, everyone looked up to one side. It turned out that numerous drones had begun to rise into the air, forming the shape of two people, clearly depicting the scene of Chi Yu's proposal.","The male figure knelt to propose, the female nodded, they put rings on each other and embraced. Finally, it transformed into Cupid's arrow striking a heart.","Chi Yu and Song Luokui smiled at each other, and Chi Yu kissed her again.","Others were also very happy, everyone taking photos. In fact, from the moment Song Luokui entered the estate, drones had been following and filming her. Cameras had also been secretly recording, so the entire scene was captured.","In the distance, people saw this drone performance. It had started with fireworks and then included drones, leading everyone to guess that someone must be proposing or confessing their love.","They just didn't know which wealthy family's daughter it was.","The news of Chi Yu proposing to Song Luokui quickly spread among the young ladies and gentlemen of the Capital Circle. Some had thought Chi Yu might just be playing around or that the two would eventually break up, even though they were engaged before. But now he had proposed? It seemed they were really going to tie the knot.","Some people offered sincere blessings, while others were less genuine, but those people had nothing to do with Song Luokui and Chi Yu.","Song Luokui was puzzled why the proposal was in the estate, but Chi Yu explained that this would be where they'd live after marriage, their marital home.","The design of the estate was completely finished, with the butler, bodyguards, and servants all ready. It just needed the master and mistress to move in.","With the proposal done, the wedding was next on the agenda.","Both families consulted their birth charts and chose an auspicious date in October, just three months away.","Song Luokui asked, \"Isn't that too rushed?\"","Chi Yu replied, \"Not at all, everything is already prepared.\"","Song Luokui: ?","Within a couple of days, a handmade phoenix crown and embroidered wedding dress were delivered for Song Luokui to try on. Everything from the innermost layer to the outermost, including the shoes, was custom-made.","The phoenix crown was adorned with dazzling jewels, and the exquisite shoes were embroidered stitch by stitch by famous female embroiderers, also studded with gems.","Song Luokui looked at the clothes in shock and turned to Chi Yu, \"When did you arrange all this?\"","Chi Yu kissed the back of her hand, \"I started after we got engaged.\"","Apart from trying on the wedding attire, she didn't have much else to do. All other matters were arranged by others, and when the time came, she just needed to show up.","As the wedding approached, Song Luokui thought she might feel anxious like she did before the engagement, but surprisingly, she didn't. Perhaps after experiencing the series of events, she realized life is short, and some things are better done sooner.","After the new semester started, she became a graduate student. One day, her advisor asked her to cover a class for him, teaching the new freshmen.","Song Luokui had no problem with this. In the morning, the driver took her to school. She no longer lived on campus and had been staying at ChunWang Manor with Chi Yu. On weekends, she would go home for dinner with her family, and sometimes visit Chi's parents for meals.","After the wedding, they would move directly to the estate where he had proposed.","At 7:50, Song Luokui arrived at the Literature Building. The car dropped her off right in front. Today, she wore a blouse and a skirt, her hair tied up, carrying a bag, trying to look more mature.","At this time, many students were rushing to class in the Literature Building. When they saw such a beautiful woman, their eyes lit up, wondering if she was a teacher or a student.","Some watched as she entered the building and headed towards a particular classroom.","\"Which class is in that room today?!\"","\"I want to know everything about that beauty in three minutes.\"","Yu Chi Yan, who was cycling to an elective class, almost crashed into a tree when he saw Song Luokui getting out of the car. He stared at her, his heart pounding. How could there be such a beauty in their school?","He thought about his dormmates talking about the so-called campus beauties like Li something or Chen something from XX department, but compared to the woman before him, they weren't worth mentioning.","Parking his bike, Yu Chi Yan followed the beauty, watching her enter a classroom. He immediately sent a message asking someone to find out which class she was in.","Although the beauty had stepped out of a luxury car, he was the heir to the renowned Yu Chi family of S City.","He believed he was worthy of such a beauty, or rather, only such a beauty was worthy of him.","As soon as Song Luokui entered the classroom, the students let out a collective gasp of admiration.","Someone said, \"Huh? Isn't it supposed to be Zhang Teacher's class today? Do we have such a beauty in our class?\"","It wasn't until Song Luokui walked to the podium and introduced herself that they understood. \"Hello everyone, I'm your senior, Song Luokui. Zhang Teacher asked me to cover his class today.\" Song Luokui also wrote her name on the blackboard.","From the audience, someone raised their hand and asked, \"Senior, which year are you in?\"","Song Luokui answered, \"I'm currently in my first year of graduate school.\"","Just then, the bell rang outside signaling the start of class. Song Luokui opened her computer and connected it to the display screen. \"Now let's begin our class. Everyone, please open...\"","In the middle of the lesson, Song Luokui asked if anyone had any questions. Suddenly, someone raised their hand and said, \"Senior, do you have a boyfriend?\"","Song Luokui was taken aback. The students below started laughing, all looking at her.","Song Luokui held out her hand, showing the ring on her finger. \"This isn't a class-related question. Please refrain from asking personal questions from now on. However, I can answer you now: I don't have a boyfriend, but I do have a fiancé who will become my husband next month.\"","\"Wow~\"","\"Wow~\"","When Song Luokui said she had a boyfriend, there was one exclamation from below. When she mentioned he would become her husband next month, everyone exclaimed again. So, does this mean their senior was getting married next month?"]},{"number":196,"title":"Chapter 196: End: Marriage 01","paragraphs":["After the class ended, Song Luokui left, with some people following her. Along the way, they had many questions, mostly personal ones.","\"Senior, is your boyfriend handsome? If not, I feel he wouldn't be good enough for you.\"","\"Senior, you're so beautiful. It would be great if you became a celebrity. I'd definitely be your biggest fan.\"","\"Senior, will you teach us again next time? I love listening to your lectures.\" Mainly because they loved looking at her face.","\"Senior, can I add you on WeChat? Can I ask you questions about studying?\"","Song Luokui: \"...\" Although everyone was very enthusiastic, she replied, \"Handsome, not becoming a celebrity, not sure about next time, and no.\"","Downstairs, a luxury car was waiting by the roadside. Song Luokui said goodbye to them, \"I'm heading back now, bye.\"","Before Song Luokui could reach the car, a chauffeur in a suit and white gloves got out and opened the door for her. Song Luokui got in, and the chauffeur closed the door before getting back in the driver's seat and driving away.","Everyone looked at the expensive car and then at the license plate. \"Oh my God, our senior must be either rich or noble.\"","\"She's getting married next month, so she must be marrying someone wealthy, right?\"","\"Definitely. How could someone from a family like that marry an ordinary person?\"","Once in the car, Song Luokui let out a sigh of relief. She first reported to her supervisor, then Chi Yu called her. \"How was your class today? Everything okay?\"","Song Luokui: \"It went well. Just finished now.\"","Chi Yu: \"Do you have anything else this morning? Want to come over? I've booked a restaurant for lunch. Shall we eat together?\"","Song Luokui thought for a moment and realized she had nothing else planned for the morning. \"Alright, but I need to go to the company in the afternoon.\"","\"Okay.\"","Song Luokui asked the driver to take her to Shan Yu Group. She spent a little time playing in Chi Yu's office before they went out for lunch.","By now, the whole company had gotten used to her presence, as Song Luokui often visited. People would greet her with \"Hello, Madame.\"","At first, Song Luokui wasn't used to it, but she gradually became accustomed.","Meanwhile, Yu Chi Yan had finally finished investigating Song Luokui. First-year graduate student, senior to him, and already had a boyfriend.","Having a boyfriend wasn't a problem; he could still try to win her over. He didn't believe that with his capabilities and looks, he couldn't succeed.","However, he couldn't find her on campus after that. He tried looking for her, but Song Luokui rarely stayed at school unless she had something to do.","A month later, he finally saw her at a wedding, but... the senior had become the bride.","The night before the wedding, Song Luokui felt thirsty and found no water in her room, so she stepped out. She discovered Song Luosheng smoking on the balcony. It was already very late.","\"Brother?\" Song Luokui approached him.","Song Luosheng turned around, looked at her, and said, \"Kui Kui.\" He immediately put out his cigarette.","\"Brother, what's wrong? Why aren't you sleeping so late?\"","Song Luosheng patted her head, \"Tomorrow, you're getting married.\" He seemed like an old father worrying about his daughter. \"After this, I won't be able to see you at home anymore.\"","Song Luokui: \"I'll still come back home.\" She hugged his arm. \"You'll always be my brother, and you can come to my place for dinner too, you know?\"","Song Luosheng reminisced about the past: \"When you were little, you were just this big, and now you're getting married. Kui Kui... can you not get married?\"","Song Luokui looked up, \"Brother, the wedding is tomorrow.\"","Song Luosheng put his arm around her shoulders and sighed, \"I know, I just can't bear to let you go.\" They had grown up together, and now his sister would belong to another family, calling her old home \"maiden home\" when she visited.","Song Luokui hugged him back, \"I'll always be your sister. And you'll always be my best brother. Brother, you're the most handsome.\"","Song Luosheng paused, then patted her back, \"If Chi Yu ever bullies you, I won't let him off the hook.\"","Song Luokui: \"Forget about you, I wouldn't let him off either.\"","Song Luosheng: \"Go rest now. Don't you have to get up early tomorrow?\"","Song Luokui: \"Mm-hmm, you should sleep early too, brother. Don't smoke too much, it's bad for your health.\"","\"Okay.\"","Song Luokui left to rest, while Song Luosheng stood on the balcony for a long time before going to bed...","The wedding would be held at the estate, which was where the couple would live afterward. They had started decorating a week in advance.","It was even grander than the engagement. Only those with invitations could enter. The Yu family had managed to get an invitation through some connections.","This invitation was something many people wanted but couldn't obtain.","The estate was huge. One side of the parking lot was full of luxury cars. Not only that, there were plainclothes bodyguards guarding the foot of the mountain, and men in suits patrolling inside. Previously, all facilities had been checked, including fire safety measures.","New carpets had been laid, and everything had been polished. The entire estate looked brand new.","Due to the grand scale of the event, there was even a traffic jam on the road.","Song Luokui was getting ready at her family home in the compound. She was dressed in a traditional Chinese bridal outfit, with Zhang Xiyue, Lou Sasa, Weng Jiao, and Zhou Yue as her bridesmaids.","Song Luokui felt a bit sleepy, as she had woken up at around 3 AM and hadn't eaten much. Fortunately, Zhang Xiyue and the others had secretly slipped her some food.","At noon, Chi Yu arrived. He first went through several challenges before reaching the final two: his brother-in-law Song Luosheng and his friends were blocking the stairway.","It felt like they were kids again, with the two sides facing off.","They stared at each other for a while until the onlookers started to egg them on, \"Come on, come on, give the red envelopes!\"","Song Luosheng's hand twitched, and Chi Yu's side thought he was going to make a move. Instead, Song Luosheng held out his hand and said, \"Red envelope.\"","Chi Yu paused, then quickly handed over an extra-large red envelope. Song Luosheng's friends also held out their hands one by one, saying, \"Red envelope, red envelope.\"","After receiving the red envelopes, Song Luosheng crossed his arms and lifted his chin, \"Call me.\"","Chi Yu: \"Brother!\" His voice was loud and clear.","Song Luosheng's friends all cheered, \"We won! We won! Chi Yu called him brother!\"","\"Hahahahaha!\"","Chi Yu's side also laughed. After all, it was a joyous day, so they didn't mind letting them have this victory.","Song Luosheng stepped aside, \"You may pass.\"","Chi Yu: \"Thank you, big brother.\" Then he walked up the stairs.","Finally, it was time for the bridesmaids to block the door. After stuffing many red envelopes and saying numerous kind words, they were at last allowed to enter. Once inside, they still had to find the bride's shoes before finally being able to meet her.","Afterward came the kneeling ceremony to pay respects to the ancestors and parents. Song Luokui, nestled in Chi Yu's arms, walked out of her family home. As she turned her head to look back at the doorway, she felt a sudden urge to cry.","She was getting married!"]},{"number":197,"title":"Chapter 197: End: Marriage 02","paragraphs":["The wedding motorcade cruised down the main street, with dozens of luxury cars driving side by side as onlookers snapped photos.","Inside one of the cars, Song Luokui held a folding fan in one hand while Chi Yu gripped her other hand tightly. Her eyes were slightly red and brimming with tears.","Chi Yu comforted her in a low voice, gently wiping her eyes. \"Don't cry. We'll go home to have dinner with Mom and Dad every week.\" He now referred to Song Luokui's parents as Mom and Dad, having already changed his form of address.","Song Luokui opened her eyes wide, trying not to let the tears fall for fear of ruining her makeup. \"Is my eye makeup still okay?\"","Chi Yu replied, \"It's perfect. You're the most beautiful bride today.\"","Song Luokui smiled instantly, but tears still rolled down her cheeks. Chi Yu quickly helped her dab them away.","As the car arrived at the entrance of the estate, Chi Yu carried Song Luokui out. A long red carpet stretched before them, similar to the one from his proposal, but it was brand new. The surroundings were decorated with fresh flowers, balloons, and other new decorations.","Chi Yu set Song Luokui down. She covered her face with the folding fan as they walked side by side along the red carpet, holding a red silk between them. A wedding hostess scattered various items and recited auspicious phrases beside them, while musicians played festive music. Crowds of spectators gathered around to watch the spectacle.","They walked all the way into the castle, where they knelt to pay respects to heaven and earth and their parents, then bowed to each other as husband and wife. The entire venue was filled with the clamor of gongs and drums, creating a lively atmosphere.","Afterwards, they were sent to the bridal chamber—","\"Woohoo!\" Everyone cheered joyfully.","Back in their room, Song Luokui and Chi Yu drank from the wedding goblets, then changed into new outfits to go out and toast the guests.","Yu Chi Yan watched this wedding that had stirred up the entire Capital Circle, marveling at its grandeur. It truly befitted the union of two of the Capital Circle's top families, with seemingly every notable person in attendance.","However, when he saw the newlyweds emerge in their new attire to toast the guests, he was stunned! How could this be?!","He knew the bride was from the Capital Circle's Song Family, but he never imagined she would be the beauty he had seen at school—the one he had been searching for over a month!","The beauty was getting married today, and he wasn't the groom.","Yu Chi Yan remained dazed until Chi Yu and Song Luokui reached his table. Yu Chi Yan's father nudged him, saying, \"What are you doing? They're toasting us.\"","Yu Chi Yan glanced at Song Luokui, who was now within arm's reach. Today, her eyebrows were even more striking, and her smile was radiant—she was breathtakingly beautiful!","Yu Chi Yan downed his drink in one gulp, his eyes fixed on Song Luokui.","Song Luokui didn't notice anything, but Chi Yu did. He shot a cold glance at Yu Chi Yan, sending a chill straight to his core!","Yu Chi Yan immediately lowered his head, almost breaking into a cold sweat. What was he doing? How could he be coveting the wife of the Capital Circle's crown prince?","As Yu Chi Yan came to his senses and sat down, Chi Yu had already led Song Luokui to the next table.","Yu Chi Yan didn't dare look up again for the rest of the evening. His father, noticing his odd behavior, thought he might be unwell. \"Study hard while you're here, and try to make connections with important people if you can. If not, at least avoid making enemies. You can't afford to offend anyone in Jing City, understand?\"","\"I heard the bride and groom both graduated from Peking University. You're their junior now, so try to connect with them if possible.\"","Yu Chi Yan thought to himself: Connect? Impossible now.","...","Back in their room, Song Luokui was exhausted. Her legs ached terribly, so she just lay down without even changing out of her dress. Getting married was truly tiring! During their engagement, due to an incident, they had left right after the meal. The wedding involved toasting guests at every table, though she had only been drinking water.","\"Thank goodness we only do this once,\" Song Luokui murmured.","Chi Yu walked over to massage her feet. \"What do you mean, only once?\"","Song Luokui replied, \"We only get married once, right?\"","Chi Yu laughed and pinched her cheeks. \"How many times did you want to get married, hm?\" Then he leaned in to kiss her.","Song Luokui struggled briefly before giving in, wrapping her arms around his neck. Just as things were about to heat up, they separated. Song Luokui pushed him gently, \"Don't you need to go see the guests off? Hurry up!\"","Chi Yu pecked her lips several more times. \"I'll be back soon.\"","Before he returned, Song Luokui was already singing in the bathtub. When Chi Yu came back and heard her voice, he loosened his tie, took off his jacket, and began unbuttoning his shirt as he walked into the bathroom.","The singing abruptly stopped, replaced by a conversation: \"Honey, did you know the guy at table 85 who kept staring at you?\"","Song Luokui replied, \"What table 85? Who was staring at me? Wasn't everyone staring at me today?\"","Chi Yu laughed, \"You're right!\"","Soon, the beautiful singing resumed in the bathroom...","The lights in the castle on the estate stayed on all night, and the singing continued until dawn...","The End","Happy New Year in advance~ Let me know in the comments if you'd like to see any extras."]},{"number":198,"title":"Chapter 198: Extra Story: Pregnant","paragraphs":["After getting married, Song Luokui's life didn't change much from before, except for living in a different place. Every morning, a driver would pick her up and drop her off at work, and also take her to school when she had classes.","At school, Song Luokui sometimes substituted for her teacher to give lectures. Whenever she opened the floor for questions, students would always ask her personal questions, especially after learning she was married.","\"Senior, why did you get married so early?\"","\"Senior, doesn't your husband come to pick you up?\"","\"Senior, is your husband handsome?\"","Song Luokui: ...","\"Please don't ask questions unrelated to the class,\" Song Luokui would always respond.","However, one time when Chi Yu came to pick her up, everyone saw him. After that, no one asked these questions anymore.","One day, halfway through class, there was suddenly thunder and lightning with heavy rain. The sound of the downpour made everyone feel a bit gloomy. Some were worried about getting soaked if the rain was still heavy when class ended.","Song Luokui wasn't worried, since she had a driver to pick her up. But unexpectedly, just as she reached the entrance of the Faculty of Liberal Arts, Chi Yu got out of the car. He walked up to her with a black umbrella: \"Do you have anything else to do? Ready to go home?\"","Song Luokui stepped under his umbrella. \"Why did you come?\"","Chi Yu: \"It's raining heavily, so I came to pick you up.\"","They chatted as they slowly walked to the car. The driver opened the door for them to get in before taking the driver's seat and driving away. Many students had gathered there, so a lot of them witnessed this scene.","Many felt it was like a scene from a romantic drama - a handsome man and a beautiful woman walking towards a luxury car in the rain, then slowly driving away.","\"Wow! So that's our senior's husband?\"","\"That guy looks so familiar... Ah! I know, he's on the school's donation wall and official website. He's Chi Yu, a senior who graduated several years before us!\"","\"So that's Senior Chi Yu? He's our senior's husband? A handsome man and a beautiful woman, they're such a perfect couple.\"","In a dimly lit room, Song Luokui was covered in sweat. She heard the bedside drawer open and close. Chi Yu held her tightly, \"We're out. I'll go buy some.\"","Song Luokui wrapped her arms around his, her voice soft and tender, \"So quickly? But it's not necessary, I should be in my safe period.\" She clearly remembered there was a drawer full of them, how did they run out so fast?","But then she thought... after getting married, it seemed Chi Yu had lost all his restraint. Almost every night, they would soak through a set of sheets...","Chi Yu kissed her forehead, \"You haven't graduated yet. It's not good.\" He suddenly got up, put on a coat, and went out.","Song Luokui curled up under the covers, already feeling drowsy. By the time Chi Yu returned with the items, Song Luokui had fallen asleep.","Chi Yu came over, took off his coat, slipped under the covers, kissed her face with a smile, and fell asleep holding her.","But the next morning, as soon as Song Luokui woke up, Chi Yu started kissing her again. \"You only have classes in the afternoon. We still have time, hmm?\"","Song Luokui: ??","Song Luokui turned to look at the bedside table, which was now stocked with many boxes. Chi Yu reached for one and handed it to her. \"Help me?\"","Song Luokui: \"... Don't you have work?\"","Chi Yu had already started kissing her. \"Not going. You need to make it up to me for last night.\"","Song Luokui: ...","When she returned to school in the afternoon, her waist was sore. Mainly because later, Chi Yu had carried her from the balcony to the sofa and then to the bathroom...","Song Luokui patted her cheeks. She couldn't think about it anymore; she'd blush.","Chi Yu had originally planned to wait at least until Song Luokui graduated before considering having children, or even waiting a few more years would be fine. He also wanted to enjoy more time as just the two of them. But it seemed a little accident had occurred.","When Song Luokui realized her period was two weeks late, she panicked a bit.","She still had one semester left before graduation. Could it be because of that time in the home swimming pool...","After leaving school, Song Luokui went to the pharmacy to buy a test kit to check for herself. Rushing back home, she went straight to the bathroom.","Song Luosheng happened to come over to see her. Today was Grandpa Song's birthday celebration. Chi Yu wasn't in Jing City and would only return around 5 PM, so Song Luosheng came first to pick up Song Luokui and go together.","Chi Yu would rush over as soon as he got back to Jing City later.","Song Luosheng first knocked on the door, but there was no sound from inside. He pushed the door open and called out, \"Kuikui?\" The maid had said she was back.","Song Luosheng walked in and immediately saw the pharmacy bag on the table. Thinking Song Luokui might be sick, he picked up the box from the bag and was stunned...","At this moment, Song Luokui was a bit dazed in the bathroom, to the point where she ignored the commotion outside. She stared at the two lines on the test, her heart racing.","She looked up information on her phone. Some people said that even with two lines, it wasn't necessarily pregnancy, and it was better to go to the hospital for a check-up.","Song Luokui patted her chest and took a deep breath. \"Stay calm, it's not certain. It's not certain.\"","Although she said this, Song Luokui was still a bit panicked and at a loss. She had already started thinking about what to do if she really was pregnant. Could she really take good care of a child right now?","Song Luokui bit her finger and walked out of the bathroom, planning to go to the hospital first. However, as soon as she opened the door, she saw Song Luosheng holding the pregnancy test box.","\"Brother...\" Song Luokui was stunned. She hadn't expected Song Luosheng to be there.","Song Luosheng looked at her, then at the pregnancy test in her hand. He strode over and saw the two lines on the test Song Luokui was holding. He gasped, his eyes widening, \"Kuikui, are you pregnant?\"","Song Luokui: \"I... I don't know. Brother, I'm scared.\" A frightened expression appeared on Song Luokui's face.","Song Luosheng quickly hugged her. \"Don't be afraid. I'm here. Let's go to the hospital right away.\" He wanted to pull Song Luokui to run quickly, but then remembering she might be pregnant, he stopped. \"Kuikui, should I carry you out? No, no, I'm afraid I might fall. Should I support you? Or should I have someone bring a wheelchair?\"","Song Luokui: \"...That won't be necessary. I'm not that fragile.\" She walked out.","The two of them headed to the hospital. Once in the car, Song Luosheng began reassuring Song Luokui not to be afraid, while simultaneously searching online for information about what to do when pregnant. Then, Song Luosheng called Chi Yu. As soon as the call connected, Song Luosheng rapidfire typed, \"Where are you? Where are you now? When are you coming back? Come back quickly! Something's happened to Kuikui! Hurry back!\"","Chi Yu immediately panicked on the other end, \"What's wrong with Kuikui?\"","Just then, they arrived at the hospital. Song Luosheng got out of the car, \"Come quickly, we're at Jing City First Hospital!\" Then he hung up.","Chi Yu swiftly got into a car, \"Head back, to Jing City First Hospital. And make it fast.\"","\"Yes, sir.\"","Today was supposed to be Grandpa Song's birthday celebration. Chi Yu had originally planned to stay at home, but some business matters came up in the neighboring city, so he went to deal with them first, intending to rush back later for the party.","Chi Yu was terribly afraid. He clenched his fists tightly, praying that nothing had happened to Song Luokui."]},{"number":199,"title":"Chapter 199: Extra Edition: Pregnancy 02","paragraphs":["When Chi Yu arrived at the hospital, Song Luokui was already holding the test results in her hands. She sat on the chair, looking somewhat dazed, as if she couldn't believe it.","Chi Yu thought the test results must be very bad. His legs went weak and he \"thudded\" to his knees on the ground. Both Song Luokui and Song Luosheng looked over at him. Chi Yu quickly scrambled to his feet and walked over to Song Luokui. She was about to ask if he was alright.","Chi Yu, his eyes reddening, hugged her tightly. \"It's okay, it's okay. I'll find you the best specialists.\"","Song Luokui: ??","Song Luosheng pulled him away, frowning. \"What are you talking about? What do you think happened to my sister? She's perfectly fine.\"","Chi Yu let go of Song Luokui. She handed him the test results. Chi Yu took one look and froze, remaining stunned for quite a while. Song Luokui had to nudge him before he came back to his senses.","He hugged her tightly again. \"Is it true? Really?\"","Song Luokui smiled and hugged him back. \"Mm-hmm, it's true.\"","Tears welled up in Chi Yu's eyes - tears of joy. \"Thank you, thank you, darling!\"","Song Luosheng interjected from the side: \"Don't hug her so tightly. What if it affects the baby?\"","Only then did Chi Yu loosen his grip. \"Are you okay? Do you feel uncomfortable anywhere?\"","Song Luokui placed her hand on her belly and shook her head. \"No, I'm fine.\"","She glanced at the time and realized it was getting late. \"Shall we go to Grandpa's house now? We might be running out of time.\"","Chi Yu supported her as she stood up. Song Luosheng also came over to help her. \"Let's walk slowly, no rush. Grandpa will understand when he knows.\"","Song Luokui looked at both of them: \"...I'm not that fragile. Stop supporting me like this. You're making me feel like I'm disabled.\" She shook off their hands and turned to Chi Yu: \"You just got back. Don't you want to freshen up? My brother and I can go to the venue first. Why don't you go get ready?\"","Chi Yu was in a bit of a disheveled state due to his rush and worry. He looked at himself and agreed. \"Alright, I'll see you to the car first. Then I'll go freshen up and join you very soon.\"","\"Okay, okay.\"","After seeing Song Luokui into the car, Chi Yu instructed the driver and Song Luosheng to take good care of her. He then rented a nearby room to tidy himself up before driving to Grandpa's house.","In the car, Song Luokui folded the test results and put them in a paper bag. \"How about I give this to Grandpa as his birthday gift?\"","Song Luosheng: \"Of course! Grandpa will be thrilled!\" The whole family would be overjoyed.","Because Song Luokui was pregnant, the driver drove more slowly. By the time Song Luokui arrived at Grandpa's house, Chi Yu had just pulled up behind them, with gifts for Grandpa in the trunk.","When they entered Grandpa's house, everyone was already sitting in the living room, chatting. Seeing Chi Yu arrive, Sheng Rong immediately waved him over. \"Little Yu is here? Come, sit down.\" She even made space for Chi Yu next to Song Luokui.","Chi Yu walked over, first greeting everyone, then placing down the gifts. \"Wishing Grandpa good health and longevity.\"","\"Good, good, sit down.\" Song Ruhui was in high spirits today.","Chi Yu sat down next to Song Luokui, holding her hand as they exchanged a smile.","The TV was on, and everyone was eating fruit and chatting. Soon, Chi Yong and Yan Sui arrived as well. \"Wishing Old Song good health and all the best.\"","Song Ruhui: \"Thank you, please sit. We'll start the feast soon.\"","Chi Yong: \"Glad we made it in time.\"","Song Ruhui: \"It wouldn't have mattered if you were late. I would have had them save a table for you.\"","Chi Yong waved his hand, \"That would be too much trouble.\"","\"It's no trouble at all. Today, everyone should feel at ease.\"","Soon, the feast began. It was a super large dining table, with both families seated together.","Everyone first raised their glasses to wish Song Ruhui longevity, then happily ate and drank. Finally, towards the end, Song Luokui spoke up: \"Grandpa, I have another gift for you.\"","Song Ruhui looked over, \"Oh? What gift?\"","The others were curious too, only Chi Yu and Song Luosheng knew.","Song Luokui took out a paper bag and handed it to Song Ruhui. He felt only a thin layer of paper inside and thought it might be a card or a check. When he opened it, he found a folded piece of paper.","The others were also looking at the paper. Lin Xianyuan, sitting next to him, said: \"Open it!\"","As soon as Song Ruhui unfolded it, Lin Xianyuan, sitting next to him, saw it and exclaimed, \"Ah!\" She looked at Song Luokui with delight!","Song Ruhui also looked at Song Luokui excitedly: \"Really?\"","Song Luokui nodded with a smile. Chi Yu, beside her, hugged her and smiled too.","Sheng Rong and Song Moqian were confused until Song Ruhui showed them the paper. They too looked at Song Luokui with joy. Then Chi Yong and Yan Sui saw it as well, and everyone was ecstatic.","\"Wonderful! Wonderful! This is the best birthday gift I've ever received!\"","Sheng Rong: \"Have you been tired lately? Is there anything you want to eat? Do you feel uncomfortable anywhere?\"","Song Luokui shook her head, \"I'm fine. Nothing uncomfortable.\"","Yan Sui: \"Mother-in-law, it looks like we need to start looking for a nutritionist for them. Oh, and we should start searching for a nanny too.\"","Sheng Rong: \"Yes, yes, you're right. We'll discuss it thoroughly later.\"","\"Mm-hmm.\"","After the birthday feast, Chi Yu took Song Luokui home. Sheng Rong watched the two leave: \"Time flies so fast. We're going to be grandparents.\"","Song Moqian put his arm around her shoulders: \"Indeed.\"","Song Luosheng chimed in: \"I'm going to be an uncle too.\"","Sheng Rong: \"If you'd get your act together, we could be grandparents on your side too, and you could be a father.\"","Song Luosheng: ...How did this turn to him?","Meanwhile, back at home, Song Luokui sat on the sofa. Chi Yu had already lowered his head to her belly and started listening. \"I'm your daddy.\"","Song Luokui laughed, \"It's just an embryo right now.\"","Chi Yu: \"If I talk more, maybe it will sense me.\"","Song Luokui patted his head, \"I'm tired. I want to rest now.\"","Chi Yu: \"The housekeeper has already prepared the bath. Let me help you there first.\"","\"Okay.\"","A few weeks later, Song Luokui went for another check-up. The doctor said hesitantly, \"It might be twins. It will be a bit harder on the mother.\"","Song Luokui: \"Ah?\"","Chi Yu, however, gripped her hand tightly. He had heard the doctor's mention of difficulty.","A month later, during another checkup, it was confirmed to be twins. Everyone in the family was overjoyed, but Chi Yu had been harboring a vague sense of worry all along.","In the days that followed, Song Luokui finally experienced what pregnancy was truly like. She felt constantly tired and became extremely sensitive to fishy smells. After the third month, she even started vomiting. Every night, she would wake up craving strange foods, and surprisingly found herself enjoying things she had previously disliked.","A nutritionist had been arranged, and high heels were now a thing of the past. Her collection of flat shoes had grown significantly, along with several pairs of non-slip slippers."]},{"number":200,"title":"Chapter 200: Extra Episode Giving Birth","paragraphs":["As her belly grew larger, Song Luokui still had to busy herself with her graduation thesis and taking graduation photos. However, Song Luokui felt she looked too unattractive now, so she didn't take any photos, only taking a few pictures with her family.","In her room, Song Luokui was sitting at her desk typing on her computer when the baby in her belly suddenly moved, then moved again. Song Luokui exclaimed in surprise, and Chi Yu immediately rushed over, asking, \"What's wrong? Are you uncomfortable somewhere?\"","Song Luokui rubbed her belly, saying, \"It's nothing, they just suddenly moved.\"","Chi Yu reached out to touch her belly, and after a moment, he felt the movement. Both of them were delighted.","\"Babies, don't disturb mommy. Be good,\" Chi Yu said, speaking to the belly.","As soon as he finished speaking, the babies stopped moving.","Song Luokui said, \"Looks like they listen to daddy.\"","Chi Yu replied, \"If they don't behave, we'll give them a spanking when they come out.\"","Song Luokui laughed and said, \"I'm afraid you won't have the heart to do it.\"","Chi Yu responded, \"If they make you angry, I definitely will.\"","Perhaps because of the twin pregnancy, Song Luokui's pregnancy was quite difficult. At night, she would either get leg cramps or need to get up to use the bathroom. Sometimes she felt hungry, and other times she inexplicably felt depressed.","There were even times when she would suddenly start crying for no apparent reason. When they went to see the doctor, they were told it was due to hormonal changes.","Chi Yu felt distressed seeing her struggle, even though they had a nutritionist, housekeeper, and doctor at home, along with various other professionals. The difficulty of pregnancy was something only she could truly feel.","By seven months, her belly was already very large, and the doctor said there might be a chance of premature birth, so Song Luokui was directly admitted to the hospital.","She stayed in a VIP room, with doctors coming to check on her every day. Now, Chi Yu would leave work early every day to come to the hospital, and Song Luosheng would also come by after work.","At night, Chi Yu would stay to keep her company, but Song Luokui felt he was working too hard. \"Let the aunt stay with me, you need to rest well so you can earn money for me,\" she said.","Chi Yu replied, \"It's fine, it's just for this period of time.\"","Labor started in the early hours of the morning. Song Luokui woke up feeling a pain in her belly, but she didn't call out because she had been experiencing occasional pains recently, which the doctor said was normal.","Chi Yu was sleeping soundly on the other side. He had been bringing his laptop to work alongside her recently, as she was close to giving birth. Chi Yu had cancelled all business trips, opting for video conferences instead. He wouldn't go, or he'd send someone else in his place. He was afraid that if he went away, Song Luokui might go into labor.","At first, Song Luokui thought it was the same kind of contraction as before, but then she realized the pain was intensifying. \"Hmm,\" she groaned in pain, and Chi Yu seemed to hear the sound and suddenly woke up, asking, \"What's wrong?\"","Song Luokui was in so much pain she could barely speak, \"I... might... be... in labor.\"","\"I'll... I'll go get the doctor right away,\" Chi Yu said.","Chi Yu quickly opened the door and ran out. Song Luokui wanted to tell him he could just press the button at the head of the bed, but she was in too much pain.","Soon, the doctor arrived, examined her, and said, \"She's in labor, quickly take her to the delivery room!\"","Song Luokui was quickly wheeled into the delivery room. Chi Yu wanted to follow but was left outside. Actually, he could have applied to be present during the delivery, but Song Luokui didn't agree. She felt that if Chi Yu was there, she would be more vulnerable and distracted.","Chi Yu kept peering through the door for a long time before remembering to call the others.","Sheng Rong was startled awake by the ringing phone in the middle of the night. She quickly got dressed and went out. Aunt Gui had already left her room to answer the phone.","Sheng Rong went downstairs, saying, \"I'll answer it.\" As soon as she picked up the phone, she heard Chi Yu's somewhat panicked voice: \"Mom, Luokui is about to give birth.\"","Sheng Rong took a deep breath, \"Don't panic, don't panic! Has the doctor arrived?\"","Chi Yu seemed at a loss, \"Yes, Luokui has been taken to the delivery room.\"","By this time, Song Moqian and Song Luosheng had woken up and left their rooms. Sheng Rong said, \"I'll be right there, everything will be fine.\"","\"Okay.\"","Sheng Rong first told Song Moqian and Song Luosheng, then called the in-laws. At around two in the morning, everyone arrived at the hospital.","When they arrived, Chi Yu was still peering through the door on tiptoes. \"How is it? How is it?\" they asked.","Chi Yu shook his head, \"I don't know, Luokui has been in there for a long time.\" He was very worried.","\"It's alright, it's alright, don't worry,\" Yan Sui comforted her son. Although everyone was a bit anxious, those used to handling big situations remained calm on the surface.","Mainly because it was twins and premature, everyone was a bit worried.","After what seemed like an eternity, as the sun began to rise outside, the sound of crying finally came from the delivery room.","A nurse came out holding two babies, asking, \"Who are the patient's family members?\"","Chi Yu immediately stepped forward, saying, \"Me, I am.\" The others also gathered around, looking at the babies in the nurse's arms. Newborn babies aren't typically beautiful, but in everyone's eyes, these two angels were the most adorable babies in the world!","\"This is the brother, and this is the sister. Take a good look, okay?\" the nurse told everyone.","Chi Yu glanced towards the delivery room, asking, \"Where's my wife? Is my wife okay?\"","The nurse replied, \"She's fine, she'll be out soon. Please wait a moment.\"","\"Okay, okay. As long as she's alright.\" Chi Yu finally relaxed completely, only then realizing his back was soaked with sweat.","Soon after, Song Luokui was wheeled out. Chi Yu immediately went to her side, and seeing Song Luokui sleeping, he became worried again, \"Is she really okay? Why isn't she waking up?\" Chi Yu had watched many videos before and remembered that some women were awake when they came out after giving birth.","The doctor said, \"The mother is too tired and has fallen asleep.\"","Chi Yu was finally reassured again.","When Song Luokui woke up, she saw Chi Yu staring at her. She smiled at him, and Chi Yu suddenly gripped her hand tightly, lowering his head to rest against hers, saying, \"You're finally awake. Let's not have any more children, I was so scared.\"","\"I'm fine,\" Song Luokui said, patting his head, but giving birth was indeed exhausting.","Because she had twins, Song Luokui stayed in the hospital for postpartum care for over forty days. During this time, she didn't need to handle anything related to the babies; she only needed to focus on recovering.","Everyone wanted her to be happy, fearing she might experience postpartum depression. Chi Yu even took several days off work to stay with her, and later only worked half days before returning home to accompany her.","By the time she was discharged from the hospital, everything at home had been prepared: the nursery, all kinds of baby essentials, four nannies, and even additional bodyguards specifically hired to protect the children.","Back at home, Song Luokui and Chi Yu each held a child as they took a group photo with everyone. Looking at the picture and then at the children, Song Luokui suddenly broke into a smile.","Chi Yu asked her, \"What is it?\"","Song Luokui shook her head, \"Nothing, I just feel very happy.\"","She had changed her family's fate, and she had even married and had children with this man. How unexpected was that?","Chi Yu smiled at her, putting an arm around her, \"I feel very blessed too.\"","The children sandwiched between them thought: ...Go ahead and show your affection, but don't use us as the filling in your sandwich!"]}]);
